text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#镜像里有什么","content":"`VOLUME /data`、`EXPOSE 7869`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"378":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-57","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#镜像里有什么","content":"健康检查：每 30 秒请求 `http://127.0.0.1:7869/api/v1/app/health`（这个地址不需要令牌）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"379":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-58","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#镜像里有什么","content":"启动命令：`mizuoto webui --host 0.0.0.0 --port 7869 --no-open`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"380":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-59","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#运行","content":"然后在浏览器打开 `http://<主机地址>:7869`，网页界面会要求输入一次 **访问令牌**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"381":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-60","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#运行","content":"`--gpus all` 需要宿主机安装 NVIDIA 驱动和 NVIDIA Container Toolkit。不加 `--gpus` 时引擎在 CPU 上运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"382":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-61","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#运行","content":"只想用某一块 GPU：`--gpus '\"device=1\"'`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"383":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-62","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#运行","content":"`docker exec -it mizuoto mizuoto doctor` 检查镜像里的 torch 是否适合容器能看到的 GPU。","locale":"zh-CN"},"384":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-63","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#运行","content":"容器里的服务器绑定在 `0.0.0.0`，这时 Mizuoto 不再检查 `Host` 头，任何能连到端口的人都能使用全部功能（下载模型、删除文件）。请用 `MIZUOTO_SERVER__ACCESS_TOKEN` 设置令牌，或只把端口映射到本机：`-p 127.0.0.1:7869:7869`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"385":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-64","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#数据卷","content":"Mizuoto 写入的一切都在 `/data` 中：`settings.toml`、数据库、模型、共享文件、音色、结果、数据集、实验、项目、缓存和日志。镜像本身不保存状态，重新构建的镜像可以继续使用同一个数据卷。","locale":"zh-CN"},"386":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-65","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#设置与环境变量","content":"任何设置都可以用 `MIZUOTO_<分组>__<字段>` 环境变量给出（见 配置与环境变量）。环境变量的值只在内存中生效，不写入 `/data/settings.toml`，在网页界面中显示为 **由环境变量设置**：","locale":"zh-CN"},"387":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-66","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#设置与环境变量","content":"`HF_TOKEN` 只会发送给 huggingface.co（见 模型下载）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"388":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-67","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#在容器里使用命令行","content":"镜像的环境变量对 `docker exec` 同样有效，所以命令行直接作用于同一个数据文件夹：","locale":"zh-CN"},"389":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-68","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#需要接受许可的引擎","content":"只有用 `--build-arg GATED=1` 构建的镜像才包含 Fish Speech 和 IndexTTS；否则它们的卡片显示 **不可用**（缺少 `mizuoto-fishspeech` 或 `mizuoto-indextts`）。即使包含了，下载它们的模型和合成之前仍要接受许可：","locale":"zh-CN"},"390":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-69","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#需要接受许可的引擎","content":"或在网页界面 **模型** › **引擎** 中点击 **接受许可**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"391":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-70","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#在容器里运行-agent","content":"GPU 机器可以用同一个镜像作为 远程主机，运行 `mizuoto agent` 而不是网页界面：","locale":"zh-CN"},"392":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-71","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#在容器里运行-agent","content":"agent 有自己的数据卷和模型；它的镜像与主机的镜像构建方式相同（相同的 Mizuoto 版本，要提供需许可的引擎时用 `GATED=1`）。镜像的健康检查请求的是网页界面的 7869 端口，agent 不提供它，所以这里用 `--no-healthcheck` 关掉。agent 没有 TLS 时请求和音频以明文传输，请只在可信的网络中使用，或用 `--ssl-certfile` / `--ssl-keyfile` 提供证书（把证书文件挂载进容器）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"393":{"id":"/docs/advanced-docker-72","page_id":"/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-docker#在容器里运行-agent","conten