"同 v2，另有 **发音控制**，没有 **长文本**","locale":"zh-CN"},"930":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-206","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#cosyvoice","content":"**语言**：zh、en、ja、ko、yue；v3 为 zh、en、ja、ko、de、es、fr、it、ru、yue。","locale":"zh-CN"},"931":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-207","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#cosyvoice","content":"**预置说话人**（v1 SFT / Instruct）：中文女、中文男、日语男、粤语女、英文女、英文男、韩语女。","locale":"zh-CN"},"932":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-208","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#cosyvoice","content":"**行内标签**：v1 为 `[laughter]`、`[breath]`、`<strong></strong>`；v2 另有 `<laughter></laughter>`；v3 为 `[breath]`、`[laughter]`、`[cough]`、`[sigh]` 等 11 个。","locale":"zh-CN"},"933":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-209","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#cosyvoice","content":"**参考音频**：1–30 秒，至少 16 kHz。","locale":"zh-CN"},"934":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-210","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#cosyvoice","content":"**流式**：v2/v3 逐 token 流式输出；流式文本输入需要参考音频的文本（零样本克隆或 instruct2）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"935":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-211","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#cosyvoice","content":"**训练**（GPU 或 CPU）：**Fine-tune the language model**（`llm`）和 **Fine-tune the LLM and the flow**（`llm_flow`），起点为 v1_base、v2、v3，按上游 LibriTTS 流程，至少 60 秒数据，导出为新模型。只训 LLM 时韵律与发音跟随数据集；连 flow 一起训时音色也跟随数据集。","locale":"zh-CN"},"936":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-212","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#cosyvoice","content":"**共享文件**：`cosyvoice/wetext`（13 MB，把数字、日期和单位写成文字的文本规范化语法），随第一个模型一起下载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"937":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-213","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#cosyvoice","content":"**加载选项**：`fp16`（GPU 上用半精度：更快，结果略有不同）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"938":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-214","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#f5-tts","content":"流匹配语音合成，从一段短音频和它的文本克隆音色。适合：精确控制生成时长，以及只替换录音中的几处词句（语音编辑）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"939":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-215","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#f5-tts","content":"模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"940":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-216","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#f5-tts","content":"变体","locale":"zh-CN"},"941":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-217","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#f5-tts","content":"大小","locale":"zh-CN"},"942":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-218","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#f5-tts","content":"显存","locale":"zh-CN"},"943":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-219","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#f5-tts","content":"推荐","locale":"zh-CN"},"944":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-220","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#f5-tts","content":"`f5tts/v1-base`","locale":"zh-CN"},"945":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-221","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#f5-tts","content":"F5-TTS v1 Base","locale":"zh-CN"},"946":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-222","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#f5-tts","content":"1.3 GB","locale":"zh-CN"},"947":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-223","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#f5-tts","content":"2.5 GB","locale":"zh-CN"},"948":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-224","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#f5-tts","content":"是","locale":"zh-CN"},"949":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-225","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#f5-tts","content":"`f5tts/base`","locale":"zh-CN"},"950":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-226","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#f5-tts","content":"F5-TTS Base","locale":"zh-CN"},"951":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-227","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#f5-tts","content":"1.3 GB","locale":"zh-CN"},"952":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-228","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#f5-tts","content":"2.5 GB","locale":"zh-CN"},"953":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-229","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#f5-tts","content":"`f5tts/e2-base`","locale":"zh-CN"},"954":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-230","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#f5-tts","content":"E2-TTS Base","locale":"zh-CN"},"955":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-231","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#f5-tts","content":"1.3 GB","locale":"zh-CN"},"956":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-232","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#f5-tts","content":"2.5 GB","locale":"zh-CN"},"957":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-233","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#f5-tts","content":"**能力**（三个变体相同）：**克隆音色**、**语速**、**时长**、**长文本**、**种子**、**流式输出**（按块）、**语音编辑**。克隆必须有参考音频的文本：没有文本时，开启 `tts.auto_transcribe` 且已下载语音识别模型就会自动转写。","locale":"zh-CN"},"958":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-234","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#f5-tts","content":"**语言**：zh、en。采样率 24 kHz。","locale":"zh-CN"},"959":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-235","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#f5-tts","content":"**参考音频**：1–12 秒，至少 16 kHz。","locale":"zh-CN"},"960":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-236","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#f5-tts","content":"**许可**：代码 MIT，预训练权重 CC-BY-NC-4.0（在 Emilia 上训练），不能商用；不需要接受许可，结果带有提示。","locale":"zh-CN"},"961":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-237","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#f5-tts","content":"**训练**：**Fine-tune the model**（`full`）：上游 `finetune_cli` 的流程，整个模型继续训练，导出为同类新模型。最好有一小时以上语音，几乎必须用 GPU；结果继承 CC-BY-NC-4.0。","locale":"zh-CN"},"962":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-238","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#f5-tts","content":"**加载选项**：`ode_method`（`euler` 或 `midpoint`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"963":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-239","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#gpt-sovits","content":"从 3–10 秒音频少样本克隆，也是经典的微调路线：每个音色可以有自己的 GPT 和 SoVITS 权重，按请求切换。适合：用几分钟录音训练一个专属音色。","locale":"zh-CN"},"964":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-240","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#gpt-sovits","content":"模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"965":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-241","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#gpt-sovits","content":"变体","locale":"zh-CN"},"966":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-242","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#gpt-sovits","content":"大小","locale":"zh-CN"},"967":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-243","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#gpt-sovits","content":"显存","locale":"zh-CN"},"968":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-244","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#gpt-sovits","content":"推荐","locale":"zh-CN"},"969":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-245","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#gpt-sovits","content":"`gptsovits/v2-base`","locale":"zh-CN"},"970":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-246","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#gpt-sovits","content":"v2","locale":"zh-CN"},"971":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-247","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#gpt-sovits","content":"249 MB","locale":"zh-CN"},"972":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-248","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#gpt-sovits","content":"2.5 GB","locale":"zh-CN"},"973":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-249","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#gpt-sovits","content":"`gptsovits/v2pro-base`","locale":"zh-CN"},"974":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-250","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#gpt-sovits","content":"v2Pro","locale":"zh-CN"},"975":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-251","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#gpt-sovits","content":"303 MB","locale":"zh-CN"},"976":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-252","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#gpt-sovits","content":"2.5 GB","locale":"zh-CN"},"977":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-253","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#gpt-sovits","content":"是","locale":"zh-CN"},"978":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-254","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#gpt-sovits","content":"`gptsovits/v2proplus-base`","locale":"zh-CN"},"979":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-255","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#gpt-sovits","content":"v2ProPlus","locale":"zh-CN"},"980":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-256","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#gpt-sovits","content":"339 MB","locale":"zh-CN"},"981":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-257","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#gpt-sovits","content":"2.8 GB","locale":"zh-CN"},"982":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-258","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#gpt-sovits","content":"`gptsovits/v4-base`","locale":"zh-CN"},"983":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-259","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#gpt-sovits","content":"v4","locale":"zh-CN"},"984":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-260","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#gpt-sovits","content":"937 MB","locale":"zh-CN"},"985":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-261","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#gpt-sovits","content":"4 GB","locale":"zh-CN"},"986":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-262","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#gpt-sovits","content":"`gptsovits/v5turbo-base`","locale":"zh-CN"},"987":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-263","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#gpt-sovits","content":"v5 Turbo","locale":"zh-CN"},"988":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-264","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#gpt-sovits","content":"934 MB","locale":"zh-CN"},"989":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-265","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#gpt-sovits","content":"4 GB","locale":"zh-CN"},"990":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-266","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#gpt-sovits","content":"**能力**：**克隆音色**、**多段参考**（最多 4 段）、**训练音色**、**语速**、**批量**（最多 20 条）、**长文本**、**流式输出**、**种子**；v2、v2Pro、v2ProPlus 另有 **无文本克隆**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"991":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-267","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#gpt-sovits","content":"**采样率**：v2 / v2Pro / v2ProPlus 为 32 kHz，v4 / v5 Turbo 为 48 kHz。","locale":"zh-CN"},"992":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-268","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#gpt-sovits","content":"**语言**：zh、en、ja、ko、yue。日语需要可选依赖 `mizuoto[gptsovits-ja]`，韩语需要 `mizuoto[gptsovits-ko]`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"993":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-269","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#gpt-sovits","content":"**参考音频**：3–10 秒。","locale":"zh-CN"},"994":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-270","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#gpt-sovits","content":"**音色权重**：音色可以带一对 GPT（`.ckpt`）和 SoVITS（`.pth`）权重，版本与模型变体一致时使用，否则给出提示并改用克隆。用 `mizuoto voice add-weights <音色> -e gptsovits -f gpt=x.ckpt -f sovits=y.pth` 添加。","locale":"zh-CN"},"995":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-271","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#gpt-sovits","content":"**共享文件**：每个模型都需要 `gptsovits/encoders`（1.0 GB）、`gptsovits/g2pw`（562 MB）、`gptsovits/nltk-data`、`gptsovits/open-jtalk`，随第一个模型一起下载；训练 v2、v2Pro、v2ProPlus 还需要对应的判别器 `gptsovits/s2d-*`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"996":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-272","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#gpt-sovits","content":"**训练**：**Fine-tune a voice**（`speaker`）：上游的完整流程（文本特征、语音特征、语义 token、训练 SoVITS、训练 GPT），导出为音色专属的一对权重。一到十分钟的单人语音；GPU 上几分钟，CPU 上几小时。v4 和 v5 Turbo 以 LoRA 训练 SoVITS。","locale":"zh-CN"},"997":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-273","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#omnivoice","content":"小米的扩散语言模型语音合成。适合：小语种（600 多种语言）、不提供参考音频时用模型自带的音色，以及按性别、年龄、音高、口音、方言等属性设计音色。","locale":"zh-CN"},"998":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-274","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#omnivoice","content":"模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"999":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-275","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#omnivoice","content":"变体","locale":"zh-CN"},"1000":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-276","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#omnivoice","content":"大小","locale":"zh-CN"},"1001":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-277","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#omnivoice","content":"显存","locale":"zh-CN"},"1002":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-278","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#omnivoice","content":"推荐","locale":"zh-CN"},"1003":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-279","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#omnivoice","content":"`omnivoice/omnivoice`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1004":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-280","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#omnivoice","content":"OmniVoice","locale":"zh-CN"},"1005":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-281","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#omnivoice","content":"3.1 GB","locale":"zh-CN"},"1006":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-282","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#omnivoice","content":"5 GB","locale":"zh-CN"},"1007":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-283","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#omnivoice","content":"是","locale":"zh-CN"},"1008":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-284","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#omnivoice","content":"**能力**：**克隆音色**、**按属性设计**、**自带音色**、**行内标签**、**发音控制**、**语速**、**时长**、**批量**（最多 8 条）、**长文本**、**种子**。克隆时 Mizuoto 总会提供文本（缺少时由语音识别补全），所以 OmniVoice 不会自己加载 Whisper。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1009":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-285","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#omnivoice","content":"**设计属性**：gender（male、female）、age（child … elderly）、pitch（very low pitch … very high pitch）、style（whisper）、accent（american accent 等 10 种）、dialect（河南话、四川话、东北话等 12 种）。不接受自由描述。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1010":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-286","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#omnivoice","content":"**行内标签**：`[laughter]`、`[sigh]`、`[question-en]`、`[surprise-wa]` 等 13 个。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1011":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-287","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#omnivoice","content":"**参考音频**：1–20 秒，至少 16 kHz。采样率 24 kHz。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1012":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-288","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#omnivoice","content":"**训练**：**Fine-tune the model**（`full`）和 **Fine-tune with LoRA**（`lora`，导出时合并），都导出为新模型。全量微调适合用数小时语音学习新语言或风格，需要 24 GB 以上显存；LoRA 更轻。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1013":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-289","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#voxcpm","content":"OpenBMB 的无离散分词语音合成：逐个“块”（patch）生成连续的语音潜变量（由 MiniCPM-4 语言模型和每块一个小扩散模型完成），中间没有语音编码。适合：自然的音色克隆（有无参考文本均可）、用一句描述生成音色、对克隆的音色加风格指令，以及 30 种语言的 48 kHz 合成（VoxCPM2）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1014":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-290","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#voxcpm","content":"模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"1015":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-291","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#voxcpm","content":"变体","locale":"zh-CN"},"1016":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-292","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#voxcpm","content":"大小","locale":"zh-CN"},"1017":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-293","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#voxcpm","content":"显存","locale":"zh-CN"},"1018":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-294","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#voxcpm","content":"推荐","locale":"zh-CN"},"1019":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-295","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#voxcpm","content":"`voxcpm/2`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1020":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-296","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#voxcpm","content":"VoxCPM2","locale":"zh-CN"},"1021":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-297","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#voxcpm","content":"5.0 GB","locale":"zh-CN"},"1022":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-298","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#voxcpm","content":"6.5 GB","locale":"zh-CN"},"1023":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-299","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#voxcpm","content":"是","locale":"zh-CN"},"1024":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-300","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#voxcpm","content":"`voxcpm/1.5`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1025":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-301","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#voxcpm","content":"VoxCPM 1.5","locale":"zh-CN"},"1026":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-302","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#voxcpm","content":"2.0 GB","locale":"zh-CN"},"1027":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-303","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#voxcpm","content":"3 GB","locale":"zh-CN"},"1028":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-304","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#voxcpm","content":"`voxcpm/0.5b`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1029":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-305","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#voxcpm","content":"VoxCPM 0.5B","locale":"zh-CN"},"1030":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-306","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#voxcpm","content":"1.6 GB","locale":"zh-CN"},"1031":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-307","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#voxcpm","content":"2.5 GB","locale":"zh-CN"},"1032":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-308","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#voxcpm","content":"**能力**：VoxCPM2：**克隆音色**、**无文本克隆**、**按描述设计**、**指令**、**自带音色**、**流式输出**（每 40 毫秒一块）、**种子**。VoxCPM 1.5 和 0.5B：**克隆音色**（需要参考文本，缺少时由语音识别补全）、**自带音色**、**流式输出**、**种子**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1033":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-309","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#voxcpm","content":"**克隆**：有参考文本时，VoxCPM2 同时把参考音频作为独立的参考和待续写的开头（与上游演示相同；选项 **reference_prefix** 关闭后只续写）；没有文本时只作为参考。VoxCPM 1.5 和 0.5B 以续写方式克隆。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1034":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-310","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#voxcpm","content":"**描述与指令**（VoxCPM2）：按上游的做法写在文本前的括号里：`(年轻女性，温柔甜美)你好`。中英文均可；汉语方言也这样指定（粤语、四川话……）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1035":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-311","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#voxcpm","content":"**参数**：**步数**（每块扩散的欧拉步数，10）、**引导强度**（2.0）、**文本规范化**（默认关闭；由 wetext 读出数字、日期和符号）、**最大生成 token 数**（块数，4096）。选项：`min_len`、`retry_badcase`（默认开启：结果比文本长得多时用下一个种子重新生成，最多 `retry_badcase_max_times` 次；流式时不重试）、`retry_badcase_ratio_threshold`、`reference_prefix`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1036":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-312","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#voxcpm","content":"**语言**：VoxCPM2 支持 30 种（ar、my、zh、da、nl、en、fi、fr、de、el、he、hi、id、it、ja、km、ko、lo、ms、no、pl、pt、ru、es、sw、sv、tl、th、tr、vi），不需要语言标签，按原文朗读。VoxCPM 1.5 和 0.5B：zh、en。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1037":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-313","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#voxcpm","content":"**参考音频**：1–30 秒，至少 16 kHz。输出：48 kHz（VoxCPM2）、44.1 kHz（1.5）、16 kHz（0.5B）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1038":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-314","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#voxcpm","content":"**精度**：与上游相同，除 Apple 设备（fp32）外都用模型自带的 bf16；需要全精度时设 `engines.voxcpm.dtype fp32`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1039":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-315","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#voxcpm","content":"**未包含**：上游可选的参考音频降噪（ZipEnhancer，ModelScope 流水线）与时间戳；两者在上游默认都关闭。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1040":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-316","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#voxcpm","content":"**训练**：**Fine-tune the model**（`full`）和 **Fine-tune with LoRA**（`lora`），即上游自己的方案（`train_voxcpm_finetune.py` 及其按模型的配置），结果都导出为新模型；LoRA 模型把基础权重与适配器放在一起，加载时按上游的方式应用。超参数留为 0 时取该模型的方案值。在 GPU 上与上游相同（fp32 权重，bf16 自动混合精度）；在 CPU 上用 fp32（上游本身无法在 CUDA 以外训练）。VoxCPM2 的全量微调约需 40 GB 内存；LoRA 少得多。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1041":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-317","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#fish-speech","content":"Fish Audio S2 Pro：双自回归模型，约一千万小时、五十种左右语言的训练数据。适合：富有表现力的克隆、自由形式的行内标签（如 `[laughing]`）和多说话人对话。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1042":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-318","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#fish-speech","content":"模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"1043":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-319","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#fish-speech","content":"变体","locale":"zh-CN"},"1044":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-320","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#fish-speech","content":"大小","locale":"zh-CN"},"1045":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-321","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#fish-speech","content":"显存","locale":"zh-CN"},"1046":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-322","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#fish-speech","content":"推荐","locale":"zh-CN"},"1047":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-323","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#fish-speech","content":"`fishspeech/s2-pro`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1048":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-324","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#fish-speech","content":"S2 Pro","locale":"zh-CN"},"1049":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-325","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#fish-speech","content":"10.5 GB","locale":"zh-CN"},"1050":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-326","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#fish-speech","content":"22 GB","locale":"zh-CN"},"1051":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-327","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#fish-speech","content":"是","locale":"zh-CN"},"1052":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-328","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#fish-speech","content":"**能力**：**克隆音色**、**多段参考**（最多 4 段）、**行内标签**、**对话**、**流式输出**（按段）、**种子**。采样率 44.1 kHz。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1053":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-329","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#fish-speech","content":"**参考音频**：2–30 秒。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1054":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-330","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#fish-speech","content":"**许可**：Fish Audio Research License，需要接受（`fish-audio-research@2026-03-07`），不可商用，结果不能用于训练其他引擎，结果下方显示 \"Built with Fish Audio\"。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1055":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-331","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#fish-speech","content":"**设备**：GPU 上用 bf16；CPU 上用 fp32（bf16 在 CPU 上是模拟的，慢得多）。显存需求约 22 GB。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1056":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-332","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#fish-speech","content":"**训练**：**Fine-tune with LoRA**（`lora`，GPU 或 CPU）：上游的 LoRA 流程（提取语义 token、打包、训练、合并），导出为新模型。上游提醒它学到的更多是说话风格而不是音色；需要 24 GB 显存，结果仍受 Fish Audio 研究许可约束。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1057":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-333","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#fish-speech","content":"Mizuoto 目录中没有 int8 版本（官方没有公开该仓库）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1058":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-334","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#indextts","content":"哔哩哔哩的零样本语音合成：不需要文本就能从一段音频克隆。适合：情感控制——IndexTTS-2 可以用一段音频、八个情感权重或一句描述指定情感；2.5 增加日语、西班牙语和语速。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1059":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-335","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#indextts","content":"模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"1060":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-336","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#indextts","content":"变体","locale":"zh-CN"},"1061":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-337","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#indextts","content":"大小","locale":"zh-CN"},"1062":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-338","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],