ext","url":"/docs/development-acceleration","content":"每个引擎在 CPU 上的输出都与其上游逐样本一致（见引擎详解），提速工作保持这一点：**默认设置从不改变结果**。以相同参数执行相同内核的提速（CUDA Graph、更少地等待设备、CPU 内存与线程的放置）默认开启；改变运算的提速（其他注意力内核、TF32、`torch.compile`、合并投影）需要主动开启，并且每个输出都会列出实际用到的那些。测量结果见性能记录；显存管理见显存与内存。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2666":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-15","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#哪些会改变结果","content":"功能","locale":"zh-CN"},"2667":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-16","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#哪些会改变结果","content":"设置（默认）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2668":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-17","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#哪些会改变结果","content":"结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"2669":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-18","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#哪些会改变结果","content":"解码步骤的 CUDA Graph","locale":"zh-CN"},"2670":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-19","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#哪些会改变结果","content":"`compute.cuda_graphs`（开）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2671":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-20","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#哪些会改变结果","content":"与即时执行完全相同","locale":"zh-CN"},"2672":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-21","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#哪些会改变结果","content":"无同步采样","locale":"zh-CN"},"2673":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-22","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#哪些会改变结果","content":"始终","locale":"zh-CN"},"2674":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-23","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"