ation#哪些会改变结果","content":"多数引擎略有不同（见下文）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2693":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-42","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#哪些会改变结果","content":"Qwen3-TTS 的合并投影","locale":"zh-CN"},"2694":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-43","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#哪些会改变结果","content":"加载选项 `fused_projections`（关）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2695":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-44","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#哪些会改变结果","content":"在 CPU 上的一致性用例中相同；在 CUDA 上不同","locale":"zh-CN"},"2696":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-45","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#哪些会改变结果","content":"静态 KV 缓存","locale":"zh-CN"},"2697":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-46","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#哪些会改变结果","content":"`compute.kv_cache = static`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2698":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-47","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#哪些会改变结果","content":"在 CPU 上相同；见显存与内存","locale":"zh-CN"},"2699":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-48","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#哪些会改变结果","content":"原生代码从不改动进程级状态：不给 `torch.backends` 赋值，不用 `sdpa_kernel`（它会为所有线程切换 SDPA 的内核），不给全局随机数生成器播种。唯一的例外是 `runtime/accel/features.py`，由主机和训练阶段调用（两者都由架构测试强制）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2700":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-49","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#注意力","content":"`runtime`、`nn`、各引擎、各训练器以及需要接受许可的包中的每一次注意力计算，都经过同一个入口，参照了 ComfyUI 的注意力后端和 `comfy_kitchen` 的注册表：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2701":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-50","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#注意力","content":"`q`、`k`、`v` 的形状为 `(batch, heads, length, head_dim)`；`mask` 为布尔型（True 表示参与注意力）或加性掩码，可广播到 `(batch, heads, q_length, k_length)`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2702":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-51","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#注意力","content":"`causal` 即 SDPA 的 `is_causal`：左上对齐。调用点按上游传 `is_causal` 的方式传它（CosyVoice 的流式文本步骤会借助它在缓存上一次送入多个 token）。右下对齐的因果关系（KV 缓存的情形）通过 `mask_info` 表达。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2703":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-52","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#注意力","content":"架构测试禁止在 `runtime/accel/` 之外使用 `F.scaled_dot_product_attention` 及其 aten 内核。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2704":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-53","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#注意力","content":"代码","locale":"zh-CN"},"2705":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-54","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#注意力","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"2706":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-55","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#注意力","content":"`runtime/accel/dispatch.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2707":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-56","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#注意力","content":"`attention`、`Site`、`MaskInfo`、`Masked`；参照计算形式 `sdpa`、`math_kernel`、`softmax_attention`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2708":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-57","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#注意力","content":"`runtime/accel/registry.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2709":{"id":"/docs/development-ac