码器（`qwen`）、F5-TTS 的 DiT、CosyVoice 的 U-Net 与 v3 DiT、Seed-VC、HuBERT、BERT、Whisper、GPT-SoVITS 的 T2S 与 v4/v5 DiT、Qwen3-TTS 的 Mimi 编码器、VoxCPM 的 MiniCPM、Fish Speech 的预填充与编解码器、IndexTTS 的 GPT-2","locale":"zh-CN"},"2727":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-76","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#调用点与参照计算","content":"`math_kernel`：直接调用 SDPA 的 math 内核","locale":"zh-CN"},"2728":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-77","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#调用点与参照计算","content":"Fish Speech 的解码步骤（`fishspeech.step`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2729":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-78","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#调用点与参照计算","content":"手写的 softmax","locale":"zh-CN"},"2730":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-79","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#调用点与参照计算","content":"Fish Speech 的快速 transformer（`fishspeech.fast`）、IndexTTS 的 perceiver（`indextts.perceiver`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2731":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-80","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#调用点与参照计算","content":"在分数中加入相对位置、或需要概率矩阵的注意力不是调用点：wenet 的相对位置注意力、IndexTTS 的 Conformer、w2v-BERT、VITS，以及 s3tokenizer（q 和 k 各乘 d^-¼）、MelStyle 和 G2PW 的 BERT。没有融合内核能计算它们，所以保持手写。`Site(swappable=False)` 让一个调用点无论什么策略都使用参照计算；`approx_ok=False` 拒绝所有非精确的后端。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2732":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-81","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#策略","content":"设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"2733":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-82","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#策略","content":"取值","locale":"zh-CN"},"2734":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-83