ion","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#后端与后端链","content":"`flash`、`xformers`、`sdpa`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2819":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-168","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#后端与后端链","content":"fp32，或 XPU、MPS、CPU","locale":"zh-CN"},"2820":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-169","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#后端与后端链","content":"`sdpa`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2821":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-170","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#后端与后端链","content":"**选择。** 每次调用用一个 `Call` 描述（设备类型、计算能力、精度、头维度、GQA、单个还是多个查询、长度是否相等、查询是否超过 1024 个、掩码类型、`mask_info` 的结构、自定义缩放、因果、dropout、是否需要梯度），它可哈希，所以一个解码循环对每个 `(site, Call)` 只选择一次。后端在以下情况被跳过：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2822":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-171","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#后端与后端链","content":"探测表明它不能在该设备上运行（未安装、版本不对、没有内核、自检失败）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2823":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-172","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#后端与后端链","content":"调用需要它缺少的反向传播或 dropout；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2824":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-173","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#后端与后端链","content":"调用点需要精确的注意力而该后端不精确；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2825":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-174","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#后端与后端链","content":"它的约束拒绝该调用（设备、计算能力、精度、头维度、掩码、长度不等时的因果、缩放）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2826":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-175","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#后端与后端链","content":"内核抛出异常（显存不足和取消除外）时，该后端对这种调用被标为损坏，由下一个后端接手。显存不足会向上传递给精确重试。每种回退按（调用点，后端，原因）只记录一次日志。请求的 `Run` 统计用了什么，有回退时输出会记录下来并带一条警告：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2827":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-176","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#结构化掩码","content":"融合内核以结构而不是稠密张量的形式接受掩码（flash：`cache_seqlens`、`cache_leftpad`、`window_size`；xFormers：右下对齐的因果掩码和局部掩码）。根据某种结构构造掩码的调用点，在稠密掩码之外再传 `mask_info=MaskInfo(keys, causal, window, padding)`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2828":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-177","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#结构化掩码","content":"`keys`：形状 `(batch, k_length)` 的布尔值，表示真实的键；`padding`：每行是一段连续的真实键时为 `right` 或 `left`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2829":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-178","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#结构化掩码","content":"`causal`：右下对齐（查询 *i* 能看到键 *j* 当 `j ≤ i + n_k − n_q`）；`window`：`j > i' − window`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2830":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-179","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#结构化掩码","content":"参照计算忽略它，使用稠密掩码，所以 `auto` 不受影响。Qwen 的 `mask_for` 返回 `Masked(dense, info)`；VoxCPM 的解码步骤、Seed-VC、GPT-SoVITS v4/v5 和 Fish Speech 的编解码器也提供各自的 `mask_info`。打开 `dispatch.DEBUG` 时（小型引擎的测试），每次调用都检查 `mask_info` 是否描述了它的稠密掩码；`MIZUOTO_TEST_ACCEL=count` 检查每个小型引擎和训练器的每个调用点都经过分发器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2831":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-180","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#探测与-doctor","content":"每个可选后端在策略第一次要在某个设备上用它时才导入它的包，然后检查：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2832":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-181","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#探测与-doctor","content":"版本：flash-attn ≥ 2.6；xFormers 不在 0.0.21–0.0.26 之间（大批次时出错），并且带有 C++ 内核（`_has_cpp_library`：为别的 torch 构建的 wheel 能导入但没有内核）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2833":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-182","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#探测与-doctor","content":"设备与计算能力；","locale":"zh-CN"},"2834":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-183","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#探测与-doctor","content":"**自检**：一个 1 × 2 × 64 × D 的 fp16 注意力，与 fp32 下 SDPA 的 math 内核比较，要求结果有限且误差不超过 2e-3（SageAttention 为 2e-2），这能发现为别的 torch 或 GPU 构建的 wheel。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2835":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-184","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#探测与-doctor","content":"结果按进程和设备缓存。`mizuoto doctor` 有一项 `acceleration` 检查结果：相关设置、每个包（从元数据读取，不导入它）、它能否在每块 GPU 上运行（有 GPU 时在子进程中运行 `python -m mizuoto.runtime.accel`），以及保留现有 torch 的安装命令（`--no-deps`；xFormers 固定为针对已安装 torch 构建的版本）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2836":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-185","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#探测与-doctor","content":"注册表、策略、回退、严格模式和绑定都在 CPU 上测试过：真实模型经过每个调用点（`auto` 下音频、指标和权重完全相同），可选后端的衔接代码则用计算相同数学的假包测试。可选内核本身、它们的速度和质量尚未测量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2837":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-186","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#computefast","content":"参照 ComfyUI `--fast` 的进程级 GPU 开关，由主机在运行时启动时设置一次，训练阶段在加载训练器之前设置（`features.apply`）；输出会列出它们（`params.fast`）。每一项都会改变结果；修改在下次启动时生效。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2838":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-187","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#computefast","content":"功能","locale":"zh-CN"},"2839":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-188","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#computefast","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"2840":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-189","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#computefast","content":"`tf32`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2841":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-190","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#computefast","content":"TensorFloat-32 矩阵乘法和 cuDNN 卷积（NVIDIA，Ampere 及以后）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2842":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-191","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#computefast","content":"`fp16_accumulation`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2843":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-192","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#computefast","content":"fp16 乘法以 fp16 累加（torch ≥ 2.7）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2844":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-193","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#computefast","content":"`cudnn_benchmark`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2845":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-194","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#computefast","content":"cuDNN 针对每种形状尝试内核","locale":"zh-CN"},"2846":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-195","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#computefast","content":"`sdpa_reduced_precision`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2847":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-196","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#computefast","content":"SDPA 的 math 内核以 fp16/bf16 自身精度求和（torch ≥ 2.5）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2848":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-197","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"`mizuoto.runtime.compile.Compiled` 把一个热点模块包进 `torch.compile(dynamic=True)`：不按形状分桶，新的长度不会触发重新编译。引擎调用 `compiled or module`，所以设置关闭时走的就是即时执行路径。该设置在每次加载时读取（`RuntimeOptions.compile`），对修改之后加载的模型生效。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2849":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-198","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"引擎","locale":"zh-CN"},"2850":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-199","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"编译的模块","locale":"zh-CN"},"2851":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-200","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"F5-TTS","locale":"zh-CN"},"2852":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-201","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"DiT，或 E2 的 UNetT","locale":"zh-CN"},"2853":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-202","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"CosyVoice","locale":"zh-CN"},"2854":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-203","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"flow 估计器","locale":"zh-CN"},"2855":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-204","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"GPT-SoVITS v4、v5 Turbo","locale":"zh-CN"},"2856":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-205","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"CFM 估计器（每个加载的 SoVITS 模型，包括音色自己的）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2857":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-206","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"IndexTTS 2、2.5","locale":"zh-CN"},"2858":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-207","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"s2mel DiT 和 BigVGAN（加载选项 `use_torch_compile` 也会开启）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2859":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-208","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"VoxCPM","locale":"zh-CN"},"2860":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-209","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"局部 DiT","locale":"zh-CN"},"2861":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-210","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"`Compiled` 是普通属性而不是子模块：状态字典和句柄都不变。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2862":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-211","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"编译或运行编译代码时的任何错误（没有 C++ 编译器、不支持的算子）都只记一次警告，此后改为即时执行；显存不足仍会抛出。在 MPS 上（`EAGER_DEVICES`）以及位于流式单元之上时，它按即时执行运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2863":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-212","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"它以其策略的 `trace_run` 追踪（编译出的图无法读取上下文变量）；策略不是 `auto` 时，同一时间只运行一个编译调用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2864":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-213","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"wenet 的 `add_optional_chunk_mask` 在 `torch.compiler.is_compiling()` 下改用无分支的写法：它的 `.item()` 曾打断 CosyVoice 的图。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2865":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-214","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"Inductor 把生成的代码缓存在 `/tmp/torchinductor_<user>`。Docker 镜像中没有 C 编译器，所以在那里按即时执行运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2866":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-215","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#torchcompilecomputecompile","content":"**结果不精确。** 在 CPU 上以 fp32 与即时执行相比，音频最大差异为：F5-TTS 9e-5，IndexTTS 6e-5，GPT-SoVITS 3e-5。CosyVoice 的梅尔谱差异在 5.7e-6 之内，但 HiFT 由 F0 驱动的声源把它放大到音频中约 1e-2（即时执行换一个线程数也是如此）。VoxCPM 的浮点差异可能改变语音结束的位置。模型加载后的第一个请求要付出编译时间（CPU 上 30 到 160 秒）；收益见性能记录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2867":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-216","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"GPU 上的自回归模型每一步要启动几千个小内核（Qwen3-TTS：每 80 毫秒一帧约 6 000 个），每次等待设备都会清空队列，于是 CPU 的启动时间和 GPU 的计算时间相加而不是重叠。现在每个解码器每帧（或每个 token）只等待设备一次；开启 `compute.cuda_graphs`（默认开；仅 NVIDIA，ROCm 的 HIP Graph 未经验证）时，一步的内核捕获一次，之后一次性重放。图重放的正是即时执行代码启动的那些内核，参数相同，所以结果与即时执行逐位相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2868":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-217","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"`mizuoto/runtime/graphs.py`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2869":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-218","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"**`Graphs`**：一个模型在一个设备上的图，带有自己的流和生成器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2870":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-219","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"`capture(fn, state, pool)` 先运行一次 `fn`（惰性初始化），恢复它改动的张量（`state`）和生成器，然后捕获。它自己调用 `capture_begin`/`capture_end`：`torch.cuda.graph` 的 `gc.collect()` 和 `empty_cache()` 每次捕获要花几十毫秒，而一个 24 层的步骤要捕获 25 次。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2871":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-220","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"捕获之后，当前流等待捕获流：开始捕获时会在捕获流上重置生成器的 seed 和 offset 张量，第一次重放若抢在这些内核之前，就会从 offset 0 抽取随机数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2872":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-221","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"捕获失败时换上一个状态相同的新生成器（中止的捕获会让旧生成器无法再用），调用方改为即时执行；只记录一次日志。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2873":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-222","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"`drawing(generator)` 把请求的生成器状态装进图自己的生成器，结束后写回，所以带种子的请求抽到的随机数与即时执行相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2874":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-223","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"**`LayerSteps`**：把一个层栈的单 token 步骤按两次注意力调用之间的每一段捕获为一个图，由每层的 `before`、`attend`、`after` 给出。注意力在图之间即时执行，作用于每步变长的键上，所以缓存和注意力内核都与即时执行相同；归一化、投影、旋转位置编码和 MLP 被重放。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2875":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-224","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"**`DecoderSteps`**：用于 `QwenDecoder` 的 `LayerSteps`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2876":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-225","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"**`signature(modules)`**：权重所在的地址。图持有这些地址，所以只用于整个放在设备上的模型（没有流式单元），权重移动后丢弃。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2877":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-226","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"引擎","locale":"zh-CN"},"2878":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-227","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"每步等待次数（之前 → 之后）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2879":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-228","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"捕获的内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"2880":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-229","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"Qwen3-TTS（`qwen3tts/decode.py`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2881":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-230","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"每帧约 35 → 1","locale":"zh-CN"},"2882":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-231","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"采样和 code predictor 的 15 步各一个图；talker 的步骤按注意力调用之间的每一段（`DecoderSteps`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2883":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-232","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"Fish Speech（`mizuoto_fishspeech/generate.py`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2884":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-233","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"每帧约 22 → 1","locale":"zh-CN"},"2885":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-234","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"慢速步骤围绕其注意力（`LayerSteps`）；抽样和快速 transformer 为一个图；随已加载模型保留","locale":"zh-CN"},"2886":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-235","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"CosyVoice 2/3（`cosyvoice/llm.py`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2887":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-236","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"每个 token 50–80 → 1","locale":"zh-CN"},"2888":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-237","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"单 token 步骤（`DecoderSteps`）和抽样，每种 EOS 掩码一个图；上游的 nucleus 循环在设备上重放（`nucleus_device`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2889":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-238","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"VoxCPM（`voxcpm/model.py`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2890":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-239","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"每个 patch 3 → 1","locale":"zh-CN"},"2891":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-240","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"每个注意力跨度和设置下整个 patch 一个图（`PatchDecoder`）；静态缓存随模型保留","locale":"zh-CN"},"2892":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-241","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"GPT-SoVITS（`gptsovits/t2s.py`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2893":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-242","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"每步 2 → 1","locale":"zh-CN"},"2894":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-243","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"T2S 的单 token 步骤围绕每层的注意力，每种行数一组；采样即时执行","locale":"zh-CN"},"2895":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-244","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"IndexTTS（`mizuoto_indextts/gpt.py`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2896":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-245","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"每个 beam 步约 10 → 1","locale":"zh-CN"},"2897":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-246","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"GPT-2 的单 token 步骤围绕每层的注意力；缓存、beam 重排和采样即时执行","locale":"zh-CN"},"2898":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-247","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cuda-graphcomputecuda_graphs","content":"这些等待是用上游写法的精确等价形式去掉的（掩码赋值、列表下标、写入张量的 Python 标量、`.item()` 检查），停止标志每步只读一次。流正在捕获时跳过 `dispatch.DEBUG` 的掩码检查（它需要读回数据；预热时已检查过）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2899":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-248","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#无同步采样","content":"`mizuoto/runtime/sampling.py` 按 transformers 的顺序重现它的 logits 处理器（重复惩罚、最少新 token、屏蔽、温度、top-k、top-p），其中没有任何需要等待设备的操作：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2900":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-249","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#无同步采样","content":"**`multinomial1(probs, generator)`** 就是 `torch.multinomial` 自己的单样本算法 `argmax(p / Exp(1))`，只是去掉了它的两次合法性检查（每次都要等待设备）。在 CPU 和 CUDA 上得到同样的 id 和生成器状态；其他设备上调用 `torch.multinomial`。含 NaN 的概率记在一个张量里（`invalid`），调用方在那唯一一次等待时读取，届时抛出 `torch.multinomial` 的错误。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2901":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-250","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#无同步采样","content":"**`multinomial_draws(probs, n, generator)`**：不放回地抽取多个，`topk(p / Exp(1), n)`（IndexTTS 的 beam）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2902":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-251","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#无同步采样","content":"屏蔽掩码和 EOS 掩码每个设备只构造一次；`repetition_penalty_seen` 在已抽取 id 的掩码上施加惩罚，形状不再增长。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2903":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-252","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#无同步采样","content":"共用的 Qwen 解码器在不需要 autograd 时把 q 和 k 一起归一化、一起旋转，并在设备上的自检表明与 float32 上转的归一化逐位相同时使用 `F.rms_norm`（`_fused_norm_exact`：在较新 torch 的 CUDA 上以 bf16/fp16 计算时，一个内核代替八个）。调用方知道没有填充时，`mask_for(padded=…)` 跳过它的设备检查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2904":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-253","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#无同步采样","content":"**合并投影**（`engines.qwen3tts.load_options.fused_projections`，关）在加载时把每层的 q/k/v 以及 gate/up 权重分别堆叠成一个线性层（`QwenDecoder.fuse`；是真正的 `ops.Linear`，仍可流式加载）。仅用于推理。cuBLAS 对更宽的矩阵会选用别的内核，所以在 CUDA 上结果不逐位相同；输出会列出 `fused_projections`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2905":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-254","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cpu-设置","content":"`mizuoto/core/compute/cpu.py`（只用标准库）由主机在导入 torch 之前应用（建立运行时时调用 `cpu.apply`），并传给它启动的进程（`child_env`：训练阶段、任务进程）。两者都不改变结果。环境中已设置的变量优先；非 glibc 或非 Linux 系统上不起作用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2906":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-255","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cpu-设置","content":"设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"2907":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-256","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cpu-设置","content":"Linux 上 `auto` 即","locale":"zh-CN"},"2908":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-257","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cpu-设置","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"2909":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-258","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cpu-设置","content":"`compute.cpu_allocator`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2910":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-259","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cpu-设置","content":"`tuned`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2911":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-260","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cpu-设置","content":"把 glibc 的 `mmap` 阈值固定为 32 MB，并保留最多 512 MB 空闲堆内存供复用（本进程用 `mallopt`，子进程用 `GLIBC_TUNABLES`）；torch 的大张量放在透明大页上（`THP_MEM_ALLOC_ENABLE`）。一次前向在每层都要分配和释放几到几十 MB 的张量，按 glibc 默认设置每次都重新映射，并由内核清零页面。`system` 保持默认","locale":"zh-CN"},"2912":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-261","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cpu-设置","content":"`compute.cpu_threads`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2913":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-262","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cpu-设置","content":"`cores`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2914":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-263","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#cpu-设置","content":"把 OpenMP 线程绑定到不同的物理核心（`OMP_PLACES=cores`、`OMP_PROC_BIND=close`）。交给调度器时，偶尔有两个线程共用一个核心，那个进程在整个生命周期里都慢三分之一。`off` 交给调度器（有其他繁忙程序共用这些核心时更好）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2915":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-264","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#给引擎作者","content":"所有注意力都经 `accel.attention`，每个调用点一个 `Site`；上游手写的注意力作为调用点的 `reference`；掩码由结构构造时传 `mask_info`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2916":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-265","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#给引擎作者","content":"用 `multinomial1` / `multinomial_draws` 抽样，解码步骤中除每步一次之外不等待设备（不用 `.item()`、`tolist()`、写入张量的 Python 标量、掩码赋值）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2917":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-266","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#给引擎作者","content":"CUDA Graph：在固定张量上运行一步，仅当 `graphs.usable(device, runtime.options.cuda_graphs)` 且模型整个在设备上时用 `Graphs` / `LayerSteps` 捕获，图随已加载模型保留，`signature` 变化时丢弃；在 `drawing(ctx.generator_for(device))` 中抽样。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2918":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-267","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#给引擎作者","content":"对耗时且反复调用的模块用 `compile_module(module, runtime.options.compile, name)` 包装，调用 `compiled or module`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2919":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-268","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#给引擎作者","content":"验证：小型引擎在 CUDA 上开关图、故意让捕获失败、以及 `MIZUOTO_TEST_ACCEL=count` 下的音频都完全相同。见接入引擎和测试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2920":{"id":"/docs/development-api","page_id":"/docs/development-api","type":"page","content":"HTTP API 与命令行","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-api","locale":"zh-CN"},"2921":{"id":"/docs/development-api-0","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api","content":"FastAPI 应用怎样组装、安全中间件和错误怎样映射、事件怎样进入 Ope