elopment-api#新增一条命令","content":"新增一条命令","locale":"zh-CN"},"2933":{"id":"/docs/development-api-12","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api","content":"API（`mizuoto/api/`）和命令行（`mizuoto/cli/`）是同一个核心之上的两层薄壳：解析输入、调用一个核心方法、整理输出。本页讲这两层的结构和约定；核心层本身见架构，Web UI 怎样消费这里的接口见 Web UI。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2934":{"id":"/docs/development-api-13","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#应用create_app","content":"`mizuoto/api/app.py` 的 `create_app(services, bound_host, bound_port, extra_hosts, serve_ui, api_prefix)` 构建整个应用。服务由调用者拥有（`mizuoto webui` 用 `build_services(start_background=True)` 构建、`mizuoto.embed.MizuotoServer` 在宿主应用里构建），应用只把它挂在 `app.state.services` 上。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2935":{"id":"/docs/development-api-14","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#应用create_app","content":"挂载点","locale":"zh-CN"},"2936":{"id":"/docs/development-api-15","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#应用create_app","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"2937":{"id":"/docs/development-api-16","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#应用create_app","content":"`{prefix}/api/v1/...`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2938":{"id":"/docs/development-api-17","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#应用create_app","content":"每种资源一个路由模块，`routers/<资源>.py`，各自声明 `APIRouter(prefix=\"/v1/<资源>\")`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2939":{"id":"/docs/development-api-18","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#应用create_app","content":"`{prefix}/v1/...`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2940":{"id":"/docs/development-api-19","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#应用create_app","content":"`routers/openai.py`：OpenAI 兼容的 `POST /v1/audio/speech` 与 `GET /v1/models`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2941":{"id":"/docs/development-api-20","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#应用create_app","content":"`{prefix}/ws`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2942":{"id":"/docs/development-api-21","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#应用create_app","content":"`sockets.py` 的 `SocketBridge`：EventBus → socket.io，只从服务端推向客户端","locale":"zh-CN"},"2943":{"id":"/docs/development-api-22","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#应用create_app","content":"`{prefix}/docs`、`{prefix}/openapi.json`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2944":{"id":"/docs/development-api-23","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#应用create_app","content":"FastAPI 自带的 Swagger 页面与模式","locale":"zh-CN"},"2945":{"id":"/docs/development-api-24","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#应用create_app","content":"`{prefix}/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2946":{"id":"/docs/development-api-25","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#应用create_app","content":"`static.py` 的 `SPAStaticFiles`，最后注册，只接收前面都没匹配的路径","locale":"zh-CN"},"2947":{"id":"/docs/development-api-26","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#应用create_app","content":"`api_prefix` 把上面全部移到一个子路径下，供宿主应用挂载（见嵌入）。Web UI 不需要随之改动：它从自身脚本的 URL 推出根地址（`webui/src/api/baseUrl.ts`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2948":{"id":"/docs/development-api-27","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#应用create_app","content":"中间件依次是可选的 `CORSMiddleware`（只在 `server.allowed_origins` 非空时）、`GZipMiddleware`（4 KB 以上）和 `SecurityMiddleware`。lifespan 只负责启动和停止 socket 桥。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2949":{"id":"/docs/development-api-28","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#依赖depspy","content":"服务从 `app.state` 取，而不是全局变量：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2950":{"id":"/docs/development-api-29","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#依赖depspy","content":"`is_local(request)` 的含义是\"服务器本机上的浏览器\"：客户端地址是回环地址，**并且**请求的主机名也是回环名。同一台机器上的隧道或反向代理也从回环地址连进来，但会转发公网的 `Host`，所以不算本地。需要本地的路由（列出服务器目录、按服务器路径登记音频、`/models/identify`、`/models/import`、`reveal`、`POST /voices/{id}/weights`、`/engines/{id}/ops/{op}`、数据集的文件夹导入）用 `dependencies=[LocalDep]` 声明，失败时是 403 `not_local`。服务器路径还要求位于 `paths.browse_roots` 之内，这一层检查在核心层。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2951":{"id":"/docs/development-api-30","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#安全中间件securitypy","content":"一个可以删除和移动文件的 API，对每个 HTTP 与 WebSocket 请求做三项检查（全部在路由之前，纯 ASGI 实现）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2952":{"id":"/docs/development-api-31","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#安全中间件securitypy","content":"**Host**：绑定在回环地址时，`Host` 必须是 `localhost`、`127.0.0.1`、`::1`、绑定的主机名或 `extra_hosts` 中的名字，否则 400 `bad_host`。这挡住 DNS 重绑定。`extra_hosts` 按引用保存，隧道启动后加入的公网名立即生效。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2953":{"id":"/docs/development-api-32","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#安全中间件securitypy","content":"**Origin**：改变状态的请求（非 `GET`/`HEAD`/`OPTIONS`）和所有 WebSocket 握手，若带 `Origin`，必须是页面自身的源或 `server.allowed_origins` 中的一个；不带 `Origin` 时，`Sec-Fetch-Site` 只能是 `same-origin`、`none` 或缺失。否则 403 `bad_origin`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2954":{"id":"/docs/development-api-33","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#安全中间件securitypy","content":"**令牌**：设置了 `server.access_token` 时，`/api/`、`/ws/`、`/v1/`、`/openapi.json` 和 `/docs` 下的请求都要携带它：`Authorization: Bearer`、`mizuoto_token` cookie 或 `token` 查询参数，用 `hmac.compare_digest` 比较。缺失或不符是 401 `auth_required`。`/api/v1/app/health` 例外，界面外壳要先加载才能询问令牌。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2955":{"id":"/docs/development-api-34","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#安全中间件securitypy","content":"WebSocket 请求被拒时直接以 1008 关闭。socket.io 的 `connect` 处理器（`SocketBridge._on_connect`）还会再检查一次 `auth.token`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2956":{"id":"/docs/development-api-35","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#错误--httperrorspy","content":"核心层的每个错误（`mizuoto/core/errors.py`）都带 `code`、`http_status` 和 `exit_code`；`install_error_handlers()` 把任何 `MizuotoError` 变成同一个形状：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2957":{"id":"/docs/development-api-36","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#错误--httperrorspy","content":"`ERROR_RESPONSES` 在每个路由器上声明 400/403/404/409 的 `ErrorResponse` 模型，生成的客户端因此知道错误的形状。部分映射：","locale":"zh-CN"},"2958":{"id":"/docs/development-api-37","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#错误--httperrorspy","content":"异常","locale":"zh-CN"},"2959":{"id":"/docs/development-api-38","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#错误--httperrorspy","content":"`code`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2960":{"id":"/docs/development-api-39","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#错误--httperrorspy","content":"HTTP","locale":"zh-CN"},"2961":{"id":"/docs/development-api-40","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#错误--httperrorspy","content":"退出码","locale":"zh-CN"},"2962":{"id":"/docs/development-api-41","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#错误--httperrorspy","content":"`NotFoundError`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2963":{"id":"/docs/development-api-42","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#错误--httperrorspy","content":"`not_found`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2964":{"id":"/docs/development-api-43","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#错误--httperrorspy","content":"404","locale":"zh-CN"},"2965":{"id":"/docs/development-a