95","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#路由的写法","content":"**长操作返回 `Job`。** `POST /tts/speak?wait=true` 用 `JobService.wait` 等待，超过 `timeout` 抛 `OperationTimeoutError`（504，`detail.job_id` 指向仍在运行的任务）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3017":{"id":"/docs/development-api-96","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#路由的写法","content":"**音频文件**用 `files.audio_response()`：`FileResponse` 支持 `Range`，长文件可以拖动。流式合成见 `streaming.py`（分块 WAV 或裸 PCM，采样率在 `X-Mizuoto-Sample-Rate`，任务 id 在 `X-Mizuoto-Job`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3018":{"id":"/docs/development-api-97","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#运行时路由","content":"模型在服务器进程里，所以别的程序（以及 `mizuoto runtime`）要通过 API 查看和释放它们。`routers/runtime.py`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3019":{"id":"/docs/development-api-98","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#运行时路由","content":"路由","locale":"zh-CN"},"3020":{"id":"/docs/development-api-99","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#运行时路由","content":"核心方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"3021":{"id":"/docs/development-api-100","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#运行时路由","content":"返回","locale":"zh-CN"},"3022":{"id":"/docs/development-api-101","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#运行时路由","content":"`GET /api/v1/runtime`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3023":{"id":"/docs/development-api-102","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#运行时路由","content":"`runtime.status()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3024":{"id":"/docs/development-api-103","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#运行时路由","content":"`RuntimeStatus`：已安装 torch 的版本、已加载的模型（引擎、设备、字节数、最近使用、是否忙、远程主机）和各引擎的状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"3025":{"id":"/docs/development-api-104","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#运行时路由","content":"`POST /api/v1/runtime/unload`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3026":{"id":"/docs/development-api-105","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#运行时路由","content":"`runtime.unload(body.model)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3027":{"id":"/docs/development-api-106","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#运行时路由","content":"卸载 `UnloadRequest.model` 指定的模型（为 `null` 时卸载所有没在用的模型）之后的 `RuntimeStatus`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3028":{"id":"/docs/development-api-107","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#运行时路由","content":"`GET /api/v1/runtime/doctor`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3029":{"id":"/docs/development-api-108","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#运行时路由","content":"`runtime.doctor()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3030":{"id":"/docs/development-api-109","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#运行时路由","content":"`DoctorReport`：torch 构建与硬件是否匹配、推荐的构建及其安装命令、每个引擎、附加依赖和训练器的检查结果，以及旧的 `<data>/envs` 的大小","locale":"zh-CN"},"3031":{"id":"/docs/development-api-110","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#运行时路由","content":"`GET /api/v1/engines/{id}/doctor` 是单个引擎的同一份报告。引擎详情（`EngineStatus`）带 `available` 和 `missing`（`torch`、`mizuoto-fishspeech` 等），不再有环境信息；`GET /api/v1/app/meta` 带 `torch`，即已安装的版本或 `null`。`POST /api/v1/compute/release`（**释放显存**）卸载所有空闲引擎的模型。这些接口的模型定义在 `mizuoto/core/inference/models.py`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3032":{"id":"/docs/development-api-111","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#openapi-与事件","content":"socket 事件不是 HTTP 路由，FastAPI 本不会把它们写进模式。`openapi.py` 的 `MizuotoAPI` 覆盖 `openapi()`：遍历 `EventBase.get_events()`（`mizuoto/core/events/models.py` 中每个带 `__event_name__` 的子类），把各自的模型加入 `components.schemas`，再加一个 `ServerEvents` 对象，事件名 → 模型：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3033":{"id":"/docs/development-api-112","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#openapi-与事件","content":"当前的事件：`settings_changed`、`job_updated`、`job_log`、`jobs_cleared`、`outputs_added`、`outputs_removed`、`runtime_changed`、`compute_changed`、`engines_changed`、`voices_changed`、`datasets_changed`、`projects_changed`、`experiments_changed`、`train_metrics`、`presets_changed`、`models_changed`。每个事件携带快照而不是活对象：socket 桥稍后在事件循环上序列化它，而任务线程还在写。桥从 EventBus 订阅（在线程里被调用，用 `call_soon_threadsafe` 进入事件循环），按事件名 `emit`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3034":{"id":"/docs/development-api-113","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#openapi-与事件","content":"socket 只推送变化。客户端收到事件后修补或作废对应的查询，重连后重新拉取屏幕上的内容；任何状态都必须能通过 REST 读到。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3035":{"id":"/docs/development-api-114","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#为-web-ui-生成类型","content":"`scripts/generate_openapi.py` 在临时数据目录里构建服务和应用（`serve_ui=False`），打印 `app.openapi()`，不启动服务器。`python scripts/dev.py typegen` 把它交给 `openapi-typescript`，写出 `mizuoto/webui/src/api/schema.d.ts`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3036":{"id":"/docs/development-api-115","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#为-web-ui-生成类型","content":"`--default-non-nullable false` 让请求体中带默认值的字段保持可选；`Record` 设置了 `json_schema_serialization_defaults_required`，响应中的这些字段则是必填，类型与服务器实际发送的一致。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3037":{"id":"/docs/development-api-116","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#为-web-ui-生成类型","content":"既作请求体又作响应的模型（`SpeakRequest` 在输出的\"重新运行\"里被返回；项目的 `Chapter`、`Line`、`Speaker`；`CommonParams`、`VoiceInput`、`EmotionInput`、`OutputSpec`……）在模式中分成 `-Input` 和 `-Output` 两份。界面发送 `S['SpeakRequest-Input']`，读取 `S['SpeakRequest-Output']`；`webui/src/api/types.ts` 为常用的几个起了别名。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3038":{"id":"/docs/development-api-117","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#新增一个路由","content":"**核心方法。** 在 `mizuoto/core/<领域>/service.py` 写方法，参数和返回值是 `Record` 模型（`mizuoto/core/<领域>/models.py`）；错误只用 `core/errors.py` 的类。若它改变了界面要显示的东西，发布一个事件（新事件就在 `core/events/models.py` 加一个 `EventBase` 子类，模式会自动带上它）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3039":{"id":"/docs/development-api-118","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#新增一个路由","content":"**路由。** 在 `mizuoto/api/routers/` 对应的模块里加函数，带 `operation_id`；新资源则新建模块并加入 `app.py` 的 `ROUTERS`。读服务器路径的操作加 `dependencies=[LocalDep]`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3040":{"id":"/docs/development-api-119","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#新增一个路由","content":"**类型。** 运行 `python scripts/dev.py typegen`，提交 `schema.d.ts`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3041":{"id":"/docs/development-api-120","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#新增一个路由","content":"**测试。** 在 `tests/api/test_api.py` 用 `TestClient` 对着 dummy 引擎测试；改变状态的请求带 `headers={\"origin\": \"http://localhost\"}`（文件里的 `ORIGIN`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3042":{"id":"/docs/development-api-121","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#命令行","content":"`mizuoto/cli/` 用 Typer。结构：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3043":{"id":"/docs/development-api-122","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#命令行","content":"文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"3044":{"id":"/docs/development-api-123","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#命令行","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"3045":{"id":"/docs/development-api-124","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#命令行","content":"`app.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3046":{"id":"/docs/development-api-125","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#命令行","content":"`get_app()` 注册全部命令（且只在这里注册）；`main()` 统一处理错误和退出码","locale":"zh-CN"},"3047":{"id":"/docs/development-api-126","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#命令行","content":"`commands/*.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3048":{"id":"/docs/development-api-127","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#命令行","content":"每条命令是一个普通函数，参数用 `Annotated[..., typer.Option(...)]` 声明","locale":"zh-CN"},"3049":{"id":"/docs/development-api-128","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#命令行","content":"`factory.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3050":{"id":"/docs/development-api-129","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#命令行","content":"`typer_factory()`（命令按字母排序的 `AlphabeticalMixedGroup`）、给每条命令和每个组都加 `--debug` 并把领域错误变成退出码的 `DebugTyperCommand`、`report_error()`；`typer._click` 的私有导入只在这里","locale":"zh-CN"},"3051":{"id":"/docs/development-api-130","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#命令行","content":"`output.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3052":{"id":"/docs/development-api-131","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#命令行","content":"`open_services()`（每条命令构建一次服务，不启动后台线程）、`print_json()`、`print_table()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3053":{"id":"/docs/development-api-132","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#命令行","content":"`progress.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3054":{"id":"/docs/development-api-133","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#命令行","content":"`job_progress(services)`：订阅同一个 EventBus，把任务进度画成 stderr 上的 Rich 进度条；`finish(job)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3055":{"id":"/docs/development-api-134","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#命令行","content":"一条命令的典型形状（`commands/projects.py`）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3056":{"id":"/docs/development-api-135","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#命令行","content":"`print_json()` 用 `model_dump(mode=\"json\")`，与 API 序列化的方式相同。命令行不启动调度器：会产生任务的命令用核心方法的 `wait=True`（内部是 `jobs.run_now`，在当前线程前台执行，Ctrl+C 取消），外面套 `job_progress`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3057":{"id":"/docs/development-api-136","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#命令行","content":"错误：`DebugTyperCommand.invoke` 捕获 `MizuotoError`，`report_error()` 打印消息，`detail[\"hint\"]` 中有修复命令时再打印一行，然后以错误的 `exit_code` 退出。重模块（核心模型、uvicorn）在函数内导入：`tests/test_architecture.py` 检查导入 `mizuoto.cli.app` 既不加载 torch 也不加载 fastapi。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3058":{"id":"/docs/development-api-137","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#新增一条命令","content":"在 `mizuoto/cli/commands/<组>.py` 写一个带完整注解的普通函数，提供 `--json`，调用与 API 路由相同的核心方法。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3059":{"id":"/docs/development-api-138","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#新增一条命令","content":"在 `mizuoto/cli/app.py` 的 `get_app()` 中注册，名字和帮助文字写在注册处：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3060":{"id":"/docs/development-api-139","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#新增一条命令","content":"把它加进 `tests/cli/test_cli.py` 的 `EXPECTED_TREE`。`test_command_tree` 比较整棵命令树，漏加或多加都会失败：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3061":{"id":"/docs/development-api-140","page_id":"/docs/development-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-api#新增一条命令","content":"一个名字不能既是命令又是命令组，所以环境变量列表是 `mizuoto env vars`，而不是 `mizuoto env`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3062":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","type":"page","content":"整体架构","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-architecture","locale":"zh-CN"},"3063":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-0","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture","content":"