ease()` 回队列，各自运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3283":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-220","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"`mizuoto/core/errors.py` 包含全部错误类型。每个类都带 `code`、`http_status` 和 `exit_code`，两个前端机械地转换：API 把任何 `MizuotoError` 变成 `{\"code\", \"message\", \"detail\"}`（`mizuoto/api/errors.py`）；CLI 把它变成退出码，并把 `detail[\"hint\"]` 作为第二行打出（`cli/factory.report_error`）。错误码字符串在 `mizuoto/core/codes.py`（只用标准库），所以引擎和训练阶段不需要 pydantic，抛出 `EngineError(message, detail, code=codes.…)` 即可，核心再用 `error_from_code()` 还原成对应的类。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3284":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-221","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"异常","locale":"zh-CN"},"3285":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-222","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"`code`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3286":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-223","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"HTTP","locale":"zh-CN"},"3287":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-224","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"退出码","locale":"zh-CN"},"3288":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-225","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"`MizuotoError`（基类）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3289":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-226","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","content":"`internal_error`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3290":{"id":"/docs/development-architecture-227","page_id":"/docs/development-architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-architecture#错误与退出码","con