与加载选项","content":"`OptionSpec`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3733":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-56","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#参数选项与加载选项","content":"引擎专有选项（`engine_options`）；未知的选项一律报错；`group = \"hidden\"` 不在表单里显示。引擎的 `OPTION_SCHEMA` 必须与它们完全一致","locale":"zh-CN"},"3734":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-57","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#参数选项与加载选项","content":"`[load_options.<名字>]`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3735":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-58","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#参数选项与加载选项","content":"`OptionSpec`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3736":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-59","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#参数选项与加载选项","content":"模型加载时应用（`engines.<id>.load_options`，即引擎卡片上的“选项”），如 F5-TTS 的 `ode_method`、IndexTTS 的 `use_torch_compile`。它们通过 `LoadSpec.options` 传给引擎","locale":"zh-CN"},"3737":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-60","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#模型与模型文件清单","content":"`files`（`ModelFiles`）还可以有 `subdir`、`into`、`include`、`exclude` 和 `unpack`；`extra` 列出更多仓库；`assets` 指明共享资源；`vram_mb` 是随模型显示的目录显存数字（加载从不因它而拒绝）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3738":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-61","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#模型与模型文件清单","content":"增改模型后运行 `python scripts/dev.py model-manifests omnivoice`。`scripts/model_manifests.py` 把 Hugging Face 修订版本固定到当前提交，并把每个文件的大小和 SHA-256（LFS 文件取自元数据，小文件下载后计算）写进 `manifests/files/<manifest>`。下载时据此校验；`test_catalogue_models_have_files_manifests` 检查目录里的每个模型都有文件清单。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3739":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-62","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#共享资源许可与训练","content":"**`[[assets]]`**：一个引擎的多个模型共用的文件（GPT-SoVITS 的编码器和文本前端数据、IndexTTS-2 的 w2v-BERT 等），写法同模型，安装在 `<models>/_assets/<engine>/<name>/`。模型在 `assets` 里写明需要哪些；引擎通过 `spec.options[\"assets\"]`（资源 id → 目录）拿到它们的目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3740":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-63","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#共享资源许可与训练","content":"**`[licence]`**：`gated = true` 时，下载权重和共享资源、合成都要求 `engines.<id>.accepted_licence == id@version`；`file` 指向 `manifests/licences/` 里的全文；`trains_others = false` 拒绝把它的输出用作其他引擎的训练数据；`notice` 显示在结果下方；`commercial` 用于给输出打标签。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3741":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-64","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#共享资源许可与训练","content":"**`[training.<id>]`**：训练方法，由引擎的 `TRAINER` 运行；见训练器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3742":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-65","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#识别模型文件夹","content":"`mizuoto model import` 只凭文件内容判断引擎和变体：`mizuoto/core/models/detect.py` 读取配置文件（OmniVoice：`config.json` 里 `model_type == \"omnivoice\"`），引擎的 `detect_variant` 必须与它一致。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3743":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-66","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#2-实现","content":"一个引擎是 `mizuoto/engines/<id>/` 下的一个包，`__init__.py` 导出 `Engine` 子类，各模块只导入分层规则允许的东西：`mizuoto.runtime`、`mizuoto.nn`、`mizuoto.text`、`mizuoto.training`、`mizuoto.core.codes`、`mizuoto.core.inference.tasks`、自己的包，以及 numpy、torch 和文本库；绝不导入另一个引擎。它的模块顶层不导入 torch（`test_engine_contract_import_is_light` 和 `test_manifest_options_match_the_engines` 会在没有 torch 的情况下导入引擎模块）：torch 在方法内部导入，类型注解放在 `if TYPE_CHECKING:` 下。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3744":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-67","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#engine","content":"成员","locale":"zh-CN"},"3745":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-68","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#engine","con