`[-1, 1]` 的 float32 单声道音频，从不编码：拼接、归一化、重采样和编码都是核心的事。它收到的是解析好的、确实存在的绝对路径（参考音频是 `cache/refs/` 里的 16 位 WAV），从不下载。核心已经对照清单校验过请求，所以引擎只做映射，不做检查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3783":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-106","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#任务类型","content":"请求和结果都是 `mizuoto/core/inference/tasks.py` 里的标准库数据类，由 `mizuoto.runtime.engine` 重新导出：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3784":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-107","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#任务类型","content":"类型","locale":"zh-CN"},"3785":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-108","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#任务类型","content":"字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"3786":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-109","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#任务类型","content":"`SynthesisTask`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3787":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-110","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#任务类型","content":"`text`、`language`、`voice`、`style`（`instruct`、`emotion`）、`params`（按 Mizuoto 名称的通用参数）、`options`（引擎选项）、`texts`（批处理）、`segment` / `segments`、`stream`、`text_stream`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3788":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-111","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#任务类型","content":"`VoiceSpec`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3789":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-112","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#任务类型","content":"`references`（`Reference`：`audio_path`、`transcript`、`language`、`sample_rate`、`duration`）、`preset`、`description`、`attributes`、`weights`、`cache`、`voice_id`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3790":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-113","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#任务类型","content":"`VoiceConversionTask`、`SpeechEditTask`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3791":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-114","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#任务类型","content":"源音频和音色；音频、其文本和若干 `EditSpan`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3792":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-115","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#任务类型","content":"`LoadSpec`、`Description`、`AudioChunk`、`VoiceCache`、`OptionSpec`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3793":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-116","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#任务类型","content":"`load` 收到的、`describe` 返回的、音频、音色缓存、选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"3794":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-117","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#模型句柄","content":"每个带权重的模块都包进一个 `ModelHandle`，列在 `self.handles` 里，模型管理器才能安放它、移走它并报告它的大小：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3795":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-118","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#模型句柄","content":"用 `ops.default` 搭建模块（不做随机初始化），用 `mizuoto.runtime.loading`（`load_state_dict`、严格的 `load_into`）加载权重，参数保持 `nn.Module` 创建时的样子。每个随机数都从 `ctx.generator_for(device)` 或 `ctx.rng` 取，并按上游的顺序抽取（见运行时）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3796":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-119","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#模型句柄","content":"用 `mizuoto.runtime.accel.attention(q, k, v, site=SITE, …)` 计算注意力，不要直接调用 `F.scaled_dot_product_attention`（架构测试会禁止）：每个调用点声明一次 `SITE = accel.Site(\"<id>.<部分>\")`，并传入上游传给 SDPA 的参数（`causal` 就是它的 `is_causal`）。上游手写注意力的调用点把那段代码作为 `reference`；只能由参照计算的调用点设为 `swappable=False`（在分数中加入相对位置的注意力根本不是调用点，仍是手写代码）。调用点按某种结构（单侧填充、因果、窗口）构建掩码时，同时传入 `mask_info`，让更快的内核也能处理这次调用（加速）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3797":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-120","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#错误","content":"抛出 `EngineError(message, detail, code=codes.…)`，错误码取自 `mizuoto.core.codes`（`invalid_input`、`capability_not_supported`、`model_missing` 等）；把解决问题的命令放进 `detail[\"hint\"]`。`Unsupported(message)` 就是 `capability_not_supported`。核心依据错误码还原领域错误；内存不足和其他异常会自动映射。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3798":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-121","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#3-注册","content":"运行时按 id 找实现（`mizuoto/runtime/engine.py` 的 `get_engine`）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3799":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-122","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#3-注册","content":"**在本发行包里**：把引擎加进 `BUILTIN`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3800":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-123","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#3-注册","content":"**在单独的发行包里**（许可证不允许随 `mizuoto` 发布，即决策 D1）：在它的 `pyproject.toml` 里把类注册到入口点组 `mizuoto.engines`，依赖 `mizuoto`，并在 `mizuoto/core/inference/service.py` 的 `DISTRIBUTIONS` 里加上引擎 id → 发行包名，这样缺少安装时能按名字报告。Fish Speech 的写法：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3801":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-124","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#3-注册","content":"入口点每个进程只读一次：装上这样的发行包后要重启 Mizuoto。它的包遵守引擎的规则并与清单一致（`check_native_package`、`check_options_mirror`，由它的 `tests/test_<id>_package.py` 调用），版本号在 `mizuoto_<id>/version.py`，适用的 Mizuoto 版本写在它的 `pyproject.toml` 里（`check_gated_distribution`），由 CI 的 `gated` 和 `oldest-mizuoto` 作业检查，由 `scripts/build_wheels.py native` 构建（见发布）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3802":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-125","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#3-注册","content":"当 torch 能导入（dummy 引擎不需要）且实现已注册时，引擎就是*可用*的；否则 `EngineStatus.missing` 写明缺什么，界面和 `mizuoto doctor` 给出解决办法。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3803":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-126","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#4-测试","content":"`tests/engines_native/test_<id>_tiny.py` 在临时目录里搭一个与引擎结构相同、权重随机的小模型（配置文件、字节级词表、测试自己写出的 safetensors），在 CPU 上走真实的代码路径：加载、音色提示及其缓存、解码、批处理、可重复的种子、取消。不下载任何权重，所以 CI 每次推送都跑（CPU 版 torch）。`test_omnivoice_tiny.py` 是一个完整的例子；训练器有 `test_<id>_train_tiny.py`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3804":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-127","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#4-测试","content":"`tests/engines/test_contract.py`（标记 `engine` 和 `weights`，默认排除）对可用引擎的每个已安装目录模型，走完整的链路（规划 → 任务 → 运行时 → 引擎）：`describe` 与清单一致；声明的每种音色模式都能发声、采样率正确、时长与文本相称、说的是那段文本（装了 ASR 时，词错误率低于 0.35）；种子可复现；两段能正确切分；中途取消能让引擎停下；不留下任何进程级状态。新引擎的 id 要加进套件里 `engines` 设置覆盖的列表。见测试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3805":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-128","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#4-测试","content":"Mizuoto 对移植的标准是：在 CPU 上以 fp32、带种子运行时，输出与上游实现完全相同。对于 Mizuoto 0.1 已有的引擎，`scripts/parity/` 让同样的用例分别走 0.1 的链路和原生链路，逐采样比较（见测试）。移植复现了什么、哪里有偏差、对照结果如何，记在引擎参考中该引擎的页面（`site/content/docs/engines-<id>.mdx` 与 `.en.mdx`）；以后的改动不能破坏的规则记在 `AGENTS.md`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3806":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-129","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#4-测试","content":"先看随机数：上游可能在构建模型或准备参考音频时抽过随机数（HuBERT 的层丢弃、IndexTTS 的 w2v-BERT、CosyVoice 3 的声码器噪声），或者是对跨步不同的张量抽的。再看张量形状和内核：SDPA 带不带掩码、掩码的精度、是否连续、CPU 线程数。`AGENTS.md` §2b 按引擎逐一列出了这类发现。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3807":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-130","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"`mizuoto/engines/omnivoice/`（总共约 2900 行）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3808":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-131","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"模块","locale":"zh-CN"},"3809":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-132","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"3810":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-133","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"`engine.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3811":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-134","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"`OmniVoiceEngine` 和 `LoadedOmniVoice`：加载、音色提示、迭代解码、长文本分块、解码与后处理","locale":"zh-CN"},"3812":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-135","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"`model.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3813":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-136","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"基于 `mizuoto.runtime.lm.qwen` 解码器的扩散语言模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"3814":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-137","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"`audio_tokenizer.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3815":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-138","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"HiggsAudio v2 分词器：`nn/codecs/dac`、`nn/ssl/hubert`、残差码本","locale":"zh-CN"},"3816":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-139","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"`audio.py`、`text.py`、`duration.py`、`voice_design.py`、`lang_map.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3817":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-140","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"按 pydub 的算法去静音和淡入淡出；文本分块与标点；时长估计；由设计属性生成指令；语言名称","locale":"zh-CN"},"3818":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-141","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"`train.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3819":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-142","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"`OmniVoiceTrainer`：`full` 和 `lora` 两种方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"3820":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-143","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"从中可以看到：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3821":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-144","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"**加载**：`OmniVoiceModel(config, ops.default)` 由 `load_into(model, load_state_dict(folder / \"model.safetensors\"))` 填充，再转成目标精度（GPU 支持 bf16 就用 bf16，否则 fp16；CPU 上 fp32；明确设置的 `engines.omnivoice.dtype` 优先）；音频分词器同样处理；文本分词器来自 `mizuoto.text.tokenize.bpe.load_bpe(folder)`；两个句柄。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3822":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-145","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"**参数映射**：Mizuoto 的通用参数名映射到上游的生成配置（`num_steps → num_step`、`temperature → class_temperature`），其余由引擎选项填充。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3823":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-146","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"**三种音色模式**：有参考音频 → 音色提示；有属性 → 由 `instruct_from(attributes)` 生成的指令；都没有 → 模型自己的声音。自由文本描述会抛出 `capability_not_supported`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3824":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-147","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"**音色缓存**：`prepare_voice` 把提示存成 `prompt.pt`；`synthesize` 优先用 `voice.cache[\"prompt\"]`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3825":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-148","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"**随机数**：Gumbel 噪声从 `ctx.generator_for(self.device)` 抽取；HuBERT 的层丢弃抽样（上游在评估模式下也会抽）从 `ctx.generator_for(\"cpu\")` 抽取。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3826":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-149","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"**取消与进度**：每个解码步调用 `ctx.check_cancel()`，之后 `ctx.progress(\"generating\", …)`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3827":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-150","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"**批处理**：设置了 `task.texts` 时，所有文本放进一批，各自以 `segment = task.segment + index` 产出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3828":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-151","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"**内存**：`memory_required` 按批中每行估算 logits 所需的工作内存。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3829":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-152","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"OmniVoice 的引擎页面记录了对照结果（在 CPU 上以 fp32 运行时，克隆、设计、自身音色和微调模型都与 0.1 完全相同）以及做到完全一致所需的细节。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3830":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-153","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#清单一个新引擎要动哪些地方","content":"`mizuoto/core/engines/manifests/<id>.toml`；运行 `dev.py model-manifests <id>`；需要接受许可时，把许可全文放进 `manifests/licences/`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3831":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-154","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#清单一个新引擎要动哪些地方","content":"`mizuoto/engines/<id>/`（或 `packages/native/<id>/`）：`OPTION_SCHEMA` 与清单一致的 `Engine` 子类、它的 `LoadedEngine` 和所需的模块；可共用的部分放进 `mizuoto/nn` 或 `mizuoto/runtime`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3832":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-155","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#清单一个新引擎要动哪些地方","content":"注册：`mizuoto/runtime/engine.py` 的 `BUILTIN`，或 `mizuoto.engines` 入口点加 `DISTRIBUTIONS`。`mizuoto/core/models/detect.py` 能识别它的模型文件夹；可选的包放进 `pyproject.toml` 的附加依赖和 `EXTRAS`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3833":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-156","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#清单一个新引擎要动哪些地方","content":"测试：`tests/engines_native/test_<id>_tiny.py`（单独发行的引擎把它们放在自己包的 `tests/` 里，如 `packages/native/<pkg>/tests/`）；`tests/core/test_engines.py::test_registry_lookups` 里的引擎 id 列表，以及 `tests/engines/test_contract.py` 里的 `engines` 覆盖。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3834":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-157","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#清单一个新引擎要动哪些地方","content":"`mizuoto model download <id>/<名字>`，然后在真实模型上跑契约套件；把移植情况和对照结果记进该引擎的页面（`engines-<id>`，中英文都要），把它加进侧边栏（`meta.json`、`meta.en.json`）和引擎参考的表格；如有新的规则，再记进 `AGENTS.md`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3835":{"id":"/docs/development-memory","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","type":"page","content":"显存与内存","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-memory","locale":"zh-CN"},"3836":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-0","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory","content":"运行时怎样仿照 ComfyUI 使用显存和内存：阶段、预算与显存模式、单元与权重流式加载、主机副本、部分加载与让出显存、精确的显存不足重试、工作显存估算及其校准、模拟设备、训练预设，以及引擎要怎样配合。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3837":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-1","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"代码位置","locale":"zh-CN"},"3838":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-2","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-memory#阶段","content":"阶段","locale":"zh-CN"},"3839":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-3","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"预算","locale":"zh-CN"},"3840":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-4","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-memory#单元哪些会流式加载","content":"单元：哪些会流式加载","locale":"zh-CN"},"3841":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-5","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-memory#权重流式加载","content":"权重流式加载","locale":"zh-CN"},"3842":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-6","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-memory#主机副本与内存","content":"主机副本与内存","locale":"zh-CN"},"3843":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-7","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-memory#让出显存","content":"让出显存","locale":"zh-CN"},"3844":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-8","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-memory#显存不足","content":"显存不足","locale":"zh-CN"},"3845":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-9","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-memory#工作显存估算","content":"工作显存估算","locale":"zh-CN"},"3846":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-10","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-memory#报告","content":"报告","locale":"zh-CN"},"3847":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-11","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-memory#静态-kv-缓存与-cuda-分配器","content":"静态 KV 缓存与 CUDA 分配器","locale":"zh-CN"},"3848":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-12","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-memory#模拟设备与测试","content":"模拟设备与测试","locale":"zh-CN"},"3849":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-13","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-memory#训练","content":"训练","locale":"zh-CN"},"3850":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-14","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-memory#编写配合显存管理的引擎","content":"编写配合显存管理的引擎","locale":"zh-CN"},"3851":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-15","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory","content":"只要模型的最小工作集放得进设备，模型就能运行，而不必整个放得下。Mizuoto 的运行时仿照 ComfyUI（`load_models_gpu`、`ModelPatcher` 的部分加载、dynamic VRAM）做到这一点，但不用原生分配器：请求只放上当前这一步需要的组件；放不下时，其他组件逐个单元让出显存；仍然不够时，组件部分加载，其余权重留在内存中，每层运行时再流式加载到设备。显存不足由“失败”变成“更慢”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3852":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-16","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory","content":"这一切都不改变任何结果。流式加载的层与常驻的层用的是相同的张量计算，重试的那一步重放相同的随机数，测试让每个引擎在权重流式加载的情况下运行，并把音频与普通运行逐样本比较。会改变数值的机制（分块解码、静态 KV 缓存、训练的 `lowest` 预设）都需要主动开启，并在输出中注明。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3853":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-17","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory","content":"面向用户的设置见性能与加速；运行时的整体介绍见运行时。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3854":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-18","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"部分","locale":"zh-CN"},"3855":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-19","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"代码","locale":"zh-CN"},"3856":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-20","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"3857":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-21","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"`VramPolicy`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3858":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-22","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"`mizuoto/runtime/policy.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3859":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-23","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"模式、保留量、主机副本、锁页预算、复制流和显存不足时的开关；每次使用时由 `compute` 设置构造（`core/inference/service.py: policy_from`），所以修改设置后下一次加载即生效，无需重启","locale":"zh-CN"},"3860":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-24","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"单元","locale":"zh-CN"},"3861":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-25","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"`mizuoto/runtime/units.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3862":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-26","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"模块中哪些部分可以留在设备之外，哪些是固定部分","locale":"zh-CN"},"3863":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-27","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"`ModelHandle`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3864":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-28","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"`mizuoto/runtime/handle.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3865":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-29","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"一个组件：整体或部分放置、主机副本、流式单元的钩子","locale":"zh-CN"},"3866":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-30","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"`Streamer`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3867":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-31","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"`mizuoto/runtime/stream.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3868":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-32","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"每个设备一个：流式单元在设备上的副本、学到的运行顺序、副流上的预取、锁页","locale":"zh-CN"},"3869":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-33","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"`ModelManager`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3870":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-34","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"`mizuoto/runtime/manager.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3871":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-35","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"所有已登记的组件、预算、让出显存、部分加载、显存不足重试前的清理、校准、报告","locale":"zh-CN"},"3872":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-36","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"`RequestContext.use` / `run`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3873":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-37","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"`mizuoto/runtime/context.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3874":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-38","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"请求的一个阶段；`run` 另加精确重试和回退","locale":"zh-CN"},"3875":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-39","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"`peak_bytes`、`BufferCache`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3876":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-40","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"`mizuoto/runtime/lm/cache.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3877":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-41","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"供估算用的 KV 缓存峰值；静态缓存","locale":"zh-CN"},"3878":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-42","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"`tiled_1d`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3879":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-43","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"`mizuoto/nn/dsp/tiles.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3880":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-44","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"以重叠分块解码（一种回退方式）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3881":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-45","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"`DeviceService`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3882":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-46","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"`mizuoto/runtime/device.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3883":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-47","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"空闲显存、`vram_limit_mb`、模拟设备","locale":"zh-CN"},"3884":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-48","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"训练工具","locale":"zh-CN"},"3885":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-49","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"`mizuoto/training/memory.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3886":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-50","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"梯度检查点、预设、主机端优化器、流式加载的冻结权重、估算","locale":"zh-CN"},"3887":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-51","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#阶段","content":"设置了 `PHASED = True` 的引擎（Mizuoto 自带的所有真实引擎；dummy 引擎没有）把请求的每个部分包在一个阶段里，这样只放上这部分的组件，并只为这部分预留工作显存：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3888":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-52","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#阶段","content":"**`ctx.use(handles, memory)`** 是一个上下文管理器：管理器把 `handles`（整体或部分）放到设备上，为 `memory` 字节的工作显存留出空间，并在代码块结束前不让它们让出显存。用于产出音频或消费生成器的阶段。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3889":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-53","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#阶段","content":"**`ctx.run(name, handles, fn, memory, generators=(), fallback=None)`** 对一个纯函数做同样的事，另加精确重试和回退（见下文）。凡是代码块唯一的作用就是其返回值的地方都用它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3890":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-54","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#阶段","content":"阶段没有列出的组件留在原处，别的阶段需要显存时它们先让出：IndexTTS 克隆一个已缓存的音色时，从不放上 w2v-BERT 或 CAM++。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3891":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-55","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#阶段","content":"没有 `PHASED` 的引擎在整个调用期间得到所有句柄，以 `memory_required(task)` 作为工作显存。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3892":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-56","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#阶段","content":"在 CPU 上管理器什么都不移动、不计数（加载设备与卸载设备相同），所以阶段在那里没有开销。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3893":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-57","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"`ModelManager.load(handles, memory)` 按设备决定：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3894":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-58","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"**需要** = 句柄尚未放到设备上的字节 + 工作显存（估算乘以其校准系数，见下文）+ `compute.vram_reserve_mb`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3895":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-59","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"**空闲** = 驱动报告的空闲显存，加上 torch 缓存分配器占着但未使用的部分；设置了 `compute.vram_limit_mb` 时，不超过它减去本进程已占用的量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3896":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-60","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"空闲不够时，其他空闲组件让出显存（见下文“让出显存”），然后重新测量空闲显存。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3897":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-61","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"放得下就整体加载；否则在预算内部分加载，预算为空闲显存减去工作显存和保留量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3898":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-62","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"模式（`compute.vram_mode`、`engines.<id>.vram_mode`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3899":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-63","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"放得下时整体加载","locale":"zh-CN"},"3900":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-64","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"否则","locale":"zh-CN"},"3901":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-65","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"`auto` / `normal`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3902":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-66","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"是","locale":"zh-CN"},"3903":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-67","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"部分加载，最少到最小工作集","locale":"zh-CN"},"3904":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-68","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"`high`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3905":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-69","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"是","locale":"zh-CN"},"3906":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-70","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"在空闲组件整体移走后仍整体加载；不做部分加载","locale":"zh-CN"},"3907":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-71","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"`low`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3908":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-72","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"仅当权重不超过设备显存的一半（`low_ratio`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3909":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-73","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"在这一半之内部分加载","locale":"zh-CN"},"3910":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-74","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"`none`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3911":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-75","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"从不","locale":"zh-CN"},"3912":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-76","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"每个单元都流式加载：设备上只有固定部分和正在复制的副本","locale":"zh-CN"},"3913":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-77","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"`shared`（MPS 上自动使用）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3914":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-78","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"是","locale":"zh-CN"},"3915":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-79","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"整体加载：统一内存移出也省不出空间，所以不做部分加载，也不保留主机副本","locale":"zh-CN"},"3916":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-80","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"**估算从不拒绝加载**（ComfyUI 的做法）。`high` 模式下，空闲组件腾出空间后整体尝试加载；其他模式下，低于最小工作集时仍按最小工作集尝试，并在日志中记一条警告。只有显存分配真正失败才算错误。加载前从不检查模型目录中的 `vram_mb`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3917":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-81","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"**一块 GPU 上的两个请求。** `compute.gpu_jobs` 大于 1 时，如果一个请求连最小工作集都放不下（`high` 模式下是整个模型放不下），而另一个请求正占着该设备上的组件，它会等那个请求释放，最多 10 分钟，期间检查取消；然后再尝试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3918":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-82","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#单元哪些会流式加载","content":"单元是一起移动的一组权重：一个解码器层、一个 DiT 块、一级声码器（即 ComfyUI dynamic VRAM 中的 units）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3919":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-83","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#单元哪些会流式加载","content":"模块可以用 `memory_units() -> list[nn.Module]` 指定自己的单元。否则，每个 `ModuleList` 或 `Sequential` 中不小于 1 MB 的子模块是一个单元（取最外层的列表；单元不会再往下拆）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3920":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-84","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#单元哪些会流式加载","content":"**只有 `nn.Linear`、`Conv1d/2d`、`ConvTranspose1d/2d` 的权重会流式加载**，以及声明了 `STREAMABLE = True` 的类（IndexTTS 的 GPT-2 `Conv1D`）。这些层的权重只在其 `forward` 中读取。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3921":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-85","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#单元哪些会流式加载","content":"**其余都是固定部分**：只要组件在设备上，它们就在设备上。包括嵌入（码本经常通过 `.weight` 直接读取）、归一化、缩放系数、缓冲区、与单元外模块共享的参数（共享的嵌入与输出头）、模型的第一个参数（代码通过它判断模型所在设备）、小于 64 KB 的单元、标为 `fixed` 的模块，以及固定在 CPU 上的模块（`DeviceService.pin_to_cpu`，从不移动）之下的一切。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3922":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-86","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#单元哪些会流式加载","content":"引擎用 `handle.mark(module, mark)` 在句柄上标记子模块：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3923":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-87","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#单元哪些会流式加载","content":"标记","locale":"zh-CN"},"3924":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-88","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#单元哪些会流式加载","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"3925":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-89","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#单元哪些会流式加载","content":"使用者","locale":"zh-CN"},"3926":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-90","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#单元哪些会流式加载","content":"`fixed`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3927":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-91","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#单元哪些会流式加载","content":"从不流式加载：代码在其 `forward` 之外读取它的权重","locale":"zh-CN"},"3928":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-92","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#单元哪些会流式加载","content":"CosyVoice 的 HiFT F0 预测器；GPT-SoVITS 的 T2S（`memory_units() = []`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3929":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-93","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#单元哪些会流式加载","content":"`hot`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3930":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-94","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#单元哪些会流式加载","content":"每一步运行多次：优先常驻","locale":"zh-CN"},"3931":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-95","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#单元哪些会流式加载","content":"Qwen3-TTS 的 code predictor、VoxCPM 的局部 DiT 与编码器、Whisper 的解码器","locale":"zh-CN"},"3932":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-96","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#单元哪些会流式加载","content":"`cold`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3933":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-97","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#单元哪些会流式加载","content":"每个请求运行一次：优先流式加载","locale":"zh-CN"},"3934":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-98","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#单元哪些会流式加载","content":"放不下全部单元时，在 `hot` 单元之后，句柄的 `kind` 决定哪些单元常驻：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3935":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-99","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#单元哪些会流式加载","content":"`sequence`（自回归语言模型，每个 token 每层运行一次）：按运行顺序，于是固定的前若干层常驻，每个 token 流式加载的都是同样那些层；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3936":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-100","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#单元哪些会流式加载","content":"`oneshot`（编码器、解码器、对整段输入做的 flow 步）：从最大的开始，这样正在复制的副本较小。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3937":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-101","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#单元哪些会流式加载","content":"句柄的**最小工作集**是它的固定部分，加上 Streamer 同时持有的、它最大的那几个单元的副本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3938":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-102","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#权重流式加载","content":"流式单元的权重留在内存中。单元上以及每个持有其权重的模块上都有 forward 前后钩子，调用时把 `param.data` 换成设备上的副本，调用后换回。叶子模块上的钩子让任何进入该层的路径都能工作（`layer.forward_step(…)`、`vae.decode`），`ops` 和层的代码都不需要改。整个放在设备上的组件根本没有钩子，所以常驻路径没有任何开销。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3939":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-103","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#权重流式加载","content":"设备的 `Streamer`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3940":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-104","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#权重流式加载","content":"**保留少量副本**：正在运行的单元和正在传输的单元（`compute.async_offload + 1` 个）；副本被丢弃前再次运行的单元（CFG 的两半、beam）直接复用；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3941":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-105","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#权重流式加载","content":"**学习单元的运行顺序**（记录每个单元上次之后运行的单元），并在 CUDA 和 ROCm 上**预取**：当前单元计算时，在副流上复制接下来的单元。计算流在使用副本前等待复制的事件，每个副本都记录在计算流上，缓存分配器不会提前复用它的显存。不按学到的顺序进入的单元当场复制：正确性从不依赖顺序；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3942":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-106","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#权重流式加载","content":"**锁页**：在 `compute.max_pinned_mb` 之内把流式权重的主机副本放进锁页内存（复制变为异步，约快一倍）；默认为 ComfyUI 的预算：Windows 上为内存的 40 %，其他系统为 `max(0.4 × 内存, min(0.9 × 内存, 内存 − 4 GB))`。超出部分仍为可分页内存，同步复制。XPU 和 MPS 上同步复制。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3943":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-107","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#权重流式加载","content":"副本在推理模式之外、以权重自身的精度创建，所以流式加载的层与常驻的层用同一种张量计算（推理张量在 CPU 上会走另一个内核）。每次取副本都检查取消。位于流式单元之上的 `Compiled` 模块改为即时执行（编译出的图会持有权重），CUDA Graph 只对整个放在设备上的模型捕获。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3944":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-108","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#主机副本与内存","content":"有主机副本时（`compute.host_copies`：`auto` 在空闲内存高于 `compute.ram_reserve_mb` 时保留；`on`；`off`），放到设备上的参数保留其主机张量，把它移出设备不需要任何传输：设备显存成了内存之上的一层缓存。部分加载的组件总是保留主机副本（流式单元就放在那里）。缓冲区总是复制回来（模块可能原地更新它）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3945":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-109","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#主机副本与内存","content":"卸载时直接释放所有内容，不复制回来。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3946":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-110","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#主机副本与内存","content":"放置之后会改变的权重通过句柄修改（`handle.replace(module)`：音色自己的 GPT-SoVITS 权重），所以主机副本不会过时。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3947":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-111","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#主机副本与内存","content":"`compute.ram_reserve_mb`（留空：2 GB 与内存十分之一中较大者）：空闲内存低于它时，运行时服务先丢弃整体加载的组件的主机副本，再按最久未用卸载空闲模型，从不卸载固定的或忙碌的模型（`RuntimeService.relieve_ram`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3948":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-112","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#让出显存","content":"空闲显存不够时，同一设备上的空闲组件按以下顺序让出差额：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3949":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-113","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#让出显存","content":"部分加载的组件（本来就慢；ComfyUI 的第一排序键）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3950":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-114","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#让出显存","content":"然后不在 `engines.<id>.pinned_models` 中的模型先于固定的模型；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3951":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-115","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#让出显存","content":"然后最久未用的。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3952":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-116","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#让出显存","content":"任何请求正在使用的组件都不会让出；正在运行的模型中当前阶段用不到的组件则会。每个让出者按放置顺序的逆序逐个单元让出（`partially_unload`），直到满足差额；在 `high` 和 `shared` 模式下整体移走。`empty_cache` 只在让出之后执行，从不每个请求都执行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3953":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-117","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#让出显存","content":"部分加载一个阶段的组件时：较小的组件先整体加载，每个都给其余组件至少留下最小工作集，最大的组件得到剩下的部分，其余单元流式加载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3954":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-118","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#让出显存","content":"在管理器之上，`RuntimeService` 最多保留 `compute.max_resident_models` 个已加载模型，空闲超过 `compute.unload_after_minutes` 的模型被卸载（仅服务器），在 GPU 上微调前把该 GPU 上所有空闲模型移走（`release_device`），并在任务因显存不足失败后卸载所有 GPU 上未在使用的模型（`ComputeService.release_after_oom`，即 ComfyUI 的 `unload_all_models`）。见运行时。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3955":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-119","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#显存不足","content":"**精确重试**（`compute.oom_retry`，默认开）。经 `ctx.run` 运行的阶段显存不足时：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3956":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-120","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#显存不足","content":"先离开这次尝试的异常帧（它持有失败尝试的张量）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3957":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-121","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#显存不足","content":"`manager.after_oom`：该设备上其他所有空闲组件移出设备，Streamer 缓存的副本丢弃，该阶段的每个组件被限制为它原先在设备上的一半（`ModelHandle.cap_bytes`，保留到它被移出设备为止，这样后面的请求不会再次显存不足）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3958":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-122","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#显存不足","content":"请求的生成器、它的 `rng` 以及引擎指定的生成器（`generators=`）恢复到第一次尝试前的状态；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3959":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-123","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#显存不足","content":"重新运行该阶段：相同的随机数，相同的结果，只是更慢。最多重试两次；输出记录 `applied.oom_retries` 并带一条警告。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3960":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-124","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#显存不足","content":"`ctx.use` 下的阶段（产出音频或消费生成器的阶段）不会重试，所以它的估算必须覆盖它可能达到的上限。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3961":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-125","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#显存不足","content":"**回退**（`compute.oom_fallback`，默认关）。重试之后，如果引擎提供了更省显存的方式（`ctx.run(…, fallback=(what, fn))`），就用它。其输出略有不同，因此记录在 `applied.fallbacks` 中并带一条警告：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3962":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-126","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#显存不足","content":"引擎","locale":"zh-CN"},"3963":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-127","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#显存不足","content":"回退方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"3964":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-128","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#显存不足","content":"ASR","locale":"zh-CN"},"3965":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-129","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#显存不足","content":"一次一个 30 秒窗口","locale":"zh-CN"},"3966":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-130","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#显存不足","content":"GPT-SoVITS","locale":"zh-CN"},"3967":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-131","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#显存不足","content":"一次一句","locale":"zh-CN"},"3968":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-132","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#显存不足","content":"F5-TTS","locale":"zh-CN"},"3969":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-133","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#显存不足","content":"Vocos 分块解码","locale":"zh-CN"},"3970":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-134","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#显存不足","content":"IndexTTS","locale":"zh-CN"},"3971":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-135","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#显存不足","content":"BigVGAN 分块解码","locale":"zh-CN"},"3972":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-136","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#显存不足","content":"VoxCPM","locale":"zh-CN"},"3973":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-137","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#显存不足","content":"VAE 分块解码","locale":"zh-CN"},"3974":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-138","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#显存不足","content":"`tiled_1d` 每次解码 256 帧，重叠 32 帧并交叉淡化（ComfyUI 的音频 VAE 分块方式）。Qwen3-TTS 的编解码器本来就分段解码；CosyVoice 的 HiFT 带有相位状态，分块会破坏它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3975":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-139","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#工作显存估算","content":"阶段的估算决定其权重能否整体放下，所以按请求本身估算（文本 token 数、批次行数、参考音频长度），而不是按 `max_new_tokens` 允许的最坏情况。为请求永远用不到的显存预留空间，会白白把权重挤出去：最坏情况 8192 帧再翻倍，对一个只用约 20 MB 的 Qwen3-TTS 句子要预留 2.4 GB。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3976":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-140","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#工作显存估算","content":"语言模型的缓存按文本估算：Qwen3-TTS 每个文本 token 16 帧，IndexTTS 24 个码，GPT-SoVITS 每个音素 16 个，CosyVoice 按上游的每个 token 20 个，均不超过 `max_new_tokens`；Fish Speech 的批次按其真实上限；精度和 KV 宽度按模型实际计算时的。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3977":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-141","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#工作显存估算","content":"`runtime.lm.cache.peak_bytes(position_bytes, layers, positions, kind, rows)` 给出增长中的缓存的峰值：`dynamic` 为所有层，加上一步拼接时一层的新拷贝（每层的旧张量在下一层之前释放），而不是整个缓存的两倍；`static` 为翻倍后的缓冲区，加上增长时的一个旧缓冲区。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3978":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-142","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#工作显存估算","content":"在 `ctx.run` 下，偶尔超出估算的生成会以更多权重流式加载的方式精确地重新运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3979":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-143","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#工作显存估算","content":"**校准。** 在 CUDA 或 XPU 上每个阶段之后，管理器测量其工作显存：高于已放置权重的峰值，减去 Streamer 副本的最大占用，再减去该阶段之后保留下来的内存（CUDA Graph 的内存池、随模型保留的缓冲区）。超出估算时，它按阶段记住这个比值（乘以 1.1，最多 16），以引擎和组件名为键（`qwen3tts:talker`），下次相应地多预留。比值保存在 `<cache>/memory/calibration.json`（格式版本 2；其他版本的文件会被忽略）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3980":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-144","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#报告","content":"每个输出的 `meta.memory`：`streamed_mb`（请求期间从内存复制的量）、`loaded_mb`、`size_mb`，部分加载的组件还有 `partial`：每个组件的 `reason`（预算不够、`vram_mode low` 或 `none`、显存不足后被限制，或为别的组件让出了显存），以及当时权衡的 `mode`、`free_mb`、`working_mb`、`reserve_mb`，还有 `loaded_mb`、`size_mb` 和 `gave_up_for`。发生时日志中也有同样的信息。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3981":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-145","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#报告","content":"`GET /api/v1/runtime` 与 `mizuoto runtime`：每个模型的 `loaded_bytes`、`streamed_bytes`、`host_bytes`；网页界面的已加载模型面板用进度条显示。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3982":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-146","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#报告","content":"`mizuoto doctor` 有一项 `memory` 检查结果，列出当前生效的策略（模式、保留量、上限、内存保留量、主机副本、锁页预算、复制流、重试与回退）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3983":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-147","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#静态-kv-缓存与-cuda-分配器","content":"`compute.kv_cache = static` 让 Qwen 系列的缓存（Qwen3-TTS、CosyVoice 2/3）写入预分配的缓冲区，满了就翻倍（`BufferCache`）：没有每步拼接，没有临时拷贝，碎片更少。注意力读取的是带缓冲区步长的视图，某些内核会以另一种顺序求和。在 CPU 上结果相同；在 GPU 上验证结果相同之前一直需要主动开启。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3984":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-148","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#静态-kv-缓存与-cuda-分配器","content":"`compute.cuda_allocator`（`native`；`async`：cudaMallocAsync；`expandable`：可扩展段；`auto` 即 `native`）由主机在第一次使用 CUDA 之前写入 `PYTORCH_CUDA_ALLOC_CONF`，从不由引擎代码设置，并传给训练阶段。环境中已设置的值优先；修改在下次启动时生效。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3985":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-149","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#模拟设备与测试","content":"`DeviceService(simulate={\"cpu\": bytes}, strict=True)`（设置项 `compute.simulate_vram_mb`，供测试和一致性验证工具使用）让 CPU 扮演一块该大小的 GPU。管理器通过复制来放置权重、流式加载单元，并按模拟的大小计算已放置的量。严格模式下，不在设备上的每个权重都以 meta 张量存放，于是：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3986":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-150","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#模拟设备与测试","content":"在阶段之外使用的组件会报错（它没有被放置）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3987":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-151","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#模拟设备与测试","content":"在 `forward` 之外读取的单元权重会报错（它不在那里）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3988":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-152","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#模拟设备与测试","content":"`tests/engines_native/streaming.py` 这样运行每个小型引擎：所有单元都流式加载（`none` 模式）、取最小工作集与整个大小之间一半的空间、整体加载，并把每次的输出与普通 CPU 运行比较：完全相同。一致性验证工具在真实模型上也这样做（`--setting compute.simulate_vram_mb=…`）。见测试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3989":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-153","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#训练","content":"训练阶段在自己的进程中运行并独占设备：GPU 阶段开始前，主机把该 GPU 上所有空闲模型移走，训练任务占用 `gpu:<dev>` 的全部名额（`JobSpec.exclusive`）。在阶段内部，`training.memory` 选择 `mizuoto/training/memory.py` 中工具的一组预设；方法自己的超参数优先：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3990":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-154","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#训练","content":"预设","locale":"zh-CN"},"3991":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-155","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#训练","content":"增加","locale":"zh-CN"},"3992":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-156","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#训练","content":"结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"3993":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-157","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#训练","content":"`standard`（默认）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3994":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-158","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#训练","content":"无：完全按各引擎的训练配方","locale":"zh-CN"},"3995":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-159","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#训练","content":"与上游相同","locale":"zh-CN"},"3996":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-160","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#训练","content":"`low`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3997":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-161","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#训练","content":"对每个块做梯度检查点（`gradient_checkpointing`：`blocks`、`every:k`；VoxCPM、Qwen3-TTS、OmniVoice、F5-TTS、CosyVoice），重算时恢复全局生成器*以及训练器自己的生成器*；F5-TTS 的 EMA 副本放在内存中；VoxCPM 的 LoRA 冻结权重以 autocast 精度存放","locale":"zh-CN"},"3998":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-162","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#训练","content":"相同（在 CPU 上逐个训练器测试）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3999":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-163","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#训练","content":"`lowest`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4000":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-164","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#训练","content":"另外把 AdamW 的状态放在内存中并在 CPU 上更新（`host_optimizer`；Qwen3-TTS、OmniVoice、不用梯度缩放的 F5-TTS）；VoxCPM 的 LoRA 基座权重在每次矩阵乘法时从内存流式加载（`streamed_linear`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4001":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-165","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#训练","content":"在 GPU 上优化器求和的最后几位可能不同","locale":"zh-CN"},"4002":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-166","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#训练","content":"始终如此：GPU 阶段报告 `memory/peak_mb`；`MethodInfo.memory_mb` 根据模型大小估算每个预设下的峰值，GPU 上运行时若估算超过空闲显存，会在日志中警告并给出放得下的预设。训练器本身见训练器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4003":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-167","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#编写配合显存管理的引擎","content":"**把每个带权重的模块包进 `ModelHandle`**，列在 `self.handles` 中。自回归语言模型用 `kind=\"sequence\"`；每一步运行多次的部分标为 `hot`，代码在 `forward` 之外读取其权重的模块标为 `fixed`。默认拆分（`ModuleList`/`Sequential` 的子模块）不适合模型时，用 `memory_units()` 指定单元。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4004":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-168","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#编写配合显存管理的引擎","content":"**不要自己移动模块。** 在主机上构建（或在 `spec.device` 上；句柄会接手），由管理器放置。以 float64 计算的模块在没有 float64 的设备上用 `float64_device` 和 `pin_to_cpu`。用 `handle.replace` 换权重。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4005":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-169","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#编写配合显存管理的引擎","content":"**设置 `PHASED = True`，把每个部分放进一个阶段**：纯代码块用 `ctx.run`，产出或消费生成器的代码块用 `ctx.use`。引擎在上下文之外自己持有的生成器用 `generators=` 传入，重试时会一并重放。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4006":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-170","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#编写配合显存管理的引擎","content":"**按请求估算每个阶段的工作显存**：KV 缓存用 `peak_bytes`，按模型实际计算的精度；注意力分数、CFG 批次、按长度计算的解码器激活。`ctx.use` 下要给出该阶段可能达到的上限。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4007":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-171","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#编写配合显存管理的引擎","content":"**在有更省显存且足够接近的方式时提供回退**（分块、一次一项），附一句说明它做什么。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4008":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-172","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#编写配合显存管理的引擎","content":"**在 `streaming.py` 下运行小型模型**：所有单元流式加载、一半、不流式，严格模式。在那里失败时，会指出在阶段之外使用的组件或在单元之外读取的权重。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4009":{"id":"/docs/development-performance","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","type":"page","content":"性能记录","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-performance","locale":"zh-CN"},"4010":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-0","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance","content":"在结果不变的规则下怎样测量 Mizuoto 的速度（perf.py、train_perf.py），每次测量的条件，以及每一轮工作改了什么：CPU 上的几轮、注意力分发器、各引擎的 CUDA Graph 和 torch.compile。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4011":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-performance#怎样测量","content":"怎样测量","locale":"zh-CN"},"4012":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-2","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-performance#测量条件","content":"测量条件","locale":"zh-CN"},"4013":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-3","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-上时间花在哪里","content":"CPU 上时间花在哪里","locale":"zh-CN"},"4014":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-4","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-第一轮cpu-设置与精确的清理","content":"CPU 第一轮：CPU 设置与精确的清理","locale":"zh-CN"},"4015":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-5","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-第二轮训练","content":"CPU 第二轮：训练","locale":"zh-CN"},"4016":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-6","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-performance#注意力分发器","content":"注意力分发器","locale":"zh-CN"},"4017":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-7","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu不等待设备的解码以-cuda-graph-运行","content":"GPU：不等待设备的解码，以 CUDA Graph 运行","locale":"zh-CN"},"4018":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-8","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-performance#qwen3-tts","content":"Qwen3-TTS","locale":"zh-CN"},"4019":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-9","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-performance#fish-speech","content":"Fish Speech","locale":"zh-CN"},"4020":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-10","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-performance#cosyvoice-23","content":"CosyVoice 2/3","locale":"zh-CN"},"4021":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-11","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-performance#voxcpm","content":"VoxCPM","locale":"zh-CN"},"4022":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-12","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-performance#gpt-sovits","content":"GPT-SoVITS","locale":"zh-CN"},"4023":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-13","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-performance#indextts","content":"IndexTTS","locale":"zh-CN"},"4024":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-14","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-performance#在-cpu-上","content":"在 CPU 上","locale":"zh-CN"},"4025":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-15","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-performance#在-cpu-上的-torchcompile","content":"在 CPU 上的 `torch.compile`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4026":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-16","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-performance#因改变结果而没有采用的做法","content":"因改变结果而没有采用的做法","locale":"zh-CN"},"4027":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-17","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance","content":"推理和训练代码的提速工作遵循一条规则：**结果不变**。这里记录的每项优化，在 CPU 上（引擎与上游的一致性就是在 CPU 上确立的）都与之前的代码给出逐样本相同的音频，以及逐位相同的损失和保存的权重。在 GPU 上，“相同”指在同一块 GPU、同一驱动、同一 torch 和同一设置下与之前的代码完全相同。改变运算的提速是需要主动开启的功能，见加速；面向用户的设置见性能与加速。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4028":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-18","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#怎样测量","content":"工具","locale":"zh-CN"},"4029":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-19","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#怎样测量","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"4030":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-20","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#怎样测量","content":"`scripts/parity/perf.py run <cases.jsonl>… --name NAME [--only ID] [--repeat N] [--device D] [--setting k=v] [--reference NAME] [--profile] [--torch-profile]`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4031":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-21","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#怎样测量","content":"在一个进程中让一致性用例经过整个系统，每个运行 `--repeat` 次（3 次）：第一次加载模型并准备音色，其余为预热后的运行。记录墙钟时间、加载、首块音频、引擎总时间、实时率，以及每个阶段（`ctx.use` / `ctx.run`，不含嵌套阶段，另有阶段之外的时间）内的时间。逐样本比较各次运行之间的音频，以及与 `--reference` 的音频：该名称的一次早先运行，否则为用例的一致性基准文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"4032":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-22","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#怎样测量","content":"`perf.py compare --a NAME --b NAME [--report out.md]`、`perf.py show NAME`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4033":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-23","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#怎样测量","content":"两轮的预热运行对照，加速比，以及变化最大的阶段","locale":"zh-CN"},"4034":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-24","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#怎样测量","content":"`scripts/parity/train_perf.py run <engine> --fixture F --name NAME [--reference NAME] [--profile]`、`compare`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4035":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-25","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#怎样测量","content":"按一致性基准的配方经过整个系统做一次微调，每个阶段都像实际使用时一样是子进程：每个阶段的时间、每步时间、每个指标，以及导出写出的每个权重文件的 SHA-256，并与早先的运行比较","locale":"zh-CN"},"4036":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-26","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#怎样测量","content":"`--profile` 在 cProfile 下多跑一次不计入的运行（`train_perf.py` 则在进程内运行各阶段）；`--torch-profile` 按自身耗时列出算子。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4037":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-27","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#怎样测量","content":"记录写到 `MIZUOTO_PERF_DIR`（默认 `~/code_workspace/experiment/perf`），每个用例每轮一个 JSON 文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4038":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-28","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#怎样测量","content":"预热时间取最快的预热运行：机器上的其他工作只会让运行变慢。重要的比较都交错进行，两份代码在各自的进程里先后运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4039":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-29","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#怎样测量","content":"冻结要测量的代码（在该提交上建一个工作树），运行基线：对用例集运行 `perf.py run`，对每个训练器运行 `train_perf.py run`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4040":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-30","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#怎样测量","content":"用 `--profile`、`--torch-profile` 找出时间花在哪里；涉及内核层面的改动，先写一个微基准，并在引擎实际用到的形状上用 `torch.equal` 检查该运算的输出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4041":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-31","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#怎样测量","content":"以基线为 `--reference` 运行改动后的代码：每个用例的音频都必须完全相同，每次微调的指标和权重哈希都必须完全相同。然后对代码有改动的引擎运行一致性验证，并运行测试套件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4042":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-32","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#怎样测量","content":"用 `perf.py compare` 生成表格，并把这一轮记在这里。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4043":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-33","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#怎样测量","content":"推理用例集共 13 个：Qwen3-TTS `base-clone-en` 与 `cv-en-aiden`，F5-TTS `clone-en`，OmniVoice `clone-en`，CosyVoice `v2-clone-en` 与 `v3-clone-en`，GPT-SoVITS `v2-clone-zh` 与 `v4-clone-zh`，Fish Speech `clone-en`，IndexTTS `v2-clone-en` 与 `v15-clone-en`，VoxCPM `v2-clone-en` 与 `v15-clone-en`。训练用例集是每个训练器在一个 11 段音频的数据集上做一次微调。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4044":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-34","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#测量条件","content":"**CPU**：AMD Ryzen 9 5900X（12 核；torch 用 12 个线程），125 GB 内存，torch 2.8.0（MKL 2024.2、oneDNN 3.7.1），Python 3.11；fp32，VoxCPM 除外（bf16，其上游默认值）。机器上的其他工作约占 9 % 的线程；计算线程被抢占的运行会停顿，所以单次运行的波动可达 ±10 %。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4045":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-35","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#测量条件","content":"**GPU**：两块 RTX 3090（24 GB），**与另一项工作共用**，它在每块卡上占约 21 GB 显存并让两块卡都保持 100 % 繁忙。下面所有 GPU 数字都因共用而偏大；比较都在同一块 GPU、同一 torch 上交错进行。放不进剩余显存的模型只测量其解码循环：真实尺寸、随机权重、只取少数几层，用到这种方式的地方都会注明。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4046":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-36","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-上时间花在哪里","content":"CPU 优化之前的预热请求：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4047":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-37","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-上时间花在哪里","content":"引擎、用例","locale":"zh-CN"},"4048":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-38","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-上时间花在哪里","content":"音频（秒）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4049":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-39","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-上时间花在哪里","content":"预热（秒）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4050":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-40","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-上时间花在哪里","content":"各阶段（秒）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4051":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-41","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-上时间花在哪里","content":"Qwen3-TTS base-clone-en","locale":"zh-CN"},"4052":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-42","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-上时间花在哪里","content":"5.44","locale":"zh-CN"},"4053":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-43","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-上时间花在哪里","content":"34.25","locale":"zh-CN"},"4054":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-44","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-上时间花在哪里","content":"talker 30.2，codec decoder 4.0","locale":"zh-CN"},"4055":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-45","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance