ormance#cpu-上时间花在哪里","content":"**矩阵乘法占主导**（`F.linear`/`addmm`：50–90 % 的时间）。自回归语言模型对着 fp32 权重一次生成一个 token，受内存带宽限制（Qwen3-TTS 的 1.7B talker 每帧以约 36 GB/s 读取约 6.8 GB）。更快的内核、更低的精度或其他线程数都会改变求和结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4104":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-94","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-上时间花在哪里","content":"**VoxCPM 2 的 77 秒中有 40 秒花在注意力上**：每一步都在掩码下对整个 8192 个位置的静态缓存做注意力，而实际只填了几百个位置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4105":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-95","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-上时间花在哪里","content":"**内存分配**：每层都要分配和释放几到几十 MB 的张量，按 glibc 默认设置每次都重新映射，并由内核清零页面。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4106":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-96","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-第一轮cpu-设置与精确的清理","content":"改动","locale":"zh-CN"},"4107":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-97","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-第一轮cpu-设置与精确的清理","content":"为什么结果不变","locale":"zh-CN"},"4108":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-98","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-第一轮cpu-设置与精确的清理","content":"`compute.cpu_allocator` 和 `compute.cpu_threads`（加速）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4109":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-99","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-第一轮cpu-设置与精确的清理","content":"改变的是内存从哪里来、线程在哪里运行，而不是计算什么；线程数相同，工作的切分方式就相同","locale":"zh-CN"},"4110":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-100","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-第一轮cpu-设置与精确的清理","content":"VoxCPM 只对缓存中当前长度之后下一个 256 的倍数以内的位置做注意力（保留掩码），而不是全部 8192 个位置","locale":"zh-CN"},"4111":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-101","page_id":"/docs/development-performance