rmance-174","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-第一轮cpu-设置与精确的清理","content":"39.8 → 36.9","locale":"zh-CN"},"4185":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-175","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-第一轮cpu-设置与精确的清理","content":"×1.08","locale":"zh-CN"},"4186":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-176","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-第一轮cpu-设置与精确的清理","content":"**CPU 设置是怎样选定的。** 每种配置都在相互交错的独立进程中运行。同时固定 `mmap` 阈值并保留空闲堆内存对 F5-TTS 有帮助（预热中位数 64.0–68.6 秒 → 53.7–60.9 秒）；只改其中一项反而更慢；glibc 的 `hugetlb` 和 tcmalloc 都不比 torch 自己的大页更好。OmniVoice 看起来每个进程呈双峰（约 28 秒或 38 秒，与分配器无关）：原因是线程放置。默认放置的六个进程中有一个跑出 38.5 秒；线程绑定到核心的六个进程中没有一个这样（27.6–28.3 秒）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4187":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-177","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-第二轮训练","content":"对微调做性能剖析，结果显示：与其他地方一样主要是反向传播和矩阵乘法，此外是 AdamW 逐张量的循环、dropout 掩码，以及 Fish Speech 在 123 秒的训练阶段中花 41 秒重放约 180 亿次 32 位随机数抽取，只为把进程级生成器推进到上游开始训练时所处的状态。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4188":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-178","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-第二轮训练","content":"改动","locale":"zh-CN"},"4189":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-179","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-第二轮训练","content":"为什么结果不变","locale":"zh-CN"},"4190":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-180","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-第二轮训练","content":"跳跃式推进生成器而不是逐个抽取：在 GF(2) 中计算 MT19937 抽取 *n* 次后的状态（`mizuoto/training/rng.py`），204 次跳跃用 2.3 秒，而不是抽取的 41–52 秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"4191":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-181","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-第二轮训练","content":"状态与逐个抽取逐字节相同（从 1 次到 2·10⁹ 次抽取都测试过）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4192":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-182","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-第二轮训练","content":"Fish Speech 合并 LoRA 时每个基座权重只做一份 float32 拷贝，而不是两份","locale":"zh-CN"},"4193":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-183","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-第二轮训练","content":"数值相同","locale":"zh-CN"},"4194":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-184","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-第二轮训练","content":"不求梯度时 Fish Speech 编解码器的 `snake` 原地计算","locale":"zh-CN"},"4195":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-185","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-第二轮训练","content":"同样的运算、同样的顺序","locale":"zh-CN"},"4196":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-186","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-第二轮训练","content":"Fish Speech S2 Pro LoRA（2 步）：CPU 优化前 207.4 秒，第一轮后 172–173 秒，第二轮后 128.5–130.6 秒（训练阶段 146.8 → 83 秒），指标和权重完全相同。它的预热请求从 110.4 秒降到 85.7 秒（编解码器 3.3 → 2.0 秒），一致性用例不变。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4197":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-187","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#注意力分发器","content":"让每次注意力调用都经过 `mizuoto.runtime.accel`（加速）在 `auto` 下每次调用约多 1 微秒：解码规模的调用（16 个头、1 个查询、300 个键、头维度 128）多 1.11 微秒（28.8 → 30.0 微秒），小调用多 0.82 微秒。用例集中调用次数最多的请求是 7,152 次（Fish Speech），远低于其时间的 0.1 %。全部 13 个用例和全部 7 次微调都保持完全相同；预热时间在机器的波动范围内变化（Fish Speech 交错测量：之前 86.6/86.9 秒，之后 86.5/87.3 秒）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4198":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-188","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#注意力分发器","content":"在 CPU 上设置 `compute.attention = fast` 时，每次调用都经过策略，全部由 SDPA 计算，没有回退（每个请求的调用次数：F5-TTS 704，OmniVoice 896，GPT-SoVITS v4 3,044，VoxCPM 1.5 3,928，CosyVoice 2 4,688，Qwen3-TTS 4,877，IndexTTS 2 6,667，Fish Speech 7,152）。七个引擎的音频仍完全相同；IndexTTS 2 最多相差 2 个 int16 步长（SNR 86.1 dB，长度相同），因为它的 perceiver 中手写的 softmax 改由 SDPA 计算。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4199":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-189","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu不等待设备的解码以-cuda-graph-运行","content":"每个自回归解码器都逐个启动每步的几千个小内核，并且每步要等待设备多次（`torch.multinomial` 的检查、每步复制的掩码、读回的填充掩码、停止检查），于是 CPU 的启动时间和 GPU 的计算时间相加。现在每个解码器每步只等待一次，并在开启 `compute.cuda_graphs` 时以 CUDA Graph 重放一步的内核（加速）。下面每个结果都与旧代码的音频或 token 相同；每个引擎在 CPU 上的一致性用例都保持完全相同。全部在上文所述的共用 GPU 上测量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4200":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-190","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#qwen3-tts","content":"按 1.7B 模型尺寸、随机权重、28 层 talker 中取 4 或 8 层、100 帧、批大小 1 的解码循环（1.7B 模型放不进剩余显存）；每帧毫秒数，两轮交错中最快的预热运行：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4201":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-191","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#qwen3-tts","content":"torch","locale":"zh-CN"},"4202":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-192","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#qwen3-tts","content":"配置","locale":"zh-CN"},"4203":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-193","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#qwen3-tts","content":"4 层","locale":"zh-CN"},"4204":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-194","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#qwen3-tts","content":"8 层","locale":"zh-CN"},"4205":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-195","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#qwen3