pment-release","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-release#版本","content":"版本","locale":"zh-CN"},"4366":{"id":"/docs/development-release-7","page_id":"/docs/development-release","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-release#wheelscriptsbuild_wheelspy","content":"Wheel：`scripts/build_wheels.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4367":{"id":"/docs/development-release-8","page_id":"/docs/development-release","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-release#冒烟测试scriptssmoke_wheelspy","content":"冒烟测试：`scripts/smoke_wheels.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4368":{"id":"/docs/development-release-9","page_id":"/docs/development-release","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-release#ci-与发布工作流","content":"CI 与发布工作流","locale":"zh-CN"},"4369":{"id":"/docs/development-release-10","page_id":"/docs/development-release","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-release#docker","content":"Docker","locale":"zh-CN"},"4370":{"id":"/docs/development-release-11","page_id":"/docs/development-release","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-release#模型镜像scriptsmirror_modelspy","content":"模型镜像：`scripts/mirror_models.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4371":{"id":"/docs/development-release-12","page_id":"/docs/development-release","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-release#文档站","content":"文档站","locale":"zh-CN"},"4372":{"id":"/docs/development-release-13","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release","content":"一次发布产出三个发行包：`mizuoto`（wheel 和 sdist，内含构建好的 Web UI，以及所有采用宽松许可证的引擎），以及两个需要接受许可的引擎的 wheel：`mizuoto-fishspeech` 和 `mizuoto-indextts`。三者都装进同一个环境，装在用户自选的 torch 之上，各自有版本号、各自检查、各自发布。本页讲它们怎样构建、检查并发布到 PyPI（由发布工作流用 twine 完成）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4373":{"id":"/docs/development-release-14","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#依赖","content":"Mizuoto 是一个环境：核心、API、命令行、Web UI 和每个引擎的依赖都写在 `pyproject.toml` 里，一次安装。每个新依赖都要回答：它在 CI 覆盖的每个平台（Linux x86_64、Windows x86_64、macOS arm64，CPython 3.10–3.13）上有没有 wheel，它会不会改变结果，它会不会改动进程级状态。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4374":{"id":"/docs/development-release-15","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#必需的依赖","content":"用途","locale":"zh-CN"},"4375":{"id":"/docs/development-release-16","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#必需的依赖","content":"包","locale":"zh-CN"},"4376":{"id":"/docs/development-release-17","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#必需的依赖","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"4377":{"id":"/docs/development-release-18","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#必需的依赖","content":"Web 与命令行","locale":"zh-CN"},"4378":{"id":"/docs/development-release-19","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#必需的依赖","content":"fastapi（≥ 0.115.3）、starlette（≥ 0.40）、uvicorn、websockets、python-socketio、pydantic 2、httpx、typer（\\< 0.28）、rich、tomli-w、tomli（Python \\< 3.11）、send2trash","locale":"zh-CN"},"4379":{"id":"/docs/development-release-20","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#必需的依赖","content":"Starlette 0.40 起 `FileResponse` 支持 Range，播放器可以拖动；uvicorn 要有 websockets 才能处理 WebSocket；typer 锁上限，因为命令行用到它的私有模块","locale":"zh-CN"},"4380":{"id":"/docs/development-release-21","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#必需的依赖","content":"音频","locale":"zh-CN"},"4381":{"id":"/docs/development-release-22","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#必需的依赖","content":"av（PyAV）、numpy","locale":"zh-CN"},"4382":{"id":"/docs/development-release-23","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#必需的依赖","content":"解码、编码、重采样都用 PyAV，其余用 numpy；不调用 ffmpeg 或 sox 程序","locale":"zh-CN"},"4383":{"id":"/docs/development-release-24","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#必需的依赖","content":"运行时","locale":"zh-CN"},"4384":{"id":"/docs/development-release-25","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#必需的依赖","content":"torch（≥ 2.8）、safetensors、soxr、tokenizers","locale":"zh-CN"},"4385":{"id":"/docs/development-release-26","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#必需的依赖","content":"torch 的构建由用户选（见下）；soxr 是 librosa 调用的同一个重采样器；tokenizers 构建与 transformers 相同的 BPE","locale":"zh-CN"},"4386":{"id":"/docs/development-release-27","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#必需的依赖","content":"文本","locale":"zh-CN"},"4387":{"id":"/docs/development-release-28","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#必需的依赖","content":"pypinyin、rjieba、jieba、opencc、kaldifst、inflect、tiktoken、regex、wordsegment、budoux、ToJyutping、fasttext-predict、pyyaml","locale":"zh-CN"},"4388":{"id":"/docs/development-release-29","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#必需的依赖","content":"很多版本是**锁定**的（如 `pypinyin==0.55.0`、`opencc==1.4.2`、`inflect==7.3.1`）：引擎的输出依赖这些版本，换版本会改变音素和音频","locale":"zh-CN"},"4389":{"id":"/docs/development-release-30","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#必需的依赖","content":"需要接受许可的包各自带少量依赖：`mizuoto-fishspeech` 需要 tokenizers 和 safetensors，`mizuoto-indextts` 需要 sentencepiece。它们也写明自己直接导入、Mizuoto 已经带来的包（torch 和 numpy；`mizuoto-indextts` 还有 pyyaml 和 tiktoken），版本范围与 Mizuoto 相同，这样自己的依赖不靠 Mizuoto 的依赖成立。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4390":{"id":"/docs/development-release-31","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#可选附加依赖","content":"附加依赖","locale":"z