e-37","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#谁在哪里","content":"`Engine`、`LoadedEngine`、注册表","locale":"zh-CN"},"4559":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-38","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#谁在哪里","content":"`mizuoto/runtime/engine.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4560":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-39","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#谁在哪里","content":"引擎契约；`BUILTIN` 和 `mizuoto.engines` 入口点","locale":"zh-CN"},"4561":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-40","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#谁在哪里","content":"`RequestContext`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4562":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-41","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#谁在哪里","content":"`mizuoto/runtime/context.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4563":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-42","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#谁在哪里","content":"每次调用一个：取消、生成器、进度、文本片段、临时目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"4564":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-43","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#谁在哪里","content":"`Runtime`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4565":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-44","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#谁在哪里","content":"`mizuoto/runtime/runtime.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4566":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-45","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#谁在哪里","content":"`Engine.load` 收到的东西：`devices`（`DeviceService`）、`manager`（`ModelManager`）、`options`（`RuntimeOptions`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4567":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-46","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#谁在哪里","content":"`TtsService`、`AsrService` 和音色服务从不直接接触 `LocalEngine`：它们调用 `RuntimeService.loaded(ModelRef, device, dtype, options, request)`，使用它返回的句柄。本地还是远程对它们没有区别。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4568":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-47","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#运行时","content":"`InferenceService.runtime` 在第一次加载模型时为每个进程建立一个 `Runtime`，所以从不加载模型的命令不会导入其中任何部分。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4569":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-48","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#设备devicepy","content":"`DeviceService` 相当于 ComfyUI `model_management.py` 中设备相关的那一半，只是做成了对象而不是模块全局变量。设备名用 Mizuoto 的写法：`cpu`、`cuda:N`（NVIDIA，或 ROCm 上的 AMD）、`xpu:N`、`mps`；解析 `auto` 是核心的事（`ComputeService.resolve_device`）。引擎拿到的是真正的 `torch.device`；没有任何东西去收窄 `CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4570":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-49","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#设备devicepy","content":"`memory(device)`：（空闲，总量）字节数；在 CUDA 上，torch 占着但没用的显存也算空闲。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4571":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-50","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#设备devicepy","content":"`empty_cache(device)`、`synchronize(device)`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4572":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-51","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#设备devicepy","content":"`supports(device, dtype)` 和 `pick_dtype(device, requested, supported, cpu)`：组件用哪种精度运行，依据用户的 `engines.<id>.dtype` 和引擎给出的偏好顺序（CPU 上除非指定都用 fp32；GTX 16xx 显卡不用 fp16）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4573":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-52","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#设备devicepy","content":"`is_oom(error)`：一个异常是否表示设备内存不足，不导入 torch。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4574":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-53","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#设备devicepy","content":"`float64_device(device)`：以 float64 计算的模块在哪里运行——该设备，或在没有 float64 的设备（MPS、不支持 fp64 的 XPU）上改用 CPU。`pin_to_cpu(module)` 让这样的模块在父模块移动时留在 CPU 上；CosyVoice 3 的 F0 预测器用到这两者。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4575":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-54","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#设备devicepy","content":"`probe_devices()`：torch 看到的加速器（CUDA、通过 HIP 的 ROCm、XPU、MPS）及其显存。核心的设备探测（`mizuoto/core/compute/probe.py`）先询问 `nvidia-smi`、`rocm-smi`/`amd-smi` 和平台，只有在已安装的构建可能找到它们没找到的 GPU 时，才在子进程中询问 torch（`python -m mizuoto.runtime.device`）；运行时加载了 torch 之后则在本进程中询问。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4576":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-55","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#设备devicepy","content":"引擎的 `DEVICES`（默认为所有设备类型）与其清单的 `devices` 一致；在 MPS 上 `torch.compile` 不生效，按原样运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4577":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-56","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#设备devicepy","content":"`torch_build()`：已安装的 torch 是为什么构建的、本机哪些加速器可用（`mizuoto doctor` 用它）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4578":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-57","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#模型句柄与模型管理器","content":"`ModelHandle`（`handle.py`，相当于去掉扩散部分的 ComfyUI `ModelPatcher`）包装一个带权重的 `nn.Module`：`name`（显示在已加载模型列表中，如 `omnivoice/omnivoice:model`）、`load_device`、`offload_device`（CPU）、`kind`（自回归语言模型为 `sequence`，其他为 `oneshot`）以及各项大小（`size_bytes`、`loaded_bytes`、`streamed_bytes`、`host_bytes`）。引擎只读取 `module`；`LoadedEngine` 在 `self.handles` 中列出它的句柄。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4579":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-58","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#模型句柄与模型管理器","content":"`ModelManager`（`manager.py`，相当于 ComfyUI 的 `load_models_gpu` / `free_memory`）记录每个已注册句柄的所有者（`<model id>@<device>`）和最后使用时间，并在请求的每个阶段（`ctx.use`、`ctx.run`）把句柄**整体或部分**放到设备上：空闲组件逐个单元让出显存，放不下的模型把部分权重留在内存中、在各层运行时流式加载到设备，显存不足的阶段以更多权重流式加载的方式精确地重新运行。策略（`policy.py`，`VramPolicy`）在每次加载时由 `compute` 设置得出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4580":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-59","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#模型句柄与模型管理器","content":"方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"4581":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-60","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#模型句柄与模型管理器","content":"用途","locale":"zh-CN"},"4582":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-61","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#模型句柄与模型管理器","content":"`register(owner, handles, mode, pinned)` / `unregister(owner)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4583":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-62","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#模型句柄与模型管理器","content":"加载之后；卸载模型时（直接释放，不复制回来）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4584":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-63","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#模型句柄与模型管理器","content":"`use(handles, memory_required)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4585":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-64","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#模型句柄与模型管理器","content":"包在每个阶段外；没有 `PHASED` 的引擎则包住整个调用","locale":"zh-CN"},"4586":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-65","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#模型句柄与模型管理器","content":"`after_oom(handles)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4587":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-66","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#模型句柄与模型管理器","content":"`ctx.run` 重试前的清理","locale":"zh-CN"},"4588":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-67","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#模型句柄与模型管理器","content":"`release_idle(device)`、`drop_host_copies()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4589":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-68","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#模型句柄与模型管理器","content":"腾空一块 GPU（微调前、显存不足后）；内存不足时","locale":"zh-CN"},"4590":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-69","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#模型句柄与模型管理器","content":"`resident()`、`owner_usage(owner)`、`owner_placements(owner)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4591":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-70","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#模型句柄与模型管理器","content":"已加载模型列表、`meta.memory` 及其 `partial` 报告","locale":"zh-CN"},"4592":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-71","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#模型句柄与模型管理器","content":"阶段、预算与显存模式、单元与流式加载、主机副本、让出显存、精确重试、工作显存估算及其校准，以及引擎要怎样配合：见显存与内存。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4593":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-72","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#模型句柄与模型管理器","content":"在 CPU 上什么都不移动、不计数；除非 `DeviceService(simulate={\"cpu\": bytes})` 让它扮演一块 GPU（测试与一致性验证工具：`compute.simulate_vram_mb`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4594":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-73","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#层注意力加载","content":"**`ops.py`**：每个引擎都用 `ops` 命名空间而不是 `torch.nn` 来搭建模块。`ops.default` 里是同样的层，但**不做随机初始化**：构造一个大模型不花时间，也不抽随机数，所以加载永远不会碰到任何随机数生成器。`ops.cast` 还会在每次前向时把权重转换成输入的精度和设备，用于以一种精度存储、以另一种精度计算的组件。`init_random(module, generator)` 在测试里给 `default` 模块填上真正的权重。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4595":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-74","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#层注意力加载","content":"**`accel/`**：原生代码中的每一次注意力计算都写作 `accel.attention(q, k, v, *, site=SITE, mask=…, causal=…, scale=…, enable_gqa=…, dropout_p=…, mask_info=…)`，从不直接调用 SDPA（架构测试禁止在 `runtime/accel` 之外这样做）。每个 `Site` 保存它的**参照计算**，即上游在该处的精确计算；`compute.attention = auto`（默认）时运行参照计算，结果逐位相同。其他取值会绑定一个策略，按调用在 SDPA 的各内核、FlashAttention、xFormers 和 SageAttention 之间选择，带兼容性检查和回退；`features.apply` 设置主机的 `compute.fast` 开关，也是原生代码中唯一设置 `torch.backends` 标志的地方。见加速。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4596":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-75","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#层注意力加载","content":"**`loading.py`**：`load_state_dict`（safetensors，或以 `weights_only=True` 读取的 pickle）、`strip_prefix`、`replace_prefixes`、`fold_weight_norm`，以及默认严格的 `load_into`：缺少或多出的键都是错误，并写明是哪个键，除非引擎把它列为可忽略。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4597":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-76","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#层注意力加载","content":"**`sampling.py`**：`hf_sample` / `hf_process`，按 transformers 的顺序执行它的 logits 处理器（重复惩罚、最少新 token、屏蔽、温度、top-k、top-p），然后是 `multinomial1`：在请求的生成器上执行 `torch.multinomial` 自己的算法，但不等待设备，所以带种子的抽样结果一致（无同步采样）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4598":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-77","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#层注意力加载","content":"**`lm/`**：`QwenDecoder`（带 transformers 数值行为和参数名的 Qwen2/Qwen3 解码器，以及 `mask_for`、`hf_sdpa`）、`DynamicCache`、需主动开启的 `BufferCache`（`compute.kv_cache = static`），以及用于工作显存估算的 `peak_bytes`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4599":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-78","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#层注意力加载","content":"**`graphs.py`**：`Graphs`、`LayerSteps`、`DecoderSteps`：把解码步骤捕获为 CUDA Graph，重放即时执行的内核（`compute.cuda_graphs`），见 CUDA Graph。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4600":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-79","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#层注意力加载","content":"**`convert/onnx.py`**：直接从 protobuf 线格式读出 ONNX 图的节点和张量，不需要 onnx 包（CosyVoice 的语音分词器和 CAM++、GPT-SoVITS 的 G2PW 用到）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4601":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-80","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#层注意力加载","content":"**`compile.py`**：`compute.compile` 打开时，`Compiled` / `compile_module(module, enabled, name)` 把一个热点模块包进 `torch.compile(dynamic=True)`；引擎调用 `compiled or module`，编译器出错时改为即时执行。见 `torch.compile`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4602":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-81","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#层注意力加载","content":"**`policy.py`、`units.py`、`stream.py`**：显存策略、模型可流式加载的单元，以及每个设备一个的 `Streamer`（显存与内存）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4603":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-82","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#层注意力加载","content":"**`snapshot.py`**：`snapshot()` 对引擎调用必须保持不变的进程级状态做摘要；契约套件在请求前后比较它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4604":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-83","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#层注意力加载","content":"引擎共用的构件放在运行时旁边：`mizuoto/nn`（与 torchaudio、librosa、Whisper 逐位一致的 DSP，流模型，transformer，声码器，编解码器，SSL 和说话人编码器）和 `mizuoto/text`（对 Mizuoto 运行的模型与 transformers 结果一致的 BPE 分词器、Whisper 词表、wetext 规范化器）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4605":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-84","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"对引擎的每次调用都有一个 `RequestContext`（`mizuoto/runtime/context.py`）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4606":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-85","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"成员","locale":"zh-CN"},"4607":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-86","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"用途","locale":"zh-CN"},"4608":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-87","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"`check_cancel()`、`cancelled()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4609":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-88","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"协作式取消。`check_cancel()` 抛出 `Cancelled`，它是 `BaseException`，模型代码里的 `except Exception` 吞不掉它。引擎在每个 token 或每个 ODE 步调用它","locale":"zh-CN"},"4610":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-89","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"`bind()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4611":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-90","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"把上下文设为当前线程的请求；层里于是可以直接调用模块级的 `check_cancel()`，不必传参","locale":"zh-CN"},"4612":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-91","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"`generator_for(device)`、`generator`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4613":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-92","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"请求在某个设备上的 `torch.Generator`，每个设备一个，用请求的种子初始化（没有种子则用新的熵）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4614":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-93","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"`rng`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4615":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-94","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"请求的 `random.Random`，同样方式初始化","locale":"zh-CN"},"4616":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-95","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"`reseed(seed)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4617":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-96","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"让请求的随机流从头开始（像 GPT-SoVITS 上游那样每段重新播种的引擎会用）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4618":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-97","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"`progress(stage, value, message)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4619":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-98","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"`loading:<部分>`、`generating` 等","locale":"zh-CN"},"4620":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-99","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"`applied`、`warn(message)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4621":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-100","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"引擎实际使用的参数值和它的警告：两者都随结果返回","locale":"zh-CN"},"4622":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-101","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"`text_pieces()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4623":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-102","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"客户端发来的流式文本（`SynthesisTask.text_stream`）：一个真正的生成器，可以在别的线程上消费，取消时提前结束","locale":"zh-CN"},"4624":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-103","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"`tmpdir`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4625":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-104","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"`<cache>/scratch/<引擎>/` 下的临时目录，调用结束时删除","locale":"zh-CN"},"4626":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-105","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"`use(handles, memory)`、`run(name, handles, fn, memory, generators, fallback)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4627":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-106","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"请求的一个阶段：放上它的组件并为其工作显存留出空间；`run` 另加显存不足后的精确重试和可选的回退（显存与内存）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4628":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-107","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"`accel`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4629":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-108","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"模型的注意力策略，随上下文绑定（加速）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4630":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-109","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"`log`、`device`、`seed`、`request_id`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4631":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-110","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#全局状态","content":"引擎与服务器、彼此以及测试共用一个进程，所以原生代码**不改动任何进程级状态**。`test_native_code_leaves_global_state_alone` 在 `runtime`、`nn`、`text`、各引擎和需要接受许可的包里禁止：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4632":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-111","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#全局状态","content":"给全局随机数生成器播种：`torch.manual_seed`、`torch.cuda.manual_seed(_all)`、`random.seed`、`np.random.seed`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4633":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-112","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#全局状态","content":"`os.chdir`、`sys.path.append` / `insert`、`os.putenv`、给 `os.environ` 赋值；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4634":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-113","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#全局状态","content":"`logging.basicConfig`、`torch.set_default_dtype`、`torch.use_deterministic_algorithms`、给 `torch.backends.*` 和 `torch._inductor.config` 赋值。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4635":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-114","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#全局状态","content":"随机数改从 `ctx.generator_for(device)` 和 `ctx.rng` 取。这也是对照得以成立的前提：一个用种子 *s* 初始化的全新 `torch.Generator`，与 `torch.manual_seed(s)` 之后 torch 的默认生成器产出完全相同的序列，在 CPU 和 CUDA 上都是如此（`scripts/parity/check_rng.py`）。所以一个引擎只要在请求的生成器上按上游的顺序做上游的抽样，就能逐次复现上游带种子的运行。上游在构建或准备某个东西时从全局生成器抽过随机数的地方，移植版会在私有生成器上重放这些抽样，而不去碰全局生成器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4636":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-115","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#全局状态","content":"训练阶段是唯一的例外：它们在自己的进程里运行，并在那里给进程级生成器播种（见训练器）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4637":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-116","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#localengine在本进程中调用模型","content":"`RuntimeService.engine(engine_id, device)` 在第一次用到时创建一个 `LocalEngine`，并把它作为显存持有者 `engine:<引擎>:<设备>` 登记到 `ComputeService`。它的状态是 `stopped`（什么都没加载）、`ready`、`busy`，或者引擎实现导入失败时的 `crashed`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4638":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-117","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#localengine在本进程中调用模型","content":"**加载**（`LocalEngine.load`）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4639":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-118","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#localengine在本进程中调用模型","content":"`start()` 用 `get_engine(id)` 找到实现（导入它的模块，不导入 torch）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4640":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-119","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#localengine在本进程中调用模型","content":"`make_room(model_id)`：运行时服务卸载超出 `compute.max_resident_models` 的、最久未用的空闲模型（固定的模型保留）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4641":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-120","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#localengine在本进程中调用模型","content":"构造 `LoadSpec(model_id, model_dir, variant, device, dtype, options)`；`options` 合并了引擎的加载选项和 `model_options(model_id)`，后者把模型所需共享资源的目录放进 `options[\"assets\"]`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4642":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-121","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#localengine在本进程中调用模型","content":"在绑定了上下文、**不在** `torch.inference_mode()` 里的情况下运行 `Engine.load(spec, runtime, ctx)`；句柄登记到管理器，`describe()` 的结果保存为句柄的 `description`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4643":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-122","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#localengine在本进程中调用模型","content":"**调用**（`LocalHandle.prepare_voice`、`synthesize`、`convert`、`edit`、`call`）：每次都在调用线程（某个任务的线程）上、在 `torch.inference_mode()` 里运行，上下文已绑定，模型的句柄由 `manager.use(...)` 占住。种子取自任务的 `params[\"seed\"]`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4644":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-123","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#localengine在本进程中调用模型","content":"这是对照 E2-TTS 与上游时发现的一个 CPU 内核陷阱：`F.linear` 作用于跨步（非连续）的三维输入时，若权重需要梯度，或权重是*推理张量*（在 `torch.inference_mode()` 里创建的），就会走另一个内核，即使在 `no_grad` 下也是如此。上游的权重是普通的、需要梯度的参数，所以原生引擎保持 `nn.Module` 创建参数时的样子（不调用 `requires_grad_(False)`），模型也在推理模式之外加载。请求本身仍在推理模式里运行。两个陷阱的细节见引擎参考。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4645":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-124","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#流就是生成器","content":"`synthesize`、`convert` 和 `edit` 返回产出 `AudioChunk` 的生成器。`LocalEngine.stream` 惰性地驱动引擎自己的生成器：只有调用方索取下一块时引擎才运行，也只有这时它才绑定到线程、处在推理模式里。每一块都会被检查（必须是 `AudioChunk`），转成 float32 单声道 numpy 采样再交出去；第一块设定 `timings[\"first_chunk\"]`。调用方关闭流（`contextlib.closing`）就能提前停止，引擎的生成器也随之关闭。`TtsService` 逐块取出，客户端流式接收时再把每块转给 `StreamSink`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4646":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-125","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#取消与超时","content":"调用方传入一个 `EngineRequest`，带着它的 `cancel` 事件（任务的 `cancel_event`）、可选的 `timeout`、流式文本队列（`text_input`，由 `TextFeed` 填充）和 `progress` 回调。一个小的监视线程每 20 毫秒检查一次：把调用方的取消转到上下文的取消事件上；超时则把这次调用标为超时并取消它。引擎在下一次 `check_cancel()` 时停下；调用随之以 `CancelledError` 失败，超时则是 `OperationTimeoutError`。调用结束时，句柄把 `applied`、`warnings` 和 `timings[\"total\"]` 写回 `EngineRequest`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4647":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-126","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#错误","content":"引擎抛出的东西会变成核心的错误：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4648":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-127","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#错误","content":"`EngineError(message, detail, code)` 保留它的错误码（`error_from_code`），并在 detail 里加上引擎和设备；`Unsupported` 是 `capability_not_supported`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4649":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-128","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#错误","content":"内存不足（`is_oom`）时，把该设备上所有空闲组件移走（`release_idle`），并以 `compute_unavailable` 失败，`detail.reason = \"out_of_memory\"`；任务服务随后卸载所有 GPU 上未在使用的模型（`release_after_oom`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4650":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-129","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#错误","content":"其他任何异常都是 `engine_error`，detail 里（以及日志里）有异常名和回溯。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4651":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-130","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#内存","content":"内存在三个层次上管理：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4652":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-131","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#内存","content":"层次","locale":"zh-CN"},"4653":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-132","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#内存","content":"谁","locale":"zh-CN"},"4654":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-133","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#内存","content":"做什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"4655":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-134","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#内存","content":"组件","locale":"zh-CN"},"4656":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-135","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#内存","content":"`ModelManager`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4657":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-136","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#内存","content":"调用的每个阶段之前，同一设备上的空闲组件逐个单元让出显存腾地方；放不下的部分从内存流式加载（显存与内存）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4658":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-137","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#内存","content":"模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"4659":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-138","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#内存","content":"`RuntimeService`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4660":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-139","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#内存","content":"所有引擎合计最多保留 `compute.max_resident_models`（默认 3）个已加载模型；加载前卸载最久未用的空闲模型。服务器的回收线程（每 10 秒）还会卸载空闲超过 `compute.unload_after_minutes`（默认 20；0 表示从不）或 `engines.<id>.idle_minutes` 的模型。`engines.<id>.pinned_models` 既不会为腾地方而卸载，也不会因空闲而卸载","locale":"zh-CN"},"4661":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-140","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#内存","content":"进程","locale":"zh-CN"},"4662":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-141","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#内存","content":"`ComputeService`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4663":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-142","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#内存","content":"每个 `LocalEngine` 都是一个显存持有者：**释放显存**（`POST /api/v1/compute/release`）卸载所有空闲持有者的全部模型并移走剩下的东西；有持有者忙时拒绝","locale":"zh-CN"},"4664":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-143","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#内存","content":"不会因为对显存的估算而拒绝加载模型：模型总是尝试加载，只有显存分配真正失败才算错误。任务因显存不足失败时（精确重试之后），`ComputeService.release_after_oom` 卸载所有 GPU 上未在使用的模型（即 ComfyUI 的 `unload_all_models`）；CPU 上的模型保留。在这一层之下组件怎样共用一个设备，见显存与内存。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4665":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-144","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#内存","content":"任何 `engines.<id>.*` 设置的改动都会卸载该引擎的模型（`unload_engine`），下一个请求用新的设备、精度或加载选项重新加载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4666":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-145","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#远程引擎","content":"当一个引擎的设备是 `<主机>/<设备>`（例如 `engines.qwen3tts.device = \"gpu-box/cuda:0\"`）时，`RuntimeService.engine` 向 `RemoteService` 要一个 `RemoteEngine`：与那台主机上的 `mizuoto agent` 之间、针对一个设备上一个引擎的会话。agent 是一个完整的 Mizuoto，有自己的数据目录、模型和运行时；它在自己的进程里运行引擎，和主机完全一样。`RemoteEngineHandle` 与 `LocalHandle` 回应同样的调用。面向用户的配置见远程引擎。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4667":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-146","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#远程引擎","content":"**协议 2**（`mizuoto/core/remote/wire.py` 的 `AGENT_PROTOCOL`）在“已加载引擎”这一层工作。帧格式来自 `mizuoto/core/remote/frames.py`（4 字节长度、一个类型字节、JSON 正文，或 JSON 头加原始字节），走 TCP 或 TLS：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4668":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-147","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#远程引擎","content":"主机连上后发送 `hello`，带令牌（用 `hmac.compare_digest` 比较）和协议版本。协议不同的 agent 会拒绝主机，提示在两台机器上安装相同版本的 Mizuoto；主机也同样拒绝这样的 agent。否则 agent 回复它的 `AgentInfo`：版本、设备、那里哪些引擎可用，以及已安装的模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4669":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-148","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#远程引擎","content":"`open {engine, device}`，然后依次执行 `load`、`prepare_voice`、`synthesize`、`convert`、`edit`、`call`、`unload` 和 `status`；`cancel` 和 `text`（流式文本）随时可以发。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4670":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-149","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#远程引擎","content":"agent 对每个操作先回 `progress`、`chunk`（二进制帧：float32 小端单声道）和 `file` 帧，最后是 `result` 或 `error`，并每 5 秒发一次心跳。超过 `remote.heartbeat_timeout`（60 秒）收不到任何帧，主机就以 `worker_failed`（`during = \"heartbeat\"`）关闭会话；下一个请求重新连接。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4671":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-150","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#远程引擎","content":"**按内容传文件。** 路径在另一台机器上没有意义。请求里提到的每个文件都变成 `mizuoto-file:<sha256>/<文件名>`：`have` 询问 agent 缺哪些，`put` 以 8 MiB 的帧发送缺的那些，并核对 SHA-256。agent 把它们存在 `<cache>/remote/files/`，一个月没有主机要过的文件会被删除。`prepare_voice` 写入的目录变成 `mizuoto-out:…`，其中的文件作为 `file` 帧传回主机自己的目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4672":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-151","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#远程引擎","content":"主机依据自己的模型目录和 agent 的模型列表做规划；agent 自己处理它的显存，训练始终在本机进行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4673":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-152","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#查看mizuoto-runtime-与-mizuoto-doctor","content":"`mizuoto runtime` 询问正在运行的服务器（通过数据目录里的 `server.json` 找到它），因为模型在服务器进程里；没有服务器时报告命令自身进程的情况。对应 `GET /api/v1/runtime` 和 `POST /api/v1/runtime/unload`，以及 Web UI 的**内存中的模型**面板（`LoadedModelsSheet`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4674":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-153","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#查看mizuoto-runtime-与-mizuoto-doctor","content":"`mizuoto doctor [ENGINE]` 就是 `RuntimeService.doctor`：已安装的 torch 构建与本机硬件（CUDA、ROCm、XPU、MPS、CPU）是否匹配，并给出安装正确构建的命令（`mizuoto/core/compute/torch_index.py`）；每个引擎可用还是缺失（以及缺什么）；导入不了的可选附加依赖（`Engine.EXTRAS`）；以及训练器缺的依赖。对应 `GET /api/v1/runtime/doctor` 和 `GET /api/v1/engines/{id}/doctor`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4675":{"id":"/docs/development-setup","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","type":"page","content":"开发环境","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-setup","locale":"zh-CN"},"4676":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-0","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup","content":"从克隆仓库到跑起开发服务器、全部检查和一个真实引擎所需的环境与任务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4677":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-1","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-setup#python-环境","content":"Python 环境","locale":"zh-CN"},"4678":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-2","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-setup#建立-venv","content":"建立 `.venv`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4679":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-3","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-setup#先装-torch","content":"先装 torch","locale":"zh-CN"},"4680":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-4","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-setup#以可编辑方式安装-mizuoto-和开发工具","content":"以可编辑方式安装 Mizuoto 和开发工具","locale":"zh-CN"},"4681":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-5","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-setup#之后一律用这个解释器","content":"之后一律用这个解释器","locale":"zh-CN"},"4682":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-6","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-setup#可选附加依赖","content":"可选附加依赖","locale":"zh-CN"},"4683":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-7","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-setup#web-uibun","content":"Web UI：bun","locale":"zh-CN"},"4684":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-8","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`scripts/dev.py` 的任务","locale":"zh-CN"},"4685":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-9","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-setup#dev一边改一边看","content":"`dev`：一边改一边看","locale":"zh-CN"},"4686":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-10","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-setup#在本机跑一个真实引擎","content":"在本机跑一个真实引擎","locale":"zh-CN"},"4687":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-11","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup","content":"Mizuoto 的开发环境只有两部分：一个 Python 环境（`.venv`），里面装着 torch、以可编辑方式安装的 Mizuoto 和开发工具；以及给 Web UI 和文档站用的 bun。所有引擎都在这一个环境里运行，不需要另外构建什么。日常任务都通过 `scripts/dev.py` 运行，它只用标准库，在 Linux、macOS 和 Windows 上行为一致，跑的正是 CI 跑的那些工具。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4688":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-12","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#建立-venv","content":"用 Python 3.11 建一个隔离的虚拟环境（Mizuoto 支持 3.10–3.13，CI 四个版本都测；开发用 3.11）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4689":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-13","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#先装-torch","content":"torch 是 Mizuoto 的依赖，但它的构建（CUDA、ROCm、XPU、CPU）由你来选，所以先从与本机匹配的索引装它。开发和 CI 跑的所有测试用 CPU 版就够了：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4690":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-14","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#先装-torch","content":"要用 GPU，就改装 `mizuoto doctor` 给出的那个构建（例如 `…/whl/cu128`），各平台的命令见安装。之后再装 Mizuoto 不会替换这个构建。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4691":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-15","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#以可编辑方式安装-mizuoto-和开发工具","content":"开发工具同样列在 `pyproject.toml` 的 `[dependency-groups] dev` 里。不装那两个包，它们的测试会跳过，对应的引擎显示为缺失。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4692":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-16","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#之后一律用这个解释器","content":"`dev.py` 用运行它的那个解释器（`sys.executable`）调用 ruff、ty 和 pytest，而不是 `PATH` 上随便哪一个。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4693":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-17","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#可选附加依赖","content":"有些文本前端需要默认安装之外的包。缺了它们，相应语言会以 `capability_not_supported` 失败，提示里附带安装命令；`mizuoto doctor` 也会把它们列为警告：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4694":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-18","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#可选附加依赖","content":"附加依赖","locale":"zh-CN"},"4695":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-19","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#可选附加依赖","content":"包","locale":"zh-CN"},"4696":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-20","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#可选附加依赖","content":"用途","locale":"zh-CN"},"4697":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-21","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#可选附加依赖","content":"`mizuoto[gptsovits-ja]`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4698":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-22","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#可选附加依赖","content":"`pyopenjtalk==0.4.1`（只有源码包，需要 CMake 和 C++ 编译器）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4699":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-23","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#可选附加依赖","content":"GPT-SoVITS 的日语","locale":"zh-CN"},"4700":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-24","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#可选附加依赖","content":"`mizuoto[gptsovits-ko]`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4701":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-25","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#可选附加依赖","content":"`python-mecab-ko`、`jamo`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4702":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-26","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#可选附加依赖","content":"GPT-SoVITS 的韩语","locale":"zh-CN"},"4703":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-27","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#可选附加依赖","content":"`mizuoto-indextts[ja]`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4704":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-28","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#可选附加依赖","content":"`fugashi`、`unidic-lite`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4705":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-29","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#可选附加依赖","content":"IndexTTS-2.5 的日语","locale":"zh-CN"},"4706":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-30","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#可选附加依赖","content":"从源码检出安装：`uv pip install --python .venv/bin/python -e \".[gptsovits-ja,gptsovits-ko]\"`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4707":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-31","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#可选附加依赖","content":"ty 不跟随可编辑安装的路径钩子，所以 `pyproject.toml` 把 `tool.ty.environment.extra-paths` 设为 `packages/native/fishspeech` 和 `packages/native/indextts`，从源码解析 `mizuoto_fishspeech` 和 `mizuoto_indextts`。torch 和各可选附加依赖的包列在 `tool.ty.analysis.allowed-unresolved-imports` 里。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4708":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-32","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#web-uibun","content":"Web UI（`mizuoto/webui/`）和文档站（`site/`）用 bun 安装依赖、构建和测试。`dev.py` 先在 `PATH` 上找 `bun`，再找安装器默认的 `~/.bun/bin`，两处都没有时给出明确的提示而不是一串回溯。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4709":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-33","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#web-uibun","content":"构建出的 `dist/` 作为包数据随 wheel 发布；在没有 `dist/` 的源码检出里运行 `mizuoto webui`，只有 API，没有界面。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4710":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-34","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`python scripts/dev.py` 不带参数会列出全部任务。任务名后面的选项原样传给底层脚本；不接受选项的任务收到选项会报错。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4711":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-35","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"任务","locale":"zh-CN"},"4712":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-36","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"4713":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-37","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`check`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4714":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-38","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"CI 跑的全部：`lint`、`typecheck-py`、`test-py`、`test-web`、`typegen-check`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4715":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-39","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`lint`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4716":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-40","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`ruff check .` 和 `ruff format --check .`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4717":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-41","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`format`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4718":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-42","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`ruff check --fix .` 和 `ruff format .`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4719":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-43","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`typecheck-py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4720":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-44","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"用 ty 检查 `mizuoto`、需要接受许可的引擎、`tests` 和 `scripts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4721":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-45","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`test-py [pytest 选项…]`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4722":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-46","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"pytest；`live`、`engine`、`weights`、`e2e` 标记默认排除","locale":"zh-CN"},"4723":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-47","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`test-engines [引擎…] [-- pytest 选项]`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4724":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-48","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"针对已安装模型的契约套件（`MIZUOTO_TEST_DEVICE=cpu\\|cuda:N`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4725":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-49","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`model-manifests [引擎…]`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4726":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-50","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"固定目录中模型的文件（大小、SHA-256）（`scripts/model_manifests.py`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4727":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-51","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`wheels [all\\|host\\|native] [引擎…]`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4728":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-52","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"把 `mizuoto`（含界面）和需要接受许可的引擎的 wheel 构建到 `dist/`（`scripts/build_wheels.py`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4729":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-53","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`smoke`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4730":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-54","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"在新环境里先装 CPU 版 torch，再装构建好的 wheel 并试用（`scripts/smoke_wheels.py`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4731":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-55","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`dev [--api-port] [--web-port] [--data-dir]`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4732":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-56","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"同时启动 API 服务器（7869）和 Vite 开发服务器（5173）；Ctrl+C 一起停止","locale":"zh-CN"},"4733":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-57","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`web-install` / `web` / `web-dev`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4734":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-58","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"安装界面依赖 / 构建界面 / 只启动 Vite（需要已在运行的 API）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4735":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-59","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`test-web`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4736":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-60","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`bun run test`（vitest）和 `bun run typecheck`（vue-tsc）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4737":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-61","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`openapi`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4738":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-62","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"把 OpenAPI 模式打印到标准输出（`scripts/generate_openapi.py`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4739":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-63","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`typegen`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4740":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-64","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"由模式重新生成 `mizuoto/webui/src/api/schema.d.ts`（结果要提交）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4741":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-65","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`typegen-check`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4742":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-66","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"重新生成后 `git diff --exit-code`：类型过期就失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"4743":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-67","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"文档站有自己的任务：`site-install`、`site-dev`、`site` 和 `test-site`（见发布）。对照工具不是 `dev.py` 的任务，它在 `scripts/parity/` 里（见测试）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4744":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-68","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#dev一边改一边看","content":"它以 `python -m mizuoto webui --no-open --port 7869 --strict-port` 启动 API（把仓库根目录放进 `PYTHONPATH`），以 `bun run dev` 启动 Vite，并把 `MIZUOTO_BACKEND=http://127.0.0.1:7869` 传给 Vite。Vite 把 `/api` 和 `/ws` 代理到 API，所以浏览器只用打开 `http://localhost:5173`。界面改动热更新；Python 改动（包括引擎代码）需要重启这个任务，因为模型加载在服务器进程里。API 没起来时，Vite 的代理只会每隔几秒打印一行提示，而不是刷屏的连接错误。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4745":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-69","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#dev一边改一边看","content":"`--data-dir` 让开发用的设置、数据库、模型和输出与日常数据目录分开（也可以设置 `MIZUOTO_DATA_DIR`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4746":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-70","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#在本机跑一个真实引擎","content":"所有引擎都随 Mizuoto 一起装好了，真实引擎只差模型：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4747":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-71","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#在本机跑一个真实引擎","content":"模型加载进运行这条命令的进程（经 API 的请求则加载进服务器进程）。`mizuoto runtime` 列出正在运行的服务器加载了什么，`mizuoto runtime --unload` 释放它们。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4748":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-72","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#在本机跑一个真实引擎","content":"改了引擎代码，要在新进程里才生效：重启服务器，或重新运行命令。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4749":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-73","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#在本机跑一个真实引擎","content":"需要接受许可的引擎（Fish Speech、IndexTTS）要先装好它们的包，并执行 `mizuoto engine accept-licence <id>`，模型才能下载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4750":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-74","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#在本机跑一个真实引擎","content":"开发机的 GPU 可能被其他进程占满。此时把引擎设到 CPU：`mizuoto config set engines.qwen3tts.device cpu`，或在契约测试里设 `MIZUOTO_TEST_DEVICE=cpu`。模型总是会尝试加载；显存不足时任务以 `compute_unavailable`（退出码 9）失败，所有 GPU 上未在使用的模型都会被卸载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4751":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-75","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#在本机跑一个真实引擎","content":"验证一个引擎的完整做法（小型随机模型、契约套件、与 0.1 的对照）见测试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4752":{"id":"/docs/development-testing","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","type":"page","content":"测试","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-testing","locale":"zh-CN"},"4753":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-0","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing","content":"Mizuoto 的测试怎样组织：核心依靠 dummy 引擎在几秒内跑通整条链路，每个引擎和训练器都在 CI 里用小型随机模型运行（也在模拟设备上流式加载运行），真实模型有契约套件，对照工具把原生引擎与参照实现逐采样比较，行为一致性分层判断，Web UI 用 vitest，CI 覆盖三个平台和四个 Python 版本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4754":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-1","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-testing#布局","content":"布局","locale":"zh-CN"},"4755":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-2","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-testing#dummy-引擎","content":"dummy 引擎","locale":"zh-CN"},"4756":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-3","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-testing#夹具","content":"夹具","locale":"zh-CN"},"4757":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-4","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-testing#小型随机模型","content":"小型随机模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"4758":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-5","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-testing#模拟设备上的流式加载","content":"模拟设备上的流式加载","locale":"zh-CN"},"4759":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-6","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-testing#真实引擎的契约套件","content":"真实引擎的契约套件","locale":"zh-CN"},"4760":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-7","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"与参照实现对照","locale":"zh-CN"},"4761":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-8","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"行为一致性的层级与容差","locale":"zh-CN"},"4762":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-9","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-testing#web-ui-测试","content":"Web UI 测试","locale":"zh-CN"},"4763":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-10","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"CI","locale":"zh-CN"},"4764":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-11","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing","content":"Mizuoto 的测试分三层：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4765":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-12","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing","content":"**核心的测试**不需要 GPU，也不需要模型：dummy 引擎在测试自己的进程里，端到端地支撑起规划、任务、运行时服务、流式、取消和错误。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4766":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-13","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing","content":"**引擎的测试**在 CPU 上用权重随机的小模型运行每个引擎和训练器，包括在模拟设备上部分加载、流式加载的运行，同样在 CI 里跑。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4767":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-14","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing","content":"**真实模型**：契约套件让已安装的模型走完整条链路，对照工具把原生引擎与参照实现逐采样比较。开发者改动引擎时手动运行它们。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4768":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-15","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing","content":"`python scripts/dev.py check` 运行 CI 跑的全部：`lint`、`typecheck-py`、`test-py`、`test-web`、`typegen-check`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4769":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-16","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#布局","content":"`pyproject.toml` 定义了四个标记，默认全部排除（`addopts = \"-m 'not live and not engine and not weights and not e2e'\"`）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4770":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-17","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#布局","content":"标记","locale":"zh-CN"},"4771":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-18","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#布局","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"4772":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-19","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#布局","content":"`live`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4773":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-20","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#布局","content":"需要本仓库之外的东西","locale":"zh-CN"},"4774":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-21","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#布局","content":"`engine`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4775":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-22","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#布局","content":"针对已安装模型的引擎契约套件（`dev.py test-engines`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4776":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-23","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#布局","content":"`weights`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4777":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-24","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#布局","content":"需要已下载的模型权重","locale":"zh-CN"},"4778":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-25","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#布局","content":"`e2e`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4779":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-26","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#布局","content":"浏览器端到端测试","locale":"zh-CN"},"4780":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-27","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#布局","content":"所以 `python -m pytest`（或 `python scripts/dev.py test-py`）运行的是核心的测试和小模型测试。需要 torch 或某个可选包的测试，在没有它时会跳过（`pytest.importorskip`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4781":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-28","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#dummy-引擎","content":"`mizuoto/engines/dummy/` 是一个没有模型的完整引擎：引擎（`engine.py`）和训练器（`train.py`），清单是 `mizuoto/core/engines/manifests/dummy.toml`。它只导入 numpy，不需要 torch，并像所有引擎一样在测试的进程里运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4782":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-29","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#dummy-引擎","content":"它把每个字符变成一小段音调，音高取决于音色（预设、描述、参考音频的 SHA-256 或权重的哈希），所以不同音色听起来不同；随机数从 `ctx.rng` 抽取，所以同一个种子得到同样的音频。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4783":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-30","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#dummy-引擎","content":"它声明了**全部**能力：预设说话人、克隆、设计、风格与情感、流式输出与流式文本输入、音色转换、语音编辑、批处理、权重、`transcribe` 操作（所以 ASR 路径也能测）、训练。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4784":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-31","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#dummy-引擎","content":"引擎选项可以让它故意出错：`delay_ms`、`chunk_ms` 和 `load_delay_ms` 让它变慢；`fail = error | oom | crash | exception` 和 `fail_at_segment` 让它在指定位置失败、内存不足、报告崩溃（`worker_failed`）或抛出未处理的异常。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4785":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-32","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#dummy-引擎","content":"正是靠它，在下一次检查时停下的取消、内存不足变成 `compute_unavailable`、超时、卸载、空闲回收和流式音频块，都能在没有 GPU 的 CI 机器上几秒内测完。dummy 引擎也是用户试用 Mizuoto 的方式，`smoke_wheels.py` 也用它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4786":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-33","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#夹具","content":"`tests/conftest.py`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4787":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-34","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#夹具","content":"每个测试一个临时数据目录、一个空的环境（`environ={}`：开发者自己的 `MIZUOTO_*` 变量不会混进来）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4788":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-35","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#夹具","content":"`services` 是 `make_services()` 的简写；`wav_file` 是一段 2 秒、22.05 kHz 的立体声 WAV。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4789":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-36","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#夹具","content":"需要调度器和空闲回收的测试传 `start_background=True`。API 测试就是这样：`create_app(make_services(start_background=True), bound_host=\"127.0.0.1\", serve_ui=False)`，然后用 `TestClient`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4790":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-37","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#夹具","content":"下载测试把 `services.models.http_transport` 换成 `httpx.MockTransport`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4791":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-38","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#夹具","content":"远程测试（`tests/core/test_remote.py`）在本机启动一个 `AgentServer`，由主机通过 TCP 驱动它的 dummy 引擎。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4792":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-39","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#小型随机模型","content":"`tests/engines_native/` 为每个引擎搭一个与引擎结构相同、只有几个小层、权重随机的模型，按引擎期望的样子写进临时目录（配置、字节级词表、safetensors），然后驱动真实的代码：用 `Runtime(DeviceService(), ModelManager(...))` 调 `Engine.load`，配一个 `RequestContext`，测音色提示、解码、批处理、可重复的种子和取消。`test_<id>_train_tiny.py` 用几段音频跑完引擎训练器的每个阶段。它们不需要下载，所以 CI 每次推送都用 CPU 版 torch 运行。需要接受许可的引擎的测试放在各自的包里，即 `packages/native/<pkg>/tests/`；`pyproject.toml` 的 `testpaths` 列出了这些目录，所以 `python -m pytest` 会连同其余测试一起运行它们，没装对应的包时跳过。它们用到 `tests/engines_native` 的辅助模块（`streaming.py`、`accel_checks.py`），所以要在仓库根目录运行；在包目录里运行也可以，根目录 `pyproject.toml` 的 `pythonpath` 会把根目录加进 `sys.path`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4793":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-40","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#小型随机模型","content":"这里还守着几条跨引擎的规则：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4794":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-41","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#小型随机模型","content":"**注意力。** 每个调用点传入的 `mask_info` 都与它的稠密掩码对照检查。`MIZUOTO_TEST_ACCEL=count python -m pytest tests/engines_native packages/native` 让每次注意力调用都经过一个策略：它统计调用点，并按调用点自己的参照方式计算；如果某个调用点从没以这种方式被调用到（例如有代码绕过 `compute.attention` 直接调用 SDPA），测试结束时就会失败。每个 conftest 列出本目录的调用点（`SITES_TESTED`）；检查本身在 `tests/engines_native/accel_checks.py`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4795":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-42","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#小型随机模型","content":"**训练显存工具。** `training_memory.py` 的 `check_checkpointing` 把训练器的阶段在全新的工作目录里跑两遍，一遍原样，一遍每个块都做梯度检查点，比较每个指标和每个写出的权重文件：必须完全相同。保持结果的其他工具（如把优化器状态放在内存里）用同样的方式检查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4796":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-43","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#模拟设备上的流式加载","content":"显存管理改变的是权重放在哪里，不是计算什么，所以部分加载和流式加载的结果必须与整体加载完全相同。`tests/engines_native/streaming.py` 让 CPU 扮演一个给定大小的设备（`DeviceService(simulate=…, strict=True)`）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4797":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-44","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#模拟设备上的流式加载","content":"`check_streamed` 在三种设备大小下（每个单元都流式加载、一半、全部常驻）运行小型引擎，与普通 CPU 上的结果逐采样比较。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4798":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-45","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#模拟设备上的流式加载","content":"严格模式下，不在设备上的组件以 meta 张量存放，被流式加载的单元的权重只在该单元运行时存在。所以一个引擎在某个阶段用了没有为这个阶段放置（`ctx.use`）的组件，或者在单元的 `forward` 之外读了它的权重，就会在这里失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4799":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-46","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#模拟设备上的流式加载","content":"`check_oom_retry` 让阶段里的某一层第一次调用时内存不足：阶段以更多权重流式加载的方式重新运行，结果必须与未受干扰时完全相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4800":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-47","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#模拟设备上的流式加载","content":"显存管理本身见显存管理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4801":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-48","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#真实引擎的契约套件","content":"`tests/engines/test_contract.py` 对每个可用引擎的每个已安装目录模型，走完整的链路（规划 → 任务 → 运行时 → 引擎）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4802":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-49","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#真实引擎的契约套件","content":"`test-engines` 设置 `MIZUOTO_CONTRACT=1` 和 `MIZUOTO_TEST_ENGINES`（指定的引擎），以 `-m engine -v` 运行 `tests/engines`。套件使用 `MIZUOTO_TEST_DATA_DIR`（默认是平常的数据目录）里的模型，但在临时数据目录里运行，不往真实目录写任何东西，设备是 `MIZUOTO_TEST_DEVICE`（默认 `auto`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4803":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-50","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#真实引擎的契约套件","content":"测试","locale":"zh-CN"},"4804":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-51","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#真实引擎的契约套件","content":"检查什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"4805":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-52","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#真实引擎的契约套件","content":"`test_load_and_describe`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4806":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-53","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#真实引擎的契约套件","content":"加载后的 `describe` 与清单一致：采样率、预设说话人","locale":"zh-CN"},"4807":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-54","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#真实引擎的契约套件","content":"`test_every_voice_mode_speaks_the_text`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4808":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-55","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#真实引擎的契约套件","content":"声明的每种音色模式，中英文都能发声（RMS > 0.01）、采样率正确、时长与文本相称；装了 ASR 时词错误率 \\< 0.35","locale":"zh-CN"},"4809":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-56","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#真实引擎的契约套件","content":"`test_seed_repeats_and_segments`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4810":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-57","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#真实引擎的契约套件","content":"同一个种子逐采样复现；放不进一段的两句话切成两段（或由引擎自己处理长文本）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4811":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-58","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#真实引擎的契约套件","content":"`test_cancel_stops_the_engine`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4812":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-59","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#真实引擎的契约套件","content":"生成中途取消，任务在 30 秒内变为 `cancelled`，模型仍在加载状态，下一个请求正常发声","locale":"zh-CN"},"4813":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-60","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#真实引擎的契约套件","content":"`test_no_residue`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4814":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-61","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#真实引擎的契约套件","content":"进程级状态（工作目录、环境变量、`sys.path`、随机数生成器、torch 标志、日志处理器、警告过滤器）的摘要在多次请求前后相同，通过 `mizuoto.snapshot` 操作获取","locale":"zh-CN"},"4815":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-62","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#真实引擎的契约套件","content":"要克隆的参考音频来自 `MIZUOTO_TEST_REFERENCE`（加上 `MIZUOTO_TEST_REFERENCE_TEXT`），没有时由已安装的预设或设计模型说一段。需要接受许可的引擎只有在设了 `MIZUOTO_TEST_ACCEPT_LICENCES=1`（并装了它们的包）时才参加，许可只在临时目录里接受。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4816":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-63","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#真实引擎的契约套件","content":"在 CPU 上，每个引擎的全部目录模型都通过契约套件。整套跑完需要几个小时（模型越大越慢），所以改动某个引擎时只跑它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4817":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-64","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"`scripts/parity/` 把原生引擎与它们的参照实现逐采样比较（它的 README 有完整说明）。参照是 Mizuoto 0.1 的引擎 worker（git 标签 `v1-engine-workers`，各引擎在自己原来的环境里运行上游代码）；0.1 没有的 VoxCPM，参照是上游自己的包，经 `stack.py --impl upstream` 套进同一条链路。代码在仓库里；数据放在仓库之外的工作区 `MIZUOTO_PARITY_DIR`（默认 `~/code_workspace/experiment/kodama-refactor`），其中有：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4818":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-65","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"`reference/`：位于标签 `v1-engine-workers` 的 git 工作树，即原生引擎与之比对的 0.1 代码；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4819":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-66","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"`reference-host/` 和 `native-env/`：分别驱动参照实现和原生实现的 Python 环境（原生一侧用参照环境相同的 torch 2.8.0，差异因此只来自代码而不是内核）；CosyVoice 另有一套 torch 2.8 上的参照环境和数据目录；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4820":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-67","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"`corpus/`（参考音频及其转写）、`fixtures/`（每次运行写出的音频和行为）、`reports/`（比较报告）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4821":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-68","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"脚本","locale":"zh-CN"},"4822":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-69","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"4823":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-70","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"`stack.py run <cases.jsonl> --impl reference\\|native\\|upstream`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4824":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-71","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"让每个用例（一个 `SpeakRequest`，或一个 `convert` / `edit` 请求）走某一实现的完整链路，把音频和行为存进 `fixtures/<engine>/<case>/<name>`。`--name` 设置本次运行的文件名（如 `reference-repeat`、`reference-t28`），`--only` 选用例，`--setting k=v` 对整次运行应用一项设置，`--repeat` 在同一条链路里把每个用例再跑几遍，`--device`（默认 `cpu`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4825":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-72","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"`compare.py <engine…> [--a reference] [--b native]`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4826":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-73","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"逐采样比较两次运行（`--tolerance`；`--report` 写出 Markdown 报告）；不运行模型，直接从夹具打印当前的对照表","locale":"zh-CN"},"4827":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-74","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"`train.py run <engine> --impl reference\\|native --model <id> --method <m> --hp k=v --name <n>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4828":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-75","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"用某一实现在工作区的数据集上训练，保留实验、指标、预览和导出结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"4829":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-76","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"`train.py compare <engine> <name>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4830":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-77","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"比较两种实现的训练结果；导出的音色或模型可以交给另一种实现加载","locale":"zh-CN"},"4831":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-78","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"`perf.py`、`train_perf.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4832":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-79","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"按阶段计时同样的用例和微调，并与上一轮的音频、指标和权重对照（见性能工作）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4833":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-80","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"`memory.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4834":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-81","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"每个用例的显存与内存峰值、加载和卸载时间（见显存管理）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4835":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-82","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"`voxcpm_modules.py`、`voxcpm_upstream.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4836":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-83","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],