各自生成音色提示时例外：CAM++ 的说话人嵌入与 onnxruntime 相差约 1e-6，HiFT 的正弦源把这个差异沿句子积累放大；给定同一个音色提示时，CosyVoice 也逐采样相同。每个训练器在 CPU 上与上游带同样种子的运行给出逐字节相同的损失、学习率和权重。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4845":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-92","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"“相同”分层判断。低层级逐比特检查，高层级判断整条链路：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4846":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-93","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"层级","locale":"zh-CN"},"4847":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-94","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"比较什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"4848":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-95","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"在哪里","locale":"zh-CN"},"4849":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-96","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"通过条件","locale":"zh-CN"},"4850":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-97","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"**T0 运算**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4851":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-98","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"DSP、采样器、分词器、规范化器、字音转换","locale":"zh-CN"},"4852":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-99","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"CPU","locale":"zh-CN"},"4853":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-100","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"完全相同（`torch.equal`、相同的 id、相同的字符串）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4854":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-101","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"**T1 模块**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4855":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-102","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"每个模块用真实权重处理截取的输入","locale":"zh-CN"},"4856":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-103","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"CPU fp32","locale":"zh-CN"},"4857":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-104","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"最大绝对误差 ≤ 1e-5 × max(1, ‖参照‖∞)，余弦相似度 ≥ 0.99999","locale":"zh-CN"},"4858":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-105","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"GPU bf16/fp16","locale":"zh-CN"},"4859":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-106","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"余弦相似度 ≥ 0.999","locale":"zh-CN"},"4860":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-107","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"**T2 阶段**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4861":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-108","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"教师强制的 logits；给定截取的输入时的离散输出（语音分词器的码、VQ 码、注入噪声后的 ODE 轨迹）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4862":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-109","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"CPU fp32","locale":"zh-CN"},"4863":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-110","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"argmax 100% 一致；离散输出一致率 ≥ 99.9%，每个翻转都要检查并解释（如 FSQ 取整边界上的平局）；轨迹在 T1 之内","locale":"zh-CN"},"4864":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-111","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"**T3 端到端（带种子）**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4865":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-112","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"完整请求走完 Mizuoto 的链路：原生与参照，同一种子、同一 torch 版本","locale":"zh-CN"},"4866":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-113","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"CPU fp32","locale":"zh-CN"},"4867":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-114","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"**token 完全相同；音频完全相同或最大绝对误差 ≤ 1e-4**；例外逐个引擎列出并说明原因","locale":"zh-CN"},"4868":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-115","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"**T4 统计**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4869":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-116","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"每个引擎在其生产精度和设备上的语料运行，原生与参照；种子不对齐（GPU 内核不同）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4870":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-117","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"GPU（bf16/fp16）、CPU","locale":"zh-CN"},"4871":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-118","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"每种音色模式和模型至少 20 段文本 × 3 个音色 × 每个音色 3 个种子：平均 CER/WER（Whisper large-v3-turbo）≤ 参照 + 0.5 个百分点，且没有用例比参照最差的再差 5 个百分点以上；说话人相似度（CAM++ 与参考片段的余弦）均值 ≥ 参照 − 0.01；时长比在 ±5% 之内；UTMOS 均值 ≥ 参照 − 0.05；响度和 F0 中位数在参照的分布之内","locale":"zh-CN"},"4872":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-119","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"**为什么 T3 只在 CPU 上以 fp32 判断。** 任何一点 logits 差异都会翻转一次多项式抽样（或一个束），之后的一切随之分叉。在 GPU 上降精度运行时，连上游自己都不能与自己逐比特一致（例如批量和单条的贪心解码），所以 GPU 上的一致性由 T1 的模块级误差加 T4 的统计指标判断。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4873":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-120","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"**音频之外的行为**也是对照的一部分，在两种实现上都经过契约套件检查：实际生效的参数和警告、音色模式的判定（`fit`）、流式的粒度与块数、取消的行为、对无效输入的错误码（参考音频太长、不支持的语言、缺少转写）、输出采样率、分段的拼接。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4874":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-121","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"加速与提速遵守同样的层级：会改变比特的加速（例如编译）至少保持在该引擎的 T1/T3 容差之内，并记录实测误差；默认路径上的提速必须逐比特不变。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4875":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-122","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"**T0 的 DSP 夹具只在生成它们的那类机器上完全相同**：带 AVX2、不带 AVX-512 的 x86-64 Linux，且 torch 版本相同。在别处，内核的舍入不同（numpy 的 AVX-512 `exp` 和 `log`、Windows CRT 的 libm、Arm 上 torch 的 FFT 和 soxr 的 SIMD、另一个 torch 版本），所以 `tests/runtime/test_dsp.py` 在那里检查输出在这种舍入之内一致：float32 最大绝对误差 ≤ 1e-4 × max(1, ‖ref‖∞)，float64 ≤ 1e-12 × max(1, ‖ref‖∞)。CI 的 macOS、Windows 和 AVX-512 机器上实测最大为 4e-5。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4876":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-123","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#web-ui-测试","content":"`mizuoto/webui/src/**/*.test.ts` 用 vitest 运行；`python scripts/dev.py test-web` 先运行 `bun run test`，再运行 `bun run typecheck`（vue-tsc）。除了组件和 store 的单元测试，还有几个守护整个界面的规则测试：`imports.test.ts`、`tokens.test.ts`、`layout.test.ts`、`ui/layers.test.ts` 和 `i18n/i18n.test.ts`（两种语言的键相同）；见 Web UI。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4877":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-124","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#web-ui-测试","content":"`python scripts/dev.py typegen-check` 重新生成 `schema.d.ts` 并与提交的版本比较；API 改了而类型没有重新生成时失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4878":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-125","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#web-ui-测试","content":"文档站（`site/`）有自己的 vitest 测试；`src/lib/i18n-content.test.ts` 要求每个中文 `<slug>.mdx` 都有对应的 `<slug>.en.mdx`，且两个侧栏的页面顺序相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4879":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-126","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`.github/workflows/ci.yml` 在每次推送到分支和每个拉取请求时运行，使用 torch 的 CPU 构建（`https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu`）。Mizuoto 和两个需要接受许可的包各自发布，所以各自检查，一次改动只运行它所改内容的检查。依赖用 uv 安装（`astral-sh/setup-uv`，`UV_SYSTEM_PYTHON=1`：装进 `setup-python` 提供的 Python，不建虚拟环境；缓存关闭，因为解包后的 torch wheel 会挤占 10 GB 的缓存上限）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4880":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-127","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"第一个作业 `scope` 读取改动的文件（推送的来自 compare API，拉取请求的来自它的文件列表），由 `python scripts/ci.py scope` 映射为检查：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4881":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-128","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"改动","locale":"zh-CN"},"4882":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-129","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"检查","locale":"zh-CN"},"4883":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-130","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`packages/native/<id>/**`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4884":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-131","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"该包的 `gated` 和 `oldest-mizuoto` 作业，以及针对它的 `torch`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4885":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-132","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`mizuoto/webui/**`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4886":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-133","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`web`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4887":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-134","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`site/**`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4888":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-135","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`site`（文档站的测试和构建）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4889":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-136","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`mizuoto/`、`tests/`、`scripts/` 下的其他内容、`pyproject.toml`，或新路径","locale":"zh-CN"},"4890":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-137","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`host`、`web`（它的 API 类型来自代码）、`torch`，以及两个包的作业：它们跑在本次提交的 Mizuoto 运行时上","locale":"zh-CN"},"4891":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-138","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`.github/workflows/**`、`scripts/ci.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4892":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-139","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"全部","locale":"zh-CN"},"4893":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-140","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`README*.md`、`AGENTS.md`、`CLAUDE.md`、`LICENSE`、`Dockerfile`、`.gitignore`……","locale":"zh-CN"},"4894":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-141","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"无","locale":"zh-CN"},"4895":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-142","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"新分支、手动触发、被 compare API 截断的列表（300 个文件）或读取失败时检查全部；`tests/test_ci.py` 覆盖这套映射。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4896":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-143","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"作业","locale":"zh-CN"},"4897":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-144","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"环境","locale":"zh-CN"},"4898":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-145","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"步骤","locale":"zh-CN"},"4899":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-146","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`host`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4900":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-147","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"Ubuntu、Windows、macOS × Python 3.10、3.11、3.12、3.13","locale":"zh-CN"},"4901":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-148","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"从 CPU 索引 `uv pip install torch`，再装 `-e . pytest pytest-cov ruff ty httpx tomli`（只有 Mizuoto）；每个组合都运行 `dev.py lint`（整个仓库）、`dev.py typecheck-py --python-version <该组合> --python-platform <该组合> mizuoto tests scripts`（标准库的类型存根随 Python 版本和平台而不同）和 `python -m pytest -q tests`；三者中一个失败，其余照常运行","locale":"zh-CN"},"4902":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-149","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`gated`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4903":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-150","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"范围内的每个包 × Ubuntu、Windows、macOS × Python 3.10、3.13","locale":"zh-CN"},"4904":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-151","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`-e . -e packages/native/<id>`；对 `packages/native/<id>` 运行 `ruff check` 和 `ruff format --check`，对它的 `tests/` 运行 `typecheck-py` 和 `pytest`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4905":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-152","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`oldest-mizuoto`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4906":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-153","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"范围内的每个包，Ubuntu、Python 3.12","locale":"zh-CN"},"4907":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-154","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"用该包 `pyproject.toml` 允许的最旧 Mizuoto（`python scripts/ci.py lower-bound <id>`，来自 PyPI）测试它：测试在源码目录之外运行，`PYTHONPATH` 上只有 `tests/`，所以 `import mizuoto` 找到的是已发布的那个（不含范围检查，它比较的是范围与本次提交的 Mizuoto）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4908":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-155","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`torch`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4909":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-156","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"Ubuntu、Python 3.12，torch 2.8.0 和最新版","locale":"zh-CN"},"4910":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-157","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"用 Mizuoto 支持的最旧和最新的 torch 跑范围内的测试，发现 torch 的接口变化","locale":"zh-CN"},"4911":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-158","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`web`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4912":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-159","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"Ubuntu、Python 3.11、bun","locale":"zh-CN"},"4913":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-160","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`dev.py web-install`、`dev.py test-web`、`dev.py typegen-check`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4914":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-161","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`site`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4915":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-162","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"Ubuntu、bun","locale":"zh-CN"},"4916":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-163","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"在 `site/` 里 `bun install --frozen-lockfile`、`bun run check`、`bun run test`、`bun run build`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4917":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-164","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`passed`（\"CI passed\"）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4918":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-165","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"Ubuntu","locale":"zh-CN"},"4919":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-166","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"上面有作业失败或被取消时失败，都通过或因改动无关而跳过时通过：分支保护只需要求这一项","locale":"zh-CN"},"4920":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-167","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"同一分支较新的运行会取消较旧的运行。推送到 `main` 且改动了某个版本文件时会启动发布工作流，它把 `ci.yml` 作为自己的检查，检查这次推送改动的内容；CI 自己对这次推送的运行会跳过所有作业（`scope` 看到了版本文件），所以检查只跑一次。标签只启动发布工作流，它的检查是全部。把文档站推送到 GitHub Pages 由 `site.yml` 负责，不在 CI 里（见发布）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4921":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-168","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`python scripts/dev.py check` 在本地运行全部内容（只在你的平台和 Python 上，装上需要接受许可的包，基于你检出的 Mizuoto）。契约套件和对照工具需要模型（对照还需要参照实现的环境），权重有几十 GB，所以不进 CI；发布工作流有自己的 wheel 冒烟测试（见发布）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4922":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-169","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"CI 只有 CPU 版 torch。GPU 上的路径（CUDA 图、可选的注意力后端、显存流式加载的异步预取）在 CPU 上测的是逻辑；它们在 GPU 上的表现要在有 GPU 的机器上用契约套件和对照工具检查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4923":{"id":"/docs/development-training","page_id":"/docs/development-training","type":"page","content":"训练器","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-training","locale":"zh-CN"},"4924":{"id":"/docs/development-training-0","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training","content":"训练方法怎样在清单里声明，数据集怎样添加、准备和检查，各阶段怎样作为 Mizuoto 自身解释器的子进程依次运行，指纹怎样决定哪些阶段过期，训练器怎样编写，以及导出会登记什么。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4925":{"id":"/docs/development-training-1","page_id":"/docs/development-training","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"清单里的训练方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"4926":{"id":"/docs/development-training-2","page_id":"/docs/development-training","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-training#数据集","content":"数据集","locale":"zh-CN"},"4927":{"id":"/docs/development-training-3","page_id":"/docs/development-training","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-training#实验指纹与过期阶段","content":"实验、指纹与过期阶段","locale":"zh-CN"},"4928":{"id":"/docs/development-training-4","page_id":"/docs/development-training","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-training#训练任务","content":"训练任务","locale":"zh-CN"},"4929":{"id":"/docs/development-training-5","page_id":"/docs/development-training","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-training#为什么用子进程","content":"为什么用子进程","locale":"zh-CN"},"4930":{"id":"/docs/development-training-6","page_id":"/docs/development-training","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-training#trainer-与-stagecontext","content":"Trainer 与 StageContext","locale":"zh-CN"},"4931":{"id":"/docs/development-training-7","page_id":"/docs/development-training","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-training#显存","content":"显存","locale":"zh-CN"},"4932":{"id":"/docs/development-training-8","page_id":"/docs/development-training","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-training#导出","content":"导出","locale":"zh-CN"},"4933":{"id":"/docs/development-training-9","page_id":"/docs/development-training","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-training#以-omnivoice-的训练器为例","content":"以 OmniVoice 的训练器为例","locale":"zh-CN"},"4934":{"id":"/docs/development-training-10","page_id":"/docs/development-training","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-training#添加一个训练器","content":"添加一个训练器","locale":"zh-CN"},"4935":{"id":"/docs/development-training-11","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training","content":"每个可训练的引擎都以原生方式训练，在 Mizuoto 自己的环境里，用的就是它推理时的那些模块。每个训练器都复现了上游的训练方案：在 CPU 上用同一个种子，它的损失、学习率和保存的权重与上游脚本（Mizuoto 0.1 运行它们的方式；VoxCPM 则是上游自己的脚本）逐字节相同。不需要单独的训练环境或训练用的附加依赖：训练器只用推理也用的模块和依赖，不依赖 transformers、accelerate、peft、Lightning、Hydra、datasets 或 webdataset。主机一侧是 `mizuoto/core/training/service.py`（`TrainingService`）；引擎一侧是 `mizuoto/training/`（`Trainer`、`StageContext`、`stage.py`）加上各引擎的训练器模块。训练界面的用法见训练。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4936":{"id":"/docs/development-training-12","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"训练方法是引擎清单里的 `[training.<id>]`（`TrainingMethod`）。OmniVoice 的 LoRA：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4937":{"id":"/docs/development-training-13","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"4938":{"id":"/docs/development-training-14","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"4939":{"id":"/docs/development-training-15","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"`stages`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4940":{"id":"/docs/development-training-16","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"静态声明，每个阶段有 `id`、`title`、`help` 和 `uses`（它读取的超参数；省略表示全部）。界面和指纹不必运行任何东西就知道有哪些阶段","locale":"zh-CN"},"4941":{"id":"/docs/development-training-17","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"`hyperparams`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4942":{"id":"/docs/development-training-18","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"若干 `OptionSpec`；`group = \"basic\"` 的排在前面，`variants` 把某个超参数限定到部分变体","locale":"zh-CN"},"4943":{"id":"/docs/development-training-19","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"`export`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4944":{"id":"/docs/development-training-20","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"`voice_weights`（音色自有的权重，GPT-SoVITS）或 `model`（一个新的用户模型）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4945":{"id":"/docs/development-training-21","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"`variants`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4946":{"id":"/docs/development-training-22","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"只能从这些变体的模型开始","locale":"zh-CN"},"4947":{"id":"/docs/development-training-23","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"`min_seconds`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4948":{"id":"/docs/development-training-24","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"数据集至少要有多少音频","locale":"zh-CN"},"4949":{"id":"/docs/development-training-25","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"`assets`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4950":{"id":"/docs/development-training-26","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"按变体列出只有训练才用的共享资源（GPT-SoVITS 的预训练判别器）；`\"*\"` 表示所有变体","locale":"zh-CN"},"4951":{"id":"/docs/development-training-27","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"`devices`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4952":{"id":"/docs/development-training-28","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"训练所用的设备类型；训练器自己的 `DEVICES` 优先","locale":"zh-CN"},"4953":{"id":"/docs/development-training-29","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"`enabled`、`note`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4954":{"id":"/docs/development-training-30","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"关闭某个方法并说明原因","locale":"zh-CN"},"4955":{"id":"/docs/development-training-31","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"训练器类是引擎的 `TRAINER = \"模块:类\"`（见接入引擎）。`TrainingService.methods(model)` 对每个方法说明能否从这个模型开始，不能时给出 `reason`：已禁用、变体不对、引擎运行在远程主机上、模型没装、引擎不可用、没有训练器、设备类型不符、训练器的 `REQUIRES` 导入不了、缺训练用的共享资源。每条原因都附带解决它的命令。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4956":{"id":"/docs/development-training-32","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"目前的方法：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4957":{"id":"/docs/development-training-33","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-