oice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"24 kHz","locale":"zh-CN"},"5281":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-38","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"基于 Qwen2-0.5B 的 `Qwen2LM`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5282":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-39","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"`CausalMaskedDiffWithXvec`：因果 U-Net","locale":"zh-CN"},"5283":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-40","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"HiFT","locale":"zh-CN"},"5284":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-41","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"`v3`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5285":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-42","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"`cosyvoice/cosyvoice3-0.5b`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5286":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-43","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"24 kHz","locale":"zh-CN"},"5287":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-44","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"`CosyVoice3LM`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5288":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-45","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"`CausalMaskedDiffWithDiT`：22 层 DiT","locale":"zh-CN"},"5289":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-46","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"因果 HiFT，F0 预测器用 float64","locale":"zh-CN"},"5290":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-47","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"变体由目录中的 yaml 决定（`cosyvoice.yaml`、`cosyvoice2.yaml`、`cosyvoice3.yaml`）；带 `spk2info.pt` 的 CosyVoice 1 目录是 SFT 或 Instruct。目录中有 yaml、`llm.pt`、`flow.pt`、`hift.pt`、`campplus.onnx`、`speech_tokenizer_v1.onnx` / `v2` / `v3`、`spk2info.pt`，v2/v3 还有 `CosyVoice-BlankEN` 的配置和分词器（不含其权重，`llm.pt` 会替换它们）。共享资源 `cosyvoice/wetext` 存放文本规范化用的 FST。ONNX 模型只转换一次，缓存为 `<model>/.mizuoto/converted-<key>.safetensors`（ONNX 文件旁的 `<name>.safetensors` 优先）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5291":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-48","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#变体与文件","content":"能力：预置说话人、指令、克隆与跨语种克隆、音色转换、流式输出，v2/v3 还有流式文本输入。精度：fp32；加载选项 `fp16` 让语言模型和 flow 在 CUDA autocast 下运行，与上游的 `fp16` 相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5292":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-49","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#工作原理","content":"音色提示由参考音频分三路生成：16 kHz 音频 → Whisper log-mel → **语音分词器**的 token；16 kHz 音频 → kaldi fbank → **CAM++** 的 192 维说话人嵌入；以及始终为 24 kHz 的 Matcha mel，即使是 22.05 kHz 的 CosyVoice 1 也一样。**语言模型**把文本（以及提示的文本和 token）变成语音 token；**flow** 用 10 步欧拉、引导强度 0.7 把 token 变成 mel；**HiFT**（带神经源滤波器和逆 STFT 的 HiFi-GAN）把 mel 变成音频。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5293":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-50","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#工作原理","content":"模块","locale":"zh-CN"},"5294":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-51","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#工作原理","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"5295":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-52","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#工作原理","content":"`engine.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5296":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-53","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#工作原理","content":"前端、`CosyVoiceModel.tts`（token、mel、波形）、流式分块、音色转换、流式文本、音色缓存","locale":"zh-CN"},"5297":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-54","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#工作原理","content":"`config.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5298":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-55","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#工作原理","content":"把 HyperPyYAML 文件当数据读取（`!new:`/`!name:` 读成字典，解析 `!ref` 表达式）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5299":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-56","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#工作原理","content":"`frontend.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5300":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-57","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#工作原理","content":"用 wetext 的 `text_normalize`、清理和切分","locale":"zh-CN"},"5301":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-58","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#工作原理","content":"`tokenizer.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5302":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-59","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#工作原理","content":"v2/v3：BlankEN 的 Qwen2 BPE 加 CosyVoice 新增的 token；v1：Whisper 的 tiktoken 词表","locale":"zh-CN"},"5303":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-60","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#工作原理","content":"`llm.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5304":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-61","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#工作原理","content":"三种语言模型、重复感知采样（RAS）、流式文本的交错（5 个文本 : 15 个语音）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5305":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-62","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#工作原理","content":"`flow.py`、`dit.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5306":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-63","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#工作原理","content":"三种 flow；CosyVoice 3 的 DiT 估计器","locale":"zh-CN"},"5307":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-64","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#工作原理","content":"`train.py`、`sft.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5308":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-65","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#工作原理","content":"`CosyVoiceTrainer`（方法 `llm`、`llm_flow`）及其计算","locale":"zh-CN"},"5309":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-66","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#工作原理","content":"共享：`nn/codecs/s3tokenizer.py`（由 ONNX 文件构建的 v1–v3 语音分词器）、`nn/speaker/campplus.py`（按 ONNX 图的形式实现的 CAM++）、`nn/transformer/wenet.py`、`nn/flow/unet1d.py`、`nn/transformer/dit.py`、`nn/vocoders/hift.py`、`nn/dsp/`（`mel`、`kaldi`、`resample`、`wav`、`flac`）、`runtime/convert/onnx.py`、`runtime/lm/qwen.py`、`runtime/graphs.py`、`text/normalize/wetext.py`、`text/tokenize/`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5310":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-67","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#与上游一致的做法","content":"**尺寸来自 yaml。** 各模块的尺寸取自模型自己的 yaml（HyperPyYAML 的标签当数据读取），而不是写在代码里。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5311":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-68","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#与上游一致的做法","content":"**不用 onnxruntime 的语音 token 和 CAM++。** 语音分词器是 s3tokenizer 的 torch 模型，权重从 ONNX 文件读出；在测试语料上，v1、v2、v3 的编码都与 onnxruntime 相同。CAM++ 照搬导出的计算图（卷积后的 batch norm 已折叠，与导出时一样），与 onnxruntime 的相对误差约 1e-6，并非逐位一致。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5312":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-69","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#与上游一致的做法","content":"**提示 mel** 在每个版本都是 24 kHz 的 Matcha mel；v2/v3 严格保持每个提示 token 对应两帧 mel。v3 丢弃长于五个的静音 token 串，并加上它的系统提示（`You are a helpful assistant.<|endofprompt|>`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5313":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-70","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#与上游一致的做法","content":"**按 transformers 4.51 的方式运行 Qwen2。** CosyVoice 2/3 的语言模型原本跑在 transformers 4.51 上，那里的 SDPA 路径总是重复 KV 头，并让 q、k、v 连续（`QwenConfig.sdpa_gqa=False`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5314":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-71","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#与上游一致的做法","content":"**噪声。** v2/v3 的 flow 噪声是上游以种子 0 生成的缓冲（前 1×80×15000 个正态抽样）。`randn_like(x)` 保留 `x` 的步长，所以当 `x` 是转置的（HiFT 的正弦源）时，抽样落入元素的顺序与 `randn(shape)` 不同：`nn.vocoders.hift.randn_like` 用生成器填充 `empty_like(x)`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5315":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-72","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#与上游一致的做法","content":"**CosyVoice 3 的声码器噪声**在上游构建模型时抽取一次，位于 flow 的种子 0 噪声以及 flow 和 F0 预测器的默认初始化之后。`cosyvoice3_noise` 在私有生成器上重放这些抽样，因此数值与上游相同，而那块 259 MB 的缓冲从不真正生成。它的 F0 预测器以 float64 运行，所以权重归一化也在 float64 中折叠。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5316":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-73","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#与上游一致的做法","content":"**抽样顺序。** 非流式时按上游的顺序抽样（语言模型、v1 的 flow 噪声、声码器噪声）。流式使用上游的分块：v1 每块 100 个 token，重叠 20 个，用 Hamming 窗交叉淡化；v2/v3 从 25 个 token 起翻倍到 100，向前看三个 token。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5317":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-74","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#与上游一致的做法","content":"**文本规范化**是移植到 kaldifst 上的 wetext 规范化器，在语料上结果相同；它的 FST 是共享资源 `cosyvoice/wetext`（ModelScope `pengzhendong/wetext`，固定提交）。含 `<|…|>` 的文本不做规范化，与上游一样跳过。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5318":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-75","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#有意的差异","content":"**没有语言模型线程。** 上游把语言模型放在声码器旁边的线程里运行；这里它在请求的线程中运行，token 一到就生成分块。上游流式的 v1/v2 在主线程抽取声码器噪声，同时语言模型在另一个线程采样，所以流式音频取决于线程时序；Mizuoto 的声码器从自己的生成器（种子 + 1）抽样，token 与非流式请求相同。CosyVoice 3 的噪声是固定的，流式结果完全相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5319":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-76","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#有意的差异","content":"**0.1 缺少的规范化。** 上游前端在运行时下载 FST；在 0.1 的 worker 中下载失败，上游便静默跳过了规范化。现在 FST 是共享资源，带数字的中文文本会读出数字，因此这类文本听起来与 0.1 不同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5320":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-77","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#有意的差异","content":"**在没有 float64 的设备上**（Apple MPS、Intel Arc），CosyVoice 3 的 F0 预测器留在 CPU 上，模型其余部分照常移动；声码器在自己的设备上把输入交给它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5321":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-78","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#有意的差异","content":"**TensorRT、vLLM 和 JIT**（0.1 的加载选项 `load_trt`、`trt_concurrent`、`load_vllm`）不可用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5322":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-79","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#有意的差异","content":"保留上游的行为：流式文本模式下参考音频较长（7 秒）时，语音开头可能是参考音频的最后几个词；用同一参考音频做普通合成则不会。流式文本需要参考文本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5323":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-80","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#为什么完整链路不是逐位一致","content":"在完整链路中，两边各自计算音色提示，而 CAM++ 的嵌入是唯一不逐位一致的部分：与 onnxruntime 相差最多 7e-6（余弦 0.999999999997）。flow 把它放大为最多 2.7e-3 的 mel 变化，HiFT 的正弦源又把 F0 积分进相位（对整句做 float32 累加，九个谐波），误差沿着句子增长：在一个 CosyVoice 3 英文克隆上，每半秒的 SNR 从 66 dB 降到 20 dB。上游同样敏感：它自己的声码器链喂入 Mizuoto 的嵌入，得到的正是 Mizuoto 的音频；它自己的 onnxruntime CAM++ 用 8 个线程而不是 1 个，得到 31 dB；同等大小的随机扰动得到 20–33 dB。CosyVoice 2/3 的语言模型从不使用说话人嵌入，所以语音 token 相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5324":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-81","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#显存与速度","content":"阶段：前端（语音分词器和 CAM++）只在音色未缓存时和音色转换时使用；语言模型（`kind=\"sequence\"`）生成 token；flow 和 HiFT 把它们说出来。流式时语言模型和 flow 同时在设备上。HiFT 的 F0 预测器标记为 `fixed`（HiFT 会读取它的设备）。语言模型的工作内存是按上游上限（300 个位置的提示之后每个文本 token 20 个语音 token）计算的缓存，按模型实际的 KV 宽度（Qwen2 的两个 KV 头），每个头组重复一层的副本，再加 512 MB。`compute.kv_cache = static` 为 Qwen2 模型预分配缓存（在 CPU 上结果相同）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5325":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-82","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#显存与速度","content":"**CUDA 上的解码（CosyVoice 2/3）。** 上游的采样器在排序后的概率上跑 Python 循环：每保留一个 token 就把累计和读回，把概率拷到主机再拷回，在主机上检查重复窗口：每个 token 约 50–80 次等待设备，另外还有 24 层逐个以 eager 方式启动。在 CUDA 上，`llm._Steps` 每个 token 只等待设备一次，抽出相同的 token：nucleus 循环在设备上对排序后的前 25 个 token 重放（在分数的 dtype 中做同样的 0 维加法；抽样用 `multinomial` 自己的 `argmax(p / Exp(1))`，其前 *n* 个指数抽样正是 *n* 元素抽样所用的那些），对 1 到 25 的每个 *n*、在 fp32、fp16 和 bf16 下，token 和生成器状态都与上游循环相同。出现重复后的重采样仍以 eager 方式进行。开启 `compute.cuda_graphs`（NVIDIA，语言模型完整位于设备上）时，单 token 步骤以 CUDA 图运行在注意力调用两侧，抽样作为一个 CUDA 图；每个 token 都把 CUDA 图的生成器与请求的生成器同步，因为 CosyVoice 3 的流式 flow 会在 token 之间从中抽样。真实的 CosyVoice 2 模型在有无 CUDA 图时给出相同的 token，每个 token 约快七倍。其他设备沿用上游的循环。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5326":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-83","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#显存与速度","content":"`compute.compile` 包装 flow 估计器。在 CPU 上没有收益（U-Net 的卷积和矩阵乘法已经是库内核）；mel 与 eager 相差不超过 5.7e-6，HiFT 由 F0 驱动的源把它放大到音频中约 1e-2（47 dB），换一个线程数的 eager 运行也会如此。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5327":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-84","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#训练","content":"方法 `llm` 和 `llm_flow`（阶段 `features`、`llm`、`flow`、`export`；起点为 CosyVoice 1、2 或 3）：上游的 LibriTTS 流程和 `bin/train.py`，不需要 onnxruntime、pyarrow、pyworld、transformers、deepspeed 或 torchrun。在 CPU 上（gloo，world size 1）它与上游的损失、准确率、学习率和 `epoch_<N>_whole.pt` 逐字节相同，覆盖三代模型，数据加载 worker 为 0 或 2 个，以及在 epoch 结束时剩余未满的梯度累积；特征（语音 token 和 CAM++）给出 onnxruntime 的 token，嵌入相差不超过 6e-6。上游只在 CUDA 上训练；这个训练器在所有设备类型上都能运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5328":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-85","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#训练","content":"**参考实现**是在模型构建完成后用阶段的种子给生成器播种的上游：上游在 yaml 中播种 1986（其 v2/v3 flow 在构建时又重新播种 0），然后抽取随机初始化，而这里在训练前不做任何抽样。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5329":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-86","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#训练","content":"**数据加载。** 每个加载 worker 对自己的分片跑完整个流水线；分片（每片 1000 段音频）少于 worker 时，每个 worker 都读所有分片，所以默认两个 worker 时每段音频每个 epoch 出现两次，与上游相同。打乱顺序从 `Random(base_seed + k)` 抽样；批次轮流来自各 worker；特征在单线程上生成，与 worker 中一样。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5330":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-87","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#训练","content":"**每个 epoch 以一轮验证结束**（在训练列表上，与上游相同），验证同样会抽样（Qwen2LM 的双流选择、flow 的流式选择、条件和噪声）。它的损失写入日志，不作为指标。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5331":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-88","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#训练","content":"**裁剪顺序。** 参数按上游的顺序裁剪（`sft._ORDER`），因为总范数按这个顺序求和；检查点保持上游的键顺序，Qwen 绑定的 `lm_head` 与嵌入共享存储。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5332":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-89","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#训练","content":"**Qwen2 在 transformers 4.51 的加性掩码下训练**（`causal_mask_451`）；记录的 `loss` 除以累积步数，与上游的记录方式相同；CosyVoice 1 保留流程中的 `WarmupLR`（2500 步）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5333":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-90","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#训练","content":"0.1 无法训练 CosyVoice 2 或 3（上游需要一个任何模型都没有附带的 `speech_tokenizer_v*.batch.onnx`）。Mizuoto 的导出在两种实现中都能加载，给定相同的音色提示时两边说出的结果相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5334":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-91","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#训练","content":"`training.memory`：对语言模型或 flow 的各个块做梯度检查点，损失和权重都相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5335":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-92","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#对照结果","content":"参考实现是 torch 2.8 上的上游（在它自己的 torch 2.3.1 上，它与自己在 2.8 上的结果不一致）。把上游的音色提示同时喂给两边时，克隆（英文、带数字的中文）、跨语种克隆、指令、预置说话人、流式音频和音色转换在 v1、v2、v3 上都逐采样相同。在完整链路中两边各自生成提示：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5336":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-93","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#对照结果","content":"大多数 v2 用例：45.5–68.3 dB SNR；","locale":"zh-CN"},"5337":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-94","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#对照结果","content":"CosyVoice 3 英文克隆：约 23 dB（CAM++ 的浮点噪声，见上文）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"5338":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-95","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#对照结果","content":"SFT 中文用例和 v2 中文克隆的长度不同，来自文本规范化；两边都关闭规范化时，前者完全相同，后者只差 CAM++ 的噪声；","locale":"zh-CN"},"5339":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-96","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#对照结果","content":"训练交叉加载用例（一种实现的导出由另一种实现说出）：57.4 dB 和 38.1 dB。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5340":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-97","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#对照结果","content":"契约套件通过（18 项测试）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5341":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-98","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#限制","content":"在完整链路中，结果与上游非常接近但不逐位一致，因为 CAM++ 与 onnxruntime 不是逐位一致的。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5342":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-99","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#限制","content":"流式的 CosyVoice 1/2 音频不等于上游的流式音频（后者取决于线程时序）；这里的结果可以复现。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5343":{"id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice-100","page_id":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-cosyvoice#限制","content":"快速解码路径仅限 CUDA。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5344":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","type":"page","content":"F5-TTS","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","引擎参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-f5tts","locale":"zh-CN"},"5345":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-0","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts","content":"Mizuoto 中实现的 F5-TTS 引擎：v1 Base、v0 Base 和 E2，DiT 与 UNetT，CFM 采样器与 Vocos，哪些做法与上游完全一致，显存与编译说明，全量微调，以及对照结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5346":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-1","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#变体与文件","content":"变体与文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"5347":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-2","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#工作原理","content":"工作原理","locale":"zh-CN"},"5348":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-3","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#与上游一致的做法","content":"与上游一致的做法","locale":"zh-CN"},"5349":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-4","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#有意的差异","content":"有意的差异","locale":"zh-CN"},"5350":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-5","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#显存与速度","content":"显存与速度","locale":"zh-CN"},"5351":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-6","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#训练","content":"训练","locale":"zh-CN"},"5352":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-7","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#对照结果","content":"对照结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"5353":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-8","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#限制","content":"限制","locale":"zh-CN"},"5354":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-9","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts","content":"一个流匹配语音合成：在参考音频的 mel 谱之后补全新的 mel 谱，再用 Vocos 转成音频（SWivid/F5-TTS；代码 MIT，预训练权重 CC-BY-NC-4.0）。代码：`mizuoto/engines/f5tts`。在 CPU 上以 fp32、同一种子运行时，三个模型的克隆和语音编辑都与 Mizuoto 0.1 完全相同，它的训练器也逐字节给出 0.1 导出的权重。面向用户的说明见引擎详解。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5355":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-10","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#变体与文件","content":"变体","locale":"zh-CN"},"5356":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-11","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#变体与文件","content":"目录中的模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"5357":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-12","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#变体与文件","content":"主干网络","locale":"zh-CN"},"5358":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-13","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#变体与文件","content":"`v1_base`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5359":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-14","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#变体与文件","content":"`f5tts/v1-base`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5360":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-15","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#变体与文件","content":"DiT（宽 1024、22 层），文本填充被掩码","locale":"zh-CN"},"5361":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-16","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#变体与文件","content":"`base`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5362":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-17","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#变体与文件","content":"`f5tts/base`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5363":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-18","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#变体与文件","content":"只在一个头上用旋转位置编码的 DiT（`pe_attn_head = 1`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5364":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-19","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#变体与文件","content":"`e2_base`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5365":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-20","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#变体与文件","content":"`f5tts/e2-base`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5366":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-21","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#变体与文件","content":"E2-TTS 的 UNetT：带跳连的扁平 transformer，x-transformers 的 RMSNorm","locale":"zh-CN"},"5367":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-22","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#变体与文件","content":"三者都能克隆（必须有参考文本）和编辑语音。模型目录包含检查点（`*.safetensors`，否则 `*.pt`）、`vocab.txt` 以及 `vocos/config.yaml` + `vocos/pytorch_model.bin`。E2 的仓库没有词表，所以上游自带的 `vocab.txt` 作为包数据随引擎发布，供它使用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5368":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-23","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#变体与文件","content":"精度：计算能力 7 及以上的 CUDA GPU 上用 fp16，与上游的 `load_checkpoint` 判断相同；其他设备用 fp32。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5369":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-24","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#工作原理","content":"文本（参考文本加上新文本，汉字转成带声调的拼音）经 ConvNeXtV2 块嵌入；transformer 以参考音频的 mel 为条件，预测从噪声到 mel 帧的流；ODE 求解器在固定的时间网格上积分，无分类器引导作为一个大小为 2 的批次计算；Vocos 把 mel 转成 24 kHz 音频。没有时长模型：长度来自参考音频的语速，或者来自 `duration`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5370":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-25","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#工作原理","content":"模块","locale":"zh-CN"},"5371":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-26","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#工作原理","content":"是什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"5372":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-27","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#工作原理","content":"`engine.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5373":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-28","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#工作原理","content":"参考音频预处理、分块、`CFM.sample`（带种子的噪声、EPSS 或 sway 时间网格、Euler 或中点法步、引导）、Vocos、交叉淡化；`edit` 按上游的 `speech_edit.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5374":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-29","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#工作原理","content":"`text.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5375":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-30","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#工作原理","content":"字符与拼音（`f5_tts.model.utils`）、上游的分块","locale":"zh-CN"},"5376":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-31","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#工作原理","content":"`vocab.txt`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5377":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-32","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#工作原理","content":"上游自带的词表","locale":"zh-CN"},"5378":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-33","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#工作原理","content":"`train.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5379":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-34","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#工作原理","content":"`F5Trainer`（方法 `full`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5380":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-35","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#工作原理","content":"共享：`nn/transformer/dit.py`（AdaLN-zero、ConvNeXtV2 文本块、交错式旋转位置编码）、`nn/transformer/unett.py`、`nn/flow/cfm.py`（`odeint_fixed`、`epss_timesteps`、`sway`）、`nn/vocoders/vocos.py`、`nn/dsp/mel.py`、`nn/dsp/resample.py`、`nn/dsp/tiles.py`、`runtime/compile.py`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5381":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-36","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#与上游一致的做法","content":"**参考音频**按 `preprocess_ref_audio_text` 的方式裁剪和填充，响度调到 `target_rms`，用 torchaudio 的 `Resample` 重采样。pydub 的 50 毫秒填充按 `audioop.ratecv` 的帧数复现（`edge_pad`：24 kHz 下 1198 个采样，而不是 1200），因为 Python 3.13 已经没有 `audioop`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5382":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-37","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#与上游一致的做法","content":"**文本。** 以单字节字符结尾的参考文本会补一个空格，与 `infer_batch_process` 相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5383":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-38","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#与上游一致的做法","content":"**分块**按上游的方式切分，按顺序生成，并用上游的交叉淡化拼接；`duration` 也按上游的方式分摊到各块。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5384":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-39","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#与上游一致的做法","content":"**ODE。** torchdiffeq 固定网格的 Euler 和中点法步即 `nn.flow.cfm.odeint_fixed`；步数为 5、6、7、10、12 或 16 时用上游的 Empirically Pruned Step Sampling 网格，否则用线性网格加 sway 采样。噪声按上游的方式抽取，逐条、以模型的 dtype。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5385":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-40","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#与上游一致的做法","content":"**x-transformers 的交错式旋转位置编码和 RMSNorm** 原样移植。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5386":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-41","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#与上游一致的做法","content":"**GPU 上的精度。** 与上游相同，模型*先*转换到它的 dtype，再复制检查点，所以在 GPU 上旋转位置编码的 `inv_freq` 也是 fp16，角度以 fp16 计算。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5387":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-42","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#有意的差异","content":"**按顺序生成各块。** 上游在一个共享全局随机数生成器的线程池里生成长文本的各块，所以它自己的输出取决于线程时序；0.1 的适配层按顺序生成，Mizuoto 也是如此。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5388":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-43","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#有意的差异","content":"只提供 Vocos 声码器；上游 v0 模型的 BigVGAN 版本不在模型目录中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5389":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-44","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#显存与速度","content":"两个阶段：transformer 加 mel（每个 ODE 步；引导使批次翻倍）和 Vocos。开启 `compute.oom_fallback` 时，若 Vocos 显存不足，它会以 256 帧为一块、重叠 32 帧并交叉淡化地分块解码（`applied.fallbacks` 会注明）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5390":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-45","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#显存与速度","content":"`compute.compile` 用 `torch.compile(dynamic=True)` 包装 DiT 或 UNetT。在 CPU 上以 fp32、8 线程运行时，transformer 预热后的耗时下降 23 %（一个请求从 60 秒降到 45 秒）；第一个请求要付出约 30 秒的编译时间；音频与 eager 的差异在 9.2e-5 以内（89 dB）。`compute.cpu_allocator` 和 `compute.cpu_threads` 的 CPU 分配器与线程绑定，能让 F5-TTS 在 Linux 上快 10–20 %，且不改变任何结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5391":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-46","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#训练","content":"方法 `full`（阶段 `prepare`、`train`、`export`）：上游的 `finetune_cli` 方案，不需要 accelerate、datasets、wandb 或 ema_pytorch。两边用同样的种子时，它在 CPU 上逐字节给出 0.1 的损失、学习率和导出的 `model_<update>.safetensors`。（0.1 自己从未播种：它的条件丢弃来自未播种的 `random`。）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5392":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-47","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#训练","content":"**按上游的顺序抽样**：按上游的构建顺序做模型的随机初始化（UNetT 最后才创建一层的跳连投影），前两个 epoch 各一个数据加载 worker 的种子（持久化的加载器；accelerate 的 `skip_first_batches` 副本会遍历 epoch 0），然后每个批次依次是片段、噪声、时间、两次 `random()` 调用和 dropout 掩码。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5393":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-48","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#训练","content":"**第 *e* ≥ 1 个 epoch 用种子 666 + *e* − 1 打乱**：accelerate 的加载器会把采样器的 epoch 重置为它自己的迭代次数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5394":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-49","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#训练","content":"**mel 在单线程上计算**，与上游的加载 worker 相同；线程更多会改变滤波器组乘积的求和。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5395":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-50","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#训练","content":"**导出**保留使用上游键名的 EMA 权重、词表和声码器，所以 0.1 和 Mizuoto 都能加载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5396":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-51","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#训练","content":"`training.memory`：对 transformer 的块做梯度检查点，结果相同；`low` 把 EMA 副本放在内存里；`lowest` 把 AdamW 的状态也放进去（CPU 上相同）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5397":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-52","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#对照结果","content":"全部 6 个完整链路用例在 CPU 上以 fp32 与 0.1 逐采样相同：v1 Base、v0 Base 和 E2 的英文与中文克隆、微调后的模型，以及语音编辑。另有两个用例用一种实现合成另一种实现的训练导出，也都相同。契约套件通过（12 项）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5398":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-53","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#限制","content":"预训练权重是 CC-BY-NC-4.0，基于它们的微调结果也是；输出带有标记。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5399":{"id":"/docs/engines-f5tts-54","page_id":"/docs/engines-f5tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-f5tts#限制","content":"在 GPU 上模型像上游一样以 fp16 运行；Mizuoto 在那里不提供 fp32 的旋转位置编码。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5400":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","type":"page","content":"Fish Speech","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","引擎参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","locale":"zh-CN"},"5401":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-0","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","content":"Mizuoto 单独发行包 mizuoto-fishspeech 中实现的 Fish Speech S2 Pro 引擎：双自回归 transformer 与 44.1 kHz 编解码器，哪些做法与上游完全一致，每帧只等待设备一次与 CUDA 图，LoRA 微调，以及对照结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5402":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-1","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#变体与文件","content":"变体与文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"5403":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-2","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理","content":"工作原理","locale":"zh-CN"},"5404":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-3","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#与上游一致的做法","content":"与上游一致的做法","locale":"zh-CN"},"5405":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-4","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#有意的差异","content":"有意的差异","locale":"zh-CN"},"5406":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-5","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#显存与速度","content":"显存与速度","locale":"zh-CN"},"5407":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-6","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#训练","content":"训练","locale":"zh-CN"},"5408":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-7","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#对照结果","content":"对照结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"5409":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-8","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#限制","content":"限制","locale":"zh-CN"},"5410":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-9","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","content":"Fish Audio S2 Pro（fishaudio/fish-speech，Fish Audio Research License）。移植版同样受该许可约束，所以作为单独的发行包发布：`mizuoto-fishspeech`（`packages/native/fishspeech`，包名 `mizuoto_fishspeech`，附 `LICENSE.md`），注册在入口点组 `mizuoto.engines` 下（`fishspeech = mizuoto_fishspeech:FishSpeechEngine`）。下载模型和合成都需要先接受许可。在 CPU 上以 fp32、相同种子运行时，它的编码和音频与 Mizuoto 0.1 所运行的上游带种子 `generate_long` 完全相同，训练器导出的模型与 0.1 逐位相同。面向用户的说明见 引擎详解。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5411":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-10","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#变体与文件","content":"只有一个变体 `s2_pro`（目录模型 `fishspeech/s2-pro`）：用一到四段参考音频克隆，每段都带参考文本；行内标签；说话人之间的对话（`<|speaker:i|>`）。模型目录中有 `config.json`、权重（`model.safetensors.index.json` 及其分片、`model.safetensors` 或 `model.pth`）、`codec.pth` 和 BPE 分词器文件。音色缓存是 `codes.pt`，即每段参考音频的编码。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5412":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-11","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#变体与文件","content":"精度：与上游相同，CUDA GPU 上用 bf16；其他设备用 fp32（bf16 在 CPU 上是模拟的，慢得多）；`engines.fishspeech.dtype` 可以覆盖。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5413":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-12","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理","content":"提示是一段 ChatML 对话：一条系统消息，包含每段参考音频的文本及其编码，然后是要说的文本。**慢 transformer**（Qwen3-4B 的形状：36 层，q/k RMSNorm，一个融合的 `wqkv`）生成每帧的语义 token；**快 transformer**（4 层）根据慢模型归一化后的隐藏状态生成其余九个码本。**编解码器**（改造过的 44.1 kHz DAC：因果卷积、窗口化 transformer、下采样残差量化器，含一个 4096 的语义码本和九个 1024 的码本；约每秒 21.5 帧）编码参考音频，并把帧解码成音频。文本按说话人轮次分批生成，每批完成即解码。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5414":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-13","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理","content":"模块","locale":"zh-CN"},"5415":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-14","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"5416":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-15","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理","content":"`engine.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5417":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-16","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理","content":"读取参考音频、重采样到 44.1 kHz 并编码；按说话人轮次分批生成；编解码器解码；`codec_encode` 和 `codec_decode` 操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"5418":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-17","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理","content":"`model.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5419":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-18","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理","content":"双自回归 transformer","locale":"zh-CN"},"5420":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-19","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理","content":"`generate.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5421":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-20","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理","content":"对话提示、按上游顺序采样、轮次分组、带 CUDA 图的解码器（`Decoder`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5422":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-21","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理","content":"`codec.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5423":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-22","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理","content":"44.1 kHz 编解码器","locale":"zh-CN"},"5424":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-23","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理","content":"`train.py`、`finetune.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5425":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-24","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理","content":"`FishSpeechTrainer`（方法 `lora`）及其计算","locale":"zh-CN"},"5426":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-25","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#工作原理","content":"共享：`text/tokenize/bpe.py`、`runtime/lm/cache.py`、`runtime/graphs.py`、`nn/dsp/`（`resample`、`wav`、`flac`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5427":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-26","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#与上游一致的做法","content":"**提示**是上游的对话，每个文本部分单独分词；每帧的主 token 是 `semantic_begin_id + code`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5428":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-27","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#与上游一致的做法","content":"**采样**按上游的顺序从请求的生成器抽样：主 token 抽两次（先用请求的温度和 top-p，再用 1.0 和 0.9 做重复感知采样），然后是快 transformer 的九次抽样。一次抽样就是 `argmax(probs / -log(u))`。top-k 固定为 30，与上游相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5429":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-28","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#与上游一致的做法","content":"**数值**：Fish 的 RMSNorm 在 float32 中计算；RoPE 作用于相邻元素对，频率表舍入到 bfloat16；预填充用带布尔因果掩码的 SDPA，解码步骤用 SDPA 的 math 内核（直接调用，不改进程级设置）；快 transformer 用手写的 softmax。权重归一化保留检查点的两种格式，并在每次前向时重新计算，与上游相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5430":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-29","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#与上游一致的做法","content":"**参考音频**用 torchaudio 的内核重采样到 44.1 kHz。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5431":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-30","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#与上游一致的做法","content":"**WAV 输出。** `codec_decode` 用 `nn.dsp.wav.write_wav` 写 WAV，与 `soundfile.write` 逐字节相同：libsndfile 1.2 存储裁剪后的 `lrint(x × 2³¹) >> 16`，也就是 `floor(x × 32768)`，只有略低于一个台阶的值例外。`codec_encode` 只读 WAV。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5432":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-31","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#有意的差异","content":"**没有守护线程，也没有预分配 32 768 个位置的缓存。** 缓存通过拼接增长；经过 `repeat_interleave` 后，键和值就是上游构造的那些张量。注意力掩码按调用生成，而不是上游那 4 GiB 的掩码缓冲。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5433":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-32","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#有意的差异","content":"**不构建上游从不运行的编解码器模块。** 上游的编解码器为解码器第一个块构建了一个 transformer，却从不接上它（没有权重，从不运行）。`codec.pth` 里还有旧版上游保存的 RoPE 表和掩码，上游已不再加载，这里也忽略。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5434":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-33","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#有意的差异","content":"**接受但无效果**：`normalize` 和 `repetition_penalty` 在上游的推理路径中不起任何作用，所以这里也不起作用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5435":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-34","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#显存与速度","content":"阶段：编解码器编码参考音频并解码每批帧；语言模型（`kind=\"sequence\"`，快 transformer 为 `hot`）生成每一批，生成继续时重新放置。每批的工作内存是慢模型缓存的真实上限：参考音频的编码、每个文本 token、之前各批的帧和 `max_new_tokens`，不超过 `max_seq_len`。模型完整运行需要约 22 GB 显存；不够时运行时会流式加载部分权重。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5436":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-35","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#显存与速度","content":"一帧是一次慢 transformer 步骤加十个码本。原本的循环每帧约等待设备 22 次：轮次结束检查；把非语义 token 的码本嵌入置零的掩码赋值（`vq_sum[~mask] = 0` 会把掩码读回）；用列表下标取快 transformer 的掩码和旋转编码行（每个码本两次拷贝到设备）；采样器中把 Python 布尔值存入设备张量，每次抽样两次。它们都换成了完全等价的写法（`torch.where`、切片、`fill_`），解码步骤的掩码直接按它本来的样子生成为一行全真。每帧只剩一次等待。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5437":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-36","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#显存与速度","content":"开启 `compute.cuda_graphs`（NVIDIA，模型完整位于设备上）时，`generate.Decoder` 为每个已加载的模型保留固定张量：慢步骤在两次注意力调用之间的每一段作为一个 CUDA 图运行（`LayerSteps`），该帧的抽样、重复感知采样和快 transformer 作为一个 CUDA 图。采样设置是按请求填充的设备张量，所以一套 CUDA 图服务所有请求。编码完全相同，解码循环每帧快 2.2–2.5 倍。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5438":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-37","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#训练","content":"方法 `lora`（阶段 `tokens`、`train`、`export`）：上游的 `extract_vq`、`build_dataset`，以及基于 Lightning + Hydra、使用 loralib 的 `train.py` 和 `merge_lora`，但不需要这些库，也不需要 protobuf。以相同方式播种时，它在 CPU 上的编码、损失、LoRA 权重和导出的 `model.pth` 与 0.1 逐位相同，导出的其他文件逐字节相同。（0.1 从不播种，所以只有第一步能复现。）它在所有设备类型上都能运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5439":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-38","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#训练","content":"**跳过初始化抽样。** 上游在加载检查点之前先用随机权重构建模型，并在抽取 `A` 之前把每个 loralib 层初始化两次：约 18 G 次抽样。`initial_lora` 只根据形状算出这些抽样让生成器前进多少（float32 的 `normal_` 或 `uniform_` 前进其大小，大小不是 16 的倍数时 `normal_` 再多 16），然后在 GF(2) 中把 MT19937 向前跳（`mizuoto.training.rng`）：用 2 秒而不是 40 秒的抽样得到同样的状态，在加载权重的同时在另一个线程中计算。随后是加载器的基础种子和每一步的 LoRA dropout 掩码。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5440":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-39","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#训练","content":"**与上游相同的混合精度。** 检查点中的张量按上游的方式赋值，所以 S2 的归一化层保持 bfloat16，而 LoRA 层持有 float32 副本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5441":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-40","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#训练","content":"**保留**：上游的训练前向不像推理那样把码本嵌入乘以 1/√11；预热让第一步的学习率为 0，`B` 从零开始，所以前两步的损失相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5442":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-41","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#训练","content":"**填充。** 整理器用 `<|end_of_text|>` 填充，而 S2 的词表里没有它：上游实际以 0 填充，Mizuoto 也是。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5443":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-42","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#训练","content":"**导出**是上游扁平的 `dual_ar` 形式（`config.json` + `model.pth`），0.1 和 Mizuoto 都能加载。最后一轮验证被跳过（它不改变任何保留下来的东西）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5444":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-43","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#训练","content":"`training.memory`：上游的逐层检查点保持原样；在 `bf16-true` 下，LoRA 层冻结的副本直接以 bfloat16 生成（数值相同，内存少约 9 GB），导出的键顺序从一个在 meta 设备上构建的模型中读取。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5445":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-44","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#对照结果","content":"在 CPU 上以 fp32 运行时，编码与上游带种子的 `generate_long` 相同；分词器、参考音频的重采样和编码以及编解码器的解码也都相同。两个完整链路用例（英文和中文克隆）逐采样相同；另外两个用例让每种实现加载另一种实现的导出，结果也相同。契约套件通过（6 项测试）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5446":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-45","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#限制","content":"完整运行模型需要约 22 GB 显存；在 CPU 上以 fp32 运行，速度慢。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5447":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-46","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#限制","content":"`normalize` 和 `repetition_penalty` 没有效果（与上游相同），top-k 不能更改。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5448":{"id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech-47","page_id":"/docs/engines-fishspeech","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-fishspeech#限制","content":"结果受 Fish Audio Research License 约束：不可商用，也不能用于训练其他引擎。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5449":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","type":"page","content":"GPT-SoVITS","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","引擎参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","locale":"zh-CN"},"5450":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-0","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","content":"Mizuoto 中 GPT-SoVITS 引擎的实现：v2、v2Pro、v2ProPlus、v4 和 v5 Turbo，带有移植的转换器和模型的文本前端，T2S 模型、SoVITS 与流模型，哪些做法与上游完全一致，GPU 解码，写出上游文件的音色微调，以及对照结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5451":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-1","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"变体与文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"5452":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-2","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"工作原理","locale":"zh-CN"},"5453":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-3","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#与上游一致的做法","content":"与上游一致的做法","locale":"zh-CN"},"5454":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-4","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#有意的差异","content":"有意的差异","locale":"zh-CN"},"5455":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-5","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#显存与速度","content":"显存与速度","locale":"zh-CN"},"5456":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-6","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#训练","content":"训练","locale":"zh-CN"},"5457":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-7","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#对照结果","content":"对照结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"5458":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-8","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#限制","content":"限制","locale":"zh-CN"},"5459":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-9","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","content":"少样本克隆与音色微调（RVC-Boss/GPT-SoVITS，MIT）。代码：`mizuoto/engines/gptsovits`。在 CPU 上以 fp32、相同种子运行时，它在全部 15 个对照用例中都与 Mizuoto 0.1（经适配器调用上游的 `TTS_infer_pack.TTS`）完全相同，训练器写出的上游准备文件和权重也完全一致。面向用户的说明见引擎详解。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5460":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-10","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"变体","locale":"zh-CN"},"5461":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-11","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"目录模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"5462":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-12","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"采样率","locale":"zh-CN"},"5463":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-13","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"第二阶段","locale":"zh-CN"},"5464":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-14","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"`v2`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5465":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-15","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"`gptsovits/v2-base`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5466":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-16","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"32 kHz","locale":"zh-CN"},"5467":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-17","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"SoVITS：VITS 解码器（耦合流、HiFi-GAN）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5468":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-18","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"`v2pro`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5469":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-19","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"`gptsovits/v2pro-base`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5470":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-20","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"32 kHz","locale":"zh-CN"},"5471":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-21","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"同 v2，另加说话人验证嵌入（ERes2NetV2）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5472":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-22","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"`v2proplus`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5473":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-23","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"`gptsovits/v2proplus-base`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5474":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-24","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"32 kHz","locale":"zh-CN"},"5475":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-25","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"更大的 v2Pro SoVITS","locale":"zh-CN"},"5476":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-26","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"`v4`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5477":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-27","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"`gptsovits/v4-base`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5478":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-28","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"48 kHz","locale":"zh-CN"},"5479":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-29","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"`SynthesizerTrnV3`、带 DiT 的 CFM、48 kHz HiFi-GAN 声码器","locale":"zh-CN"},"5480":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-30","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"`v5turbo`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5481":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-31","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"`gptsovits/v5turbo-base`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5482":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-32","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"48 kHz","locale":"zh-CN"},"5483":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-33","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"同 v4，用 `CFMV5`，四步","locale":"zh-CN"},"5484":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-34","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"变体由模型目录中的基础 GPT 与 SoVITS 权重对决定，目录结构与上游相同：`gsv-v2final-pretrained/…`、`s1v3.ckpt`、`v2Pro/s2Gv2Pro.pth` / `s2Gv2ProPlus.pth`、`gsv-v4-pretrained/{s2Gv4,vocoder}.pth`、`gsv-v5-pretrained/{s2Gv5turbo,vocoder}.pth`。音色自己的权重（`Voice.weights[\"gptsovits\"]`：一个 GPT `.ckpt` 和一个 SoVITS `.pth`，版本从文件读出）会为该音色替换基础权重对。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5485":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-35","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"共享资源：`gptsovits/encoders`（chinese-hubert-base、chinese-roberta-wwm-ext-large、说话人验证检查点）、`gptsovits/g2pw`、`gptsovits/nltk-data`、`gptsovits/open-jtalk`；训练 v2、v2Pro 和 v2ProPlus 还需要预训练判别器 `gptsovits/s2d-v2`、`s2d-v2pro`、`s2d-v2proplus`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5486":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-36","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#变体与文件","content":"精度：在 CUDA GPU 上，`engines.gptsovits.dtype` 为 `auto` 或 `fp16` 时用 fp16，否则用 fp32。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5487":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-37","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"**文本前端**：先做语种切分，再按各语言做字音转换，得到音素 id；中文另有 BERT 特征（chinese-roberta 倒数第三层，按音素重复）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5488":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-38","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"**参考音频**：16 kHz 的音频末尾补 0.3 秒静音；HuBERT 特征经 SoVITS 量化为提示的语义 token；线性频谱供风格编码器使用；v2Pro 另有说话人验证嵌入。v4/v5 还把最后读入的那段音频在 32 kHz 下的梅尔谱作为流模型的提示。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5489":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-39","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"**GPT（T2S）**：24 层自回归 transformer，根据提示的音素和 token 以及目标的音素预测 25 Hz 语义 token；批量时左侧补齐，流式时逐行生成。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5490":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-40","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"**SoVITS**（v2 系列）把 token、音素和风格解码为 32 kHz 音频；v4/v5 先由流模型生成梅尔谱，再由声码器生成 48 kHz 音频。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5491":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-41","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"**后处理**：每个片段峰值限制为 1，后接片段间停顿，整体截断为 16 位。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5492":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-42","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"模块","locale":"zh-CN"},"5493":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-43","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"5494":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-44","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"`engine.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5495":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-45","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"按 0.1 适配器的调用方式实现的 `TTS.run`：参考音频、文本、长度分桶、T2S、SoVITS 或流模型加声码器、片段、流式","locale":"zh-CN"},"5496":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-46","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"`audio.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5497":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-47","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"读取参考音频；用 torchaudio 的内核或上游移植的 resampy `kaiser_best` 重采样","locale":"zh-CN"},"5498":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-48","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"`checkpoints.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5499":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-49","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"读取 `.pth`（覆盖在 zip 魔数上的版本标记、MD5 与文件大小规则），以及针对 `HParams` 的受限反序列化器","locale":"zh-CN"},"5500":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-50","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"`t2s.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5501":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-51","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"文本到语义模型：批量解码与逐行解码，上游的采样器","locale":"zh-CN"},"5502":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-52","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"`sovits.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5503":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-53","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"v2/v2Pro/v2ProPlus 的 `SynthesizerTrn` 解码（不构建后验编码器 `enc_q`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5504":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-54","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"`sovits_v3.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5505":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-55","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"`SynthesizerTrnV3`、`CFM`/`CFMV5`、GPT-SoVITS 的 DiT 变体、声码器路径、LoRA 合并","locale":"zh-CN"},"5506":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-56","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"`vocoder.py`、`sv.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5507":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-57","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"v4/v5 的 48 kHz HiFi-GAN；ERes2NetV2 说话人验证嵌入","locale":"zh-CN"},"5508":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-58","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"`text/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5509":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-59","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"前端：`frontend.py`（清洗、`TextPreprocessor`）、切分、语种识别（split-lang、fast-langdetect）、中文（变调、规范化、G2PW）、英文（规范化、词性标注、g2p_en）、日文、韩文（g2pk2）、粤语、符号与数据","locale":"zh-CN"},"5510":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-60","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"`train.py`、`train_s1.py`、`train_s2.py`、`s2_modules.py`、`s2_lora.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5511":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-61","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"`GptSovitsTrainer`（方法 `speaker`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5512":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-62","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#工作原理","content":"共享模块：`nn/ssl/hubert.py`、`nn/transformer/`（`bert`、`vits`、`dit`）、`nn/flow/coupling.py`、`nn/speaker/melstyle.py`、`nn/vocoders/hifigan.py`、`nn/dsp/`（`kaldi`、`mel`、`resample`、`swresample`、`wav`、`flac`）、`runtime/convert/onnx.py`（G2PW）、`runtime/graphs.py`、`runtime/compile.py`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5513":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-63","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#与上游一致的做法","content":"**抽样。** 一个生成器按段重新播种，先抽 T2S 的采样，再抽 SoVITS（或流模型）的噪声，与上游的 `set_seed` 加全局随机流一致。准备参考音频时不抽样（不重放 HuBERT 的层丢弃；0.1 出于同样的原因在播种之前准备参考音频）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5514":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-64","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#与上游一致的做法","content":"**停顿与输出。** 每个片段后的停顿无论输出采样率如何都按 32 kHz 计算，音频截断为 16 位（`(x × 32768).astype(int16)`），与上游的返回值相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5515":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-65","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#与上游一致的做法","content":"**文本前端自己持有用到的一切**，从共享资源路径构建：不改 `nltk.data.path`，没有 fastText 全局变量，也不调用 `logging.basicConfig`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5516":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-66","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#与上游一致的做法","content":"jieba 替代 jieba_fast（同一词典；在 20 446 条文本上结果相同）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"5517":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-67","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#与上游一致的做法","content":"OpenCC 用 C++ 版 `opencc==1.4.2`（纯 Python 移植版在 182 814 次转换中有 321 次不同，而这些结果会送入 G2PW）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"5518":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-68","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#与上游一致的做法","content":"G2PW 用其 ONNX 权重在 torch 中运行（拼音完全相同）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"5519":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-69","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#与上游一致的做法","content":"NLTK 的词性标注器和分词器、g2p_en、g2pk2、split-lang 和 fast-langdetect 都已移植，数据随包提供；","locale":"zh-CN"},"5520":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-70","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#与上游一致的做法","content":"日语需要 `pyopenjtalk==0.4.1`（可选依赖 `mizuoto[gptsovits-ja]`）：pyopenjtalk-plus 修改了 OpenJTalk 的规则，用它时 18 % 的日语句子结果不同。韩语需要 MeCab-ko 和 jamo（可选依赖 `mizuoto[gptsovits-ko]`）。日语用户词典只编译一次，放在共享资源 `gptsovits/open-jtalk` 的 `.mizuoto/` 目录里。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5521":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-71","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#与上游一致的做法","content":"**HuBERT 的 float16 检查点**载入 float32 参数，并在 float32 下折叠其权重归一化，与 transformers 的计算方式相同（在 float16 下折叠时特征相差 1e-4）。BERT 走 transformers 的 SDPA 路径，即 transformers 4.57 为 chinese-roberta 选用的路径。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5522":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-72","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#与上游一致的做法","content":"**微调权重。** 序列化了上游 `utils.HParams` 的 SoVITS 检查点由受限反序列化器读取（张量、`OrderedDict`，`HParams` 作为字典）。v4/v5 的 LoRA 文件不经 peft 合并（在 float32 下 W += B·A·α/r，与 peft 的合并结果相同）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5523":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-73","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#有意的差异","content":"**v4/v5 的流模型提示**始终是最后一段辅助参考音频；上游的取决于之前的请求。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5524":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-74","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#有意的差异","content":"**流式时每段文本都会朗读。** 上游在流式模式下只朗读每组 `batch_size` 中的第一段文本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5525":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-75","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#有意的差异","content":"**出错时抛出错误**，而不是像上游那样返回一秒 16 kHz 静音。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5526":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-76","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#有意的差异","content":"**未移植**：上游的 CUDA 图 T2S（`t2s_accel`，会改变结果）、`set_seed` 对进程级 TF32 的切换，以及超采样（仅 v3，不在模型目录中）。在带 bf16 矩阵单元的 CPU 上，上游的 `set_float32_matmul_precision(\"medium\")` 可能会用到它们；Mizuoto 保持 fp32。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5527":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-77","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#显存与速度","content":"阶段：每次调用文本前端时用 BERT；为参考音频的语义编码同时用 HuBERT 和 SoVITS；说话人验证模型（v2Pro）；GPT；然后是 SoVITS（以及 v4/v5 的声码器）。GPT 整体放置（它的各层直接读取融合后的投影；模型很小，约 150 MB）。音色自己的权重用 `ModelHandle.replace` 换入。GPT 的工作内存按批次中最长的一行估算（其音素、参考音频的编码，以及每个音素 16 个编码，不超过上游的 1500 步）。开启 `compute.oom_fallback` 时，显存不足的批次会改为一次朗读一段文本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5528":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-78","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#显存与速度","content":"GPT 很小，瓶颈在内核启动：一步约 360 个小内核，过去还要等待设备两次（上游的两次序列结束检查），另有 top-p 把一个 Python 布尔值拷到设备上。现在两次检查一起读取（同一个布尔值），拷贝改为 `fill_`：每步只等待设备一次。开启 `compute.cuda_graphs`（NVIDIA，GPT 完整位于设备上）时，单 token 步骤以 CUDA 图运行，图围绕每层的注意力切分，每种行数一组（行在结束后退出）；按拼接增长的缓存和采样仍在请求的生成器上即时执行。音色自己的 GPT 有自己的 CUDA 图。真实的 v2、v2Pro 和 v4 模型在有无 CUDA 图时音频相同，每个请求快 1.3–2.0 倍。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5529":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-79","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#显存与速度","content":"`compute.compile` 包装 v4/v5 的 CFM 估计器（每个加载的 SoVITS，包括音色自己的）：在 CPU 上预热后快 7 %，与即时执行相差不超过 3.1e-5（87 dB）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5530":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-80","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#训练","content":"方法 `speaker`（阶段 `text`、`speech`、`semantic`、`sovits`、`gpt`、`export`）：上游自己的流程，不需要 Lightning、torchmetrics、transformers、pandas 或 ffmpeg 程序。导出结果是音色自己的一对权重。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5531":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-81","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#训练","content":"**与上游完全相同的文件。** 每个阶段按上游的目录结构写出上游的文件，与其四个准备脚本的输出完全相同：`inputs.list`、`2-name2text.txt`、`3-bert/`、`4-cnhubert/`、`5-wav32k/`（逐字节）、`7-sv_cn/`、`6-name2semantic.tsv`。上游的 `load_audio` 通过 ffmpeg 程序读取音频；`nn/dsp/swresample.py` 是 libswresample 的默认重采样器，在试过的每种采样率上都与 ffmpeg 7.0.2 相同（soxr 只有 43 dB）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5532":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-82","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#训练","content":"**GPT**（`train_s1.py`）：每一步的损失、准确率、学习率、CPU 生成器状态，以及保存的 `<exp>-e<N>.ckpt`，都与以相同种子运行的 `s1_train.py` 相同（一个和两个 epoch，批大小 1 和 4，DPO）。上游在构建 GPT 时抽样（一个编码器层被深拷贝 24 次，然后是输出头），并为数据加载器的基础种子抽一次；`replay_construction_draws` 重放这些抽样。分桶采样器对全局 `random` 的重新播种改为私有的 `Random(epoch)`。`training_step` 在批次索引大于 0 且能被 4 整除时执行 ScaledAdam 的一步，所以梯度先累积五个批次，并跨越 epoch 边界；学习率调度在第一步之后把学习率锁定为 0.002，而第一步用的是 ScaledAdam 自己的 0.01。这些都保留。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5533":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-83","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#训练","content":"**SoVITS**（`train_s2.py`）：在 CPU 上以相同种子运行时，每一步的损失与 `s2_train.py` 和 `s2_train_v3_lora.py` 相同，保存的权重逐张量相同（半精度、版本标记、无 `enc_q`），覆盖 v2、v2Pro、v2ProPlus、v4 和 v5 Turbo（梯度累积、梯度检查点、两个 epoch）。v4 和 v5 以 LoRA 训练 SoVITS。上游从一个 `set` 列出音频，顺序随进程变化；这里排序。WaveNet 门控与上游一样用 TorchScript 编译（其梯度与即时执行在最后几位上不同）。没有 `s2d-*` 共享资源时 SoVITS 阶段拒绝运行，与 0.1 相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5534":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-84","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#训练","content":"不写出 Lightning 用于续训的检查点（930 MB）。比较时请使用相同的线程数：CPU 内核按线程数拆分求和。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5535":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-85","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#训练","content":"`training.memory`：speech 阶段在加载说话人模型之前释放 HuBERT；semantic 阶段只把 SoVITS 的 SSL 投影和量化器放到设备上。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5536":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-86","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#对照结果","content":"在 CPU 上走完整链路，全部 15 个用例都与 0.1 逐采样相同：克隆（中文、英文）、无参考文本、两段参考音频加语速、在每个标点处切分的批次、串行解码、流式 v2（token 分块、SOLA）和 v4（片段）、v4/v5 的批量与串行流模型，以及带自己 v2Pro 权重的音色。模块层面还包括文本前端（11 种语言模式下的 476 条文本）、HuBERT、BERT、说话人验证模型、LoRA 合并和每条解码路径。另外四个用例让每种实现加载另一种实现训练出的音色，也完全相同。契约套件全部通过（24 项测试）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5537":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-87","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#限制","content":"日语和韩语文本需要对应的可选依赖；缺少时这类文本以 `capability_not_supported` 失败，提示中给出安装命令。pyopenjtalk 0.4.1 是源码包，需要 CMake 和 C++ 编译器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5538":{"id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits-88","page_id":"/docs/engines-gptsovits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-gptsovits#限制","content":"流式时，若中间某块短于 SOLA 重叠长度，会留下一个空片段，上游的后处理会因此报错；保持上游的行为。在 `min_chunk_length` 为 4 时出现过。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5539":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","type":"page","content":"IndexTTS","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","引擎参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-indextts","locale":"zh-CN"},"5540":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-0","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts","content":"Mizuoto 单独发行包 mizuoto-indextts 中实现的 IndexTTS 引擎：IndexTTS-1.5、2 和 2.5，带束采样的 GPT-2、条件编码、情感与 s2mel 解码器，哪些做法与上游完全一致，显存与 GPU 解码，以及对照结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5541":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-1","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-indextts#变体与文件","content":"变体与文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"5542":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-2","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"工作原理","locale":"zh-CN"},"5543":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-3","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-indextts#与上游一致的做法","content":"与上游一致的做法","locale":"zh-CN"},"5544":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-4","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-indextts#有意的差异","content":"有意的差异","locale":"zh-CN"},"5545":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-5","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-indextts#显存与速度","content":"显存与速度","locale":"zh-CN"},"5546":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-6","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-indextts#训练","content":"训练","locale":"zh-CN"},"5547":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-7","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-indextts#对照结果","content":"对照结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"5548":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-8","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-indextts#限制","content":"限制","locale":"zh-CN"},"5549":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-9","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts","content":"哔哩哔哩的零样本语音合成（index-tts/index-tts，bilibili Model Use License）。移植版同样受该许可约束，所以作为单独的发行包发布：`mizuoto-indextts`（`packages/native/indextts`，包名 `mizuoto_indextts`，附 `LICENSE.txt`），注册在 `mizuoto.engines` 下（`indextts = mizuoto_indextts:IndexTtsEngine`）。下载和合成都需要先接受许可，克隆还需要一份同意声明。在 CPU 上以 fp32、相同种子运行时，IndexTTS-1.5、2 和 2.5 在完整链路中与 Mizuoto 0.1 完全相同。面向用户的说明见 引擎详解。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5550":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-10","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#变体与文件","content":"变体","locale":"zh-CN"},"5551":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-11","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#变体与文件","content":"目录模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"5552":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-12","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#变体与文件","content":"采样率","locale":"zh-CN"},"5553":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-13","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#变体与文件","content":"新增内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"5554":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-14","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#变体与文件","content":"`v1_5`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5555":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-15","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#变体与文件","content":"`indextts/v1.5`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5556":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-16","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#变体与文件","content":"24 kHz","locale":"zh-CN"},"5557":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-17","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#变体与文件","content":"无文本克隆，中文和英文","locale":"zh-CN"},"5558":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-18","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#变体与文件","content":"`v2`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5559":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-19","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#变体与文件","content":"`indextts/v2`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5560":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-20","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#变体与文件","content":"22.05 kHz","locale":"zh-CN"},"5561":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-21","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#变体与文件","content":"情感来自一段音频、八个权重或一句描述","locale":"zh-CN"},"5562":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-22","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#变体与文件","content":"`v2_5`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5563":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-23","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#变体与文件","content":"`indextts/v2.5`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5564":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-24","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#变体与文件","content":"22.05 kHz","locale":"zh-CN"},"5565":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-25","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#变体与文件","content":"日语和西班牙语、语言 token，以及语速（`duration_factor = 1 / speed`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5566":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-26","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#变体与文件","content":"1.5 读取 `config.yaml`、其中指定的 GPT 和 BigVGAN 检查点以及 SentencePiece 模型；音色缓存是 `cond_mel.pt`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5567":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-27","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#变体与文件","content":"2 和 2.5 读取 `config.yaml`、`gpt.pth`、`s2mel.pth`、`wav2vec2bert_stats.pt`、说话人与情感矩阵、`glossary.yaml` 和情感模型的目录（`qwen0.6bemo4-merge`）；2.5 还读取 `codec.pth` 和它的 tiktoken 词表。共享资源：`indextts/w2v-bert`、`indextts/campplus`（`campplus_cn_common.bin`）、`indextts/bigvgan`，以及仅 2 需要的 `indextts/semantic-codec`（2.5 从不读取它，所以它的目录条目不下载它）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5568":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-28","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#变体与文件","content":"精度：默认 fp32。在 CUDA GPU 上，`engines.indextts.dtype` 为 `fp16` 时 IndexTTS-2 的 GPT 用 fp16 运行；2.5 在其为 `auto` 或 `bf16` 时用 bf16，与 0.1 的选择相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5569":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-29","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"IndexTTS-2 对每个文本分段：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5570":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-30","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"**音色提示**（随音色缓存）：22.05 kHz 的音频（最多 15 秒）及其 16 kHz 副本；w2v-BERT 2.0 的第 17 层隐藏状态经归一化后作为 GPT 的条件；MaskGCT 语义编解码器把它量化为解码器的提示编码；CAM++ 给出风格；mel 是解码器的提示。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5571":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-31","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"**情感**：来自说话人音频本身、另一段音频（按 `emo_alpha` 混合），或通过情感矩阵混入的八个权重（按 CAM++ 相似度选行）；描述由情感模型（Qwen3-0.6B，贪心解码）转换为权重。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5572":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-32","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"**GPT**（`UnifiedVoice`，24 层 GPT-2）：用束采样生成语义编码，再对这些编码做一遍前向以得到隐变量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5573":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-33","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"**s2mel**：长度调节器和作为 CFM 的 Seed-VC DiT（25 步欧拉，引导强度 0.7）生成 mel。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5574":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-34","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"**BigVGAN v2** 生成 22.05 kHz 音频；各分段之间插入静音拼接，尾部淡出，结果量化为 16 位，与上游的返回值相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5575":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-35","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"2.5 不用 w2v-BERT 上的 Conformer 和 perceiver，而是用投影后的 CAM++ 嵌入和语言嵌入作为 GPT 的条件；文本通过带 `<|lang|>` 前缀的 tiktoken 读取；编码由它自己的编解码器（RepCodec、Vocos 主干、×2 上采样）转换为解码器特征，而不是用 GPT 的隐变量。1.5 没有情感：参考音频的 log-mel 作为 GPT 的条件，BigVGAN v1 配合其 ECAPA 说话人编码器直接把 GPT 的隐变量变成音频。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5576":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-36","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"模块","locale":"zh-CN"},"5577":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-37","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"5578":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-38","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"`engine.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5579":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-39","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"`IndexTTS2.infer`（2、2.5）和 1.5 的路径（`LoadedIndexTts15`）：条件编码、情感、分段、DiT、BigVGAN、淡出","locale":"zh-CN"},"5580":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-40","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"`gpt.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5581":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-41","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"`UnifiedVoice`：transformers 4.52 的 GPT-2（`Conv1D` 即 `addmm`、tanh GELU、SDPA）及其基于 `BeamSearchScorer` 的束采样","locale":"zh-CN"},"5582":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-42","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"`conditioning.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5583":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-43","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"IndexTTS 的 Conformer 和 perceiver 重采样器","locale":"zh-CN"},"5584":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-44","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"`codec.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5585":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-45","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"2.5 的 `EnhancedCodec` 解码","locale":"zh-CN"},"5586":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-46","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"`qwen_emotion.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5587":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-47","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"情感模型：Qwen3-0.6B，贪心解码，它的对话模板，把回答解析为八个权重","locale":"zh-CN"},"5588":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-48","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"`text.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5589":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-49","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"1.5/2 的前端：通过 kaldifst 应用的 WeTextProcessing FST（`TnProcessor`）、`TextNormalizer`、SentencePiece、`split_segments`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5590":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-50","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"`text25.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5591":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-51","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"2.5 的前端：标点映射、规范化、日语用 fugashi、带 `<\\|lang\\|>` 的 tiktoken","locale":"zh-CN"},"5592":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-52","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"`assets/tn/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5593":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-53","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"WeTextProcessing 的中英文 tagger 和 verbaliser FST（10 MB）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5594":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-54","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#工作原理","content":"共享：`nn/ssl/w2vbert.py`、`nn/codecs/repcodec.py`、`nn/transformer/seedvc.py`、`nn/vocoders/bigvgan.py`（v2；v1 配 ECAPA）、`nn/speaker/campplus_torch.py`、`nn/vocoders/vocos.py`、`nn/dsp/`（`seamless`、`kaldi`、`mel`、`resample`、`wav`）、`runtime/lm/qwen.py`、`runtime/sampling.py`、`runtime/graphs.py`、`text/normalize/wetext.py`、`text/tokenize/bpe.py`、`runtime/compile.py`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5595":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-55","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#与上游一致的做法","content":"**按 transformers 4.52 的计算方式实现 GPT-2**：`Conv1D` 即 `addmm`，tanh GELU，SDPA 在提示上因果且不带掩码，在每个新 token 上不带掩码。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5596":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-56","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#与上游一致的做法","content":"**束采样**，即上游所用的旧版 transformers 路径：log-softmax 依次经过重复惩罚（作用于所有 id，包括提示的占位 id）、温度、top-k 和 top-p（至少保留两个），加上各束的分数，不放回地抽取 `2 × num_beams` 个候选，再由 `BeamSearchScorer` 维护假设。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5597":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-57","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#与上游一致的做法","content":"**IndexTTS-1.5 不用 KV 缓存**，除非以 fp16 运行，与上游相同：每一步都重新计算整个序列，用缓存的话求和结果会不同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5598":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-58","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#与上游一致的做法","content":"**抽样顺序**：所有抽样都按上游的顺序（先 GPT，后 DiT 的噪声）来自请求的生成器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5599":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-59","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#与上游一致的做法","content":"**情感嵌入**从音频以 16 kHz 重新读取，而不是由 22.05 kHz 的副本重采样得到：它是音色缓存中单独的一个字段。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5600":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-60","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#与上游一致的做法","content":"**文本（1.5、2）** 用 WeTextProcessing 自己的 FST 通过 kaldifst 做规范化。上游在 Linux 上运行 pynini，在其他平台用另一套 FST；Mizuoto 在所有平台上都给出 Linux 上的行为。人名和拼音按首次出现的顺序编号（上游用 `set` 的顺序，每次运行都可能不同）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5601":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-61","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#与上游一致的做法","content":"**2.5 的文本**：zh、en、ja、es 以外的语言（以及未指定语言）以 `zhen` 发送，与上游相同。上游同样没有 NeMo 的日语和西班牙语规范化，所以这类文本原样通过；日语需要 fugashi（`mizuoto-indextts[ja]`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5602":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-62","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#有意的差异","content":"**不做 w2v-BERT 的 layer drop 抽样**：在 eval 模式下它们从不改变输出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5603":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-63","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#有意的差异","content":"**尺寸来自配置。** 上游写死的尺寸（w2v-BERT 的宽度、`gpt_layer`）改为取自配置，这样小型测试模型也能构建；真实模型得到的数值相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5604":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-64","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#有意的差异","content":"**严格加载。** 检查点严格加载；上游对缺失的键保留随机权重（已发布的检查点中没有缺失的键）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5605":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-65","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#有意的差异","content":"**未移植**：TensorRT、上游的加速引擎和 BigVGAN 的 CUDA 内核（0.1 的加载选项 `use_accel`、`use_trt`、`trt_precision`、`use_cuda_kernel`），以及 2.5 的低显存文本切分（上游在显存不足 10 GB 的 GPU 上把文本切成 40 个字符的片段；Mizuoto 由运行时管理显存）。`use_torch_compile` 会为 s2mel DiT 和 BigVGAN 开启 `compute.compile`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5606":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-66","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#显存与速度","content":"阶段：音色未缓存时依次是 w2v-BERT、CAM++、语义编解码器和长度调节器（情感音频只用 w2v-BERT）；有情感文本时是情感模型；然后是 GPT（`kind=\"sequence\"`；它的 GPT-2 `Conv1D` 层像线性层一样流式加载）、s2mel 和 BigVGAN。克隆已缓存的音色时从不放置 w2v-BERT 或 CAM++。开启 `compute.oom_fallback` 时，若 BigVGAN 显存不足，就分块解码（IndexTTS 2/2.5）。GPT 的工作内存按每个分段估算：其文本 token 数和每个 token 24 个编码（实际语速约为 5），不超过 `max_mel_tokens`，计入每一束，按它实际计算所用的 dtype。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5607":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-67","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#显存与速度","content":"束采样原来每一步约等待设备十次（`torch.multinomial` 的检查、评分器用 `.item()` 读取每个候选、停止判断、束重排、位置嵌入的下标张量）。现在只等一次：抽样用 `multinomial` 自己的 `topk(p / Exp(1), 2 × beams)`（`runtime.sampling.multinomial_draws`，在 CPU 和 CUDA 上 id 和生成器状态都相同）；候选的分数、token 和所属束一次读回，评分器在主机上根据这些值做决定；位置嵌入直接取表中的一行。开启 `compute.cuda_graphs`（NVIDIA，GPT 完整位于设备上并使用 KV 缓存：IndexTTS 2/2.5，以及 fp16 下的 1.5）时，所有束的 GPT-2 单 token 步骤以 CUDA 图运行在每层注意力的两侧；缓存、它的束重排和采样仍以 eager 方式进行。音频相同，按 1.5 的尺寸每步快 2.6–3.2 倍。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5608":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-68","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#显存与速度","content":"CPU 上以 fp32 运行 `compute.compile`：s2mel DiT 的热启动时间减少 7 %，BigVGAN 减少 20 %；音频与 eager 相差不超过 6.1e-5（87.7 dB）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5609":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-69","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#训练","content":"无：IndexTTS 没有公开其语音合成模型的训练代码，清单中也没有声明任何训练方法。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5610":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-70","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#对照结果","content":"在 CPU 上以 fp32 运行时，IndexTTS-1.5、2 和 2.5 在完整链路的全部四个用例中都与 0.1 逐采样相同：一个 1.5 克隆、一个 2 克隆、带情感权重的 IndexTTS-2 和一个 2.5 中文克隆。在组件层面，情感模型、每个文本前端以及带和不带 KV 缓存的 GPT 也都相同。契约套件通过（18 项测试）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5611":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-71","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#限制","content":"没有训练方法。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5612":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-72","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#限制","content":"2.5 的日语和西班牙语文本不做规范化（与上游相同）；日语需要 `ja` 附加依赖。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5613":{"id":"/docs/engines-indextts-73","page_id":"/docs/engines-indextts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-indextts#限制","content":"结果不能用于训练其他引擎（`trains_others = false`），克隆需要许可要求的同意声明。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5614":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","type":"page","content":"OmniVoice","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","引擎参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","locale":"zh-CN"},"5615":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-0","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","content":"Mizuoto 中实现的 OmniVoice 引擎：迭代解掩码的双向 Qwen3，HiggsAudio v2 分词器（DAC 与 HuBERT），不依赖 pydub 的 pydub 算术，哪些做法与上游完全一致，全量与 LoRA 微调，以及对照结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5616":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-1","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#变体与文件","content":"变体与文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"5617":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-2","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"工作原理","locale":"zh-CN"},"5618":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-3","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#与上游一致的做法","content":"与上游一致的做法","locale":"zh-CN"},"5619":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-4","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#有意的差异","content":"有意的差异","locale":"zh-CN"},"5620":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-5","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#显存","content":"显存","locale":"zh-CN"},"5621":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-6","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#训练","content":"训练","locale":"zh-CN"},"5622":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-7","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#对照结果","content":"对照结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"5623":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-8","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#限制","content":"限制","locale":"zh-CN"},"5624":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-9","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","content":"小米的扩散语言模型语音合成，支持 600 多种语言（k2-fsa/OmniVoice，Apache-2.0）。代码：`mizuoto/engines/omnivoice`。在 CPU 上以 fp32、同一种子运行时，它在每个对照用例中都与 Mizuoto 0.1（运行在 transformers 5.3 上的上游）完全相同，两个训练器也逐字节给出 0.1 的适配器和导出权重。面向用户的说明见引擎详解。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5625":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-10","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#变体与文件","content":"一个变体 `v0`（目录中的模型 `omnivoice/omnivoice`）：克隆（必须有参考文本；缺少时 Mizuoto 用语音识别补全，所以引擎自己从不加载 Whisper）、按封闭的属性词表设计音色、模型自带音色，以及 13 个行内非语言标签。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5626":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-11","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#变体与文件","content":"模型目录包含 `config.json`、`model.safetensors`、BPE 分词器文件和 `audio_tokenizer/`（`config.json`、`model.safetensors`、`preprocessor_config.json`）。音色缓存是 `prompt.pt`，与上游的音色克隆提示相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5627":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-12","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#变体与文件","content":"精度：支持 bf16 的 CUDA GPU 上用 bf16（否则 fp16），其他设备用 fp32；`engines.omnivoice.dtype` 可以覆盖。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5628":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-13","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"音频是 HiggsAudio v2 分词器的 8 个码本。语言模型是**双向**运行的 Qwen3-0.6B，它看到风格 token、文本、参考音频的编码，以及作为掩码位置的目标；在固定的步数里（默认 32 步）逐步解开最有把握的编码，采用对数概率空间里的无分类器引导、按码本的惩罚，以及位置上的 Gumbel 噪声。每一步都是对整个序列的完整前向（没有 KV 缓存）。目标长度来自基于规则的估计（按文字系统的字符权重，再按参考音频的语速缩放），或者来自 `speed` 和 `duration`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5629":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-14","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"模块","locale":"zh-CN"},"5630":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-15","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"是什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"5631":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-16","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"`engine.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5632":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-17","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"`create_voice_clone_prompt`、时长、`_generate_iterative`、长文本分块、后处理","locale":"zh-CN"},"5633":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-18","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"`model.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5634":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-19","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"网络：在文本和音频编码上运行的双向 Qwen3（`audio_embeddings`、`audio_heads`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5635":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-20","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"`audio_tokenizer.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5636":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-21","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"按 transformers 5.3 的计算方式实现的 HiggsAudio v2 分词器：DAC 声学编码器 + HuBERT 语义分支、欧氏残差码本；`fc2` + DAC 解码器","locale":"zh-CN"},"5637":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-22","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"`audio.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5638":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-23","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"不依赖 pydub 的后处理（`Segment`：在 int16 数组上做 pydub 的毫秒算术、`audioop.rms`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5639":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-24","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"`duration.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5640":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-25","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"基于规则的时长估计，上游的表格","locale":"zh-CN"},"5641":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-26","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"`text.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5642":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-27","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"在标点处分块、`add_punctuation`、`combine_text`、识别标签的分词","locale":"zh-CN"},"5643":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-28","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"`voice_design.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5644":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-29","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"封闭的设计词表和 `_resolve_instruct`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5645":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-30","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"`lang_map.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5646":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-31","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"语言名称到 OmniVoice id 的映射","locale":"zh-CN"},"5647":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-32","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"`train.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5648":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-33","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"`OmniVoiceTrainer`（方法 `full`、`lora`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5649":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-34","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#工作原理","content":"共享：`runtime/lm/qwen.py`、`nn/codecs/dac.py`、`nn/ssl/hubert.py`、`text/tokenize/bpe.py`、`nn/dsp/resample.py`、`nn/dsp/wav.py`、`nn/dsp/flac.py`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5650":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-35","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#与上游一致的做法","content":"**注意力掩码。** 语言模型是 `runtime/lm/qwen` 的解码器，使用完整的四维布尔掩码：transformers 原样返回四维掩码，SDPA 收到的是重复了 KV 头的掩码，不是因果的。条件行和无条件行在一个批次里运行，与上游的批处理方式相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5651":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-36","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#与上游一致的做法","content":"**抽样。** 位置上（以及设了 `class_temperature` 时类别上）的 Gumbel 噪声来自请求的生成器，按步、按条抽取，与上游相同；批次的组成会改变抽样，上游也是如此。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5652":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-37","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#与上游一致的做法","content":"**分词器**由 DAC（奇数步幅加输出填充，没有最后的 tanh）、HuBERT（位置卷积的权重归一化沿第 2 维折叠）和欧氏残差码本组成。语义解码器和 `fc1` 只在训练中使用，不加载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5653":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-38","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#与上游一致的做法","content":"**HuBERT 的抽样。** HuBERT 即使在 eval 模式下，每层也从 CPU 生成器抽取一次 `torch.rand([])`；`HubertModel` 在 `ctx.generator_for(\"cpu\")` 上做同样的抽样。因此没有缓存音色提示的克隆，与有缓存的克隆得到的噪声不同，0.1 和 Mizuoto 都是如此；Mizuoto 总在请求之前先准备好提示，所以这一点从不显现。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5654":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-39","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#与上游一致的做法","content":"**不依赖 pydub 的 pydub。** 对提示和输出的静音去除，在 int16 数组上按 pydub 的算术复现：毫秒长度四舍五入、位置截断、`audioop.rms` 向下取整。Python 3.13 已经没有 `audioop`，本来就需要移植。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5655":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-40","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#与上游一致的做法","content":"**响度与长文本。** 参考音频的响度调到 RMS 0.1，输出再调回去；长输出按文本分块生成，以参考音频（或第一块）为条件，并交叉淡化。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5656":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-41","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#与上游一致的做法","content":"**文本分词器**是 `mizuoto.text` 的 BPE，不加 transformers 的 “Mistral fix”（模型声明的是 transformers 5.3，那里不适用）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5657":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-42","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#有意的差异","content":"**没有自由文本设计。** 模型是在封闭的属性词表上训练的；自由文本会被拒绝，与 0.1 相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5658":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-43","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#有意的差异","content":"**没有 FlashInfer 和 CUDA 图。** 0.1 中它们的加载选项已经去掉；SDPA 适用于所有平台。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5659":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-44","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#有意的差异","content":"**上游的文本规范化**（`normalize_text`、WeTextProcessing）Mizuoto 的请求用不到，没有移植。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5660":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-45","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#显存","content":"两个阶段：音频分词器（音色提示，然后解码）和语言模型。语言模型每一步都在整个序列上重新运行，所以在权重流式加载中它是一个 `oneshot` 模型（最大的单元留在设备上）。训练：对模型的层做梯度检查点，结果相同，LoRA dropout 也包括在内；`lowest` 把 AdamW 的状态放在内存里（CPU 上相同）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5661":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-46","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#训练","content":"方法 `full` 和 `lora`（阶段 `tokens`、`train`、`export`；上游的 `extract_audio_tokens` 和使用其 SDPA 微调配置的 `OmniTrainer`；不需要 transformers、peft、accelerate 或 webdataset）。两边用同样的种子时，两者都在 CPU 上逐字节给出 0.1 的编码、批次、损失、学习率、LoRA 适配器和导出的 `model.safetensors`，在梯度累积、多个分片和多个加载 worker 下也是如此。LoRA 会合并进导出的模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5662":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-47","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#训练","content":"**上游在构建模型之后用配置中的 42 重新播种**，所以阶段的种子只通过 peft 的 LoRA 初始化起作用，这一初始化首先按模块顺序从进程级生成器抽取（`A` 和 `B` 先作为 `nn.Linear` 创建，`A` 再抽取一次）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5663":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-48","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#训练","content":"**重新播种之后的抽样来自私有生成器**：每个 epoch 加载器的基础种子和 LoRA dropout 掩码共用一个以 42 播种的生成器；第 *w* 个 worker 的 `Random` 和 `Generator` 以 `(base + w) mod 2**32` 播种。在每个 worker 里，webdataset 先花掉一次 `randint(0, 1000000)` 生成一个从不使用的种子，然后处理器才开始抽样。分片列表用 `Random(epoch)` 打乱，样本经过以 epoch 播种的 webdataset 20 000 样本缓冲区；各 worker 的批次轮流到来。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5664":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-49","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#训练","content":"**按长度分批**（`StreamLengthGroupDataset`、`PaddingDataCollator` 的四维掩码），与 SDPA 配置相同，而不是 FlexAttention 的打包。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5665":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-50","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#训练","content":"**梯度裁剪**按上游的参数顺序（token 嵌入在先）累加各张量的范数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5666":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-51","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#训练","content":"**token 顺序**遵循 `JsonlDatasetReader` 以 42 为种子的顺序。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5667":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-52","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#训练","content":"检查点不保存优化器状态。加载 worker 多于分片时 0.1 会失败；这里多出的 worker 空闲。预览带种子。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5668":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-53","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#对照结果","content":"全部 4 个完整链路用例在 CPU 上以 fp32 与 0.1 逐采样相同：克隆、按属性设计、自带音色和微调后的模型。模块层面还包括音色提示的编码、分词器的解码、logits、`class_temperature`、`speed`、`duration`、批量以及长文本分块路径。另有两个用例让一种实现加载另一种实现导出的 LoRA，结果相同。契约套件通过（12 项）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5669":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-54","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#限制","content":"每一步都是条件行和无条件行在整个序列上的完整前向；这个引擎没有 CUDA 图路径。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5670":{"id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice-55","page_id":"/docs/engines-omnivoice","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-omnivoice#限制","content":"不能用自由文本设计音色（模型只接受属性）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5671":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","type":"page","content":"Qwen3-TTS","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","引擎参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","locale":"zh-CN"},"5672":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-0","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","content":"Mizuoto 中实现的 Qwen3-TTS 引擎：变体与文件，talker、code predictor、说话人编码器和 12 Hz 编解码器，哪些做法与上游完全一致，显存与 CUDA 图解码，说话人微调，以及对照结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5673":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-1","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#变体与文件","content":"变体与文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"5674":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-2","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#工作原理","content":"工作原理","locale":"zh-CN"},"5675":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-3","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#与上游一致的做法","content":"与上游一致的做法","locale":"zh-CN"},"5676":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-4","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#有意的差异","content":"有意的差异","locale":"zh-CN"},"5677":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-5","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#显存","content":"显存","locale":"zh-CN"},"5678":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-6","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#速度","content":"速度","locale":"zh-CN"},"5679":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-7","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#训练","content":"训练","locale":"zh-CN"},"5680":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-8","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#对照结果","content":"对照结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"5681":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-9","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#限制","content":"限制","locale":"zh-CN"},"5682":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-10","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","content":"阿里通义千问的 12 Hz 语音语言模型（QwenLM/Qwen3-TTS，Apache-2.0）。代码：`mizuoto/engines/qwen3tts`。在 CPU 上以 fp32、同一种子运行时，它在全部 8 个对照用例中逐采样给出 Mizuoto 0.1（适配层后面的上游 `qwen_tts`）的音频，它的训练器也逐字节给出 0.1 的检查点。各变体能做什么见引擎详解。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5683":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-11","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#变体与文件","content":"变体","locale":"zh-CN"},"5684":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-12","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#变体与文件","content":"目录中的模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"5685":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-13","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#变体与文件","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"5686":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-14","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#变体与文件","content":"`base`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5687":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-15","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#变体与文件","content":"`qwen3tts/1.7b-base`、`qwen3tts/0.6b-base`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5688":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-16","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#变体与文件","content":"克隆：有参考文本时在上下文中克隆，没有时用说话人嵌入（x-vector）克隆","locale":"zh-CN"},"5689":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-17","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#变体与文件","content":"`custom_voice`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5690":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-18","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#变体与文件","content":"`qwen3tts/1.7b-custom-voice`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5691":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-19","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#变体与文件","content":"九个预置说话人，可用指令控制","locale":"zh-CN"},"5692":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-20","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#变体与文件","content":"`custom_voice_lite`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5693":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-21","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#变体与文件","content":"`qwen3tts/0.6b-custom-voice`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5694":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-22","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#变体与文件","content":"没有指令的预置说话人（上游对 0.6B 静默丢弃指令，所以这个变体不声明指令）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5695":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-23","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#变体与文件","content":"`voice_design`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5696":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-24","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#变体与文件","content":"`qwen3tts/1.7b-voice-design`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5697":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-25","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#变体与文件","content":"按自由文本描述生成音色","locale":"zh-CN"},"5698":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-26","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#变体与文件","content":"变体由 `config.json`（`tts_model_type`、`tts_model_size`）决定；只接受 `tokenizer_type = qwen3_tts_tokenizer_12hz`。模型目录包含 `config.json`、`model.safetensors`、分词器文件（`tokenizer.json`，或 `vocab.json` + `merges.txt` + `tokenizer_config.json`）和 `speech_tokenizer/`（`config.json`、`model.safetensors`）。Base 模型的音色缓存是 `prompt.pt`，即克隆提示（参考音频的编码和说话人嵌入）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5699":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-27","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#变体与文件","content":"精度：支持 bf16 的 CUDA GPU 上用 bf16（否则 fp16），其他设备用 fp32；`engines.qwen3tts.dtype` 可以覆盖。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5700":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-28","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#工作原理","content":"每 80 毫秒的一帧音频是 16 个编码。**talker** 是一个在文本和编解码器嵌入上运行的 28 层 Qwen3 解码器，预测一帧的第一个编码；**code predictor** 是一个 5 层 transformer，依次预测其余 15 个；16 个编码嵌入之和（加上下一个文本 token 的嵌入）是 talker 的下一个输入。**12 Hz 编解码器**把编码还原成 24 kHz 音频（每帧 1920 个采样），克隆时还把参考音频编码。Base 模型另有一个**说话人编码器**（ECAPA-TDNN），它的嵌入放在提示里。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5701":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-29","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#工作原理","content":"模块","locale":"zh-CN"},"5702":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-30","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#工作原理","content":"是什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"5703":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-31","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#工作原理","content":"`engine.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5704":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-32","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#工作原理","content":"按 `Qwen3TTSForConditionalGeneration.generate` 的方式构建提示、talker 循环、分块解码、音色缓存","locale":"zh-CN"},"5705":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-33","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#工作原理","content":"`decode.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5706":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-34","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#工作原理","content":"`FrameDecoder`：在固定张量上运行一帧（采样、code predictor、talker 一步），eager 或 CUDA 图","locale":"zh-CN"},"5707":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-35","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#工作原理","content":"`config.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5708":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-36","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#工作原理","content":"不经 transformers 读取 `config.json`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5709":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-37","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#工作原理","content":"`talker.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5710":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-38","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#工作原理","content":"talker 和 code predictor，基于 `runtime/lm/qwen.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5711":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-39","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#工作原理","content":"`speaker.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5712":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-40","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#工作原理","content":"Qwen2.5-Omni 所带的 ECAPA-TDNN：没有 BatchNorm、反射填充，输入 24 kHz 的 128 维 log-mel，输出 2048 维嵌入","locale":"zh-CN"},"5713":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-41","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#工作原理","content":"`codec.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5714":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-42","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#工作原理","content":"12 Hz 语音分词器：Mimi 式编码器（transformers `MimiModel` 的编码路径）和因果解码器（72 帧注意力窗口、SnakeBeta 上采样）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5715":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-43","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#工作原理","content":"`train.py`、`sft.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5716":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-44","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#工作原理","content":"`Qwen3Trainer`（方法 `speaker`）及其计算","locale":"zh-CN"},"5717":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-45","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#工作原理","content":"共享：`runtime/lm/qwen.py`（解码器、`hf_sdpa`、`mask_for`）、`runtime/lm/cache.py`、`runtime/sampling.py`、`runtime/graphs.py`、`text/tokenize/bpe.py`、`nn/dsp/mel.py`（`matcha_mel`）、`nn/dsp/resample.py`、`nn/dsp/wav.py`、`nn/dsp/flac.py`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5718":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-46","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#与上游一致的做法","content":"**分词器的切分。** 上游用 `fix_mistral_regex=True` 加载处理器，transformers 4.57.3 对配置中版本号介于 4.57.2 和 5.0 之间的本地模型，会换用它的 “Mistral fix” 预分词正则。`load_bpe(mistral_fix=…)` 根据模型的 `config.json` 做出同样的判断；不这样做，少数文本的分词会不同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5719":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-47","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#与上游一致的做法","content":"**相同的张量形状。** 提示按上游 `generate` 的方式构建：三个特殊嵌入在一次调用里查出，编解码器头作用于整个预填充。拆成更小的调用，值虽相同，浮点求和却不同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5720":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-48","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#与上游一致的做法","content":"**按 transformers 的方式调用注意力**（`hf_sdpa`）：没有掩码时，多 token 查询用带 `enable_gqa` 和 `is_causal` 的 SDPA；有掩码时重复 KV 头。缓存像 `DynamicCache` 那样靠拼接增长。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5721":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-49","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#与上游一致的做法","content":"**采样器。** talker 依次经过 transformers 的处理器链（重复惩罚、min-new-tokens、屏蔽控制 id、温度、top-k、top-p），再在请求的生成器上做 `multinomial`；批量中已结束的行被喂入 EOS，与 transformers 的填充方式相同。每帧接着是 code predictor 的 15 次抽样。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5722":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-50","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#与上游一致的做法","content":"**编解码器。** 编码器的 transformer 用普通的因果掩码（忽略配置中的 250 帧窗口，与上游的编码路径一样）；解码器的 transformer 应用 72 帧窗口。解码按上游的分块进行（300 帧，左侧 25 帧上下文），在上下文中克隆时，联合解码之后再切掉参考音频那一段。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5723":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-51","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#与上游一致的做法","content":"**说话人编码器的 mel** 是 Matcha-TTS 的（`nn.dsp.mel.matcha_mel`），与上游的计算相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5724":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-52","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#有意的差异","content":"**没有实现 25 Hz 分词器。** 没有已发布的模型使用它，上游的封装也无法解码它的输出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5725":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-53","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#有意的差异","content":"**流式按段进行**，与 0.1 相同：先生成模型的整段，再解码。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5726":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-54","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#有意的差异","content":"**帧率是 12.5**（0.1 用的是 12.0；只影响进度估计）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5727":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-55","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#有意的差异","content":"**上游的 `attn_implementation` 不是加载选项**：注意力经过 Mizuoto 的注意力分派器，由 `compute.attention` / `engines.qwen3tts.attention` 选择。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5728":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-56","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#显存","content":"四个句柄，按阶段放置：talker（`kind=\"sequence\"`，它的 code predictor 标为 `hot`，因为每帧要运行 15 次）、说话人编码器和编解码器的编码器（只用于 Base 模型的音色提示），以及编解码器的解码器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5729":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-57","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#显存","content":"talker 的工作内存按请求估算：每行的提示（指令、参考文本和编码、文本）加上每个文本 token 16 帧（实际语音约 3–4 帧），不超过 `max_new_tokens`，缓存峰值按比其大小多一层计，再加 256 MB。所以在 1.7B 模型上一句话只预留约 300–400 MB，而不是按最坏情况（8192 帧）要求的数 GB，显存紧张时 talker 也不会被无谓地流式加载。`compute.kv_cache = static` 为 talker 和 code predictor 提供预分配的缓存（CPU 上结果相同）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5730":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-58","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#速度","content":"一帧是 talker 的一步加 code predictor 的十五步：约 6 000 个小内核，由 CPU 逐个启动。普通循环每帧还要等待设备约 35 次（`torch.multinomial` 每次抽样的两项有效性检查、每步把被屏蔽的 id 复制到设备上、填充检查、EOS 检查），每次等待都会清空 GPU 的队列。`decode.py` 在不改变任何结果的前提下去掉了这些：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5731":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-59","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#速度","content":"**每帧只等待一次。** 单样本抽样采用 `multinomial` 本身的计算（`argmax(p / Exp(1))`），去掉它的检查（`runtime.sampling.multinomial1`；概率为 NaN 仍是错误，在每帧那一次等待时读取）；掩码每个设备只构建一次；重复惩罚作用于已抽取 id 的掩码（`repetition_penalty_seen`，算术相同）；填充情况在主机端已知。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5732":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-60","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#速度","content":"**CUDA 图**（`compute.cuda_graphs`，默认开启；NVIDIA，且 talker 完整位于设备上）。采样和 code predictor 的 15 步各是一个图；talker 的一步在两次注意力调用之间各为一个图，注意力在不断增长的缓存上以 eager 方式运行。图从自己的生成器抽样，该生成器从请求的生成器载入状态并写回。图按批大小和采样设置保存，权重移动时丢弃。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5733":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-61","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#速度","content":"**更少的内核，相同的比特**（仅在不需要自动求导时，所以训练不受影响）：q 和 k 一起归一化和旋转；code predictor 的旋转表只生成一次；在设备上的自检表明 `F.rms_norm` 给出与 float32 归一化相同的比特时使用它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5734":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-62","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#速度","content":"与 eager 的编码相同；在 1.7B 规模的解码循环上，比带等待的循环快 2.7–3.4 倍。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5735":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-63","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#速度","content":"**快速模式**（加载选项 `fused_projections`，默认关闭）：加载时把每层的 q/k/v 和 gate/up 投影各自合成一个带堆叠权重的线性层（它们仍像普通层一样可以流式加载）。在 GPU 上每帧快约 3–4 %，但矩阵乘法会选用其他内核，音频不再逐位相同；在 CPU 对照用例中相同。开启时输出会列出 `fused_projections`。参数名会改变，所以只用于推理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5736":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-64","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#训练","content":"方法 `speaker`（Base 模型；阶段 `prepare`、`train`、`export`）：模型学会一个说话人，成为一个唯一预置说话人就是新音色的 CustomVoice 模型，与上游的 `finetuning/sft_12hz.py` 相同。在真实的 1.7B Base 上，两边用同样的种子时，它在 CPU 上逐字节给出 0.1 的编码、损失和检查点，不需要 transformers 或 accelerate。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5737":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-65","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#训练","content":"音频每次编码八段、补零，与 `Qwen3TTSTokenizer.encode` 的批处理方式相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5738":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-66","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#训练","content":"顺序来自进程级生成器上的普通打乱数据加载器（训练阶段自己的进程）。Accelerate 的梯度累积复现为：损失按步累加，每 N 个批次以及每个 epoch 结束时执行一次优化器步。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5739":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-67","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#训练","content":"两个损失都是 transformers 的 `ForCausalLMLoss`，它会把已经移位的标签再移一次；保留。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5740":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-68","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#训练","content":"上游把原始的文本嵌入直接加到编解码器嵌入上，没有经过推理时会用的 `text_projection`；保留，这样权重才与上游相同。由此只有文本嵌入宽度与 talker 相同的模型能训练：1.7B Base 可以，不满足的模型会在训练阶段开始前被拒绝（`capability_not_supported`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5741":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-69","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#训练","content":"每次训练前向都用新的缓存：`DynamicCache` 第一次更新时会拼接，所以注意力看到的是连续的键和值，与上游相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5742":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-70","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#训练","content":"`training.memory`：对 talker 和 code predictor 的层做梯度检查点，结果相同；`lowest` 把 AdamW 的状态放在内存里（在那里是 float32）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5743":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-71","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#对照结果","content":"全部 8 个完整链路用例在 CPU 上以 fp32 与 0.1 逐采样相同：预置说话人、指令、音色设计、上下文克隆、x-vector 克隆、语音识别得到的参考文本、方言说话人和微调后的模型。另有两个用例用一种实现合成另一种实现的训练导出，都相同。分词器在分词语料上给出与 transformers 相同的 id。契约套件通过（24 项）。CUDA 图在 GPU 上用小型模型和真实的 0.6B Base 与 eager 路径对照过。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5744":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-72","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#限制","content":"`fused_projections` 以 GPU 上的逐位一致换取速度。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5745":{"id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts-73","page_id":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-qwen3tts#限制","content":"CUDA 图要求 talker 完整位于一块 NVIDIA GPU 上；部分加载的 talker 以 eager 方式解码。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5746":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","type":"page","content":"VoxCPM","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","引擎参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","locale":"zh-CN"},"5747":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-0","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","content":"Mizuoto 中 VoxCPM 引擎的实现：VoxCPM2、1.5 和 0.5B，MiniCPM-4、局部 DiT 与 AudioVAE，按上游锁定的库版本构建的分词器和文本规范化，哪些做法与上游完全一致，带 CUDA 图的逐块解码，全量与 LoRA 微调，以及对照结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5748":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-1","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"变体与文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"5749":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-2","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#工作原理","content":"工作原理","locale":"zh-CN"},"5750":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-3","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#与上游一致的做法","content":"与上游一致的做法","locale":"zh-CN"},"5751":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-4","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#有意的差异","content":"有意的差异","locale":"zh-CN"},"5752":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-5","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#显存与速度","content":"显存与速度","locale":"zh-CN"},"5753":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-6","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#训练","content":"训练","locale":"zh-CN"},"5754":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-7","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#对照结果","content":"对照结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"5755":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-8","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#限制","content":"限制","locale":"zh-CN"},"5756":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-9","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","content":"OpenBMB 的无离散分词语音合成（OpenBMB/VoxCPM，Apache-2.0，代码与权重）：逐块（patch）生成连续的语音潜变量，中间没有离散编码。代码：`mizuoto/engines/voxcpm`。Mizuoto 0.1 没有 VoxCPM，所以参考实现是上游自己的包，在同一个 Mizuoto 完整链路中经适配器运行，库版本与上游锁定的一致（transformers 5.3.0、tokenizers 0.22.2、wetext 0.1.2、inflect 7.5.0）。在 CPU 上以相同种子运行时，每个组件和每个请求在 bf16（上游的默认）和 fp32 下都与它完全相同，两个训练器得到的权重也逐位相同。面向用户的说明见引擎详解。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5757":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-10","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"变体","locale":"zh-CN"},"5758":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-11","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"目录模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"5759":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-12","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"参数量","locale":"zh-CN"},"5760":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-13","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"音频","locale":"zh-CN"},"5761":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-14","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"音色方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"5762":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-15","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"`v2`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5763":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-16","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"`voxcpm/2`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5764":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-17","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"2B","locale":"zh-CN"},"5765":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-18","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"输入 16 kHz，输出 48 kHz","locale":"zh-CN"},"5766":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-19","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"零样本、带参考文本的克隆（参考 + 续写）、无参考文本的克隆（参考）、按描述设计、对克隆音色加指令","locale":"zh-CN"},"5767":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-20","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"`v1_5`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5768":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-21","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"`voxcpm/1.5`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5769":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-22","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"0.6B","locale":"zh-CN"},"5770":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-23","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"44.1 kHz","locale":"zh-CN"},"5771":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-24","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"零样本、以续写方式克隆（需要参考文本）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5772":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-25","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"`v1`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5773":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-26","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"`voxcpm/0.5b`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5774":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-27","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"0.5B","locale":"zh-CN"},"5775":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-28","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"16 kHz","locale":"zh-CN"},"5776":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-29","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"零样本、以续写方式克隆（需要参考文本）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5777":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-30","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"模型代际由 `config.json` 的 `architecture` 决定（缺省为 `voxcpm`）；1.5 是第一代中使用 44.1 kHz VAE 的模型。模型目录包含 `config.json`、`model.safetensors`（否则 `pytorch_model.bin`）、`audiovae.pth`（否则 `audiovae.safetensors`）、`tokenizer.json` 和 `tokenizer_config.json`。音色缓存保存提示（左侧补齐）和参考（右侧补齐）的 VAE 潜变量，与上游 `build_prompt_cache` 的做法相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5778":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-31","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#变体与文件","content":"精度：`auto` 采用上游的选择，即配置中的 bf16，适用于包括 CPU 在内的所有设备，Apple MPS 上用 float32；`engines.voxcpm.dtype` 可覆盖。VAE 始终以 float32 运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5779":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-32","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#工作原理","content":"文本 token 和音频块共用一个序列。每一块中，**文本语义语言模型**（带 LongRoPE 和静态 KV 缓存的 MiniCPM-4）和较浅的**残差声学语言模型**产生两个隐状态；**局部 DiT**（双向运行的 MiniCPM-4，作为条件流模型，约 10 个欧拉步，带无分类器引导）根据它们和上一块预测下一块潜变量；**局部编码器**把这一块重新嵌入语言模型；**停止头**决定是否继续。**AudioVAE** 是类似 DAC 的因果卷积编解码器，使用 Snake 激活，负责解码潜变量（v2 带采样率条件，把 16 kHz 潜变量解码为 48 kHz 音频）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5780":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-33","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#工作原理","content":"模块","locale":"zh-CN"},"5781":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-34","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#工作原理","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"5782":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-35","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#工作原理","content":"`config.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5783":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-36","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#工作原理","content":"把 `config.json` 当作数据读取，带上游 pydantic 的默认值","locale":"zh-CN"},"5784":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-37","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#工作原理","content":"`minicpm.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5785":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-38","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#工作原理","content":"MiniCPM-4：RMSNorm、LongRoPE、GQA SDPA、静态 KV 缓存、muP 残差","locale":"zh-CN"},"5786":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-39","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#工作原理","content":"`model.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5787":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-40","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#工作原理","content":"标量量化器、局部编码器、局部 DiT（v1 和 v2）、CFM 的欧拉采样器、提示序列、`PatchDecoder` 和生成循环","locale":"zh-CN"},"5788":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-41","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#工作原理","content":"`vae.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5789":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-42","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#工作原理","content":"AudioVAE v1 和 v2（因果卷积、Snake、采样率条件）以及 v2 的有状态流式解码器","locale":"zh-CN"},"5790":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-43","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#工作原理","content":"`text.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5791":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-44","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#工作原理","content":"按 transformers 5.3 的方式构建的分词器、上游对多字汉字 token 的拆分、文本规范化","locale":"zh-CN"},"5792":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-45","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#工作原理","content":"`engine.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5793":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-46","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#工作原理","content":"`VoxCpmEngine`、`LoadedVoxCpm`：精度、音色方式、音色缓存、重试、流式","locale":"zh-CN"},"5794":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-47","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#工作原理","content":"`train.py`、`sft.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5795":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-48","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#工作原理","content":"`VoxCpmTrainer`（方法 `full`、`lora`）及其计算","locale":"zh-CN"},"5796":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-49","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#工作原理","content":"`assets/wetext/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5797":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-50","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#工作原理","content":"wetext 0.1.2 的中文（带 `remove_erhua`）和英文文本规范化 FST（7.7 MB）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5798":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-51","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#工作原理","content":"共享模块：`runtime/ops.py`、`runtime/loading.py`（折叠权重归一化）、`runtime/graphs.py`、`nn/dsp/resample.py`（librosa 调用方式下的 soxr；torchaudio 的 sinc）、`nn/dsp/wav.py`、`nn/dsp/tiles.py`、`text/normalize/wetext.py`（其 `version=\"0.1\"` 的步骤）、`runtime/compile.py`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5799":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-52","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#与上游一致的做法","content":"**精度。** 与上游一样，先转换模型的精度再拷入检查点，所以 LongRoPE 表（以 float32 构建）随之舍入为 bf16。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5800":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-53","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#与上游一致的做法","content":"**注意力**使用 SDPA，`enable_gqa`，张量连续：预填充时为因果注意力，局部模块中为双向注意力，逐步生成时在显式布尔掩码下对静态缓存计算。上游对缓存的全部位置计算（超出当前长度的部分为零并被掩码）；Mizuoto 只算到当前长度之后第一个 256 的倍数（`minicpm.ATTEND_BLOCK`），掩码保留。被掩码的位置只会加上精确的零，而 SDPA 在任何 64 的倍数处截断都给出相同的结果位（在 CPU 上以 bf16 和 fp32 对 3100 以内的每个位置检查过），所以结果完全相同，VoxCPM2 在 CPU 上快 1.5 倍。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5801":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-54","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#与上游一致的做法","content":"**随机性。** CFM 的噪声是推理时唯一的抽样，每块一次 `randn`，使用模型的精度。每次尝试都从一个以其种子初始化的新生成器抽样，与上游 `torch.manual_seed` 设置进程级随机流的位置相同。没有种子时，从请求的随机流中取一个 32 位种子（上游：`torch.seed()`），并在实际参数中报告。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5802":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-55","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#与上游一致的做法","content":"**坏例重试。** 非流式结果若每个文本 token 对应 `retry_badcase_ratio_threshold` 块或更多，就用种子 + 1 重新生成，最多 `retry_badcase_max_times` 次；块数上限为 `min(tokens × ratio + 10, max_len)`。`applied.retries` 记录重新生成的次数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5803":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-56","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#与上游一致的做法","content":"**提示。** VoxCPM2 用 `librosa.load(sr=16000)`（soxr）读取音频；0.5B 和 1.5 用 `torchaudio.load` 和 `torchaudio.functional.resample`。续写提示在左侧补齐到整块，参考在右侧补齐。参考文本与待合成文本之间不加空格拼接，与上游相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5804":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-57","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#与上游一致的做法","content":"**文本。** 换行和连续空白变成一个空格，需要时再做文本规范化。VoxCPM2 的描述或指令变成 `(…)` 前缀，并去掉其中的括号，与上游网页演示相同；请求同时有两者时用 `, ` 连接。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5805":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-58","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#与上游一致的做法","content":"**分词器**是 transformers 5.3 的 `LlamaTokenizer` 从词表构建出来的那个，忽略文件自带的流水线：没有 normalizer，`Metaspace` 使用 `prepend_scheme=\"always\"` 且不拆分，BPE 中没有未知 token，配置中的特殊 token 按 id 顺序添加（词表中没有的 token 取下一个空闲 id，所以 VoxCPM2 的 `<|im_end|>` 是 73442，而不是文件中的 73440）。直接使用 `tokenizer.json` 时，以空白开头或位于特殊 token 之后的文本会得到不同的 id。随后上游的包装把多字汉字 token 拆成单字；词表之外的字为 `<unk>`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5806":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-59","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#与上游一致的做法","content":"**文本规范化**采用 wetext 0.1.2 的做法：在标注前和每个 FST 之后去掉首尾空白，开启 `remove_erhua` 时也处理含“儿”但不含数字的文本。它的 FST 与 wetext 0.0.4（CosyVoice 的共享资源）和 WeTextProcessing（IndexTTS）的都不同，所以随引擎提供。数字由 `inflect` 读出；Mizuoto 的 7.3.1 与上游的 7.5.0 在语料上给出相同的词。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5807":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-60","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#与上游一致的做法","content":"**解码。** VoxCPM2 从开头去掉解码出的上下文块（提示的最后 `min(3, n)` 块）；第一代只要有提示音频就去掉 `2 × patch × hop` 个采样，与上游一样不管提示多长。流式时每块输出一段：VoxCPM2 经有状态的因果解码器，第一代则解码最后三块并保留最新的一块。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5808":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-61","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#与上游一致的做法","content":"**Snake** 是上游用 TorchScript 编译的那个函数；权重归一化用 `torch._weight_norm` 折叠，即上游钩子在每次前向时做的调用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5809":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-62","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#有意的差异","content":"**未提供**：用 ZipEnhancer 对参考音频降噪（`denoise`；一个 ModelScope 流水线外加第二个模型，上游默认关闭）、时间戳（stable-ts）、上游在 CUDA 上的 `torch.compile`（`optimize`）以及 vLLM 服务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5810":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-63","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#有意的差异","content":"**长文本**由 Mizuoto 切分；上游不切分。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5811":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-64","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#有意的差异","content":"**VoxCPM2 带参考文本克隆时**同时使用参考*和*续写，与上游网页演示相同（`reference_prefix`，默认开启）。上游的 Python 接口只在调用方传入 `reference_wav_path` 时才加参考。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5812":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-65","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#有意的差异","content":"**`compute.compile`** 包装局部 DiT。在 CPU 上以 bf16 运行时没有收益，而且它的浮点差异可能改变语音结束的位置（VoxCPM-0.5B：56 320 对 55 040 个采样）；默认关闭。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5813":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-66","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#显存与速度","content":"阶段：VAE 为音色提示编码并负责解码；模型（`kind=\"sequence\"`；局部编码器和 DiT 标为 `hot`，因为它们每块要运行多次）负责生成；流式时两者同时在位。开启 `compute.oom_fallback` 时，若 VAE 显存不足，就按 256 个潜变量帧一块分块解码。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5814":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-67","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#显存与速度","content":"一块包括 DiT 的欧拉步（每步一对引导计算）、局部编码器、停止头和两个语言模型各一步：约 6 000 个小内核，外加三次等待设备（停止标志，以及每个语言模型从 Python 整数拷贝的位置）。`model.PatchDecoder` 在固定张量上运行一块，只等待设备一次，用于读取停止标志。语言模型在读取标志之前就前进一步（上游先读标志，在前进之前就停止）；它们不抽样，生成结束时缓存也会丢弃，所以各块完全相同。缓存满时，在上游那一步会报错的地方同样报错。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5815":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-68","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#显存与速度","content":"开启 `compute.cuda_graphs`（NVIDIA，模型完整位于设备上，`compute.compile` 关闭）时，一块就是一个 CUDA 图，按注意力跨度（`ATTEND_BLOCK` 的倍数）、步数和引导值各一个；DiT 的噪声从 CUDA 图自己的生成器抽取，该生成器每块从请求的生成器载入并写回。此时只要保留 CUDA 图，语言模型的静态缓存就随模型保留（这是请求本来就需要的显存），在权重移动或模型卸载时释放。真实的 0.5B 和 1.5 在有无 CUDA 图时音频相同，每个请求快 1.6–1.9 倍。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5816":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-69","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#训练","content":"方法 `full` 和 `lora`（`train.py`，计算在 `sft.py`），即上游的 `train_voxcpm_finetune.py` 及其按模型的方案（`conf/<model>/*.yaml`），留为 0 的超参数由方案填入。不需要 `datasets`、`transformers`、`argbind` 或 tensorboard。阶段：`prepare`（按 VAE 的采样率读取音频，读法与 `datasets` 相同：soundfile 的 float64 和 `librosa.resample` 的 soxr；文本的 token；`max_batch_tokens` 过滤）、`train`、`export`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5817":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-70","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#训练","content":"**按上游的顺序抽样**，使用以 42 播种的私有生成器（上游的 `Accelerator` 用 42 给每个生成器播种）：重放构建时的默认初始化（先 VAE，再模型，然后是用 Kaiming 初始化的 LoRA `A`，其值被保留；其余由检查点覆盖）；每次遍历数据加载器时抽基础种子和采样器的种子；每次前向时抽 CFM 的掩码、条件噪声（即使比例为 0 也会抽）、`r`、`t` 和 `z`，以及 LoRA 的 dropout 掩码。在 CPU 上一个生成器负责全部抽样，与上游的默认生成器相同；在 CUDA 上前向的抽样来自设备生成器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5818":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-71","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#训练","content":"**精度。** 在 CUDA 上与上游相同：float32 权重，bf16 自动混合精度，带梯度缩放器。其他设备全程 float32：上游用它的配置无法在 CUDA 以外训练（前向把输入转成配置中的 bf16，而权重仍是 float32），所以 CPU 上的参考实现是配置 `config.json` 为 float32 的上游。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5819":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-72","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#训练","content":"**保持上游的做法**：每段音频在右侧补齐到整块；停止标签在最后一块，损失只算音频位置；每个微批次的损失除以累积步数；关闭裁剪时梯度按 1e9 裁剪；记录的学习率是下一步的。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5820":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-73","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#训练","content":"**导出。** 全量：`model.safetensors`（float32，上游的键名），与基础模型的配置、VAE 和分词器放在一起。LoRA：基础权重（文件系统允许时用硬链接）加 `lora_weights.safetensors` 和 `lora_config.json`，在引擎加载时应用，与上游的 `VoxCPM(lora_weights_path=…)` 相同；上游从不合并它们。没有 3–15 秒的音频时，预览以零样本方式朗读。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5821":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-74","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#训练","content":"`training.memory`：对 MiniCPM 各层、局部编码器和 DiT 做梯度检查点，结果完全相同（重放 LoRA dropout 和 CFM 的抽样）；VAE 的解码器不放到设备上；对 LoRA，`low` 以自动混合精度的类型存放冻结的线性层权重（CUDA），`lowest` 从内存流式载入它们（在 CPU 上结果相同）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5822":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-75","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#对照结果","content":"**组件**，每个模型在 bf16 和 fp32 下：分词器和文本规范化在 420 条文本上，VAE 的潜变量和解码；然后是各种方式的完整请求（中英文的零样本和克隆、只用参考、只用续写、设计、带指令的克隆音色、文本规范化、强制重试、有无音色的流式，包括分块长度）。全部完全相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5823":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-76","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#对照结果","content":"**完整链路**，27 个用例（每种音色方式、文本规范化、强制重试、流式、多段、其他步数和引导值、通过 `engines.voxcpm.dtype` 设为 fp32）：音频和行为（实际参数、警告、音色方式、分段、流式分块长度）全部完全相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5824":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-77","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#对照结果","content":"**训练**：VoxCPM-0.5B 全量、VoxCPM-0.5B LoRA 和 VoxCPM2 LoRA 在每一步都与上游脚本相同（两项损失、梯度范数、学习率），保存的权重也相同。每个导出结果无论由上游还是 Mizuoto 加载，朗读结果都相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5825":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-78","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#对照结果","content":"契约套件全部通过（三个模型共 18 项测试）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5826":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-79","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#限制","content":"没有参考音频降噪，也没有时间戳。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5827":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-80","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#限制","content":"在 CUDA 上，进程中的第一个请求解码其潜变量（潜变量相同）时，结果位与之后的请求略有不同；之后的请求彼此完全一致。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5828":{"id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm-81","page_id":"/docs/engines-voxcpm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines-voxcpm#限制","content":"VoxCPM2 的全量微调约需 40 GB 内存。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5829":{"id":"/docs/engines","page_id":"/docs/engines","type":"page","content":"引擎参考","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","引擎参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines","locale":"zh-CN"},"5830":{"id":"/docs/engines-0","page_id":"/docs/engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines","content":"每个内置引擎在 Mizuoto 中怎样实现、与上游一致到什么程度：变体、代码位置、对照结果和训练方法，“一致”如何定义与检查，以及每个引擎都遵守的规则。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5831":{"id":"/docs/engines-1","page_id":"/docs/engines","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines#引擎一览","content":"引擎一览","locale":"zh-CN"},"5832":{"id":"/docs/engines-2","page_id":"/docs/engines","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines#相同指什么","content":"“相同”指什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"5833":{"id":"/docs/engines-3","page_id":"/docs/engines","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines#参考实现","content":"参考实现","locale":"zh-CN"},"5834":{"id":"/docs/engines-4","page_id":"/docs/engines","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines#条件","content":"条件","locale":"zh-CN"},"5835":{"id":"/docs/engines-5","page_id":"/docs/engines","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines#层级","content":"层级","locale":"zh-CN"},"5836":{"id":"/docs/engines-6","page_id":"/docs/engines","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines#怎样检查","content":"怎样检查","locale":"zh-CN"},"5837":{"id":"/docs/engines-7","page_id":"/docs/engines","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines#每个引擎都遵守的规则","content":"每个引擎都遵守的规则","locale":"zh-CN"},"5838":{"id":"/docs/engines-8","page_id":"/docs/engines","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines#共享构件","content":"共享构件","locale":"zh-CN"},"5839":{"id":"/docs/engines-9","page_id":"/docs/engines","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines#需接受许可的引擎","content":"需接受许可的引擎","locale":"zh-CN"},"5840":{"id":"/docs/engines-10","page_id":"/docs/engines","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/engines#限制","content":"限制","locale":"zh-CN"},"5841":{"id":"/docs/engines-11","page_id":"/docs/engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines","content":"Mizuoto 的每个引擎都是一个移植版：把上游项目的模型代码，在 Mizuoto 的运行时（`mizuoto/runtime`）和共享构件（`mizuoto/nn`、`mizuoto/text`）之上重新写一遍。不内嵌任何上游代码，也没有引擎导入 transformers、onnxruntime 或上游的包。每个移植版都遵守同一个标准：在 CPU 上、以 fp32、用同一个种子运行时，它逐采样地给出被它取代的那份代码的输出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5842":{"id":"/docs/engines-12","page_id":"/docs/engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines","content":"本节逐个引擎记录：做到这一点需要什么，引擎在哪些地方有意与上游不同，它怎样使用显存、怎样跑得快，怎样训练，以及对照的结果。该选哪个引擎、各自能做什么，见引擎详解；引擎怎样编写和注册，见接入引擎。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5843":{"id":"/docs/engines-13","page_id":"/docs/engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines#引擎一览","content":"引擎","locale":"zh-CN"},"5844":{"id":"/docs/engines-14","page_id":"/docs/engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines#引擎一览","content":"变体","locale":"zh-CN"},"5845":{"id":"/docs/engines-15","page_id":"/docs/engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines#引擎一览","content":"代码","locale":"zh-CN"},"5846":{"id":"/docs/engines-16","page_id":"/docs/engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines#引擎一览","content":"一致程度（CPU、fp32、同一种子）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5847":{"id":"/docs/engines-17","page_id":"/docs/engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines#引擎一览","content":"训练","locale":"zh-CN"},"5848":{"id":"/docs/engines-18","page_id":"/docs/engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines#引擎一览","content":"Qwen3-TTS","locale":"zh-CN"},"5849":{"id":"/docs/engines-19","page_id":"/docs/engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/engines#引擎一览","content":"`base`、`custom_voice`、`custom_voice_lite`、`voice_design`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5850":{"id":"/docs/e