:{"id":"/docs/guide-models-23","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型","content":"**已损坏**","locale":"zh-CN"},"6071":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-24","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型","content":"某个文件的大小不对，或校验失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"6072":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-25","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型","content":"**内置**","locale":"zh-CN"},"6073":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-26","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型","content":"演示引擎的模型，不需要下载","locale":"zh-CN"},"6074":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-27","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型","content":"可以做的操作：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6075":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-28","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型","content":"**下载**：下载缺少的文件。下载会续传、核对每个文件的大小和 SHA-256，某个来源缺文件时自动换下一个来源（见下载来源）。它需要的共享文件随之一起下载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6076":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-29","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型","content":"**校验**：重新计算已安装模型所有文件的 SHA-256。完好时提示 **全部 N 个文件完好**，否则列出 **已损坏：文件名**。已损坏的模型可以删除后重新下载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6077":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-30","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#模型","content":"删除按钮：删除模型文件（确认提示 **删除 模型名？之后可以重新下载。**）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6078":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-31","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#导入模型文件夹","content":"已经有模型文件（之前下载的、别处拷来的、微调的结果）时，点 **导入模型文件夹**，选择服务器上的一个文件夹。这个按钮只在服务器本机的浏览器中出现。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6079":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-32","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#导入模型文件夹","content":"Mizuoto 根据文件判断它属于哪个引擎、哪个变体：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6080":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-33","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#导入模型文件夹","content":"文件大小与目录中的某个模型一致时，再核对 SHA-256，通过后作为该目录模型导入；","locale":"zh-CN"},"6081":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-34","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#导入模型文件夹","content":"否则作为用户模型导入，id 为 `引擎/文件夹名`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6082":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-35","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#导入模型文件夹","content":"命令行可以指定名称，或移动而不是复制：`mizuoto model import <文件夹> [--name 名称] [--move]`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6083":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-36","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#引擎","content":"每个引擎一张卡片：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6084":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-37","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#引擎","content":"标题下方是模型数量和许可名称（语音识别显示 **供 Mizuoto 自身使用**），右侧是 **可用** 或 **不可用**；引擎在远程主机上运行时还显示 **在 主机 上**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6085":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-38","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#引擎","content":"一句引擎说明。不可用时说明缺什么：**需要** *torch*（或 *mizuoto-indextts* 等）**，但尚未安装：运行 mizuoto doctor 查看安装方法。** 除了需要接受许可的引擎是单独的发行包，其他引擎都是 Mizuoto 的一部分（见首次运行）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6086":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-39","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#设备精度启用","content":"**设备**：**自动**，本机上该引擎支持的设备（如 `cuda:0`、`cpu`），以及已添加的、该引擎在其上可用的远程主机的设备（显示为“主机 · 设备”）。选了远程设备后，这个引擎在那台机器上运行，卡片显示 **在 主机 上**，其依赖也由那台机器管理（见远程主机）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6087":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-40","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#设备精度启用","content":"**精度**：**自动**、`bf16`、`fp16`、`fp32`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6088":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-41","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#设备精度启用","content":"**已启用**：关闭后这个引擎的模型不能使用，合成页底部会改为提供 **启用** 按钮。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6089":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-42","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#设备精度启用","content":"修改这些设置会卸载该引擎的模型，下次使用时按新设置加载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6090":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-43","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#选项","content":"引擎有加载选项时，卡片上有 **选项**：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6091":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-44","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#选项","content":"引擎","locale":"zh-CN"},"6092":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-45","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#选项","content":"选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"6093":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-46","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#选项","content":"CosyVoice","locale":"zh-CN"},"6094":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-47","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#选项","content":"`fp16`：在 GPU 上用半精度，更快，结果略有不同","locale":"zh-CN"},"6095":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-48","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#选项","content":"IndexTTS 2 / 2.5","locale":"zh-CN"},"6096":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-49","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#选项","content":"`use_qwen_emo`（把文字描述的情感转成权重的情感模型，约 1.2 GB）、`use_torch_compile`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6097":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-50","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#选项","content":"F5-TTS","locale":"zh-CN"},"6098":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-51","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#选项","content":"`ode_method`（`euler` 或 `midpoint`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"6099":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-52","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#选项","content":"Qwen3-TTS","locale":"zh-CN"},"6100":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-53","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#选项","content":"`fused_projections`：快速模式，在 GPU 上快几个百分点，结果不再逐位一致","locale":"zh-CN"},"6101":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-54","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#选项","content":"**更改在模型下次加载时生效（其模型现在会被卸载）。** **设置 › 计算** 中的 **编译模型（torch.compile）** 可以同时为多个引擎提速。详见性能。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6102":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-55","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#检查本机","content":"展开 **检查本机**，列出这个引擎在本机上的检查结果：torch 及其构建是否与显卡匹配、引擎是否可用、它能用到的可选扩展（如 GPT-SoVITS 的日语前端），有问题的项后面附带修复命令。命令行：`mizuoto doctor <引擎>`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6103":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-56","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#许可","content":"需要接受许可的引擎（Fish Speech、IndexTTS）卡片上有 **接受许可** 按钮，打开许可全文；接受后显示 **已接受许可**。见首次运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6104":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-57","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#共享文件","content":"**同一引擎的多个模型共用的文件，随第一个需要它们的模型一起下载一次。** 例如 GPT-SoVITS 的编码器、G2PW、NLTK 数据、Open JTalk 词典和训练用的判别器，IndexTTS-2 的 w2v-BERT、语义编解码器、CAM++、BigVGAN，以及 CosyVoice 的文本规范化语法。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6105":{"id":"/docs/guide-models-58","page_id":"/docs/guide-models","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-models#共享文件","content":"每行显示名称、大小、说明和 **用于 模型列表**。可以单独 **下载** 或删除。缺少某个共享文件的模型显示为 **部分下载**。共享文件保存在数据文件夹的 `models/_assets/<引擎>/` 中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6106":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","type":"page","content":"项目","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","使用教程"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-projects","locale":"zh-CN"},"6107":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-0","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects","content":"项目页：由一组角色逐句朗读整本书、剧本或对话，包括导入脚本、编辑台词、生成、管理版本与导出带字幕的音频。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6108":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-1","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-projects#项目列表","content":"项目列表","locale":"zh-CN"},"6109":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-2","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-projects#新建项目","content":"新建项目","locale":"zh-CN"},"6110":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-3","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-projects#脚本格式","content":"脚本格式","locale":"zh-CN"},"6111":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-4","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-projects#导入脚本","content":"导入脚本","locale":"zh-CN"},"6112":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-5","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-projects#编辑脚本","content":"编辑脚本","locale":"zh-CN"},"6113":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-6","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-projects#章节","content":"章节","locale":"zh-CN"},"6114":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-7","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词","content":"台词","locale":"zh-CN"},"6115":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-8","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词状态","content":"台词状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"6116":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-9","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-projects#角色","content":"角色","locale":"zh-CN"},"6117":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-10","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-projects#生成","content":"生成","locale":"zh-CN"},"6118":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-11","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-projects#版本","content":"版本","locale":"zh-CN"},"6119":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-12","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-projects#导出","content":"导出","locale":"zh-CN"},"6120":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-13","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-projects#删除","content":"删除","locale":"zh-CN"},"6121":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-14","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-projects#命令行","content":"命令行","locale":"zh-CN"},"6122":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-15","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects","content":"**项目** 用来朗读长篇内容：一本书、一份剧本或一段多人对话。一个项目由两部分组成：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6123":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-16","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects","content":"**脚本**：若干章节，每章是一句一句的台词。每句有文本和说话的角色，可以单独加风格指令。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6124":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-17","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects","content":"**角色表**：每个角色有自己的模型、音色（音色库中的音色、预置说话人或模型自带的音色）、语言、说话方式和参数。**第一个角色是旁白**：没有指定角色的句子都由旁白朗读。没有选模型的角色使用项目的模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6125":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-18","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects","content":"每一句单独生成，生成结果称为一个**版本**。改了某句的文本、角色或设置后，只需重新生成这一句；最后把所有句子按设定的停顿拼成一个文件，并附带字幕。不同角色可以用不同引擎的模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6126":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-19","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects","content":"项目保存在数据文件夹的 `projects/<名称>/project.json` 中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6127":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-20","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#项目列表","content":"在导航栏打开 **项目**。每张卡片显示项目名称、已生成句数/总句数（有失败的句子时显示为红色）、描述、**N 章 · N 句**、**N 个角色**、已生成部分的时长，以及一条按句子状态着色的进度条。点卡片打开项目。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6128":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-21","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#新建项目","content":"点 **新建项目**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6129":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-22","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#新建项目","content":"填写 **项目名称**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6130":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-23","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#新建项目","content":"选择 **模型**：项目的默认模型，旁白和其他没有单独选模型的角色都用它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6131":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-24","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#新建项目","content":"可选：在 **脚本** 中粘贴一份脚本（格式见下一节），并在 **按此切分台词** 中选择 **每行文本** 或 **每个句子**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6132":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-25","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#新建项目","content":"点 **创建**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6133":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-26","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#新建项目","content":"新项目自带一个名为 **旁白** 的角色。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6134":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-27","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#脚本格式","content":"导入的脚本是纯文本，规则如下（输入框下方也有提示）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6135":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-28","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#脚本格式","content":"写法","locale":"zh-CN"},"6136":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-29","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#脚本格式","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"6137":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-30","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#脚本格式","content":"`# 标题`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6138":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-31","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#脚本格式","content":"开始新的一章，标题为 `#` 之后的文字","locale":"zh-CN"},"6139":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-32","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#脚本格式","content":"`名字：文本`（全角或半角冒号），或 `[名字]: 文本`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6140":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-33","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#脚本格式","content":"该角色的一句台词（见下方规则）","locale":"zh-CN"},"6141":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-34","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#脚本格式","content":"其他行","locale":"zh-CN"},"6142":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-35","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#脚本格式","content":"旁白的台词","locale":"zh-CN"},"6143":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-36","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#脚本格式","content":"空行","locale":"zh-CN"},"6144":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-37","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#脚本格式","content":"结束一个段落（导出时段落之后的停顿更长）","locale":"zh-CN"},"6145":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-38","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#脚本格式","content":"`名字：` 前缀在以下任一情况下才被当作角色名，否则整行原样作为旁白的台词：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6146":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-39","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#脚本格式","content":"这个名字已经在角色表中；","locale":"zh-CN"},"6147":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-40","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#脚本格式","content":"同一个名字出现在两行或更多行的开头；","locale":"zh-CN"},"6148":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-41","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#脚本格式","content":"脚本是一段对话（已有某个名字满足上面两条之一），并且这个前缀**看起来像名字**：以字母或汉字开头、最多三个词，例如 `Dr. Watson`、`林黛玉`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6149":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-42","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#脚本格式","content":"因此，在不是对话的脚本中，偶尔出现的“注意：明天停电”不会被当作角色；但在对话脚本中，任何看起来像名字的前缀都会成为角色。每个名字都只出现一次的对话不会被识别，这时先在 **角色** 中添加同名角色再导入即可。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6150":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-43","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#脚本格式","content":"新出现的名字自动加入角色表。它们还没有模型和音色（使用项目的模型），导入后在 **角色** 中为它们选择音色。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6151":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-44","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#脚本格式","content":"第一个 `#` 之前的台词放进一章：项目还没有任何章节时，这章以项目名为标题，否则不加标题。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6152":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-45","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#脚本格式","content":"**按此切分台词**：**每行文本** 时每行是一句；**每个句子** 时每行再按句子拆成多句。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6153":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-46","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#脚本格式","content":"示例：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6154":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-47","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#脚本格式","content":"导入后得到一章、六句：“安娜”和“老人”各出现两次，成为两个新角色；其余句子归旁白；第一段、对话段和最后一句各是一个段落。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6155":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-48","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#导入脚本","content":"在项目页底部点 **导入脚本**（项目为空时页面中间也有这个按钮），粘贴脚本，选择切分方式和 **导入方式**：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6156":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-49","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#导入脚本","content":"导入方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"6157":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-50","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#导入脚本","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"6158":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-51","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#导入脚本","content":"**作为新章节**","locale":"zh-CN"},"6159":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-52","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#导入脚本","content":"把脚本中的章节追加到项目末尾","locale":"zh-CN"},"6160":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-53","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#导入脚本","content":"**加到本章**","locale":"zh-CN"},"6161":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-54","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#导入脚本","content":"把所有台词追加到当前打开的章节，不新建章节（`#` 标题行会被忽略）","locale":"zh-CN"},"6162":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-55","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#导入脚本","content":"**替换现有脚本**","locale":"zh-CN"},"6163":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-56","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#导入脚本","content":"用脚本中的章节替换全部现有章节；原有台词的版本会被删除","locale":"zh-CN"},"6164":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-57","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#导入脚本","content":"点 **导入**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6165":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-58","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#编辑脚本","content":"项目页有三个标签页：**脚本**、**角色**、**导出**。顶部显示项目名称、保存状态（**正在保存…**、**已保存**、**有未保存的修改**）和“已生成句数/总句数 · 时长”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6166":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-59","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#编辑脚本","content":"所有修改在停止输入后不久自动保存，离开页面时也会保存，不需要手动保存。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6167":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-60","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#章节","content":"左侧 **章节** 列出所有章节，每章显示“已生成/总句数”；点章节名切换。**添加章节** 新建一章。右侧上方是 **章节标题**，旁边的菜单中有 **上移**、**下移** 和 **删除本章**（会同时删除这些句子的版本）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6168":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-61","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词","content":"每句一行，从左到右是：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6169":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-62","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词","content":"状态圆点（悬停显示状态名称，见下一节）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"6170":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-63","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词","content":"**角色**：选择说这句话的角色；选第一个角色（旁白）就是不指定角色；","locale":"zh-CN"},"6171":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-64","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词","content":"**文本**：在文本框中按 Ctrl+Enter 在下方插入一句；","locale":"zh-CN"},"6172":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-65","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词","content":"播放按钮：播放这句当前使用的版本；","locale":"zh-CN"},"6173":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-66","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词","content":"**重新生成这一句**：立即为这句生成一个新版本，即使它已经是最新的；","locale":"zh-CN"},"6174":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-67","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词","content":"更多操作菜单：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6175":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-68","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词","content":"菜单项","locale":"zh-CN"},"6176":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-69","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"6177":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-70","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词","content":"**在下方插入一句**","locale":"zh-CN"},"6178":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-71","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词","content":"新句沿用这一句的角色","locale":"zh-CN"},"6179":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-72","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词","content":"**在此结束段落** / **与下一句同段**","locale":"zh-CN"},"6180":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-73","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词","content":"设置段落结尾，影响导出时的停顿","locale":"zh-CN"},"6181":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-74","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词","content":"**添加风格指令**","locale":"zh-CN"},"6182":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-75","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词","content":"显示 **这一句的风格**，这句用它代替角色的 **说话方式**","locale":"zh-CN"},"6183":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-76","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词","content":"**上移** / **下移**","locale":"zh-CN"},"6184":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-77","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词","content":"调整顺序","locale":"zh-CN"},"6185":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-78","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词","content":"**在“合成”中试听**","locale":"zh-CN"},"6186":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-79","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词","content":"把这一句的完整请求（模型、音色、文本、参数）载入合成页，方便调试","locale":"zh-CN"},"6187":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-80","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词","content":"**第 N 版（秒数）**","locale":"zh-CN"},"6188":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-81","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词","content":"这一句的各个版本，当前使用的带有 ✓；点一个切换","locale":"zh-CN"},"6189":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-82","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词","content":"**删除**","locale":"zh-CN"},"6190":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-83","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词","content":"删除这一句及其版本","locale":"zh-CN"},"6191":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-84","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词","content":"本章末尾的 **添加一句** 在最后追加一句。生成失败的句子下方会显示失败原因。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6192":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-85","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词状态","content":"状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"6193":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-86","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词状态","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"6194":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-87","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词状态","content":"**已生成**","locale":"zh-CN"},"6195":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-88","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词状态","content":"有版本，而且与当前的文本和设置一致","locale":"zh-CN"},"6196":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-89","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词状态","content":"**修改后未重新生成**","locale":"zh-CN"},"6197":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-90","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词状态","content":"有版本，但之后改过文本、角色、角色的模型、音色或参数，或者所用的音色库音色本身改过","locale":"zh-CN"},"6198":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-91","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词状态","content":"**未生成**","locale":"zh-CN"},"6199":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-92","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词状态","content":"还没有版本","locale":"zh-CN"},"6200":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-93","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词状态","content":"**失败**","locale":"zh-CN"},"6201":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-94","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词状态","content":"最近一次生成失败，原因显示在句子下方","locale":"zh-CN"},"6202":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-95","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词状态","content":"**生成中**","locale":"zh-CN"},"6203":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-96","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词状态","content":"正在生成","locale":"zh-CN"},"6204":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-97","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词状态","content":"**空**","locale":"zh-CN"},"6205":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-98","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#台词状态","content":"没有文本，生成和导出时跳过","locale":"zh-CN"},"6206":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-99","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#角色","content":"**角色** 标签页上方的 **项目** 部分可以修改项目的 **模型**、**项目名称** 和 **描述**。下面是每个角色一张卡片：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6207":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-100","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#角色","content":"**角色名称**；第一个角色带有 **旁白** 标记；旁边显示这个角色的句数和移除按钮。移除角色后，它的台词交给旁白。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6208":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-101","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#角色","content":"**模型**：没选时标签显示 **模型（使用项目的：…）**；选了之后可以点 **使用项目的模型** 改回。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6209":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-102","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#角色","content":"音色：**音色库中的音色**、**预置说话人** 或 **模型自带音色**，只列出这个模型支持的方式。选音色库音色时，选择器同样标出这个模型能否使用每个音色。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6210":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-103","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#角色","content":"**语言**：**使用项目的语言**，或模型支持的某种语言。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6211":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-104","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#角色","content":"**说话方式**：这个角色每句话的风格指令（模型支持指令时才显示）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6212":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-105","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#角色","content":"**参数**：展开后与合成页的参数面板相同；有改动时显示 **已设置 N 项**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6213":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-106","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#角色","content":"**添加角色** 新建一个角色。项目本身的语言在同一标签页的 **项目** 中设置（**语言**；**由各模型决定** 表示交给各模型），也可以用 `mizuoto project set --lang`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6214":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-107","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#角色","content":"角色的模型、音色、语言、说话方式或参数变化后，这个角色已生成的句子都会变为 **修改后未重新生成**。导出设置中的 **每句音量统一** 也属于生成设置，修改它会让所有句子过期。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6215":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-108","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#生成","content":"页面底部有两个按钮：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6216":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-109","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#生成","content":"**生成本章（N）**：生成当前章节中所有不是 **已生成** 的句子（未生成、过期、失败的）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6217":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-110","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#生成","content":"**全部生成（N）**：对整个项目做同样的事。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6218":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-111","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#生成","content":"生成是一个 **生成项目** 任务，每章一个步骤。它为每句提交一个普通的合成任务，同时保持最多 8 个在排队，这样 **设置 › 语音 › 合并等待中的请求** 可以把模型、音色和设置都相同、只有文本不同的句子合并为一批运行（在支持批处理的引擎上，例如 Qwen3-TTS、GPT-SoVITS、OmniVoice）。这些合成任务不会逐个弹出提示，只有整个生成任务结束时提示一次。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6219":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-112","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#生成","content":"一句失败不影响其他句子：失败的句子标为 **失败** 并记下原因，其余继续生成。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6220":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-113","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#生成","content":"取消生成任务会一并取消它已提交的合成任务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6221":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-114","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#生成","content":"生成过程中仍可以编辑脚本；改过的句子会按新的内容判断是否过期。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6222":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-115","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#版本","content":"每次生成一句都会新增一个版本并立即使用它。每句最多保留 5 个版本，更早的、未在使用的版本会被删除。在台词菜单中点 **第 N 版** 可以换回旧版本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6223":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-116","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#版本","content":"版本是 FLAC 格式的结果，不显示在历史中。删除句子、章节或项目时，它们的版本一并删除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6224":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-117","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#导出","content":"**导出** 标签页：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6225":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-118","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#导出","content":"设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"6226":{"id":"/docs/guide-projects-119","page_id":"/docs/guide-projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-projects#导