ngs#语音","content":"**合并等待中的请求**：同一模型和音色、仅文本不同的请求，在支持批处理的引擎上（Qwen3-TTS、GPT-SoVITS、OmniVoice）合并为一批运行。具体来说，只有一段文本、没有指定种子的请求才会合并：正在运行的任务在调用引擎前，把排队中设置完全相同的任务一起带上，一次生成，再分别保存各自的结果；批处理失败时，这些任务回到队列中各自运行。指定种子的请求不合并，因为批处理时随机数的取法不同。项目的生成正是借助这一点加速的。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6357":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-81","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#训练","content":"设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"6358":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-82","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#训练","content":"默认","locale":"zh-CN"},"6359":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-83","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#训练","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"6360":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-84","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#训练","content":"**训练设备**","locale":"zh-CN"},"6361":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-85","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#训练","content":"**引擎所用设备**","locale":"zh-CN"},"6362":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-86","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#训练","content":"或 CPU、某块显卡。**微调运行时独占该设备**","locale":"zh-CN"},"6363":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-87","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#训练","content":"**训练精度**","locale":"zh-CN"},"6364":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-88","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#训练","content":"**自动**","locale":"zh-CN"},"6365":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-89","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#训练","content":"**自动**、`fp32`、`fp16`、`bf16`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6366":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-90","page_id":"/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-settings#训练","content":"**每次运行保留的检查点数**","locale":"zh-CN"},"6367":{"id":"/docs/guide-settings-91","page_id":