:"/docs/guide-train#检查报告","content":"**可用片段：可用数/总数 · 时长**；","locale":"zh-CN"},"6631":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-104","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#检查报告","content":"**片段时长** 的直方图；","locale":"zh-CN"},"6632":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-105","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#检查报告","content":"问题列表：**过短**、**过长**、**缺少文本**、**削波**，每一项旁的 **查看** 会只列出这些片段；","locale":"zh-CN"},"6633":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-106","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#检查报告","content":"其他提示，以及 **片段的许可证**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6634":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-107","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#编辑片段","content":"**片段** 列表每页 50 条，可以搜索文本或按问题筛选。每条片段：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6635":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-108","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#编辑片段","content":"播放按钮和时长；","locale":"zh-CN"},"6636":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-109","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#编辑片段","content":"文本框（标签为说话人名，没有文本时提示 **没有文本：请转写或手动输入**），改完点保存按钮或按回车；","locale":"zh-CN"},"6637":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-110","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#编辑片段","content":"**用于训练** / **不用于训练**：排除的片段保留在数据集中但不参与训练；","locale":"zh-CN"},"6638":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-111","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#编辑片段","content":"删除按钮。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6639":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-112","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#编辑片段","content":"**详情** 中可以修改名称、语言和描述。页面底部有 **删除**（移到回收站；用它建立的实验将无法再运行）和 **用它训练**（以这个数据集新建实验）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6640":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-113","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#新建实验","content":"在 **实验** 标签页点 **新建实验**（或在数据集页点 **用它训练**）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6641":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-114","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#新建实验","content":"**起始模型**：只列出可以训练的已安装模型。没有时提示安装可训练的模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6642":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-115","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#新建实验","content":"**训练方式**：这个模型可用的方式；不可用的带有 **（不可用）** 并写明原因（缺少共享文件、引擎不可用或在远程主机上等）。下方显示这种方式的说明、阶段、结果类型（**生成音色专属权重** 或 **生成新模型**）和所需的最少语音时长。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6643":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-116","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#新建实验","content":"**数据集**；数据集中可用的语音时长不足时，创建会失败，并说明现有与所需的时长。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6644":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-117","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#新建实验","content":"**实验名称**：默认是“数据集-模型”，只能用字母、数字、`-`、`_` 和 `.`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6645":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-118","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#新建实验","content":"结果是音色权重时，还有 **权重所属音色**：选音色库中的一个音色，或 **新建音色**（用数据集中三段 3 到 10 秒的片段新建一个）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6646":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-119","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#新建实验","content":"主要设置（轮数、学习率等）可以在这里修改，**更多设置（包括高级设置）在实验页面中。**","locale":"zh-CN"},"6647":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-120","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#新建实验","content":"点 **创建**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6648":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-121","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#新建实验","content":"实验保存在 `experiments/<引擎>/<名称>/` 中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6649":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-122","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#阶段","content":"实验页上方显示起始模型、数据集、结果类型和语言。**阶段** 部分是一排步骤，每个阶段的状态为 **未运行**、**运行中**、**已完成**、**已过期** 或 **失败**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6650":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-123","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#阶段","content":"按钮","locale":"zh-CN"},"6651":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-124","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#阶段","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"6652":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-125","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#阶段","content":"**运行**","locale":"zh-CN"},"6653":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-126","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#阶段","content":"从第一个未完成（或已过期）的阶段运行到最后；全部完成后显示 **已完成**","locale":"zh-CN"},"6654":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-127","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#阶段","content":"**运行此阶段**","locale":"zh-CN"},"6655":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-128","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#阶段","content":"只运行选中的阶段；它之前的阶段必须已完成","locale":"zh-CN"},"6656":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-129","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#阶段","content":"**从头开始**","locale":"zh-CN"},"6657":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-130","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#阶段","content":"确认后从第一个阶段起重新运行所有阶段","locale":"zh-CN"},"6658":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-131","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#阶段","content":"点一个阶段查看它的说明、完成时间和结果；失败时显示错误。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6659":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-132","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#阶段","content":"一次运行是一个 **训练** 任务，它的步骤就是各个阶段，任务卡片显示在阶段下方。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6660":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-133","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#阶段","content":"**已过期**：每个完成的阶段都记录了它读取的内容——数据集、起始模型的版本和它用到的设置，以及之前阶段的结果。这些内容变化后，这个阶段及其后的阶段都标为 **已过期**（**此阶段运行后，它读取的内容（数据集、模型或它用到的设置）已改变：请重新运行。**）。重新运行某个阶段时，它之后已完成的阶段也会过期，因为它们读的是这个阶段的旧文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6661":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-134","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#损失曲线","content":"**损失** 部分在训练阶段运行时实时显示曲线；有多个训练阶段时可以切换，有多条曲线时可以用标签逐条开关。还没有数据时显示 **训练阶段运行时，损失曲线显示在这里**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6662":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-135","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#设置","content":"**设置** 中是这种训练方式的超参数（数字输入框），**高级** 中是其余的。**修改设置会使用到它的阶段及其后的阶段过期。** 改完点 **保存**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6663":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-136","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#试听与导出","content":"**试听**：导出阶段会用训练结果朗读一段（**设置 › 训练 › 训练后合成试听** 打开时），结果列在这里。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6664":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-137","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#试听与导出","content":"**已导出**：导出的 **音色**（可以 **打开** 或 **在合成中使用**）或 **模型**（点 **模型** 跳到模型页）。导出的权重会加到所选音色上；导出的新模型以 `引擎/名称` 出现在模型列表中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6665":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-138","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#试听与导出","content":"页面底部的 **删除** 把实验及其工作文件移到回收站，已导出的内容保留。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6666":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-139","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#cpu-与-gpu","content":"微调实际上需要 GPU；Fish Speech 的 LoRA 建议 24 GB 显存。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6667":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-140","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#cpu-与-gpu","content":"所有引擎也都能在 CPU 上训练，适合用很少的数据和步数确认流程能走通。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6668":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-141","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#cpu-与-gpu","content":"**设置 › 训练** 中还有 **训练精度**、**每次运行保留的检查点数** 和 **内存**：*标准* 按各配方训练；*低* 加上梯度检查点（反向传播时重新运行模型的每个块，而不保留其激活值），并把用不到的部分移出 GPU，结果相同，约慢三分之一；*最低* 还把优化器状态放在内存中，并从内存流式加载 LoRA 的冻结权重，结果略有不同。方法自己的 **gradient_checkpointing** 超参数优先。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6669":{"id":"/docs/guide-train-142","page_id":"/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-train#cpu-与-gpu","content":"为新实验选择方法时，对话框会显示每种内存设置下一次运行大约需要多少显存；估计超过 GPU 空闲显存的运行会在日志中说明，并给出放得下的设置。在 GPU 上，每个记录的步骤还会报告 **memory/peak_mb**，即实际用量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6670":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","type":"page","content":"音色","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","使用教程"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-voices","locale":"zh-CN"},"6671":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-0","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices","content":"音色库：从音频创建、设计、添加预置说话人，管理参考音频、文本和微调权重，查看各模型能否使用，导出与导入。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6672":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-1","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-voices#音色列表","content":"音色列表","locale":"zh-CN"},"6673":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-2","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-voices#新建音色","content":"新建音色","locale":"zh-CN"},"6674":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-3","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-voices#音色页","content":"音色页","locale":"zh-CN"},"6675":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-4","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-voices#参考音频","content":"参考音频","locale":"zh-CN"},"6676":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-5","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-voices#微调权重","content":"微调权重","locale":"zh-CN"},"6677":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-6","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-voices#哪些模型可以使用","content":"哪些模型可以使用","locale":"zh-CN"},"6678":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-7","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-voices#试听","content":"试听","locale":"zh-CN"},"6679":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-8","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-voices#详情","content":"详情","locale":"zh-CN"},"6680":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-9","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-voices#页面底部","content":"页面底部","locale":"zh-CN"},"6681":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-10","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-voices#导入","content":"导入","locale":"zh-CN"},"6682":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-11","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-voices#命令行","content":"命令行","locale":"zh-CN"},"6683":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-12","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices","content":"**音色** 页是音色库。一个音色可以在 **合成**、**项目**、**工具** 中反复使用，换模型时 Mizuoto 会自动判断它在新模型上怎么用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6684":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-13","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices","content":"音色有四类：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6685":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-14","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices","content":"类别","locale":"zh-CN"},"6686":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-15","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices","content":"来源","locale":"zh-CN"},"6687":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-16","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices","content":"**来自音频**","locale":"zh-CN"},"6688":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-17","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices","content":"一段或几段参考音频及其文本，用来克隆","locale":"zh-CN"},"6689":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-18","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices","content":"**设计**","locale":"zh-CN"},"6690":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-19","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices","content":"设计模型按文字描述生成的声音；生成的那段音频成为它的主音频，因此也能被其他模型克隆","locale":"zh-CN"},"6691":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-20","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices","content":"**预置**","locale":"zh-CN"},"6692":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-21","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices","content":"某个模型的预置说话人，只能用于这个模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"6693":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-22","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices","content":"**训练**","locale":"zh-CN"},"6694":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-23","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices","content":"训练得到的音色，带有专属的微调权重（见训练）","locale":"zh-CN"},"6695":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-24","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices","content":"每个音色是数据文件夹下 `voices/<名称>/` 中的一个文件夹（`voice.json` 和 `references/` 中的 FLAC 音频）。列表就是对这些文件夹的扫描，直接复制进去的音色文件夹也会出现。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6696":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-25","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#音色列表","content":"顶部有 **搜索音色**、按类别筛选的标签、**导入音色** 和 **新建音色**。每张卡片显示名称、类别、描述、语言、**N 段音频** 和总时长；有主音频的可以直接 **播放其音频**，**在合成中使用** 会带着这个音色跳到合成页。点卡片打开音色页。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6697":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-26","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#新建音色","content":"点 **新建音色**，在对话框中先填 **名称**，再选一种方式：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6698":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-27","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#新建音色","content":"添加一段或几段参考音频：拖放或选择文件、**录音**（3 到 30 秒的清晰语音为佳）、**服务器文件** 或 **之前的结果**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6699":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-28","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#新建音色","content":"每段音频下方有 **音频中说的内容**。可以留空：**缺少的文本会在安装语音识别后自动填写。**","locale":"zh-CN"},"6700":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-29","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#新建音色","content":"选择 **语言**（或 **任意语言**）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6701":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-30","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#新建音色","content":"点 **创建**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6702":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-31","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#新建音色","content":"需要一个能设计音色的已安装模型，例如 Qwen3-TTS 1.7B VoiceDesign；没有时提示 **没有安装可设计音色的模型。**","locale":"zh-CN"},"6703":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-32","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#新建音色","content":"选择 **设计模型**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6704":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-33","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#新建音色","content":"在 **描述音色** 中写下想要的声音，例如“温暖低沉的男声，平静，略带沙哑”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6705":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-34","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#新建音色","content":"**音色样例要说的话** 是试听用的句子，可以修改。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6706":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-35","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#新建音色","content":"点 **生成**。每次生成一个候选，出现在 **候选** 中（保留最近 4 个），逐个试听。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6707":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-36","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#新建音色","content":"在满意的候选旁点 **保留这个**，它就成为一个 **设计** 类音色。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6708":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-37","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#新建音色","content":"选择 **模型**（只列出带预置说话人的已安装模型）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6709":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-38","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#新建音色","content":"选择 **说话人**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6710":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-39","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#新建音色","content":"点 **创建**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6711":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-40","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#新建音色","content":"还可以在合成结果的菜单中点 **保存为音色**，把任意一条结果存为音色。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6712":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-41","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#音色页","content":"音色页顶部显示名称和类别；设计出的音色还显示 **由 模型 设计** 和当时的描述，预置音色显示 **模型 的说话人 名称**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6713":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-42","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#参考音频","content":"（预置音色没有这一部分。）每段音频一行：播放按钮、波形、时长与采样率，以及：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6714":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-43","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#参考音频","content":"**主音频** 标记，或 **设为主音频** 按钮。克隆时主音频排在最前；音色列表中播放的也是它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6715":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-44","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#参考音频","content":"删除按钮（至少保留一段）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6716":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-45","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#参考音频","content":"下面的文本框是这段音频的文本，改完点 **保存**（或按回车）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6717":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-46","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#参考音频","content":"**重新识别** 用语音识别重新转写所有音频；**添加音频** 再加一段。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6718":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-47","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#微调权重","content":"（来自音频和训练类的音色才有。）一个音色可以带有某个引擎的专属微调权重，目前是 GPT-SoVITS：一个 GPT 的 `.ckpt` 和一个 SoVITS 的 `.pth`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6719":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-48","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#微调权重","content":"选择 **引擎**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6720":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-49","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#微调权重","content":"按提示 **选择 gpt 文件（.ckpt）** 和 **选择 sovits 文件（.pth）**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6721":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-50","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#微调权重","content":"点 **添加权重**，上传完成后显示 **已添加 GPT-SoVITS 的权重**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6722":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-51","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#微调权重","content":"权重的版本从文件中识别。同版本的 GPT-SoVITS 模型使用这个音色时会换上这套权重（在 **哪些模型可以使用** 中带有 **自有权重** 标记）；版本不同的模型给出提示并照常克隆。**音色仍保留其参考音频：引擎使用权重时也需要参考音频。** 训练实验导出的权重会自动加到音色上。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6723":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-52","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#哪些模型可以使用","content":"列出每个已安装的模型能否使用这个音色、以何种方式：**克隆**、**克隆（无文本）**、**预置说话人**、**设计** 或 **训练**，以及 **自有权重**、**先识别文本**、**裁剪以适配** 等标记；不能使用的写明原因。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6724":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-53","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#哪些模型可以使用","content":"克隆方式的行有 **准备** 按钮：提前为这个模型计算并缓存音色（参考音频的特征等），之后第一次合成会更快。不准备的话，第一次合成时也会自动做一次。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6725":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-54","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#试听","content":"选择一个可用的 **模型**，修改 **文本**，点 **合成**。结果列在下方。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6726":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-55","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#详情","content":"**名称**、**语言**、**标签**（逗号分隔）和 **描述**，改完点 **保存**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6727":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-56","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#页面底部","content":"**删除**：把音色移到数据文件夹的回收站（`trash/`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6728":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-57","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#页面底部","content":"**导出**：下载一个 zip，包含音色信息、参考音频和微调权重。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6729":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-58","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#页面底部","content":"**在合成中使用**：带着这个音色打开合成页。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6730":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-59","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#导入","content":"在音色列表点 **导入音色**，选择一个导出的 zip。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6731":{"id":"/docs/guide-voices-60","page_id":"/docs/guide-voices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-voices#命令行","content":"其余命令（`add-ref`、`set-transcript`、`retranscribe`、`edit`、`remove`…）见 `mizuoto voice --help` 和命令参考。`voice add`、`voice from-output` 和 `voice edit` 接受 `--consent`：一条关于这是谁的声音的可选说明，随音色保存（`voice info` 会显示），但不是必需的。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6732":{"id":"/docs/guide","page_id":"/docs/guide","type":"page","content":"界面总览","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","使用教程"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide","locale":"zh-CN"},"6733":{"id":"/docs/guide-0","page_id":"/docs/guide","tags":[],"type":"