oice\": \"<id>\"`.","locale":"en"},"7267":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-api-249","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-api#events","content":"The server pushes events over socket.io at `/ws` (socket.io path `/ws/socket.io`). Traffic is server to client only: every operation goes through REST, REST is the truth, and events only tell you when to refresh.","locale":"en"},"7268":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-api-250","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-api#events","content":"Event","locale":"en"},"7269":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-api-251","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-api#events","content":"Payload","locale":"en"},"7270":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-api-252","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-api#events","content":"`job_updated`","locale":"en"},"7271":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-api-253","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-api#events","content":"`job`: the job's state, progress and download speed","locale":"en"},"7272":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-api-254","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-api#events","content":"`job_log`","locale":"en"},"7273":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-api-255","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-api#events","content":"`job_id`, `offset`, `lines` (at most 50; read the rest over REST)","locale":"en"},"7274":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-api-256","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-api#events","content":"`jobs_cleared`","locale":"en"},"7275":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-api-257","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-api#events","content":"`ids`","locale":"en"},"7276":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-api-258","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/e