n the model takes no speed","locale":"en"},"7327":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-api-309","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-api#openai-compatible-api","content":"`response_format`","locale":"en"},"7328":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-api-310","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-api#openai-compatible-api","content":"`mp3` (default), `opus` (made as ogg), `aac` (made as m4a), `flac`, `wav`, `pcm` (24 kHz mono 16-bit little-endian, no header)","locale":"en"},"7329":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-api-311","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-api#openai-compatible-api","content":"`stream_format`","locale":"en"},"7330":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-api-312","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-api#openai-compatible-api","content":"`audio` with `wav` or `pcm` streams the audio as it is made; `sse` is not supported","locale":"en"},"7331":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-api-313","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-api#openai-compatible-api","content":"Parameters are lenient here: one the model does not take is dropped rather than refused. Errors take OpenAI's shape, `{\"error\": {\"message\", \"type\", \"param\", \"code\"}}`, with Mizuoto's error code as `code`. A successful answer carries `X-Mizuoto-Job` and `X-Mizuoto-Model` headers.","locale":"en"},"7332":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-api-314","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-api#openai-compatible-api","content":"Give the usual names aliases first:","locale":"en"},"7333":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-api-315","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-api#next","content":"Using Mizuoto from Python: call the core services without HTTP, or embed the server in your own program.","locale":"en"},"7334":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-api-316","page_id":"