ge-contains","content":"`false`","locale":"en"},"7389":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker-52","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-docker#what-the-image-contains","content":"No browser is opened","locale":"en"},"7390":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker-53","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-docker#what-the-image-contains","content":"`PYTHONUNBUFFERED`","locale":"en"},"7391":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker-54","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-docker#what-the-image-contains","content":"`1`","locale":"en"},"7392":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker-55","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-docker#what-the-image-contains","content":"Logs reach `docker logs` at once","locale":"en"},"7393":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker-56","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-docker#what-the-image-contains","content":"`VOLUME /data`, `EXPOSE 7869`.","locale":"en"},"7394":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker-57","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-docker#what-the-image-contains","content":"A health check every 30 s on `http://127.0.0.1:7869/api/v1/app/health` (which needs no token).","locale":"en"},"7395":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker-58","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-docker#what-the-image-contains","content":"The command: `mizuoto webui --host 0.0.0.0 --port 7869 --no-open`.","locale":"en"},"7396":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker-59","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-docker#running","content":"Then open `http://<host address>:7869`; the web UI asks for the **Access token** once.","locale":"en"},"7397":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker-60","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-docker#running","content":"`--gpus all` needs the NVIDIA driver and the NVIDIA Container Toolkit on the host. Without `--gpus` the engines run on the CPU.","locale":"en"},"7398":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker-61","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-docker#running","content":"One GPU only: `--gpus '\"device=1\"'`.","locale":"en"},"7399":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker-62","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-docker#running","content":"`docker exec -it mizuoto mizuoto doctor` checks the image's torch against the GPUs the container sees.","locale":"en"},"7400":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker-63","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-docker#running","content":"The server in the container binds `0.0.0.0`, where Mizuoto no longer checks the `Host` header: anyone who reaches the port can do everything (download models, delete files). Set a token with `MIZUOTO_SERVER__ACCESS_TOKEN`, or publish the port on this machine only: `-p 127.0.0.1:7869:7869`.","locale":"en"},"7401":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker-64","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-docker#volumes","content":"Everything Mizuoto writes is in `/data`: `settings.toml`, the database, models, shared files, voices, outputs, datasets, experiments, projects, caches and logs. The image itself holds no state, so a rebuilt image keeps working on the same volume.","locale":"en"},"7402":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker-65","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-docker#settings-and-environment-variables","content":"Any setting can come from a `MIZUOTO_<GROUP>__<FIELD>` variable (see Configuration and environment variables). Such values live in memory only, are never written to `/data/settings.toml`, and show as **Set by an environment variable** in the web UI:","locale":"en"},"7403":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker-66","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-docker#settings-and-environment-variables","content":"`HF_TOKEN` is sent to huggingface.co only (see Model downloads).","locale":"en"},"7404":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker-67","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-docker#the-command-line-in-the-container","content":"The image's environment variables apply to `docker exec` too, so commands work on the same data folder:","locale":"en"},"7405":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker-68","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-docker#licence-gated-engines","content":"Fish Speech and IndexTTS are in the image only when it was built with `--build-arg GATED=1`; otherwise their cards say **Not available** (`mizuoto-fishspeech` or `mizuoto-indextts` missing). Even then, their licence must be accepted before downloading their models or speaking:","locale":"en"},"7406":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker-69","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-docker#licence-gated-engines","content":"Or click **Accept the licence** in the web UI's **Models** › **Engines**.","locale":"en"},"7407":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker-70","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-docker#an-agent-in-a-container","content":"A GPU machine can serve as a remote host from the same image, running `mizuoto agent` instead of the web UI:","locale":"en"},"7408":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker-71","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-docker#an-agent-in-a-container","content":"The agent has its own volume and models; build its image like the host's (same Mizuoto version, `GATED=1` if it serves the gated engines). The image's health check asks the web UI's port 7869, which an agent does not serve, hence `--no-healthcheck`. Without TLS, requests and audio cross the network unencrypted: use a trusted network, or give a certificate with `--ssl-certfile` / `--ssl-keyfile` (mount the files into the container).","locale":"en"},"7409":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker-72","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-docker#an-agent-in-a-container","content":"Then, on the host:","locale":"en"},"7410":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","type":"page","content":"Model downloads and mirrors","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto Documentation","Advanced"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","locale":"en"},"7411":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-0","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","content":"Where model files come from, how Mizuoto falls back between sources, resumes and verifies them, and how to use the mizuoto-model mirror or run your own.","locale":"en"},"7412":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-1","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#sources","content":"Sources","locale":"en"},"7413":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-2","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#order-and-fallback","content":"Order and fallback","locale":"en"},"7414":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-3","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#resuming-and-verification","content":"Resuming and verification","locale":"en"},"7415":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-4","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#hugging-face-token-and-proxies","content":"Hugging Face token and proxies","locale":"en"},"7416":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-5","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#shared-files","content":"Shared files","locale":"en"},"7417":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-6","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#importing-a-model-folder","content":"Importing a model folder","locale":"en"},"7418":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-7","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#the-mizuoto-model-mirror","content":"The mizuoto-model mirror","locale":"en"},"7419":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-8","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#maintaining-a-mirror","content":"Maintaining a mirror","locale":"en"},"7420":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-9","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#build-lay-out-the-installed-models","content":"`build`: lay out the installed models","locale":"en"},"7421":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-10","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#mirror_fetchpy-the-whole-catalogue","content":"`mirror_fetch.py`: the whole catalogue","locale":"en"},"7422":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-11","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#mirror_readmepy-the-card-and-licence-files","content":"`mirror_readme.py`: the card and licence files","locale":"en"},"7423":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-12","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#upload-publish","content":"`upload`: publish","locale":"en"},"7424":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-13","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#check-find-missing-files","content":"`check`: find missing files","locale":"en"},"7425":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-14","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#running-your-own-mirror","content":"Running your own mirror","locale":"en"},"7426":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-15","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","content":"Every model in the catalogue names its repository and a pinned files manifest (`mizuoto/core/engines/manifests/files/*.files.json`): the repository's commit and each file's path, size and SHA-256. Mizuoto fetches only the listed files and checks each one's size and SHA-256, so the files are identical whichever source served them.","locale":"en"},"7427":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-16","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#sources","content":"`downloads.source`","locale":"en"},"7428":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-17","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#sources","content":"Address","locale":"en"},"7429":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-18","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#sources","content":"Notes","locale":"en"},"7430":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-19","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#sources","content":"`huggingface` (default)","locale":"en"},"7431":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-20","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#sources","content":"`https://huggingface.co`","locale":"en"},"7432":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-21","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#sources","content":"The official repositories","locale":"en"},"7433":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-22","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#sources","content":"`hf-mirror`","locale":"en"},"7434":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-23","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#sources","content":"`https://hf-mirror.com`","locale":"en"},"7435":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-24","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#sources","content":"A Hugging Face mirror, often faster in mainland China","locale":"en"},"7436":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-25","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#sources","content":"`modelscope`","locale":"en"},"7437":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-26","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#sources","content":"`https://www.modelscope.cn`","locale":"en"},"7438":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-27","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#sources","content":"ModelScope, for the models that name a ModelScope repository","locale":"en"},"7439":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-28","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#sources","content":"`custom`","locale":"en"},"7440":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-29","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#sources","content":"`downloads.endpoint`","locale":"en"},"7441":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-30","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#sources","content":"Any Hugging Face compatible server (URL form under Running your own mirror)","locale":"en"},"7442":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-31","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#sources","content":"**Settings** › **Downloads** › **Download source**; with **Custom**, fill in **Custom endpoint**.","locale":"en"},"7443":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-32","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#sources","content":"Models with a ModelScope repository: every Qwen3-TTS, CosyVoice and VoxCPM model, and OmniVoice. CosyVoice's shared file `cosyvoice/wetext` exists on ModelScope only, so it comes from there whatever the source. The others (F5-TTS, GPT-SoVITS, IndexTTS, Fish Speech, the Whisper speech recognition model) and their shared files come from Hugging Face and compatible addresses only. On ModelScope the `master` branch is used (`cosyvoice/wetext` is pinned to a commit); its files are checked against the same sizes and SHA-256. ModelScope may answer several anonymous downloads at once with 403; `downloads.concurrency` 1 gets them.","locale":"en"},"7444":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-33","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#order-and-fallback","content":"Each file picks its source on its own:","locale":"en"},"7445":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-34","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#order-and-fallback","content":"With `downloads.repository` set to `mizuoto-model` (the default), the mizuoto-model mirror first;","locale":"en"},"7446":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-35","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#order-and-fallback","content":"then the source in `downloads.source`;","locale":"en"},"7447":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-36","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#order-and-fallback","content":"then the rest of `huggingface`, `hf-mirror`, `modelscope` in that order (with `custom` chosen, `custom` comes before these three).","locale":"en"},"7448":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-37","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#order-and-fallback","content":"A source that answers 401, 403 or 404 for a file, or serves it with the wrong size or SHA-256, is left for the next one at once. Other errors (a dropped connection, a timeout, a 5xx) are retried on the same source up to 4 times, after 1, 2, 4 and 8 seconds (30 at most). When every source fails, the job ends with `download_failed` (exit code 12); its detail lists the sources tried and the last errors. The job log has one line per file naming the source it came from.","locale":"en"},"7449":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-38","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#resuming-and-verification","content":"A file is written to `<name>.part` and renamed only when its size and SHA-256 match. Downloading again after an interruption resumes with an HTTP Range request; a server that ignores the range starts the file over.","locale":"en"},"7450":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-39","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#resuming-and-verification","content":"A file already present with the right size is not downloaded again.","locale":"en"},"7451":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-40","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#resuming-and-verification","content":"With `downloads.verify_checksums` (**Verify checksums**, on by default) off, only sizes are checked.","locale":"en"},"7452":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-41","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#resuming-and-verification","content":"`downloads.concurrency` (**Files at once**, 1–8, default 2): how many files download at once, the largest first.","locale":"en"},"7453":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-42","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#resuming-and-verification","content":"Download jobs share the `io` resource: four run at once, the others wait (shown as **Waiting for other downloads**).","locale":"en"},"7454":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-43","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#resuming-and-verification","content":"A model's state:","locale":"en"},"7455":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-44","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#resuming-and-verification","content":"State","locale":"en"},"7456":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-45","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#resuming-and-verification","content":"In the UI","locale":"en"},"7457":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-46","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#resuming-and-verification","content":"Meaning","locale":"en"},"7458":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-47","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#resuming-and-verification","content":"`missing`","locale":"en"},"7459":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-48","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#resuming-and-verification","content":"**Not downloaded**","locale":"en"},"7460":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-49","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#resuming-and-verification","content":"No folder","locale":"en"},"7461":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-50","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#resuming-and-verification","content":"`partial`","locale":"en"},"7462":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-51","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#resuming-and-verification","content":"**Partly downloaded**","locale":"en"},"7463":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-52","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#resuming-and-verification","content":"A folder without `model.json` (the download did not finish), or a shared file it needs is missing","locale":"en"},"7464":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-53","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#resuming-and-verification","content":"`downloading`","locale":"en"},"7465":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-54","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#resuming-and-verification","content":"**Downloading**","locale":"en"},"7466":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-55","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#resuming-and-verification","content":"Being downloaded","locale":"en"},"7467":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-56","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#resuming-and-verification","content":"`installed`","locale":"en"},"7468":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-57","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#resuming-and-verification","content":"**Installed**","locale":"en"},"7469":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-58","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#resuming-and-verification","content":"`model.json` written (it is written last)","locale":"en"},"7470":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-59","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#resuming-and-verification","content":"`corrupt`","locale":"en"},"7471":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-60","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#resuming-and-verification","content":"**Damaged**","locale":"en"},"7472":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-61","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#resuming-and-verification","content":"A file's size differs, or the last verification failed","locale":"en"},"7473":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-62","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#resuming-and-verification","content":"Verification lists the damaged files. Since files of the right size are not downloaded again, delete those files (or the whole model with `mizuoto model delete`) and then download again.","locale":"en"},"7474":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-63","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#hugging-face-token-and-proxies","content":"When `HF_TOKEN` is set in the environment, it is sent as `Authorization: Bearer` to huggingface.co only, never to hf-mirror, ModelScope, a custom endpoint or the mizuoto-model mirror.","locale":"en"},"7475":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-64","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#hugging-face-token-and-proxies","content":"Downloads use httpx, which reads the standard proxy variables `HTTPS_PROXY`, `HTTP_PROXY`, `ALL_PROXY` and `NO_PROXY`. Set them in the environment that starts `mizuoto webui` or `mizuoto model download`.","locale":"en"},"7476":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-65","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#shared-files","content":"Files several models of an engine share (GPT-SoVITS's encoders and text front-end data; IndexTTS-2/2.5's w2v-BERT, semantic codec, CAM++ and BigVGAN; CosyVoice's text normalisation grammars) are shared files, kept in `<models folder>/_assets/<engine>/<name>/` with an `asset.json`.","locale":"en"},"7477":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-66","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#shared-files","content":"They are downloaded with the first model that needs them (the job's steps list them); a model whose shared files are missing is **Partly downloaded**.","locale":"en"},"7478":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-67","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#shared-files","content":"Manage them on their own in **Models** › **Shared files**, or:","locale":"en"},"7479":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-68","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#shared-files","content":"Some shared files are archives (GPT-SoVITS's G2PW, NLTK data and Open JTalk dictionary): verified, unpacked into the folder, then deleted; verification and new downloads work on the unpacked files. Archive members cannot land outside the target folder.","locale":"en"},"7480":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-69","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#importing-a-model-folder","content":"Model files you already have (an earlier download, another program's copy, your own fine-tune) can be imported instead of downloaded:","locale":"en"},"7481":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-70","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#importing-a-model-folder","content":"Mizuoto identifies the engine and variant from the folder's files (and a GPT-SoVITS weight's version). A folder it does not recognise is refused.","locale":"en"},"7482":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-71","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#importing-a-model-folder","content":"When the file sizes match a catalogue model's manifest exactly, the folder becomes that catalogue model and every file's SHA-256 is then checked; a mismatch is an error.","locale":"en"},"7483":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-72","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#importing-a-model-folder","content":"Otherwise (or with `--name`) it becomes a user model `<engine>/<name>`; the name cannot be a catalogue model's.","locale":"en"},"7484":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-73","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#importing-a-model-folder","content":"In the web UI: **Models** › **Import a model folder**. It reads a server path, so it works only in a browser on the server's own machine, and the path must lie inside `paths.browse_roots`.","locale":"en"},"7485":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-74","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#the-mizuoto-model-mirror","content":"mizuoto-model is a mirror repository holding the files Mizuoto downloads, laid out as Mizuoto keeps them:","locale":"en"},"7486":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-75","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#the-mizuoto-model-mirror","content":"`<path>` is the file's place in the model's folder. Every model is in one repository, so reaching that one repository is enough. The mirror is `licyk/mizuoto-model` on Hugging Face and `licyks/mizuoto-model` on ModelScope; both hold the whole catalogue: every model and shared file, archives and the licence-gated engines included, with their licence and notice files.","locale":"en"},"7487":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-76","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#the-mizuoto-model-mirror","content":"**Settings** › **Downloads** › **Repository**: **mizuoto-model mirror first** (the default). The mirror is fetched from the place chosen in **Download source**. **Each model's own repository** skips the mirror.","locale":"en"},"7488":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-77","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#the-mizuoto-model-mirror","content":"Setting","locale":"en"},"7489":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-78","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#the-mizuoto-model-mirror","content":"Default","locale":"en"},"7490":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-79","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#the-mizuoto-model-mirror","content":"Meaning","locale":"en"},"7491":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-80","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#the-mizuoto-model-mirror","content":"`downloads.repository`","locale":"en"},"7492":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-81","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#the-mizuoto-model-mirror","content":"`mizuoto-model`","locale":"en"},"7493":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-82","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#the-mizuoto-model-mirror","content":"`mizuoto-model`: the mirror first; `official`: each model's own repositories","locale":"en"},"7494":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-83","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#the-mizuoto-model-mirror","content":"`downloads.mirror_repo`","locale":"en"},"7495":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-84","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#the-mizuoto-model-mirror","content":"`licyk/mizuoto-model`","locale":"en"},"7496":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-85","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#the-mizuoto-model-mirror","content":"The mirror repository on Hugging Face, also used through hf-mirror and a custom endpoint","locale":"en"},"7497":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-86","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#the-mizuoto-model-mirror","content":"`downloads.mirror_repo_modelscope`","locale":"en"},"7498":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-87","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#the-mizuoto-model-mirror","content":"`licyks/mizuoto-model`","locale":"en"},"7499":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-88","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#the-mizuoto-model-mirror","content":"The mirror repository on ModelScope, used when `downloads.source` is `modelscope`","locale":"en"},"7500":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-89","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#the-mizuoto-model-mirror","content":"The mirror is fetched from `downloads.source`: the `main` branch on Hugging Face, hf-mirror and custom endpoints, `master` on ModelScope.","locale":"en"},"7501":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-90","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#the-mizuoto-model-mirror","content":"It is not pinned to a commit, but each file is checked against the manifest's size and SHA-256 like any other; a file that does not match comes from the official repository.","locale":"en"},"7502":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-91","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#the-mizuoto-model-mirror","content":"Files the mirror lacks (models it does not hold; archive-type shared files in a mirror made with `build`) come from each model's official repositories, so a partial mirror works.","locale":"en"},"7503":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-92","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#maintaining-a-mirror","content":"Three scripts, run from a source checkout, make and publish a mirror: `scripts/mirror_models.py` lays out the models installed on this machine, publishes the result and checks it; `scripts/mirror_fetch.py` downloads the whole catalogue into the mirror's layout; `scripts/mirror_readme.py` writes the repository's card and licence files. Publishing is the mirror owner's step: the weights keep their own licences, and `MIRROR.json` names each file's origin.","locale":"en"},"7504":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-93","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#build-lay-out-the-installed-models","content":"Argument or option","locale":"en"},"7505":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-94","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#build-lay-out-the-installed-models","content":"Meaning","locale":"en"},"7506":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-95","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#build-lay-out-the-installed-models","content":"`OUT`","locale":"en"},"7507":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-96","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#build-lay-out-the-installed-models","content":"The output folder","locale":"en"},"7508":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-97","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#build-lay-out-the-installed-models","content":"`IDS...`","locale":"en"},"7509":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-98","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#build-lay-out-the-installed-models","content":"Only these models and shared files (default: every installed one)","locale":"en"},"7510":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-99","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#build-lay-out-the-installed-models","content":"`--models-dir <path>`","locale":"en"},"7511":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-100","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#build-lay-out-the-installed-models","content":"The models folder; default: the data folder's","locale":"en"},"7512":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-101","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#build-lay-out-the-installed-models","content":"`--gated`","locale":"en"},"7513":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-102","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#build-lay-out-the-installed-models","content":"Include licence-gated engines (Fish Speech, IndexTTS); their licences may not allow redistribution","locale":"en"},"7514":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-103","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#build-lay-out-the-installed-models","content":"`--no-verify`","locale":"en"},"7515":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-104","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#build-lay-out-the-installed-models","content":"Check sizes only, not SHA-256","locale":"en"},"7516":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-105","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#build-lay-out-the-installed-models","content":"Files are hard-linked where possible, else copied; each is checked against its manifest, and an incomplete or mismatching model is skipped with the reason.","locale":"en"},"7517":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-106","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#build-lay-out-the-installed-models","content":"`MIRROR.json` (every file's path, size, SHA-256 and official origin: repository, revision, path) and a `README.md` are written.","locale":"en"},"7518":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-107","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#build-lay-out-the-installed-models","content":"Archive-type shared files are not kept after unpacking, so `build` leaves them out and they come from the official repository; `mirror_fetch.py` includes them.","locale":"en"},"7519":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-108","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#mirror_fetchpy-the-whole-catalogue","content":"Argument or option","locale":"en"},"7520":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-109","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#mirror_fetchpy-the-whole-catalogue","content":"Default","locale":"en"},"7521":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-110","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#mirror_fetchpy-the-whole-catalogue","content":"Meaning","locale":"en"},"7522":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-111","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#mirror_fetchpy-the-whole-catalogue","content":"`OUT`","locale":"en"},"7523":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-112","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#mirror_fetchpy-the-whole-catalogue","content":"The output folder","locale":"en"},"7524":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-113","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#mirror_fetchpy-the-whole-catalogue","content":"`IDS...`","locale":"en"},"7525":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-114","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#mirror_fetchpy-the-whole-catalogue","content":"every one","locale":"en"},"7526":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-115","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#mirror_fetchpy-the-whole-catalogue","content":"Only these models and shared files","locale":"en"},"7527":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-116","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#mirror_fetchpy-the-whole-catalogue","content":"`--models-dir <path>`","locale":"en"},"7528":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-117","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#mirror_fetchpy-the-whole-catalogue","content":"the data folder's models folder","locale":"en"},"7529":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-118","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#mirror_fetchpy-the-whole-catalogue","content":"Take verified copies from here; can be given more than once","locale":"en"},"7530":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-119","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#mirror_fetchpy-the-whole-catalogue","content":"`--gated`","locale":"en"},"7531":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-120","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#mirror_fetchpy-the-whole-catalogue","content":"off","locale":"en"},"7532":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-121","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#mirror_fetchpy-the-whole-catalogue","content":"Include licence-gated engines (Fish Speech, IndexTTS); run `mirror_readme.py` afterwards so that their licence and notice files lie beside them","locale":"en"},"7533":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-122","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#mirror_fetchpy-the-whole-catalogue","content":"`--workers`","locale":"en"},"7534":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-123","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#mirror_fetchpy-the-whole-catalogue","content":"`4`","locale":"en"},"7535":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-124","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#mirror_fetchpy-the-whole-catalogue","content":"Files downloaded at once","locale":"en"},"7536":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-125","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#mirror_fetchpy-the-whole-catalogue","content":"Each file goes where Mizuoto's mirror source asks for it. A copy in a models folder with the same size and SHA-256 is hard-linked (else copied); anything else is downloaded from the official sources by Mizuoto's own downloader: resumed, retried and checked against its SHA-256.","locale":"en"},"7537":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-126","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#mirror_fetchpy-the-whole-catalogue","content":"Archive-type shared files are kept as published; a machine using the mirror unpacks them after downloading.","locale":"en"},"7538":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-127","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#mirror_fetchpy-the-whole-catalogue","content":"`HF_TOKEN`, when set, is sent to huggingface.co only.","locale":"en"},"7539":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-128","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#mirror_fetchpy-the-whole-catalogue","content":"Running it again skips what is already there. `MIRROR.json` (as `build` writes it, archives marked `archive`) is written once every file is in place; when a file fails, the run lists it and exits with 1.","locale":"en"},"7540":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-129","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#mirror_readmepy-the-card-and-licence-files","content":"It reads `MIRROR.json` (from `build` or `mirror_fetch.py`) and writes:","locale":"en"},"7541":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-130","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#mirror_readmepy-the-card-and-licence-files","content":"`README.md`: the Hugging Face card: metadata, how to use the mirror, each engine's licence notes and a table of every model and shared-file folder with its size and origin repositories. It replaces the shorter README that `build` writes;","locale":"en"},"7542":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-131","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#mirror_readmepy-the-card-and-licence-files","content":"`LICENSES.md`: each engine's licence and its link;","locale":"en"},"7543":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-132","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#mirror_readmepy-the-card-and-licence-files","content":"for each licence-gated engine in the mirror, its licence text as `<engine>/LICENSE.*` and, for Fish Speech, the `NOTICE.txt` its licence asks for.","locale":"en"},"7544":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-133","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#mirror_readmepy-the-card-and-licence-files","content":"`--repo` (default `licyk/mizuoto-model`) goes into the card's licence link, which Hugging Face requires to be an `https` address.","locale":"en"},"7545":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-134","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads#upload-publish","content":"Option","locale":"en"},"7546":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-downloads-135","page_id":"/en/docs/advan