t","url":"/en/docs/development-acceleration#what-changes-results","content":"Static KV cache","locale":"en"},"9713":{"id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration-46","page_id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-acceleration#what-changes-results","content":"`compute.kv_cache = static`","locale":"en"},"9714":{"id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration-47","page_id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-acceleration#what-changes-results","content":"identical on the CPU; see Memory","locale":"en"},"9715":{"id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration-48","page_id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-acceleration#what-changes-results","content":"Native code never changes process-wide state: no `torch.backends` assignments, no `sdpa_kernel` (it switches SDPA's kernels for every thread), no global seeding. `runtime/accel/features.py` is the one exemption, called by the host and by a training stage (an architecture test enforces both).","locale":"en"},"9716":{"id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration-49","page_id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-acceleration#attention","content":"Every attention computation in `runtime`, `nn`, the engines, the trainers and the gated packages goes through one entry point, after ComfyUI's attention backends and `comfy_kitchen`'s registry:","locale":"en"},"9717":{"id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration-50","page_id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-acceleration#attention","content":"`q`, `k`, `v` are `(batch, heads, length, head_dim)`; `mask` is boolean (True attends) or additive, broadcastable to `(batch, heads, q_length, k_length)`.","locale":"en"},"9718":{"id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration-51","page_id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-acceleration#attention","content":"`causal` is SDPA's `is_causal`: aligned top-left. Sites pass it as upstream passed `is_causal` (CosyVoice's streamed-text steps feed several tokens over a cache with it). Bottom-right causality, a KV cache's, comes through `mask_info`.","locale":"en"},"9719":{"id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration-52","page_id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-acceleration#attention","content":"An architecture test forbids `F.scaled_dot_product_attention` and its aten kernels anywhere outside `runtime/accel/`.","locale":"en"},"9720":{"id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration-53","page_id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-acceleration#attention","content":"Code","locale":"en"},"9721":{"id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration-54","page_id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-acceleration#attention","content":"Role","locale":"en"},"9722":{"id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration-55","page_id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-acceleration#attention","content":"`runtime/accel/dispatch.py`","locale":"en"},"9723":{"id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration-56","page_id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-acceleration#attention","content":"`attention`, `Site`, `MaskInfo`, `Masked`; the reference forms `sdpa`, `math_kernel`, `softmax_attention`","locale":"en"},"9724":{"id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration-57","page_id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-acceleration#attention","content":"`runtime/accel/registry.py`","locale":"en"},"9725":{"id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration-58","page_id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-acceleration#attention","content":"`Backend`, `Constraints`, `Call`