acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-acceleration#sites-and-their-references","content":"`sdpa`: SDPA with the call's arguments (the default)","locale":"en"},"9742":{"id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration-75","page_id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-acceleration#sites-and-their-references","content":"most: the Qwen decoder (`qwen`), F5-TTS's DiT, the CosyVoice U-Net and v3 DiT, Seed-VC, HuBERT, BERT, Whisper, GPT-SoVITS's T2S and v4/v5 DiT, Qwen3-TTS's Mimi encoder, VoxCPM's MiniCPM, Fish Speech's prefill and codec, IndexTTS's GPT-2","locale":"en"},"9743":{"id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration-76","page_id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-acceleration#sites-and-their-references","content":"`math_kernel`: SDPA's math kernel called directly","locale":"en"},"9744":{"id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration-77","page_id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-acceleration#sites-and-their-references","content":"Fish Speech's decode steps (`fishspeech.step`)","locale":"en"},"9745":{"id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration-78","page_id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-acceleration#sites-and-their-references","content":"a hand-written softmax","locale":"en"},"9746":{"id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration-79","page_id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-acceleration#sites-and-their-references","content":"Fish Speech's fast transformer (`fishspeech.fast`), IndexTTS's perceiver (`indextts.perceiver`)","locale":"en"},"9747":{"id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration-80","page_id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-acceleration#sites-and-their-references","content":"The attentions that add relative positions inside the scores, or need the probability matrix, are not sites: wenet's relative attention, IndexTTS's Conformer, w2v-BERT, VITS, plus the s3tokenizer (q and k each scaled by d^-¼), MelStyle and G2PW's BERT. They stay hand-written, since no fused kernel computes them. `Site(swappable=False)` keeps a site on its reference whatever the policy; `approx_ok=False` refuses every backend that is not exact.","locale":"en"},"9748":{"id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration-81","page_id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-acceleration#policies","content":"Setting","locale":"en"},"9749":{"id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration-82","page_id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-acceleration#policies","content":"Values","locale":"en"},"9750":{"id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration-83","page_id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-acceleration#policies","content":"Default","locale":"en"},"9751":{"id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration-84","page_id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-acceleration#policies","content":"`compute.attention`","locale":"en"},"9752":{"id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration-85","page_id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-acceleration#policies","content":"`auto`, `fast`, `sdpa`, `math`, `sdpa_flash`, `sdpa_efficient`, `sdpa_cudnn`, `flash`, `xformers`, `sage`, `sage3`","locale":"en"},"9753":{"id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration-86","page_id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-acceleration#policies","content":"`auto`","locale":"en"},"9754":{"id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration-87","page_id":"/en/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/development-acceleration#policies","content":"`engines.<id>.attention`","locale":"en"},"9755":{"id":"