ide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#speech","content":"**Run waiting requests together**: requests for the same model and voice that differ only in their text run as one batch, on engines that take one (Qwen3-TTS, GPT-SoVITS, OmniVoice). Only one-segment requests without a seed qualify: just before calling the engine, the running job takes the queued jobs with exactly the same settings along, makes them in one go and stores each one's result; if the batch fails, those jobs go back to the queue to run on their own. Requests with a seed are never joined, since a batch draws random numbers differently. Rendering a project relies on this to go faster.","locale":"en"},"13373":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-81","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#training","content":"Setting","locale":"en"},"13374":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-82","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#training","content":"Default","locale":"en"},"13375":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-83","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#training","content":"What it does","locale":"en"},"13376":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-84","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#training","content":"**Training device**","locale":"en"},"13377":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-85","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#training","content":"**The engine’s device**","locale":"en"},"13378":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-86","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#training","content":"Or the CPU or one GPU. **A fine-tune takes the device for itself while it runs**","locale":"en"},"13379":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-87","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/d