ide-speak","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#command-line","content":"Command line","locale":"en"},"13437":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-14","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak","content":"**Speak** turns text into speech. From top to bottom the screen has **Model**, **Voice**, **Text**, **Style** (when the model has it), **Parameters** and **Results**; the **Speak** button stays at the bottom of the page. Each part shows only what the chosen model supports, so the screen changes with the model.","locale":"en"},"13438":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-15","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#model","content":"Click **Model** to open the picker; it can be searched. It lists every model of every speech engine (installed or not), each with its engine, variant, size and GPU memory, and badges for what is missing: **demo** (the dummy engine), **Not available** (the engine needs something installed), **Licence** (a licence to accept), the model's state (such as **Not downloaded**) and **recommended**.","locale":"en"},"13439":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-16","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#model","content":"Badges under the model list its capabilities, such as **Clone a voice**, **Preset speakers**, **Instructions**, **Streaming** and **Long text**.","locale":"en"},"13440":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-17","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#model","content":"The first time, the screen picks **Settings › Speech › Default model**, or else the first model that is ready. Then it remembers your last choice.","locale":"en"},"13441":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-18","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#when-the-model-is-not-ready","content":"A model that is not ready can still be chosen. The **Speak** button at the bottom is then replaced by the **first** thing it needs; click it to start, with its progress:","locale":"en"},"13442":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-19","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#when-the-model-is-not-ready","content":"Button","locale":"en"},"13443":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-20","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#when-the-model-is-not-ready","content":"Why","locale":"en"},"13444":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-21","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#when-the-model-is-not-ready","content":"**Enable**","locale":"en"},"13445":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-22","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#when-the-model-is-not-ready","content":"The engine is disabled under **Models › Engines**","locale":"en"},"13446":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-23","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#when-the-model-is-not-ready","content":"**Accept the** *engine* **licence**","locale":"en"},"13447":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-24","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#when-the-model-is-not-ready","content":"A licence-gated engine (Fish Speech, IndexTTS): opens the licence dialog","locale":"en"},"13448":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-25","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#when-the-model-is-not-ready","content":"*engine* **needs** *torch*… with the install command","locale":"en"},"13449":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-26","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#when-the-model-is-not-ready","content":"The engine is not available: torch, or a licence-gated engine's package, is not installed. Install it into Mizuoto's Python, then restart Mizuoto","locale":"en"},"13450":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-27","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#when-the-model-is-not-ready","content":"**Download** *model* *(size)*","locale":"en"},"13451":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-28","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#when-the-model-is-not-ready","content":"The model is not downloaded","locale":"en"},"13452":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-29","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#when-the-model-is-not-ready","content":"When all is done the **Speak** button is back.","locale":"en"},"13453":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-30","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#voice","content":"Models get their voice in different ways; **Voice** offers the ones the model supports:","locale":"en"},"13454":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-31","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#voice","content":"Way","locale":"en"},"13455":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-32","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#voice","content":"Use","locale":"en"},"13456":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-33","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#voice","content":"**Library voice**","locale":"en"},"13457":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-34","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#voice","content":"A voice from the voice library","locale":"en"},"13458":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-35","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#voice","content":"**A clip**","locale":"en"},"13459":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-36","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#voice","content":"Upload or record a reference clip and clone its voice","locale":"en"},"13460":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-37","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#voice","content":"**Preset speaker**","locale":"en"},"13461":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-38","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#voice","content":"One of the model's own speakers (Qwen3-TTS CustomVoice, CosyVoice 300M SFT…)","locale":"en"},"13462":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-39","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#voice","content":"**Describe**","locale":"en"},"13463":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-40","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#voice","content":"A description in words (Qwen3-TTS VoiceDesign, VoxCPM2), or choices from fixed attributes (OmniVoice)","locale":"en"},"13464":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-41","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#voice","content":"**Its own voice**","locale":"en"},"13465":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-42","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#voice","content":"No voice given: the model speaks in its own voice","locale":"en"},"13466":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-43","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#voice","content":"After a model change the screen picks a suitable way: the library voice you had chosen when it suits the new model, else a preset speaker, a description or a clip, in that order.","locale":"en"},"13467":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-44","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#library-voice","content":"Every voice in the picker carries badges saying how **this model** can use it: **Clone**, **Clone (no transcript)**, **Preset speaker**, **Designed** and so on; and when more is needed, **transcribed first** (the clip has no transcript, so it is transcribed before speaking) or **trimmed to fit** (the clip is too long and will be cut). Voices the model cannot use are greyed, with the reason. With an empty library, **New voice** is offered.","locale":"en"},"13468":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-45","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#a-clip","content":"Drop audio on **Drop audio files here**, or click it to choose a file (WAV, FLAC, MP3, M4A, OGG…). Or:","locale":"en"},"13469":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-46","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#a-clip","content":"**Record** with the microphone. While recording it shows the **Input level** and **A voice reference works best between 3 and 30 seconds of clear speech.**; then **Stop and add** or **Discard**. Browsers allow the microphone only over HTTPS or on this computer (localhost).","locale":"en"},"13470":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-47","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#a-clip","content":"**Server files** picks a file on the server (only in a browser on the server machine).","locale":"en"},"13471":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-48","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#a-clip","content":"**Earlier results** picks a synthesized result.","locale":"en"},"13472":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-49","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#a-clip","content":"Type the clip's text under **What is said in the clip**. **Transcribe** has speech recognition fill it in now, for you to correct.","locale":"en"},"13473":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-50","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#transcripts-and-speech-recognition","content":"Most models need the reference clip's text to clone it. When you leave it empty:","locale":"en"},"13474":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-51","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#transcripts-and-speech-recognition","content":"With **Settings › Speech › Transcribe reference clips without a transcript** on and speech recognition installed, Mizuoto looks in its transcript cache, else transcribes the clip first in the speak job (the plan says **transcribed first**). A library voice keeps the transcript it gets.","locale":"en"},"13475":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-52","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#transcripts-and-speech-recognition","content":"Without speech recognition, a model that clones without a transcript does so (**Clone (no transcript)**); otherwise you get an error saying how to install speech recognition.","locale":"en"},"13476":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-53","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#transcripts-and-speech-recognition","content":"A clip longer than the model allows follows **Settings › Speech › A reference clip too long for a model**: by default **Cut it to fit** (at the quietest point before the limit; its transcript is then dropped), or **Refuse it**.","locale":"en"},"13477":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-54","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#text","content":"The **Text** box takes up to 20,000 characters. Ctrl+Enter in it speaks.","locale":"en"},"13478":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-55","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#text","content":"**Language**: **Detect**, or one of the model's languages.","locale":"en"},"13479":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-56","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#text","content":"**One result per line**: only for models that take batches (Qwen3-TTS, GPT-SoVITS, OmniVoice); each line becomes its own result.","locale":"en"},"13480":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-57","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#text","content":"A moment after you stop typing, the box shows how Mizuoto will cut long text (**N segments**, one chip each), or **The engine splits long text itself** when the model handles long text. The parameter **Pause between segments (ms)** sets the silence between segments.","locale":"en"},"13481":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-58","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#style","content":"Shown only when the model takes instructions or emotions.","locale":"en"},"13482":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-59","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#style","content":"**How to say it**: a style instruction such as \"Cheerfully, a little faster\" (Qwen3-TTS 1.7B CustomVoice, CosyVoice 2 and 3, CosyVoice 300M Instruct).","locale":"en"},"13483":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-60","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#style","content":"Emotion (IndexTTS-2 and 2.5) comes three ways, as the model supports:","locale":"en"},"13484":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-61","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#style","content":"**Emotion weights**: a 0–1 slider per emotion (**Happy**, **Angry**, **Sad**, **Afraid**, **Disgusted**, **Melancholic**, **Surprised**, **Calm**).","locale":"en"},"13485":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-62","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#style","content":"**From a clip**: an **Emotion clip**; only the clip's emotion is borrowed, not its voice; **Strength** 0–2.","locale":"en"},"13486":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-63","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#style","content":"**Described**: write it under **The emotion, described**.","locale":"en"},"13487":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-64","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#parameters","content":"**Parameters** lists only what this model takes; a value you leave alone is not sent, so the engine uses its own default. The engine's own options are under **Engine options**.","locale":"en"},"13488":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-65","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#parameters","content":"**Seed**: empty means **A new seed each time**; a number means **Keep this seed**, so the same input gives the same result. The dice button is **Roll a seed**; the unlock button goes back to a new seed each time.","locale":"en"},"13489":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-66","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#parameters","content":"**Output**: **Format** (WAV, FLAC, MP3, OGG, M4A), **Sample rate** (**The model’s own**, or 16–48 kHz) and **Levelling** (**Peak**, **Loudness**, **None**). The defaults come from **Settings › Speech**.","locale":"en"},"13490":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-67","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#presets","content":"**Presets** opens a menu:","locale":"en"},"13491":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-68","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#presets","content":"Click a preset to apply it (marked **default** or **every model**).","locale":"en"},"13492":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-69","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#presets","content":"**Save as a preset…**: a **Preset name**; with **Only for** *model* checked it keeps every parameter, otherwise only the common parameters, for every model (a preset holding engine options is for the current model only). **Apply it whenever this model is picked** makes it the model's default.","locale":"en"},"13493":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-70","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#presets","content":"**Manage presets…**: **Make it the default**, **Stop it being the default**, delete.","locale":"en"},"13494":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-71","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#presets","content":"When a model is picked, its default preset is applied; the chosen voice's own default preset comes first.","locale":"en"},"13495":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-72","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#plan-speak-and-stream","content":"**Plan** shows **What will happen** without speaking: the model, the voice mode, language, device, the number of segments, the parameters sent, each reference clip (and whether it is **transcribed first**) and **Notes**. Unsuitable settings fail here already.","locale":"en"},"13496":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-73","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#plan-speak-and-stream","content":"**Speak** submits a speak job. Its card shows at the bottom of the page; when it is done the result appears under **Results**. Several jobs fold into one line, **… jobs**, saying how many run and how many wait (**… running · … waiting**), with their progress together and a button that cancels them all; open it to see each job's card in a list that scrolls. Synthesis jobs run one at a time by default, across all engines and devices; the others wait in order, showing **Waiting for other synthesis jobs** (**Settings › Compute › Synthesis jobs at once**).","locale":"en"},"13497":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-74","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#plan-speak-and-stream","content":"**Stream**: with this switch (beside **Plan** and **Speak**) on, **Speak** plays the audio as it is made. Hover over it to see how this model streams: CosyVoice starts within moments of the first words; the other engines play each sentence as soon as it is ready; or Mizuoto splits the text and plays each part as soon as it is ready. The player bar shows **… played · … ready ahead** and offers **Stop**. When the model falls behind, playback pauses and waits rather than dropping speech; the whole result is still kept under **Results**.","locale":"en"},"13498":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-75","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#results","content":"**Results** lists what you spoke on this screen. Each shows its text, duration, waveform (click to seek), model, time taken, real-time factor (RTF) and seed, with any warnings and licence notices. Its menu:","locale":"en"},"13499":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-76","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#results","content":"Action","locale":"en"},"13500":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-77","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#results","content":"What it does","locale":"en"},"13501":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-78","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#results","content":"**Favourite** / **Not a favourite**","locale":"en"},"13502":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-79","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#results","content":"History can show favourites only","locale":"en"},"13503":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-80","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#results","content":"**Download**","locale":"en"},"13504":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-81","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#results","content":"Download the file","locale":"en"},"13505":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-82","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#results","content":"**Show in folder**","locale":"en"},"13506":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-83","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#results","content":"Only in a browser on the server machine","locale":"en"},"13507":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-84","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#results","content":"**Use as a reference clip**","locale":"en"},"13508":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-85","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#results","content":"Use this result as **A clip**, with its text as the transcript","locale":"en"},"13509":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-86","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#results","content":"**Keep as a voice**","locale":"en"},"13510":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-87","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#results","content":"Type the **Name of the new voice** to put it in the library","locale":"en"},"13511":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-88","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#results","content":"**Run again with these settings**","locale":"en"},"13512":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-89","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#results","content":"Load the model, voice, text and parameters that made it back into Speak","locale":"en"},"13513":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-90","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#results","content":"**Delete**","locale":"en"},"13514":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-91","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#results","content":"Delete the result","locale":"en"},"13515":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-92","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#results","content":"With more than one result, **Download all** downloads them together.","locale":"en"},"13516":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-speak-93","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-speak#command-line","content":"`mizuoto speak --help` lists every option (`--describe`, `--attr`, `--emotion-audio`, `--batch`, `--use-preset` and more); see the command reference.","locale":"en"},"13517":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","type":"page","content":"Tools","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto Documentation","Guides"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/guide-tools","locale":"en"},"13518":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-0","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-tools","content":"The Tools screen: say a recording in another voice with CosyVoice, and replace words in a recording with F5-TTS.","locale":"en"},"13519":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-1","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/guide-tools#convert-voice","content":"Convert voice","locale":"en"},"13520":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-2","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/guide-tools#edit-speech","content":"Edit speech","locale":"en"},"13521":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-3","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-tools","content":"**Tools** has two tabs: **Convert voice** and **Edit speech**. Both start from an existing recording; their results appear under **Results** at the bottom of the page (and in History), with the same menu as in Speak.","locale":"en"},"13522":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-4","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-tools#convert-voice","content":"**Say what a recording says in another voice, keeping its words and timing.** It needs a model with voice conversion: CosyVoice (300M, 300M SFT, 2, 3).","locale":"en"},"13523":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-5","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-tools#convert-voice","content":"Choose a CosyVoice model under **Model**. The picker lists only models that convert voices; when the model is not ready, the button at the bottom offers the step it still needs first, such as the download (see Speak).","locale":"en"},"13524":{"id":"/