ine, never on a remote host; when an engine's device is on a remote host, its methods are not available. A fine-tune takes its device for itself while it runs. Choose the device under **Settings › Training › Training device**; by default it is **The engine’s device**.","locale":"en"},"13597":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-54","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#a-new-dataset","content":"On the **Datasets** tab, click **New dataset**.","locale":"en"},"13598":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-55","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#a-new-dataset","content":"Type the **Dataset name**, choose the **Language**, and optionally a **Description**.","locale":"en"},"13599":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-56","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#a-new-dataset","content":"Click **Create**; the dataset's page opens.","locale":"en"},"13600":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-57","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#a-new-dataset","content":"A dataset is saved in `datasets/<name>/` in the data folder: `dataset.json`, `manifest.jsonl` with one row per clip, and FLAC clips in `audio/`.","locale":"en"},"13601":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-58","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#adding-clips","content":"The **Add clips** part of a dataset's page offers several sources:","locale":"en"},"13602":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-59","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#adding-clips","content":"**Audio files or recordings**: drop or choose files, **Record**, or **Server files**. Optionally say who speaks in them under **Speaker**, then click **Add (N)**.","locale":"en"},"13603":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-train-60","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-train","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-train#adding-clips","content":"**A voice’s 