nnot reach gpu-box at …\", with a hint to check that the agent runs"],[1450,"\"Cannot reach gpu-box at …\"，提示检查 agent 是否在运行"],[8469,"\"gpu-box refused: The agent refused the token\", with a hint to `mizuoto remote add` again with the right token"],[1453,"\"gpu-box refused: The agent refused the token\"，提示用正确的令牌重新 `mizuoto remote add`"],[1462,"\"No remote host 'x'\"，先 `mizuoto remote add`"],[8478,"\"No remote host 'x'\": `mizuoto remote add` it first"],[11861,"\"The same\" is judged in tiers. The lower tiers are checked bit for bit; the upper ones judge the whole stack:"],[12125,"\"Views import components only from `@/ui`\" is a convention; no test enforces it yet."],[4845,"“相同”分层判断。低层级逐比特检查，高层级判断整条链路："],[5832,"“相同”指什么"],[5109,"\"视图只从 `@/ui` 导入组件\"是约定，目前没有测试强制。"],[7358,"(final)"],[13733,"(For voices from a clip and trained voices.) A voice can carry its own fine-tuned weights for an engine; today that is GPT-SoVITS: a GPT `.ckpt` and a SoVITS `.pth`."],[13728,"(Not for preset voices.) One row per clip: a play button, the waveform, its length and sample rate, and:"],[342,"（最终镜像）"],[6718,"（来自音频和训练类的音色才有。）一个音色可以带有某个引擎的专属微调权重，目前是 GPT-SoVITS：一个 GPT 的 `.ckpt` 和一个 SoVITS 的 `.pth`。"],[6713,"（预置音色没有这一部分。）每段音频一行：播放按钮、波形、时长与采样率，以及："],[10755,"**`[[assets]]`**: files several models of an engine share (GPT-SoVITS's encoders and text front-end data, IndexTTS-2's w2v-BERT…), described like models, installed in `<models>/_assets/<engine>/<name>/`. A model names the ones it needs in `assets`; the engine gets their folders as `spec.options[\"assets\"]` (asset id → folder)."],[3739,"**`[[assets]]`**：一个引擎的多个模型共用的文件（GPT-SoVITS 的编码器和文本前端数据、IndexTTS-2 的 w2v-BERT 等），写法同模型，安装在 `<models>/_assets/<engine>/<name>/`。模型在 `assets` 里写明需要哪些；引擎通过 `spec.options[\"assets\"]`（资源 id → 目录）拿到它们的目录。"],[10756,"**`[licence]`**: with `gated = true`, downloading the weights and assets and synthesis need `engines.<id>.accepted_licence == id@version`; `file` names the full text in `manifests/licences/`; `trains_others = false` refuses the outputs as training data for other engines; `notice` shows under results; `commercial` tags outputs."],[3740,"**`[licence]`**：`gated = true` 时，下载权重和共享资源、合成都要求 `engines.<id>.accepted_licence == id@version`；`file` 指向 `manifests/licences/` 里的全文；`trains_others = false` 拒绝把它的输出用作其他引擎的训练数据；`notice` 显示在结果下方；`commercial` 用于给输出打标签。"],[10757,"**`[training.<id>]`**: training methods, run by the engine's `TRAINER`; see Trainers."],[3741,"**`[training.<id>]`**：训练方法，由引擎的 `TRAINER` 运行；见训练器。"],[11611,"**`accel/`**: every attention computation in native code is `accel.attention(q, k, v, *, site=SITE, mask=…, causal=…, scale=…, enable_gqa=…, dropout_p=…, mask_info=…)`, never a direct call to SDPA (an architecture test forbids that outside `runtime/accel`). Each `Site` holds its **reference**, the exact computation upstream made there; with `compute.attention = auto` (the default) the reference runs, bit for bit. Another setting binds a policy that chooses among SDPA's kernels, FlashAttention, xFormers and SageAttention per call, with compatibility checks and fallbacks; `features.apply` sets the host's `compute.fast` switches, the one place native code sets `torch.backends` flags. See Acceleration."],[4595,"**`accel/`**：原生代码中的每一次注意力计算都写作 `accel.attention(q, k, v, *, site=SITE, mask=…, causal=…, scale=…, enable_gqa=…, dropout_p=…, mask_info=…)`，从不直接调用 SDPA（架构测试禁止在 `runtime/accel` 之外这样做）。每个 `Site` 保存它的**参照计算**，即上游在该处的精确计算；`compute.attention = auto`（默认）时运行参照计算，结果逐位相同。其他取值会绑定一个策略，按调用在 SDPA 的各内核、FlashAttention、xFormers 和 SageAttention 之间选择，带兼容性检查和回退；`features.apply` 设置主机的 `compute.fast` 开关，也是原生代码中唯一设置 `torch.backends` 标志的地方。见加速。"],[12180,"**`AGENTS.md`** (repository root; `CLAUDE.md` points to it): the short working record for contributors and coding\nagents: a map of the code, the rules that must not break, the workflow, and which page covers what."],[5164,"**`AGENTS.md`**（仓库根目录，`CLAUDE.md` 指向它）：给贡献者和编码代理的简短工作记录：代码地图、不能破坏的规则、工作流程，\n以及哪一页讲什么。"],[9763,"**`auto` binds nothing**: `attention()` reads one context variable, finds no policy and calls the site's reference (about 1 µs a call)."],[2747,"**`auto` 什么都不绑定**：`attention()` 读一次上下文变量，发现没有策略，就调用该调用点的参照计算（每次约 1 微秒）。"],[11617,"**`compile.py`**: `Compiled` / `compile_module(module, enabled, name)` wrap one hot module in `torch.compile(dynamic=True)` when `compute.compile` is on; engines call `compiled or module`, and any compiler error falls back to eager. See `torch.compile`."],[4601,"**`compile.py`**：`compute.compile` 打开时，`Compiled` / `compile_module(module, enabled, name)` 把一个热点模块包进 `torch.compile(dynamic=True)`；引擎调用 `compiled or module`，编译器出错时改为即时执行。见 `torch.compile`。"],[12828,"**`compute.compile`** wraps the local DiT. On the CPU in bf16 it gains nothing, and its float differences can move where the speech ends (VoxCPM-0.5B: 56 320 against 55 040 samples); off by default."],[5812,"**`compute.compile`** 包装局部 DiT。在 CPU 上以 bf16 运行时没有收益，而且它的浮点差异可能改变语音结束的位置（VoxCPM-0.5B：56 320 对 55 040 个采样）；默认关闭。"],[11616,"**`convert/onnx.py`**: an ONNX graph's nodes and tensors read from the protobuf wire format, without the onnx package (CosyVoice's speech tokenizers and CAM++, GPT-SoVITS's G2PW)."],[4600,"**`convert/onnx.py`**：直接从 protobuf 线格式读出 ONNX 图的节点和张量，不需要 onnx 包（CosyVoice 的语音分词器和 CAM++、GPT-SoVITS 的 G2PW 用到）。"],[10137,"**`core/inference` is the one door**, so the core's knowledge of model code sits in one package, and every import of it is visibly lazy."],[3121,"**`core/inference` 是唯一的入口**，于是核心对模型代码的了解集中在一个包里，而且每处导入都一眼可见是延迟的。"],[10905,"**`ctx.run(name, handles, fn, memory, generators=(), fallback=None)`** is the same around a pure function and adds the exact retry and the fallback (below). Use it wherever the block's only effect is its result."],[3889,"**`ctx.run(name, handles, fn, memory, generators=(), fallback=None)`** 对一个纯函数做同样的事，另加精确重试和回退（见下文）。凡是代码块唯一的作用就是其返回值的地方都用它。"],[10904,"**`ctx.use(handles, memory)`** is a context manager: the manager loads `handles` (whole or partly) with room for `memory` bytes of working memory and keeps them from giving up memory until the block ends. Use it for a phase that yields audio or consumes a generator."],[3888,"**`ctx.use(handles, memory)`** 是一个上下文管理器：管理器把 `handles`（整体或部分）放到设备上，为 `memory` 字节的工作显存留出空间，并在代码块结束前不让它们让出显存。用于产出音频或消费生成器的阶段。"],[9891,"**`DecoderSteps`**: `LayerSteps` for a `QwenDecoder`."],[2875,"**`DecoderSteps`**：用于 `QwenDecoder` 的 `LayerSteps`。"],[12142,"**`EngineCard`** shows **Available** or **Not available** with the missing packages, and a doctor panel with the findings for that engine (torch, extras, training)."],[5126,"**`EngineCard`** 显示**可用**或**不可用**以及缺少的包，并有一个 doctor 面板，列出该引擎的检查结果（torch、附加依赖、训练）。"],[11615,"**`graphs.py`**: `Graphs`, `LayerSteps`, `DecoderSteps`: decoding steps captured as CUDA graphs that replay the eager kernels (`compute.cuda_graphs`), see CUDA graphs."],[4599,"**`graphs.py`**：`Graphs`、`LayerSteps`、`DecoderSteps`：把解码步骤捕获为 CUDA Graph，重放即时执行的内核（`compute.cuda_graphs`），见 CUDA Graph。"],[9885,"**`Graphs`**: the graphs of one model on one device, with their own stream and generator."],[2869,"**`Graphs`**：一个模型在一个设备上的图，带有自己的流和生成器。"],[9890,"**`LayerSteps`**: a layer stack's one-token step as one graph per stretch between two attention calls, given each layer's `before`, `attend` and `after`. Attention runs eagerly between the graphs, over keys whose length grows each step, so the cache and the attention kernel are the eager code's; norms, projections, rotary embeddings and MLPs are replayed."],[2874,"**`LayerSteps`**：把一个层栈的单 token 步骤按两次注意力调用之间的每一段捕获为一个图，由每层的 `before`、`attend`、`after` 给出。注意力在图之间即时执行，作用于每步变长的键上，所以缓存和注意力内核都与即时执行相同；归一化、投影、旋转位置编码和 MLP 被重放。"],[11614,"**`lm/`**: `QwenDecoder` (the Qwen2/Qwen3 decoder with transformers' numerics and parameter names, `mask_for`, `hf_sdpa`), `DynamicCache`, the opt-in `BufferCache` (`compute.kv_cache = static`) and `peak_bytes` for working-memory estimates."],[4598,"**`lm/`**：`QwenDecoder`（带 transformers 数值行为和参数名的 Qwen2/Qwen3 解码器，以及 `mask_for`、`hf_sdpa`）、`DynamicCache`、需主动开启的 `BufferCache`（`compute.kv_cache = static`），以及用于工作显存估算的 `peak_bytes`。"],[11612,"**`loading.py`**: `load_state_dict` (safetensors, or a pickle with `weights_only=True`), `strip_prefix`, `replace_prefixes`, `fold_weight_norm`, and `load_into`, strict by default: a missing or unexpected key is an error naming it, unless the engine lists it as ignorable."],[4596,"**`loading.py`**：`load_state_dict`（safetensors，或以 `weights_only=True` 读取的 pickle）、`strip_prefix`、`replace_prefixes`、`fold_weight_norm`，以及默认严格的 `load_into`：缺少或多出的键都是错误，并写明是哪个键，除非引擎把它列为可忽略。"],[12141,"**`ModelGate`** (`components/ModelGate.vue`) replaces Speak's main button with the one action a model still needs, checked in this order: enable the engine, accept its licence, install what is missing, download the model. For a missing package it shows the command: the doctor's `install_command` for torch (the build for this machine), else `pip install <package>`; for an engine on a remote host it says the host lacks it."],[5125,"**`ModelGate`**（`components/ModelGate.vue`）把合成页的主按钮换成模型还差的那一个操作，按以下顺序检查：启用引擎、接受许可、安装缺少的包、下载模型。缺包时显示命令：torch 用 doctor 给出的 `install_command`（适合本机的构建），其他包用 `pip install <包名>`；引擎在远程主机上时，提示那台主机缺这个包。"],[12143,"**`ModelsView`** marks each engine group whose engine is unavailable and says what it needs."],[5127,"**`ModelsView`** 标出引擎不可用的分组，并写明它需要什么。"],[9917,"**`multinomial_draws(probs, n, generator)`**: the draw of several without replacement, `topk(p / Exp(1), n)` (IndexTTS's beams)."],[2901,"**`multinomial_draws(probs, n, generator)`**：不放回地抽取多个，`topk(p / Exp(1), n)`（IndexTTS 的 beam）。"],[9916,"**`multinomial1(probs, generator)`** is `torch.multinomial`'s own one-sample computation, `argmax(p / Exp(1))`, without its two validity checks (each a wait). The same ids and generator state on the CPU and CUDA; elsewhere it calls `torch.multinomial`. NaN probabilities are flagged in a tensor (`invalid`) the caller reads at its one wait, and raise `torch.multinomial`'s error then."],[2900,"**`multinomial1(probs, generator)`** 就是 `torch.multinomial` 自己的单样本算法 `argmax(p / Exp(1))`，只是去掉了它的两次合法性检查（每次都要等待设备）。在 CPU 和 CUDA 上得到同样的 id 和生成器状态；其他设备上调用 `torch.multinomial`。含 NaN 的概率记在一个张量里（`invalid`），调用方在那唯一一次等待时读取，届时抛出 `torch.multinomial` 的错误。"],[11610,"**`ops.py`**: every engine builds its modules from an `ops` namespace instead of `torch.nn`. `ops.default` has the same layers with **no random initialisation**: constructing a large model takes no time and draws no random numbers, so loading never touches an RNG. `ops.cast` also casts weights to the input's dtype and device on every forward, for a component stored in one dtype and computed in another. `init_random(module, generator)` gives a `default` module real weights in tests."],[4594,"**`ops.py`**：每个引擎都用 `ops` 命名空间而不是 `torch.nn` 来搭建模块。`ops.default` 里是同样的层，但**不做随机初始化**：构造一个大模型不花时间，也不抽随机数，所以加载永远不会碰到任何随机数生成器。`ops.cast` 还会在每次前向时把权重转换成输入的精度和设备，用于以一种精度存储、以另一种精度计算的组件。`init_random(module, generator)` 在测试里给 `default` 模块填上真正的权重。"],[11618,"**`policy.py`, `units.py`, `stream.py`**: the VRAM policy, a model's streamable units, and the per-device `Streamer` (Memory)."],[4602,"**`policy.py`、`units.py`、`stream.py`**：显存策略、模型可流式加载的单元，以及每个设备一个的 `Streamer`（显存与内存）。"],[11613,"**`sampling.py`**: `hf_sample` / `hf_process`, transformers' logits processors in transformers' order (repetition penalty, min new tokens, suppression, temperature, top-k, top-p), then `multinomial1`, `torch.multinomial`'s own computation on the request's generator without its waits for the device, so a seeded draw matches (sync-free sampling)."],[4597,"**`sampling.py`**：`hf_sample` / `hf_process`，按 transformers 的顺序执行它的 logits 处理器（重复惩罚、最少新 token、屏蔽、温度、top-k、top-p），然后是 `multinomial1`：在请求的生成器上执行 `torch.multinomial` 自己的算法，但不等待设备，所以带种子的抽样结果一致（无同步采样）。"],[12144,"**`SettingsView`** shows the torch check under **Compute** (the doctor's `torch` finding): the installed version and build, and the command that installs the recommended build when they differ."],[5128,"**`SettingsView`** 在 **计算** 中显示 torch 的检查结果（doctor 的 `torch` 一项）：已安装的版本和构建，以及两者不符时安装推荐构建的命令。"],[9892,"**`signature(modules)`**: where the weights are. Graphs hold their addresses, so they are only for a model wholly on its device (no streamed units) and are dropped when its weights move."],[2876,"**`signature(modules)`**：权重所在的地址。图持有这些地址，所以只用于整个放在设备上的模型（没有流式单元），权重移动后丢弃。"],[11619,"**`snapshot.py`**: `snapshot()` digests the process-wide state an engine call must leave alone; the contract suite compares it before and after requests."],[4603,"**`snapshot.py`**：`snapshot()` 对引擎调用必须保持不变的进程级状态做摘要；契约套件在请求前后比较它。"],[5319,"**0.1 缺少的规范化。** 上游前端在运行时下载 FST；在 0.1 的 worker 中下载失败，上游便静默跳过了规范化。现在 FST 是共享资源，带数字的中文文本会读出数字，因此这类文本听起来与 0.1 不同。"],[11316,"**0.89 s**"],[11326,"**0.89 s**"],[4300,"**0.89 秒**"],[4310,"**0.89 秒**"],[11305,"**1.87 s (RTF 0.29)**"],[4289,"**1.87 秒（RTF 0.29）**"],[4275,"**10.3**"],[11291,"**10.3**"],[11321,"**2.29 s**"],[4305,"**2.29 秒**"],[11301,"**2.36 s (RTF 0.34)**"],[4285,"**2.36 秒（RTF 0.34）**"],[5601,"**2.5 的文本**：zh、en、ja、es 以外的语言（以及未指定语言）以 `zhen` 发送，与上游相同。上游同样没有 NeMo 的日语和西班牙语规范化，所以这类文本原样通过；日语需要 fugashi（`mizuoto-indextts[ja]`）。"],[12617,"**2.5's text**: a language other than zh, en, ja or es (and an unset one) is sent as `zhen`, as upstream does. NeMo's Japanese and Spanish normalisation is absent upstream too, so that text passes unchanged; Japanese needs fugashi (`mizuoto-indextts[ja]`)."],[4229,"**20.9**"],[4230,"**20.9**"],[11245,"**20.9**"],[11246,"**20.9**"],[4213,"**24.6**"],[11229,"**24.6**"],[4214,"**25.4**"],[11230,"**25.4**"],[11331,"**3.14 s**"],[4315,"**3.14 秒**"],[4261,"**38.1**"],[11277,"**38.1**"],[4260,"**38.9**"],[11276,"**38.9**"],[5232,"**5 束。** 流水线的默认生成配置（`num_beams=5`）优先于模型的贪心默认值，所以无论 `beam_size` 怎么设，0.1 总是用 5 束解码；选项 `beam_size` 为 1 时保持这 5 束，更大的值则设定束数。束搜索是 transformers 4.57 向量化的 `_beam_search`（先 log-softmax，再经处理器，`2 × beams` 个候选）。"],[4329,"**5.9**"],[11345,"**5.9**"],[4330,"**5.95**"],[11346,"**5.95**"],[4274,"**9.9**"],[11290,"**9.9**"],[10462,"**A change in behaviour changes the documentation**: what users see goes into the guide, command-line or advanced pages, what developers need into the development pages."],[11479,"**A change to a gated engine's options** changes its manifest in `mizuoto` too: release Mizuoto with the manifest, then the package with its lower bound raised to that release."],[10459,"**A change to an engine or trainer**: update its tiny-model tests in `tests/engines_native/` (including the streaming check on a simulated device), run the contract suite with real models, and compare with upstream through the parity harness."],[13458,"**A clip**"],[13527,"**A clip**: a clip of the target voice, given directly."],[12449,"**A codec module upstream never runs is not built.** Upstream's codec builds a transformer for the decoder's first block but never attaches it (no weights, never run). `codec.pth` also holds RoPE tables and masks an older upstream saved, which upstream no longer loads; they are ignored."],[13363,"**A reference clip too long for a model**"],[12346,"**A validation pass** on the training list ends each epoch, as in upstream, and it draws too (Qwen2LM's bistream choice, the flow's streaming choice, conditions and noise). Its losses are logged, not metrics."],[13603,"**A voice’s clips**: choose a library voice and click **Add** to add its reference clips and their text."],[10249,"**A voice's own weights** (`Voice.weights[engine]`): an engine whose manifest has `[weights]` roles (GPT-SoVITS's `gpt` and `sovits`) can carry a fine-tune of the voice, kept in `weights/<engine>/` and exported and imported with the voice; its version comes from the files, and it is used when it equals the variant's `weights_version`."],[9464,"**Accept the licence**"],[13446,"**Accept the** *engine* **licence**"],[12450,"**Accepted, with no effect**: `normalize` and `repetition_penalty` reach nothing in upstream's inference path, so they do nothing here either."],[13312,"**Access token**"],[13538,"**Add a change** adds a row; the button at the end of a row removes it. Only rows with a start and an end, the end after the start, are sent."],[13339,"**Add a host**: a **Name** (engines name it in their device: `name/cuda:0`), the **Address** (such as `192.168.1.20:7870`), the **Token** (the agent prints it when it makes one), **TLS** and a **CA file on this machine** when needed; then **Add**."],[13207,"**Add a line** at the end of the chapter appends a line. A line that failed shows why beneath it."],[13605,"**Add a server folder** (only in a browser on the server machine): choose the **Folder layout**, then the folder:"],[13229,"**Add a speaker** adds one. The project's own language is set under **Project** on the same tab (**Language**; **Each model decides** leaves it to each model), or with `mizuoto project set --lang`."],[13197,"**Add a style instruction**"],[12010,"**Adding.** Clips come from files (a `.lab` or `.txt` beside one is its text), uploads, a voice's references, earlier outputs (their licence tags kept), or a folder in a known layout (GPT-SoVITS `.list`, LJSpeech, CSV, plain)."],[11121,"**Allocation**: every layer allocates and frees tensors of a few to tens of megabytes, and with glibc's defaults each is mapped fresh and its pages zeroed by the kernel."],[9595,"**Any path works.** The web UI reads server files only inside **Folders the browser may open** (`paths.browse_roots`); `--ref`, `model import`, `dataset import` and the like take any path on this machine."],[13174,"**as new chapters**"],[13420,"**As the system** or **Reduced**; **Preview** plays an animation"],[12736,"**Attention as transformers called it** (`hf_sdpa`): without a mask, SDPA with `enable_gqa` and `is_causal` for multi-token queries; with one, the KV heads repeated. The cache grows by concatenation, as `DynamicCache` does."],[9492,"**Attention for this engine** on the engine's card"],[10429,"**Attention goes through `accel.attention(q, k, v, site=…)`**, never SDPA or its aten kernels directly, so `compute.attention` can switch the backend (see Attention acceleration)."],[11810,"**Attention.** Every `mask_info` an attention site passes is checked against its dense mask. `MIZUOTO_TEST_ACCEL=count python -m pytest tests/engines_native packages/native` also routes every attention call through a policy that counts its site and computes the site's own reference; it fails at the end when a site the engines have was never reached that way (a direct SDPA call that bypasses `compute.attention`). Each conftest lists its folder's sites (`SITES_TESTED`); the checks themselves are in `tests/engines_native/accel_checks.py`."],[12816,"**Attention** is SDPA with `enable_gqa` on contiguous tensors: causal for the prefill, bidirectional in the local modules, and per step against the static cache under an explicit boolean mask. Upstream attends over all of the cache's positions (zeros beyond the current length, masked); Mizuoto attends over the cache's first multiple of 256 past the current length (`minicpm.ATTEND_BLOCK`), mask kept. The masked positions only add exact zeros, and SDPA gives the same bits for any cut at a multiple of 64 (checked at every position up to 3100, bf16 and fp32, on the CPU), so the result is identical and VoxCPM2 runs 1.5 times as fast on the CPU."],[12251,"**Attention**: the query projected then scaled by `head_dim ** -0.5`, SDPA with `scale=1` on contiguous q, k and v; the decoder causal without a mask for a multi-token prompt and unmasked per new token, its cache grown by concatenation."],[13610,"**Audio files (a .lab or .txt beside each)**"],[13602,"**Audio files or recordings**: drop or choose files, **Record**, or **Server files**. Optionally say who speaks in them under **Speaker**, then click **Add (N)**."],[10033,"**Audio files** go through `files.audio_response()`: `FileResponse` answers `Range`, so long files can be seeked. Streamed synthesis is in `streaming.py` (chunked WAV or bare PCM, the rate in `X-Mizuoto-Sample-Rate`, the job id in `X-Mizuoto-Job`)."],[13319,"**Automatic**"],[13380,"**Automatic**"],[13381,"**Automatic**, `fp32`, `fp16`, `bf16`"],[12818,"**Bad-case retry.** A non-streamed result with `retry_badcase_ratio_threshold` or more patches per text token is generated again with seed + 1, at most `retry_badcase_max_times` times; the patch cap is `min(tokens × ratio + 10, max_len)`. `applied.retries` counts the regenerations."],[12680,"**Batches by length** (`StreamLengthGroupDataset`, `PaddingDataCollator`'s 4-D mask), as the SDPA configurations do, not FlexAttention's packing."],[10843,"**Batches**: with `task.texts` set, every text in one batch, each yielded with `segment = task.segment + index`."],[10433,"**Be cancellable.** Call `ctx.check_cancel()` in every loop (autoregressive token, ODE step, segment, beam step). `Cancelled` derives from `BaseException`; never swallow it with a broad `except BaseException`."],[12612,"**Beam sampling**, upstream's legacy transformers path: the log-softmax through repetition penalty (over every id, the prompt's placeholder ids included), temperature, top-k and top-p (keeping at least two), the beams' scores added, `2 × num_beams` candidates drawn without replacement, `BeamSearchScorer`'s hypotheses."],[11889,"**Behaviour beyond the audio** is part of the comparison too, checked through the contract suite on both implementations: applied parameters and warnings, the voice-mode resolution (`fit`), streaming granularity and chunk counts, cancel behaviour, error codes for invalid inputs (a reference too long, an unsupported language, a missing transcript), output sample rates, segment joins."],[12590,"**BigVGAN v2** makes 22.05 kHz audio; segments are joined with silence, the tail faded and the result quantised to 16 bits, as upstream returns it."],[5574,"**BigVGAN v2** 生成 22.05 kHz 音频；各分段之间插入静音拼接，尾部淡出，结果量化为 16 位，与上游的返回值相同。"],[10507,"**Blocking work stays off the event loop.** Routes that touch the disk or the database are plain `def` (they run in the thread pool); events from job threads cross to the loop with `call_soon_threadsafe`."],[10461,"**Both languages.** Every page of this site has `<slug>.mdx` (Simplified Chinese, the default) and `<slug>.en.mdx` (English), section for section; the sidebars are `meta.json` and `meta.en.json`, in the same order. A test checks that every Chinese page has its English twin. The README comes in two (`README.md`, `README.zh-CN.md`), and the UI's text lives in `en.ts` and `zh-CN.ts`, whose keys must match."],[8397,"**Both machines run the same Mizuoto version.** Mizuoto 0.2 speaks agent protocol 2, at the level of a loaded engine (load, prepare a voice, synthesize, convert, edit). A host and an agent of different protocols refuse each other at the handshake, with the hint to install the same Mizuoto version on both machines."],[13088,"**Built in**"],[13260,"**By loudness**"],[13261,"**By loudness**, **By peak** or **As made**; applied when each line is rendered"],[10995,"**Calibration.** After each phase on CUDA or XPU, the manager measures its working memory: the peak above the placed weights, less the streamer's copies at their most and less what the phase keeps afterwards (CUDA graphs' pools, buffers kept with the model). When that exceeds the estimate, it remembers the ratio (times 1.1, at most 16) per phase, keyed by the engine and its components' names (`qwen3tts:talker`), and sets aside that much more next time. The ratios are kept in `<cache>/memory/calibration.json` (format version 2; a file of another version is ignored)."],[11659,"**Calls** (`LocalHandle.prepare_voice`, `synthesize`, `convert`, `edit`, `call`): each runs in the calling thread (a job's) inside `torch.inference_mode()`, with the context bound and the model's handles held by `manager.use(...)`. The seed is the task's `params[\"seed\"]`."],[10842,"**Cancel and progress**: `ctx.check_cancel()` at every decoding step, `ctx.progress(\"generating\", …)` after it."],[9654,"**Cancelling**: `mizuoto job cancel` reaches only jobs of its own process and reports `Job … is not running` for a job the server runs. Cancel those with **Cancel** in the web UI's **Jobs** panel, or `POST /api/v1/jobs/{job_id}/cancel`."],[7973,"**Capabilities** (all three variants): **Clone a voice**, **Speed**, **Duration**, **Long text**, **Seed**, **Streaming** (chunk by chunk), **Speech editing**. Cloning needs the clip's transcript: when it is missing, it is transcribed if `tts.auto_transcribe` is on and the speech recognition model is downloaded."],[8024,"**Capabilities**: **Clone a voice**, **Design from attributes**, **Its own voice**, **Inline tags**, **Pronunciation**, **Speed**, **Duration**, **Batches** (up to 8), **Long text**, **Seed**. Mizuoto always passes the clip's transcript when cloning (speech recognition fills it in when missing), so OmniVoice never loads Whisper itself."],[8068,"**Capabilities**: **Clone a voice**, **Several clips** (up to 4), **Inline tags**, **Dialogue**, **Streaming** (by segment), **Seed**. 44.1 kHz."],[8006,"**Capabilities**: **Clone a voice**, **Several clips** (up to 4), **Trained voices**, **Speed**, **Batches** (up to 20), **Long text**, **Streaming**, **Seed**; v2, v2Pro and v2ProPlus also **Clone without a transcript**."],[7893,"**Capabilities**: Base has **Clone a voice** and **Clone without a transcript**; CustomVoice has **Preset speakers** and **Instructions** (the 0.6B has no instructions: upstream drops them silently, so Mizuoto does not declare them); VoiceDesign has **Design from a description**. Every variant has **Batches** (up to 8) and **Seed**."],[8048,"**Capabilities**: VoxCPM2: **Clone a voice**, **Clone without a transcript**, **Design from a description**, **Instructions**, **Its own voice**, **Streaming** (one chunk per 40 ms patch), **Seed**. VoxCPM 1.5 and 0.5B: **Clone a voice** (the transcript is needed; speech recognition fills it in), **Its own voice**, **Streaming**, **Seed**."],[10425,"**Change no process-wide state.** Do not seed the global generators, change `os.environ`, the working directory or `sys.path`, call `logging.basicConfig`, `torch.set_default_dtype`, `torch.use_deterministic_algorithms` or `torch.set_float32_matmul_precision`, assign `torch.backends.*` or `torch._inductor.config`, or use `sdpa_kernel` (it switches SDPA's kernels for every thread). `compute.fast`'s switches are set only in `mizuoto/runtime/accel/features.py`, called by the host and the training stage."],[13212,"**Changed since its take**"],[13117,"**Changes apply when the model loads next (its models are unloaded now).** The setting **Compile models (torch.compile)** under **Settings › Compute** speeds up several engines at once. More in Performance."],[13183,"**Chapters** on the left lists the chapters, each with its rendered lines out of all; click one to open it. **Add a chapter** makes a new one. Above the lines are the **Chapter title** and a menu with **Move up**, **Move down** and **Delete the chapter** (its lines' takes are deleted too)."],[12012,"**Checking.** `check` gives a `DatasetReport`: a duration histogram, clips too short or too long, empty texts, clipping, sample rates and licence tags; rows can be filtered by the report's issues and excluded or deleted one by one."],[13382,"**Checkpoints kept per run**"],[13735,"**Choose the gpt file (.ckpt)** and **Choose the sovits file (.pth)**."],[12403,"**Chunks in order.** Upstream generates a long text's chunks on a thread pool that shares the global random generator, so its own output depends on thread timing; 0.1's adapter generated them in order, and so does Mizuoto."],[12399,"**Chunks** are cut as upstream cuts them, generated in order and joined with upstream's cross-fade; `duration` is spread over the chunks as upstream spreads it."],[5920,"**CI 中**：`tests/engines_native/` 让每个引擎和训练器在一个与其结构相同的小型随机模型上运行，并在模拟设备上分别以全部流式加载、一半流式加载和不流式加载权重运行，结果必须相同；`tests/runtime/test_dsp.py` 用夹具检查 DSP。"],[12347,"**Clipping order.** Parameters are clipped in upstream's order (`sft._ORDER`), since the total norm is summed in it; checkpoints keep upstream's key order, with Qwen's tied `lm_head` sharing the embedding's storage."],[12681,"**Clipping** sums the per-tensor norms in upstream's parameter order (the token embedding first)."],[13649,"**Clips** lists 50 clips a page; search their text or filter by an issue. Each clip has:"],[7942,"**Clone a voice**, **Clone without a transcript**, **Instructions**, **Voice conversion**, **Streaming**, **Streaming text**, **Speed**, **Inline tags**, **Long text**"],[8098,"**Clone a voice**, **Clone without a transcript**, **Pronunciation**, **Long text**"],[7933,"**Clone a voice**, **Clone without a transcript**, **Voice conversion**, **Streaming**, **Speed**, **Inline tags**, **Long text**"],[12827,"**Cloning with a transcript on VoxCPM2** uses the reference *and* the continuation, as upstream's web demo does (`reference_prefix`, on by default). Upstream's Python API adds the reference only when the caller passes `reference_wav_path`."],[8049,"**Cloning**: with the clip's transcript, VoxCPM2 is given the clip both as an isolated reference and as the start of the speech to continue, as upstream's demo does (the option **reference_prefix** off keeps only the continuation); without it, as the reference alone. VoxCPM 1.5 and 0.5B continue the clip."],[12094,"**Colour roles are used in pairs**: content on a `primary` container uses `on-primary`, on `surface-container` `on-surface`; the generated pairs guarantee contrast."],[13415,"**Colour**"],[12091,"**Colours come from the seed only.** The default seed is `#4f6b3a`; users pick any colour, contrast, light or dark (system, light, dark) and motion in Settings › Appearance. Preferences live in localStorage and are synced to the server through `/api/v1/client-state/{key}`. A small script in `index.html` reads them and sets `data-theme` before the bundle runs, so the first paint does not flash the wrong theme."],[10505,"**Commands go over REST; the socket only pushes.** socket.io sits at `/ws`, server to client only. REST is the truth, and events only patch or invalidate the client's query cache; a reconnect refetches, so missed events never leave the UI stale."],[13333,"**Compile models (torch.compile)**"],[12935,"**Component checks**: `scripts/parity/check_tokenizer.py` (the BPE against transformers' tokenizer), `scripts/parity/dsp_fixtures.py` (the DSP against torchaudio, librosa, Whisper and soxr, kept as `tests/fixtures/dsp/*.npz`), `scripts/parity/check_rng.py` (explicit generators against the seeded default stream), and per-engine module scripts such as `voxcpm_modules.py`."],[12838,"**Components**, every model in bf16 and fp32: the tokenizer and the normaliser on 420 texts, the VAE's latents and decoding; then whole requests in every mode (zero-shot and cloning in English and Chinese, reference only, continuation only, design, a cloned voice with an instruction, normalisation, a forced retry, streaming with and without a voice, chunk lengths included). All identical."],[9373,"**Compute** › **Acceleration**"],[9365,"**Compute** › **Attention**"],[9361,"**Compute** › **Compile models (torch.compile)**"],[9317,"**Compute** › **Copy streams**"],[9281,"**Compute** › **Default device**"],[9369,"**Compute** › **Fail instead of falling back**"],[9353,"**Compute** › **GPU jobs at once**"],[9293,"**Compute** › **GPU memory left free (MB)**"],[9297,"**Compute** › **How models use GPU memory**"],[9309,"**Compute** › **Keep a copy of GPU weights in RAM**"],[9289,"**Compute** › **Models kept in memory**"],[9313,"**Compute** › **Page-locked RAM for streamed weights**"],[9305,"**Compute** › **RAM left free**"],[9321,"**Compute** › **Retry a step that runs out of GPU memory**"],[9357,"**Compute** › **Synthesis jobs at once**"],[9325,"**Compute** › **Then allow cheaper ways**"],[9285,"**Compute** › **Unload models after idle minutes (0: never)**"],[9301,"**Compute** › **Use at most this much of each GPU**"],[13417,"**Contrast**"],[13762,"**Convert voice** and **Edit speech**"],[5315,"**CosyVoice 3 的声码器噪声**在上游构建模型时抽取一次，位于 flow 的种子 0 噪声以及 flow 和 F0 预测器的默认初始化之后。`cosyvoice3_noise` 在私有生成器上重放这些抽样，因此数值与上游相同，而那块 259 MB 的缓冲从不真正生成。它的 F0 预测器以 float64 运行，所以权重归一化也在 float64 中折叠。"],[12331,"**CosyVoice 3's vocoder noise** is drawn once when upstream builds the model, after the flow's seed-0 noise and the default initialisations of the flow and the F0 predictor. `cosyvoice3_noise` replays those draws on a private generator, so the values are upstream's and the 259 MB buffer is never materialised. Its F0 predictor runs in float64, so its weight norm is folded in float64."],[12913,"**CosyVoice** is compared with upstream running on torch 2.8, not on the torch 2.3.1 it was released with: upstream on 2.3.1 and upstream on 2.8 disagree with each other (sampling diverges; voice conversion matches to 62 dB), and Mizuoto needs torch 2.8 or newer."],[5897,"**CosyVoice** 对照的是运行在 torch 2.8 上的上游，而不是它发布时用的 torch 2.3.1：上游在 2.3.1 和 2.8 上彼此并不一致（抽样会分叉；音色转换只一致到 62 dB），而 Mizuoto 需要 torch 2.8 或更新版本。"],[4186,"**CPU 设置是怎样选定的。** 每种配置都在相互交错的独立进程中运行。同时固定 `mmap` 阈值并保留空闲堆内存对 F5-TTS 有帮助（预热中位数 64.0–68.6 秒 → 53.7–60.9 秒）；只改其中一项反而更慢；glibc 的 `hugetlb` 和 tcmalloc 都不比 torch 自己的大页更好。OmniVoice 看起来每个进程呈双峰（约 28 秒或 38 秒，与分配器无关）：原因是线程放置。默认放置的六个进程中有一个跑出 38.5 秒；线程绑定到核心的六个进程中没有一个这样（27.6–28.3 秒）。"],[11060,"**CPU**: AMD Ryzen 9 5900X (12 cores; torch uses 12 threads), 125 GB RAM, torch 2.8.0 with MKL 2024.2 and oneDNN 3.7.1, Python 3.11; fp32, except VoxCPM in bf16 (its upstream default). Other work on the machine takes about 9 % of its threads; a run whose compute thread is preempted stalls, so single runs vary by up to ±10 %."],[4044,"**CPU**：AMD Ryzen 9 5900X（12 核；torch 用 12 个线程），125 GB 内存，torch 2.8.0（MKL 2024.2、oneDNN 3.7.1），Python 3.11；fp32，VoxCPM 除外（bf16，其上游默认值）。机器上的其他工作约占 9 % 的线程；计算线程被抢占的运行会停顿，所以单次运行的波动可达 ±10 %。"],[13616,"**CSV (audio_file\\|text)**"],[6601,"**CSV（audio_file\\|text）**"],[9593,"**Ctrl+C cancels the job.** The job is marked **Cancelled**, the engine stops at its next check (the next token or step), a training stage's process is stopped, and the command exits with code 130."],[2577,"**Ctrl+C 取消任务。** 任务被标记为 **已取消**，引擎在下一次检查时停下（下一个 token 或下一步），训练阶段的进程被结束，命令以退出码 130 结束。"],[12748,"**CUDA graphs** (`compute.cuda_graphs`, on by default; NVIDIA, with the talker wholly on its device). Sampling and the code predictor's 15 steps are one graph each; the talker's step is one graph per stretch between attention calls, attention running eagerly over the growing cache. The graphs draw from a generator of their own, loaded from the request's and written back. Graphs are kept per batch size and sampling settings and dropped when the weights move."],[5325,"**CUDA 上的解码（CosyVoice 2/3）。** 上游的采样器在排序后的概率上跑 Python 循环：每保留一个 token 就把累计和读回，把概率拷到主机再拷回，在主机上检查重复窗口：每个 token 约 50–80 次等待设备，另外还有 24 层逐个以 eager 方式启动。在 CUDA 上，`llm._Steps` 每个 token 只等待设备一次，抽出相同的 token：nucleus 循环在设备上对排序后的前 25 个 token 重放（在分数的 dtype 中做同样的 0 维加法；抽样用 `multinomial` 自己的 `argmax(p / Exp(1))`，其前 *n* 个指数抽样正是 *n* 元素抽样所用的那些），对 1 到 25 的每个 *n*、在 fp32、fp16 和 bf16 下，token 和生成器状态都与上游循环相同。出现重复后的重采样仍以 eager 方式进行。开启 `compute.cuda_graphs`（NVIDIA，语言模型完整位于设备上）时，单 token 步骤以 CUDA 图运行在注意力调用两侧，抽样作为一个 CUDA 图；每个 token 都把 CUDA 图的生成器与请求的生成器同步，因为 CosyVoice 3 的流式 flow 会在 token 之间从中抽样。真实的 CosyVoice 2 模型在有无 CUDA 图时给出相同的 token，每个 token 约快七倍。其他设备沿用上游的循环。"],[5732,"**CUDA 图**（`compute.cuda_graphs`，默认开启；NVIDIA，且 talker 完整位于设备上）。采样和 code predictor 的 15 步各是一个图；talker 的一步在两次注意力调用之间各为一个图，注意力在不断增长的缓存上以 eager 方式运行。图从自己的生成器抽样，该生成器从请求的生成器载入状态并写回。图按批大小和采样设置保存，权重移动时丢弃。"],[13364,"**Cut it to fit**"],[13365,"**Cut it to fit** (at the quietest point before the limit; its transcript is dropped), or **Refuse it**"],[13622,"**Cut long clips**"],[13618,"**Cuts long recordings at their pauses, fills missing texts with speech recognition and evens out the levels. Run it after adding clips.**"],[7471,"**Damaged**"],[13086,"**Damaged**"],[8185,"**Damaged**: `mizuoto model verify <model>` lists the damaged files; delete them (or `mizuoto model delete <model>`) and download again, since files of the right size are not downloaded again."],[12345,"**Data loading.** Each loader worker runs the whole pipeline on its shards; with fewer shards (1000 clips each) than workers every worker reads every shard, so with the default two workers each clip is seen twice an epoch, as upstream. Shuffles draw from `Random(base_seed + k)`; batches come round-robin; features are made on one thread, as in a worker."],[13658,"**Dataset**; when the dataset has less usable speech than the method needs, creating fails and says how much it has and needs."],[12341,"**Decoding on CUDA (CosyVoice 2/3).** Upstream's samplers run a Python loop over the sorted probabilities, reading the running sum back at each kept token, copying probabilities to the host and back and checking the repetition window on the host: some 50–80 waits for the device per token, on top of 24 layers launched eagerly. On CUDA `llm._Steps` draws the same tokens with one wait per token: the nucleus loop is replayed on the device over the first 25 sorted tokens (the same 0-d additions in the scores' dtype; the draw is `multinomial`'s own `argmax(p / Exp(1))`, whose first *n* exponentials are those an *n*-element draw uses), the same token and generator state as upstream's loop for every *n* from 1 to 25, in fp32, fp16 and bf16. The resample after a repetition stays eager. With `compute.cuda_graphs` (NVIDIA, the language model wholly on its device) the one-token steps run as graphs around their attention calls and the draw as one graph; the graphs' generator is synced with the request's at each token, since CosyVoice 3's streamed flow draws from it between tokens. The real CosyVoice 2 model gives the same tokens with and without graphs, about seven times faster per token. Other devices keep upstream's loop."],[12823,"**Decoding.** VoxCPM2 drops the decoded context patches (the prompt's last `min(3, n)`) from the front; the first generation drops `2 × patch × hop` samples whenever there is any prompt audio, as upstream does whatever the prompt's length. Streaming yields one chunk per patch: VoxCPM2 through the stateful causal decoder, the first generation by decoding the last three patches and keeping the newest."],[13318,"**Default device**"],[13345,"**Default model**"],[11228,"**default**"],[11244,"**default**"],[11275,"**default**"],[11289,"**default**"],[11344,"**default**"],[11297,"**Default**"],[11311,"**Default**"],[13408,"**Delete results after days (0: keep)**"],[13058,"**Delete**"],[13205,"**Delete**"],[13513,"**Delete**"],[13680,"**Delete** at the bottom moves the experiment and its work files to the trash; what it exported stays."],[13267,"**Delete** at the bottom of the page moves the project and all its takes to the trash."],[13742,"**Delete**: moves the voice to the data folder's trash (`trash/`)."],[10570,"**Deliberate numerical divergence from reference implementations** (such as a fused RMSNorm by default). Mizuoto keeps the reference maths on the default path; fused variants that change bits are opt-in."],[10569,"**Dependencies on `comfy-aimdo` (a native VRAM allocator) and an exactly pinned `comfy-kitchen`.** Memory management is built on torch's own allocator."],[13462,"**Describe**"],[13486,"**Described**: write it under **The emotion, described**."],[8050,"**Descriptions and instructions** (VoxCPM2): written in parentheses before the text, as upstream does it: `(A young woman, gentle and sweet voice)Hello`. Either language works; Chinese dialects are asked for this way (粤语, 四川话…)."],[8025,"**Design attributes**: gender (male, female), age (child … elderly), pitch (very low pitch … very high pitch), style (whisper), accent (ten, such as american accent), dialect (twelve Chinese dialects such as 河南话, 四川话, 东北话). Free-text descriptions are not taken."],[13704,"**Designed**"],[13654,"**Details** holds the name, language and description. At the bottom: **Delete** (to the trash; experiments made from it can no longer run) and **Train on it** (a new experiment on this dataset)."],[9468,"**Device**"],[13102,"**Device**: **Automatic**, the devices of this machine the engine supports (such as `cuda:0`, `cpu`), and the devices of each remote host you added where the engine is available (shown as \"host · device\"). With a remote device the engine runs on that machine, the card shows **On** *host*, and its packages are managed there (see Remote hosts)."],[8071,"**Devices**: bf16 on a GPU; fp32 on a CPU (bf16 is emulated there, far slower). About 22 GB of GPU memory."],[10430,"**Download nothing.** Every file an engine reads is a model file or a shared asset, which `ModelService` downloads and hands over through `LoadSpec`."],[13390,"**Download source**"],[13048,"**Download**"],[13503,"**Download**"],[13450,"**Download** *model* *(size)*"],[13091,"**Download** fetches the missing files. Downloads resume, every file is checked against its size and SHA-256, and when a source lacks a file the next source is tried (see Download sources). Shared files it needs come along."],[7465,"**Downloading**"],[13080,"**Downloading**"],[9386,"**Downloads** › **Custom endpoint**"],[9382,"**Downloads** › **Download source**"],[9394,"**Downloads** › **Files at once**"],[9398,"**Downloads** › **Repository**"],[9390,"**Downloads** › **Verify checksums**"],[12332,"**Draw order.** Unstreamed, the draws come in upstream's order (language model, v1's flow noise, vocoder noise). Streaming uses upstream's chunking: v1 100 tokens with 20 of overlap and Hamming cross-fades; v2/v3 25 tokens doubling up to 100, with three tokens of lookahead."],[12614,"**Draw order**: every draw comes from the request's generator in upstream's order (the GPT, then the DiT's noise)."],[12679,"**Draws after the reseed come from private generators**: each epoch's loader base seed and the LoRA dropout masks on one seeded 42; worker *w*'s `Random` and `Generator` seeded `(base + w) mod 2**32`. In each worker webdataset first spends one `randint(0, 1000000)` on a seed it never uses, then the processor draws. The shard list is shuffled with `Random(epoch)`, the samples through webdataset's 20 000-sample buffer seeded with the epoch; the workers' batches come in turn."],[12833,"**Draws in upstream's order**, from private generators seeded 42 (upstream's `Accelerator` seeds every generator with 42): the construction's default initialisations replayed (the VAE, then the model, then LoRA's `A` with Kaiming's initialisation, whose values are kept; the checkpoint replaces the rest); per loader pass the base seed and the sampler's seed; per forward the CFM's masks, condition noise (drawn even at scale 0), `r`, `t` and `z`, and LoRA's dropout masks. On a CPU one generator serves everything, as upstream's default generator does; on CUDA the forward's draws come from a device generator."],[12408,"**Draws in upstream's order**: the model's random initialisation in upstream's construction order (UNetT makes a layer's skip projection last), one data-loader worker seed in each of the first two epochs (persistent loaders; accelerate's `skip_first_batches` copy iterates epoch 0), then per batch the span, noise, time, two `random()` calls and the dropout masks."],[12667,"**Draws.** Gumbel noise on positions (and on classes with `class_temperature`) comes from the request's generator, per step and per item, as upstream draws it; a batch's composition changes the draws, as it does upstream."],[12529,"**Draws.** One generator, reseeded per segment, draws the T2S sampling and then the SoVITS (or flow) noise, as upstream's `set_seed` and the global stream did. Preparing the reference draws nothing (HuBERT's layer drop is not replayed; 0.1 prepared the reference before seeding for the same reason)."],[13471,"**Earlier results** picks a synthesized result."],[13604,"**Earlier results**: pick synthesized results. They come with their licence tags; results whose licence forbids training other engines (Fish Speech's, for example) are refused when training."],[12093,"**Elevation is shown by surface tone first** (`surface`, `surface-container-low` … `surface-container-highest`), shadows second."],[8105,"**Emotion weights** (eight, in upstream's order): happy, angry, sad, afraid, disgusted, melancholic, surprised, calm. An emotion clip takes a strength; emotion from text needs the load option `use_qwen_emo` (on by default, about 1.2 GB)."],[13484,"**Emotion weights**: a 0–1 slider per emotion (**Happy**, **Angry**, **Sad**, **Afraid**, **Disgusted**, **Melancholic**, **Surprised**, **Calm**)."],[12587,"**Emotion**: the speaker clip's, another clip's (mixed by `emo_alpha`), or eight weights mixed in through the emotion matrices (rows picked by CAM++ similarity); a description is turned into weights by the emotion model (Qwen3-0.6B, greedy)."],[13220,"**Empty**"],[13444,"**Enable**"],[9460,"**Enable** / **Disable**"],[13104,"**Enabled**: when off, the engine's models cannot be used; Speak then offers an **Enable** button at the bottom."],[13195,"**End the paragraph here** / **Continue the paragraph**"],[10139,"**Engines import no other engine**: shared code goes into `nn` or `runtime`, where it is tested once."],[12409,"**Epoch *e* ≥ 1 shuffles with seed 666 + *e* − 1**: accelerate's loader resets the sampler's epoch to its own iteration count."],[10415,"**Errors are the classes of `mizuoto/core/errors.py`**, and error codes live only in `mizuoto/core/codes.py`. A fix for the user goes in `detail[\"hint\"]`: the command line prints it as a second line and the UI shows it under the error. Routes and commands never make up their own HTTP statuses or exit codes."],[12541,"**Errors raise** instead of upstream's one second of 16 kHz silence."],[11022,"**Estimate each phase's working memory from the request**: KV caches with `peak_bytes` in the dtype the model computes in, attention scores, CFG batches, decoder activations by length. Under `ctx.use`, bound what the phase can reach."],[13628,"**Even out levels**"],[12023,"**Events**: `MetricEvent`s are batched each second into `metrics.jsonl` and published as `train_metrics` (the UI's loss chart follows them live); `ProgressEvent` becomes the step's progress and message; `OutputEvent(kind=\"sample\")` is copied into an output of kind `sample`. A stage run again first drops its earlier points from `metrics.jsonl`."],[10457,"**Every change comes with tests**, and `python scripts/dev.py check` (lint, typecheck-py, test-py, test-web, typegen-check) passes. CI runs the same tests on Linux, Windows and macOS with Python 3.10–3.13, so mind how paths, encodings and line endings behave on Windows."],[10410,"**Every function is annotated** (under `mizuoto/` and `packages/native/`; tests and scripts are exempt). `Any` only where the value really is anything (JSON)."],[10411,"**Every model that crosses the API boundary is a `Record`** (`mizuoto/core/record.py`, pydantic v2, `json_schema_serialization_defaults_required`): settings, requests, responses, events, `--json` output. Defaulted fields are required in the output schema, so the generated TypeScript types match what the server sends."],[10030,"**Every route has an `operation_id`**, the operation's name in OpenAPI."],[10937,"**Everything else is fixed**: on the device whenever the component is. That includes embeddings (codebooks are read through `.weight` as often as they are called), norms, scales, buffers, a parameter shared with a module outside the unit (tied embeddings and heads), the model's first parameter (code reads the model's device from it), units under 64 KB, modules marked `fixed` and everything under a module pinned to the CPU (`DeviceService.pin_to_cpu`, which never moves)."],[12253,"**Exact shortcuts**: language detection's encoder output is reused when there is a single window, and the cross-attention cache is not reordered when every beam's rows are bit-identical. Neither changes a token."],[13659,"**Experiment name**: \"dataset-model\" by default; **Letters, digits, - \\_ and .**"],[13265,"**Export everything**: the whole project as one file."],[13264,"**Export this chapter**: the open chapter only; the file is named \"project — chapter title\"."],[13262,"**Export what is rendered**: off (the default), every line of what you export must be **Rendered**, else the export is refused; on, lines never rendered are left out and lines changed since their take use the take they have."],[13743,"**Export**: downloads a zip with the voice's details, clips and fine-tuned weights."],[13679,"**Exported**: the exported **Voice** (**Open** it or **Use in Speak**) or **Model** (**Models** opens the Models screen). Exported weights are added to the chosen voice; an exported model appears in the model list as `engine/name`."],[13216,"**Failed**"],[10977,"**Fallbacks** (`compute.oom_fallback`, off). After the retries an engine's cheaper way runs, if it gave one (`ctx.run(…, fallback=(what, fn))`). Its output differs slightly, so it is recorded in `applied.fallbacks` with a warning:"],[12751,"**Fast mode** (load option `fused_projections`, off): each layer's q/k/v and gate/up projections become one linear layer with the stacked weights, at load (they still stream like any layer). About 3–4 % faster per frame on a GPU, where the products pick other kernels and the audio is no longer bit-identical; identical in the CPU parity cases. Outputs list `fused_projections` when it is on. Parameter names change, so it applies to inference only."],[13046,"**Favourite** / **Not a favourite**"],[13501,"**Favourite** / **Not a favourite**"],[13041,"**Favourites**: favourites only."],[12250,"**Features** are transformers' `WhisperFeatureExtractor`, with its own float64 slaney filterbank and a transposed product, not openai-whisper's log-mel. Turbo's `tokenizer_config.json` sets `clean_up_tokenization_spaces` (\" .\" becomes \".\"), applied per segment."],[12749,"**Fewer kernels, the same bits** (without autograd only, so training is untouched): q and k normed and rotated together; the code predictor's rotary tables made once; `F.rms_norm` where a self-test on the device shows it gives the float32 norm's bits."],[13399,"**Files at once**"],[11687,"**Files by content.** A path means nothing on the other machine. Every file a request names becomes `mizuoto-file:<sha256>/<name>`: `have` asks which the agent lacks, and `put` sends those in 8 MiB frames, checked against the SHA-256. The agent keeps them in `<cache>/remote/files/` and removes what no host asked for in a month. The folder a `prepare_voice` writes into becomes `mizuoto-out:…`; its files come back as `file` frames into the host's own folder."],[13120,"**Files several models of an engine share, downloaded once with the first model that needs them.** For example GPT-SoVITS's encoders, G2PW, the NLTK data, the Open JTalk dictionary and the discriminators used for training; IndexTTS-2's w2v-BERT, semantic codec, CAM++ and BigVGAN; and CosyVoice's text normalisation grammars."],[8398,"**Files travel by content.** Files a request names (reference clips, an emotion clip…) are sent by SHA-256: those the agent already has are not sent again, the others are uploaded once in 8 MB pieces. When the agent starts it deletes files no host has used for a month."],[13608,"**Find out**"],[12538,"**Fine-tunes.** SoVITS checkpoints that pickle upstream's `utils.HParams` are read by a restricted unpickler (tensors, `OrderedDict`, `HParams` as a dict). v4/v5 LoRA files are merged without peft (W += B·A·α/r in float32, identical to peft's merge)."],[12248,"**Five beams.** The pipeline's default generation config (`num_beams=5`) wins over the model's greedy default, so 0.1 always decoded with 5 beams, whatever `beam_size` said; the option `beam_size` 1 keeps those 5 beams, and a larger value sets the number. The beam search is transformers 4.57's vectorised `_beam_search` (log-softmax, then the processors, `2 × beams` candidates)."],[13406,"**Folders the browser may open**"],[13253,"**Format**"],[10911,"**Free** = the driver's free memory plus what torch's caching allocator holds but does not use, capped by `compute.vram_limit_mb` (less what this process already holds) when that is set."],[13535,"**From (s)** and **To (s)**: where the replaced speech is in the recording;"],[13702,"**From a clip**"],[13485,"**From a clip**: an **Emotion clip**; only the clip's emotion is borrowed, not its voice; **Strength** 0–2."],[9920,"**Fused projections** (`engines.qwen3tts.load_options.fused_projections`, off) stack each layer's q/k/v and gate/up weights into one linear layer each at load (`QwenDecoder.fuse`; real `ops.Linear`s, so they still stream). Inference only. cuBLAS picks other kernels for the wider matrices, so the bits differ on CUDA; outputs list `fused_projections`."],[11251,"**Fused projections** (`fused_projections`, opt-in), ms per frame at 4 / 8 layers:"],[9220,"**General** › **Access token**"],[9216,"**General** › **Open the browser when the server starts**"],[9208,"**General** › **Port**"],[9204,"**General** › **Server address**"],[12162,"**Generate the types.** With the routes in place, run `python scripts/dev.py typegen`; `schema.d.ts` gains `/api/v1/projects` and friends and the `Project`, `ProjectInput`… models. Alias them in `api/types.ts`:"],[10566,"**Giant files and long `if` chains** (such as model detection matched in order). Each engine has its own detection, configuration and construction in its own package."],[12505,"**GPT (T2S)**: a 24-layer autoregressive transformer predicts 25 Hz semantic tokens from the prompt's phones and tokens plus the target's phones, batched with left padding, or row by row when streaming."],[12611,"**GPT-2 as transformers 4.52 computes it**: `Conv1D` as `addmm`, tanh GELU, SDPA causal with no mask on the prompt and unmasked on each new token."],[6597,"**GPT-SoVITS .list**"],[13612,"**GPT-SoVITS .list**"],[5489,"**GPT（T2S）**：24 层自回归 transformer，根据提示的音素和 token 以及目标的音素预测 25 Hz 语义 token；批量时左侧补齐，流式时逐行生成。"],[12548,"**GPT** (`train_s1.py`): the losses, accuracies, learning rates, the CPU generator's state at every step and the saved `<exp>-e<N>.ckpt` equal `s1_train.py`'s seeded alike (one and two epochs, batches of 1 and 4, DPO). Upstream draws while it builds the GPT (one encoder layer deep-copied 24 times, then the head) and once for the loader's base seed; `replay_construction_draws` repeats them. The bucket sampler's reseeding of the global `random` is a private `Random(epoch)`. `training_step` steps ScaledAdam at batch indices above 0 divisible by 4, so gradients pile up over five batches first and across an epoch's end; the schedule locks the rate to 0.002 after its first step, which runs at ScaledAdam's own 0.01. All kept."],[12588,"**GPT** (`UnifiedVoice`, a 24-layer GPT-2): beam sampling of semantic codes, then a second pass over them for their latents."],[5532,"**GPT**（`train_s1.py`）：每一步的损失、准确率、学习率、CPU 生成器状态，以及保存的 `<exp>-e<N>.ckpt`，都与以相同种子运行的 `s1_train.py` 相同（一个和两个 epoch，批大小 1 和 4，DPO）。上游在构建 GPT 时抽样（一个编码器层被深拷贝 24 次，然后是输出头），并为数据加载器的基础种子抽一次；`replay_construction_draws` 重放这些抽样。分桶采样器对全局 `random` 的重新播种改为私有的 `Random(epoch)`。`training_step` 在批次索引大于 0 且能被 4 整除时执行 ScaledAdam 的一步，所以梯度先累积五个批次，并跨越 epoch 边界；学习率调度在第一步之后把学习率锁定为 0.002，而第一步用的是 ScaledAdam 自己的 0.01。这些都保留。"],[5572,"**GPT**（`UnifiedVoice`，24 层 GPT-2）：用束采样生成语义编码，再对这些编码做一遍前向以得到隐变量。"],[13327,"**GPU jobs at once**"],[9488,"**GPU memory for this engine** on the engine's card"],[5386,"**GPU 上的精度。** 与上游相同，模型*先*转换到它的 dtype，再复制检查点，所以在 GPU 上旋转位置编码的 `inv_freq` 也是 fp16，角度以 fp16 计算。"],[2636,"**GPU 不排队**：命令行的任务立即在自己的进程里运行，不进入服务器的 GPU 队列，并加载自己的一份模型。如果服务器已经把同一个模型加载在同一块 GPU 上，显存里会有两份；显存不够时任务以 `compute_unavailable`（退出码 9）失败。"],[11061,"**GPU**: two RTX 3090 (24 GB), **shared with another workload** that held about 21 GB of each and kept both 100 % busy. Every GPU number below is inflated by that sharing; comparisons were interleaved on the same GPU and torch. Models that did not fit beside the other workload were measured as their decoding loop alone: the real sizes, random weights and a few of their layers, which is labelled where it applies."],[4045,"**GPU**：两块 RTX 3090（24 GB），**与另一项工作共用**，它在每块卡上占约 21 GB 显存并让两块卡都保持 100 % 繁忙。下面所有 GPU 数字都因共用而偏大；比较都在同一块 GPU、同一 torch 上交错进行。放不进剩余显存的模型只测量其解码循环：真实尺寸、随机权重、只取少数几层，用到这种方式的地方都会注明。"],[10412,"**Heavy imports go inside functions**: av and numpy hot paths in the core, fastapi and uvicorn in the command line, and every piece of model code in `core/inference`. That keeps `mizuoto version` and `mizuoto --help` fast, and tests check it."],[13777,"**Help**: opens this documentation in a new browser tab."],[13769,"**History**"],[13036,"**History** lists every result, newest first: from Speak, the tries on voice pages, design candidates, conversions and edits from Tools, training previews, and the files projects export."],[175,"**Host 头。** 服务器绑定在本机地址（默认 `127.0.0.1`）时，`Host` 必须是 `localhost`、`127.0.0.1`、`::1`、绑定的地址，或嵌入方用 `extra_hosts` / `allow_host()` 加入的名称，否则返回 400 `bad_host`。这可以防止 DNS 重绑定。绑定到非本机地址（如 `0.0.0.0`）时不检查 `Host`。"],[11482,"**host**: `bun install --frozen-lockfile` and `bun run build` in `mizuoto/webui` (`--skip-web` reuses the existing `dist/`, as Docker's `wheels` stage does), a check that `dist/index.html` exists, then `uv build` of the `mizuoto` sdist and, from it, the wheel, from a clean copy of `mizuoto/`, `pyproject.toml` and `README.md` (no `__pycache__`, no stale `build/`)."],[9968,"**Host**: when bound to loopback, `Host` must be `localhost`, `127.0.0.1`, `::1`, the bound host or a name in `extra_hosts`, else 400 `bad_host`. This blocks DNS rebinding. `extra_hosts` is kept by reference, so a tunnel's public name added later is accepted at once."],[4466,"**host**：在 `mizuoto/webui` 中 `bun install --frozen-lockfile` 和 `bun run build`（`--skip-web` 沿用现有的 `dist/`，Docker 的 `wheels` 阶段就是这样），检查 `dist/index.html` 存在，然后用 `uv build` 构建 `mizuoto` 的 sdist，再由它构建 wheel；构建所用的是 `mizuoto/`、`pyproject.toml` 和 `README.md` 的干净副本（没有 `__pycache__`，没有残留的 `build/`）。"],[2952,"**Host**：绑定在回环地址时，`Host` 必须是 `localhost`、`127.0.0.1`、`::1`、绑定的主机名或 `extra_hosts` 中的名字，否则 400 `bad_host`。这挡住 DNS 重绑定。`extra_hosts` 按引用保存，隧道启动后加入的公网名立即生效。"],[13227,"**How it speaks**: a style instruction for each of this speaker's lines (only when the model takes instructions)."],[11202,"**How the CPU settings were chosen.** Each configuration ran in separate, interleaved processes. Fixing the `mmap` threshold and keeping free heap together helped F5-TTS (warm median 64.0–68.6 s → 53.7–60.9 s); either alone made things slower; glibc's `hugetlb` and tcmalloc gave no more than torch's own huge pages. OmniVoice looked bimodal per process (about 28 s or 38 s, whatever the allocator): the cause was thread placement. Of six processes with default placement one ran at 38.5 s; of six with threads bound to cores none did (27.6–28.3 s)."],[13482,"**How to say it**: a style instruction such as \"Cheerfully, a little faster\" (Qwen3-TTS 1.7B CustomVoice, CosyVoice 2 and 3, CosyVoice 300M Instruct)."],[5521,"**HuBERT 的 float16 检查点**载入 float32 参数，并在 float32 下折叠其权重归一化，与 transformers 的计算方式相同（在 float16 下折叠时特征相差 1e-4）。BERT 走 transformers 的 SDPA 路径，即 transformers 4.57 为 chinese-roberta 选用的路径。"],[5653,"**HuBERT 的抽样。** HuBERT 即使在 eval 模式下，每层也从 CPU 生成器抽取一次 `torch.rand([])`；`HubertModel` 在 `ctx.generator_for(\"cpu\")` 上做同样的抽样。因此没有缓存音色提示的克隆，与有缓存的克隆得到的噪声不同，0.1 和 Mizuoto 都是如此；Mizuoto 总在请求之前先准备好提示，所以这一点从不显现。"],[12669,"**HuBERT's draws.** HuBERT draws one `torch.rand([])` per layer even in eval mode, from the CPU generator; `HubertModel` makes the same draws on `ctx.generator_for(\"cpu\")`. A clone without a cached voice prompt therefore gets other noise than one with it, in 0.1 as in Mizuoto; Mizuoto always prepares the prompt before the request, so this never shows."],[12537,"**HuBERT's float16 checkpoint** is loaded into float32 parameters and its weight norm folded in float32, as transformers computes it (folded in float16 the features differed by 1e-4). BERT is transformers' SDPA path, which transformers 4.57 picks for chinese-roberta."],[6375,"**Hugging Face**"],[13391,"**Hugging Face**"],[13392,"**Hugging Face**, **hf-mirror.com**, **ModelScope** or **Custom** (then the **Custom endpoint**, a Hugging Face compatible server). A file one source lacks comes from the next that has it"],[6376,"**Hugging Face**、**hf-mirror.com**、**ModelScope** 或 **自定义**（再填写 **自定义地址**，一个与 Hugging Face 兼容的服务器）。某个来源缺少的文件会从下一个有它的来源下载"],[11883,"**Identical tokens; audio identical or max abs error ≤ 1e-4**; exceptions listed per engine with a reason"],[10414,"**Identifiers and times** come from `mizuoto/core/clock.py`: `new_id(prefix)` (a hex millisecond timestamp and 8 random hex digits, sorting roughly by creation time) and `now_iso()` (UTC, milliseconds, ending in `Z`, sorting as text)."],[10816,"**In a distribution of its own** (a licence that cannot ship in `mizuoto`, decision D1): register the class under the entry-point group `mizuoto.engines` in its `pyproject.toml`, depend on `mizuoto`, and add the engine id → distribution name to `DISTRIBUTIONS` in `mizuoto/core/inference/service.py`, so a missing install is reported by name. Fish Speech's:"],[12936,"**In CI**: `tests/engines_native/` runs every engine and trainer on a tiny random model of its own architecture, also with its weights streamed, half streamed and not streamed on a simulated device, which must give the same output; `tests/runtime/test_dsp.py` checks the DSP against its fixtures."],[10815,"**In this distribution**: add the engine to `BUILTIN`:"],[12613,"**IndexTTS-1.5 without a KV cache** unless it runs in fp16, as upstream: each step reruns the whole sequence, and with a cache the sums would differ."],[5597,"**IndexTTS-1.5 不用 KV 缓存**，除非以 fp16 运行，与上游相同：每一步都重新计算整个序列，用缓存的话求和结果会不同。"],[12455,"**Initialisation draws, jumped over.** Upstream builds the model with random weights before loading the checkpoint, and initialises each loralib layer twice before drawing `A`: some 18 G draws. `initial_lora` computes how far those draws advance the generator from the shapes alone (a float32 `normal_` or `uniform_` advances it by its size, `normal_` by 16 more when the size is not a multiple of 16) and jumps MT19937 ahead in GF(2) (`mizuoto.training.rng`): the same state in 2 s instead of 40 s of drawing, computed in a thread while the weights load. Then come the loader's base seed and each step's LoRA dropout masks."],[8026,"**Inline tags**: thirteen, such as `[laughter]`, `[sigh]`, `[question-en]`, `[surprise-wa]`."],[7948,"**Inline tags**: v1 `[laughter]`, `[breath]`, `<strong></strong>`; v2 adds `<laughter></laughter>`; v3 has eleven, such as `[breath]`, `[laughter]`, `[cough]`, `[sigh]`."],[13193,"**Insert a line below**"],[7468,"**Installed**"],[13084,"**Installed**"],[13178,"**instead of the script**"],[13464,"**Its own voice**"],[9592,"**Jobs run in the foreground.** `speak`, `design`, `model download`, `train run`, `project render` and the like create a job and run it in the terminal until it ends; a progress bar goes to stderr (only when stderr is a terminal, and not with `--json`), with bytes, speed and time left for downloads."],[8193,"**Jobs** › **Log**; `mizuoto job log <job id>`; `GET /api/v1/jobs/{id}/log`"],[9651,"**Jobs**: the command line's jobs are in the database too, so `mizuoto job list` shows the server's jobs and the web UI's **Jobs** panel shows the command line's. Each job records the process that runs it; a process opening the data folder marks unfinished jobs **Interrupted** only when their process has ended, never those of another process still running."],[13775,"**Jobs**: while jobs run it shows a spinner and their number (**N running**). It opens the jobs sheet with the 30 most recent jobs; each job card shows the state and progress (for downloads also the amount done, the speed and the time left) and offers **Cancel**, **Retry** and **Log**. **All jobs** opens the full list, filtered by **All**, **Active** or **Finished**, where **Clear finished** tidies the history. A queued job says what it waits for, such as **Waiting for the GPU**, **Waiting for the engine**, **Waiting for other synthesis jobs** (see **Synthesis jobs at once** in Settings) or **Waiting for other downloads**; when another job holds the GPU, **Run anyway** runs it beside that one if the memory suffices."],[13054,"**Keep as a voice**"],[13509,"**Keep as a voice**"],[10956,"**keeps a few copies**: the running unit and those in flight (`compute.async_offload + 1`); a unit that runs again before its copy is dropped (CFG halves, beams) reuses it;"],[12835,"**Kept as upstream**: every clip padded to whole patches on the right; the stop label on the last patch and the loss over audio positions; each micro-batch's loss divided by the accumulation; gradients clipped at 1e9 when clipping is off; the learning rate logged is the next step's."],[12457,"**Kept**: upstream's training forward does not scale the codebook embeddings by 1/√11 as inference does; the warm-up makes the first step's learning rate 0 and `B` starts at zero, so the first two steps give the same loss."],[10431,"**Key a module-level cache by its whole input** (every parameter, dtype and device), or build per call. A global cache keyed by part of its input makes a second configuration in the same process reuse the first one's result."],[12163,"**Keys and queries.** Add `projects` and `project(id)` to `api/queries/keys.ts` and create `api/queries/projects.ts`:"],[13640,"**Language they speak**"],[13306,"**Language**"],[13478,"**Language**: **Detect**, or one of the model's languages."],[13226,"**Language**: **The project's language**, or one of the model's languages."],[8108,"**Languages**: Japanese text for IndexTTS-2.5 needs the optional extra `mizuoto-indextts[ja]`."],[8052,"**Languages**: VoxCPM2 30 (ar, my, zh, da, nl, en, fi, fr, de, el, he, hi, id, it, ja, km, ko, lo, ms, no, pl, pt, ru, es, sw, sv, tl, th, tr, vi), with no language tag: it reads the text as written. VoxCPM 1.5 and 0.5B: zh, en."],[7895,"**Languages**: zh, en, de, it, pt, es, ja, ko, fr, ru."],[7946,"**Languages**: zh, en, ja, ko, yue; v3: zh, en, ja, ko, de, es, fr, it, ru, yue."],[8008,"**Languages**: zh, en, ja, ko, yue. Japanese needs the optional extra `mizuoto[gptsovits-ja]`, Korean `mizuoto[gptsovits-ko]`."],[7974,"**Languages**: zh, en. 24 kHz."],[12096,"**Layout**: a bottom navigation bar on compact windows, a navigation rail on wider ones (`AppShell`)."],[10957,"**learns the order** units run in (each unit's successor, as last seen) and, on CUDA and ROCm, **prefetches** the next units on side streams while the current one computes. The compute stream waits on a copy's event, and each copy is recorded on the compute stream so the caching allocator does not reuse it early. A unit entered out of order is copied there and then: correctness never depends on the order;"],[13537,"**Length (s)**: how long the new speech lasts; empty (**Automatic**) keeps the span's length."],[13259,"**Level each take**"],[13354,"**Levelling**"],[12671,"**Levels and long text.** The reference is levelled to an RMS of 0.1 and the output levelled back; long outputs are generated in text chunks, conditioned on the reference (or the first chunk), and cross-faded."],[12941,"**Libraries' numerics, reproduced.** `mizuoto.nn.dsp` is bit-exact with what upstream called: torchaudio (2.3.1 and 2.8.0), librosa (0.10, 0.11, 1.0), openai-whisper, soxr as `librosa.resample` calls it, Matcha-TTS's mel, the ffmpeg program's resampler and soundfile's WAV. `mizuoto.text.tokenize.bpe` gives transformers' ids for the Qwen2-family tokenizers; normalisers apply the original FSTs with kaldifst; ONNX weights are read from the protobuf without onnx."],[13456,"**Library voice**"],[13526,"**Library voice**: a voice from the library; its reference clip is the target voice;"],[8107,"**Licence**: bilibili Model Use License, gated (`bilibili-model-use@2025-09-09`); commercial use is allowed, but results cannot train other engines; the notice under results reminds that cloning a voice without its owner's permission is forbidden by the IndexTTS disclaimer."],[8070,"**Licence**: Fish Audio Research License, gated (`fish-audio-research@2026-03-07`); not for commercial use; results cannot train other engines; results show \"Built with Fish Audio\"."],[7976,"**Licence**: MIT code, CC-BY-NC-4.0 pretrained weights (trained on Emilia): not for commercial use. Nothing to accept; results carry a notice."],[10245,"**Licences.** A `licence.gated` engine (Fish Speech, IndexTTS) needs `engines.<id>.accepted_licence == \"<licence id>@<version>\"` before its models and assets download and before it speaks; the full text ships with the package (`manifests/licences/`). `requires_consent` makes cloning need a consent statement, `trains_others = false` keeps its outputs out of other engines' training data, and `notice` is shown under results. Every output carries licence tags."],[12013,"**Licences.** A trainer gets `training_rows(dataset, target engine)`: excluded rows and rows without text are left out, and when some rows' licence tags forbid training the target engine (a manifest's `trains_others = false`) the request is refused as a whole."],[13414,"**Light**, **Dark**, **System** (the theme button in the top bar switches it too)"],[13614,"**LJSpeech (metadata.csv)**"],[6599,"**LJSpeech（metadata.csv）**"],[7953,"**Load option**: `fp16` (half precision on the GPU: faster, slightly different)."],[7978,"**Load option**: `ode_method` (`euler` or `midpoint`)."],[8111,"**Load options**: `use_qwen_emo` (on by default), `use_torch_compile` (v2/v2.5: compiles the s2mel DiT and BigVGAN, as `compute.compile` does; see Performance)."],[7899,"**Load options**: Attention follows the attention settings. `fused_projections` (off) is a fast mode: each layer's q/k/v and gate/up projections become one product each, a few percent faster on a GPU, where the audio is then no longer bit-identical to the original implementation's (outputs list `fused_projections`)."],[10428,"**Load outside inference mode, and leave parameters as `nn.Module` makes them** (no `requires_grad_(False)`). Two CPU kernel traps change results: on a non-contiguous 3-D input, `F.linear` takes another kernel when the weight `requires_grad`, or when it is an inference tensor (made inside `torch.inference_mode()`), even under `no_grad` or inference mode. Upstream's weights are ordinary parameters that require grad, so native engines keep them so; requests still run in inference mode."],[9653,"**Loaded models**: `mizuoto runtime` lists the models the running server holds (it finds the server through `server.json` in the data folder) and `mizuoto runtime --unload [MODEL]` unloads them there."],[10427,"**Loading draws nothing.** Modules are built from `runtime.ops` layers (`ops.default` skips random initialisation), and checkpoints load strictly (a missing or unexpected key is an error unless the engine lists it as ignorable)."],[12943,"**Loading outside inference mode**, requests inside it (below)."],[11654,"**Loading** (`LocalEngine.load`):"],[10837,"**Loading**: `OmniVoiceModel(config, ops.default)` filled by `load_into(model, load_state_dict(folder / \"model.safetensors\"))`, cast to the dtype (bf16 on a GPU that has it, else fp16; fp32 on the CPU; an explicit `engines.omnivoice.dtype` wins); the audio tokenizer the same way; the text tokenizer from `mizuoto.text.tokenize.bpe.load_bpe(folder)`; two handles."],[10416,"**Logging** goes through the `mizuoto` logger (`logging.getLogger(__name__)` under `mizuoto.*`); only the entry point (`setup_logging` in `mizuoto/logger.py`) configures handlers."],[10032,"**Long operations return a `Job`.** `POST /tts/speak?wait=true` waits with `JobService.wait` and raises `OperationTimeoutError` after `timeout` (504, `detail.job_id` names the job, which goes on)."],[12826,"**Long text** is split by Mizuoto; upstream does not split."],[7897,"**Long text**: upstream does not split it, so Mizuoto does."],[10506,"**Long work is a job plus events**, so requests return quickly, and progress and cancellation come with it."],[13631,"**Longest clip (s)**"],[13676,"**Losses** draws the curves live while a training stage runs; switch between training stages when there are several, and turn curves on and off with the chips. Before any data it says **The losses appear here while a training stage runs**."],[13168,"**Make a line of each**: with **line of text** each line of the script is one line; with **sentence** each is split further into its sentences."],[13493,"**Manage presets…**: **Make it the default**, **Stop it being the default**, delete."],[11119,"**Matrix products dominate** (`F.linear`/`addmm`: 50–90 % of the time). The autoregressive LMs run one token at a time against fp32 weights, so they are bound by memory bandwidth (Qwen3-TTS's 1.7B talker reads about 6.8 GB a frame at about 36 GB/s). Faster kernels, lower precision or other thread counts would change the sums."],[5394,"**mel 在单线程上计算**，与上游的加载 worker 相同；线程更多会改变滤波器组乘积的求和。"],[12410,"**Mels on one thread**, as in upstream's loader workers; more threads change the filterbank product's sums."],[10844,"**Memory**: `memory_required` estimates the logits' working memory per batch row."],[12456,"**Mixed precision as upstream's.** The checkpoint's tensors are assigned as upstream assigns them, so S2's norms stay bfloat16 while the LoRA layers hold float32 copies."],[13394,"**mizuoto-model mirror first**"],[8396,"**Model states come from the agent.** For an engine whose device names a remote host, a model is \"installed\" when the agent's list of installed models has it (the host asks again every 15 seconds or so), not when this machine's models folder does. Install the models on the agent with its own `mizuoto` commands."],[13656,"**Model to start from**: only installed models that can be trained. Without any, the dialog says which engines can train."],[13040,"**Model**: **All models**, or one model;"],[13224,"**Model**: without one, its label reads **Model (the project's: …)**; with one, **Use the project's** goes back."],[13776,"**Models in memory**: shows how many models are loaded (**N loaded**). It lists each loaded model with its device, the memory its weights take and whether it is **Busy** or **Idle**; **Unload** one, or **Free GPU memory** to unload every idle model at once. An engine whose last request failed is listed with the error."],[13324,"**Models kept in memory**"],[10243,"**Models.** Catalogue models download into `models/<engine>/<model>/`; `model.json` is written last and lists the files. The state is `missing`, `partial` (a folder without `model.json`, or a shared asset it needs is missing), `installed`, `corrupt` (a size differs or verification failed) or `downloading`. A `model_download` job (resource `io`) fetches with `downloads.concurrency` threads into `<file>.part`, resumes with Range, checks size and SHA-256, and tries the sources in order (`downloads.source` first, then Hugging Face, hf-mirror, ModelScope; the mirror first with `downloads.repository = \"mizuoto-model\"`); a file one source lacks comes from the next. `import_model` identifies the engine and variant from the files, verifies SHA-256 when the sizes match a catalogue model, and otherwise registers a user model `<engine>/<name>`."],[13001,"**Models**"],[13767,"**Models**"],[8458,"**Models** › **Engines**: in the engine card's **Device**, pick a device of the remote host (shown as `host · device`)."],[13073,"**Models** has three tabs: **Models** (each engine's catalogue), **Engines** (each engine's availability and settings) and **Shared files** (files several models of an engine share)."],[10565,"**Module-level mutable globals** (the VRAM state, the loaded-models list, the interrupt flag, command-line arguments read deep in the code). Mizuoto has `Services` and settings objects, and passes the device and cancel token explicitly, because a CPU job and a GPU job can run at once."],[13419,"**Motion**"],[12095,"**Motion**: named transitions (`fade-through`, `shared-axis-x`, `container`, `sheet`, `scrim`, `list`…, in `ui/motion/`), and a container transform from a list to an item through View Transitions where the browser has them. With reduced motion chosen by the system or in the app, every transition becomes a 100 ms fade and there is no ripple."],[13199,"**Move up** / **Move down**"],[13741,"**Name**, **Language**, **Tags** (comma-separated) and **Description**; click **Save** after changing them."],[11483,"**native**: each package in `packages/native/` (or the ones named), copied without `__pycache__`, `*.egg-info`, `build` and `dist`, and built with `uv build --wheel`."],[4467,"**native**：`packages/native/` 下的每个包（或指定的那些），复制时去掉 `__pycache__`、`*.egg-info`、`build` 和 `dist`，用 `uv build --wheel` 构建。"],[12168,"**Navigation and keep-alive.** Add an entry to `nav` in `App.vue` (the icon first goes into `ui/icons.ts`); add the detail prefix to `viewKey` when each item needs its own instance, and the screen to the `lastScreen` watcher when it should be remembered:"],[10910,"**Need** = the handles' bytes not yet on the device + the working memory (the estimate times its calibration, below) + `compute.vram_reserve_mb`."],[11020,"**Never move modules yourself.** Build on the host (or on `spec.device`; the handle takes it from there), and let the manager place them. A float64 module on a device without float64 uses `float64_device` and `pin_to_cpu`. Swap weights with `handle.replace`."],[13536,"**New words**: what this part says now (for the record; the model goes by the whole text above);"],[12448,"**No daemon thread and no 32 768-position preallocated cache.** The cache grows by concatenation; after `repeat_interleave` the keys and values are the tensors upstream builds. Attention masks are made per call instead of upstream's 4 GiB of mask buffers."],[10932,"**No estimate refuses a load** (ComfyUI's way). In `high` the model is tried whole once idle components made room; in the other modes, below the minimum, it is tried at the minimum with a warning in the log. Only an allocation that really fails is an error. The catalogue's `vram_mb` is never checked before loading."],[12674,"**No FlashInfer or CUDA graphs.** 0.1's load options for them are gone; SDPA serves every platform."],[12673,"**No free-text design.** The model was trained on a closed attribute vocabulary; free text is refused, as in 0.1."],[12334,"**No language-model thread.** Upstream runs the language model on a thread beside the vocoder; here it runs in the request's thread and chunks are made as its tokens arrive. Upstream's streamed v1/v2 draw vocoder noise on the main thread while the language model samples on its own, so their streamed audio depends on timing; Mizuoto's vocoder draws from its own generator (seed + 1) and the tokens are those of the unstreamed request. CosyVoice 3, whose noise is fixed, streams identically."],[10413,"**No method named `list` on a class that annotates with `list[...]`** (ty resolves the name to the method). Write `list_models`, `list_voices`, `list_presets`."],[12940,"**No process-wide state.** No environment variables, working folder, `sys.path`, `torch.backends` flags, global seeds or logging configuration are changed; `tests/test_architecture.py` forbids it and the contract suite checks a digest of the process state before and after requests (the `mizuoto.snapshot` operation)."],[9594,"**No server needed.** Each command opens the data folder (settings, database, models) itself and closes it when done; the engines run in the command's own process and the models it loaded go with it, so every `speak` loads its model again. For many sentences in a row, a server (the web UI or the HTTP API) is faster: it keeps models loaded."],[9652,"**No shared GPU queue**: a command-line job runs at once in its own process, outside the server's GPU queue, and loads its own copy of the model. If the server has the same model loaded on the same GPU, it is in GPU memory twice; when memory runs short, the job fails with `compute_unavailable` (exit code 9)."],[12330,"**Noise.** v2/v3's flow noise is upstream's seed-0 buffer (the first 1×80×15000 normal draws). `randn_like(x)` keeps `x`'s strides, so its draws land in another element order than `randn(shape)` when `x` is transposed (HiFT's sine source): `nn.vocoders.hift.randn_like` fills `empty_like(x)` from the generator."],[13346,"**None**"],[12335,"**Normalisation that 0.1 lacked.** Upstream's frontend downloads the FSTs at run time; in 0.1's worker that download failed and upstream silently skipped normalisation. With the FSTs an asset, Chinese text with digits now has its numbers read out, so such text sounds different from 0.1."],[7459,"**Not downloaded**"],[13078,"**Not downloaded**"],[9882,"**Not exact.** Against eager on the CPU in fp32, the audio differs by at most 9e-5 for F5-TTS, 6e-5 for IndexTTS and 3e-5 for GPT-SoVITS. CosyVoice's mel stays within 5.7e-6, but HiFT's F0-driven source amplifies that to about 1e-2 in the audio (eager with another thread count does the same). For VoxCPM, float differences can move where the speech ends. The first request after a load pays the compilation (30 to 160 s on the CPU); the gains are in Performance record."],[8055,"**Not included**: upstream's optional denoiser for the reference clip (ZipEnhancer, a ModelScope pipeline) and its timestamps; both are off by default upstream."],[12825,"**Not offered**: denoising the reference with ZipEnhancer (`denoise`; a ModelScope pipeline and a second model, off by default upstream), timestamps (stable-ts), upstream's CUDA `torch.compile` (`optimize`) and vLLM serving."],[12621,"**Not ported**: TensorRT, upstream's accelerated engine and the BigVGAN CUDA kernel (0.1's load options `use_accel`, `use_trt`, `trt_precision`, `use_cuda_kernel`), and 2.5's low-memory text split (upstream splits text into 40-character pieces on GPUs under 10 GB; Mizuoto's runtime manages memory instead). `use_torch_compile` turns on `compute.compile` for the s2mel DiT and BigVGAN."],[12542,"**Not ported**: upstream's CUDA-graph T2S (`t2s_accel`, which changes results), `set_seed`'s process-wide TF32 switch, and super-sampling (v3 only, not in the catalogue). On CPUs with bf16 matrix units upstream's `set_float32_matmul_precision(\"medium\")` may use them; Mizuoto stays in fp32."],[13214,"**Not rendered**"],[12445,"**Numerics**: Fish's RMSNorm in float32; RoPE over adjacent pairs with the frequency table rounded to bfloat16; the prefill on SDPA with a boolean causal mask, decoding steps on SDPA's math kernel (called directly, no process-wide setting); the fast transformer's hand-written softmax. Weight norm is kept in both checkpoint formats and recomputed every forward, as upstream does."],[5384,"**ODE。** torchdiffeq 固定网格的 Euler 和中点法步即 `nn.flow.cfm.odeint_fixed`；步数为 5、6、7、10、12 或 16 时用上游的 Empirically Pruned Step Sampling 网格，否则用线性网格加 sway 采样。噪声按上游的方式抽取，逐条、以模型的 dtype。"],[13368,"**Off: drop them with a warning.** On: refuse the request. A value out of range is always refused"],[11023,"**Offer a fallback** where a cheaper exact-enough way exists (tiles, one item at a time), with a short description of what it does."],[8199,"**Offline**: the agent cannot be reached. Check that `mizuoto agent` runs on that machine and listens on an address this machine can reach (it listens on `127.0.0.1` unless given `--host 0.0.0.0`); check the address, the port (7870 by default) and the firewall; TLS must be on on both sides or on neither."],[12336,"**On a device without float64** (Apple MPS, Intel Arc), CosyVoice 3's F0 predictor stays on the CPU while the rest of the model moves; the vocoder feeds it on its own device."],[12933,"**On a GPU** there is no sample-level comparison with upstream. What a GPU checks is that Mizuoto's own speed paths change nothing: CUDA graphs and the decoding loops that wait for the device once per step give the same tokens and audio as the plain eager code on the same GPU."],[10504,"**One OpenAPI schema as the contract.** Every route has an explicit `operation_id`, with pydantic models in and out. `mizuoto/api/openapi.py` adds every event model and a `ServerEvents` map (event name → schema) to the schema, so socket payloads are typed like REST. `scripts/dev.py typegen` generates `schema.d.ts` with `openapi-typescript` and it is committed; `typegen-check` catches drift between the API and the types in CI."],[10029,"**One operation, one core method.** The route body parses, calls and returns; bodies and results are the core's `Record` models, so the API's JSON equals the CLI's `--json`."],[12021,"**One process per stage**: `host_target(\"mizuoto.training.stage\", cwd=work)` runs `python -m mizuoto.training.stage <request.json>` with the server's own interpreter, through `JobContext.run_worker`. The stage sees every device under its own name. The heartbeat timeout is 30 minutes (`STAGE_HEARTBEAT_TIMEOUT`); any output line resets it, and the stage beats every 10 s anyway."],[13479,"**One result per line**: only for models that take batches (Qwen3-TTS, GPT-SoVITS, OmniVoice); each line becomes its own result."],[12747,"**One wait per frame.** One-sample draws are `multinomial`'s own computation (`argmax(p / Exp(1))`) without its checks (`runtime.sampling.multinomial1`; NaN probabilities are still an error, read with the frame's one wait); masks are built once per device; the repetition penalty works on a mask of the ids drawn (`repetition_penalty_seen`, the same arithmetic); the padding is known on the host."],[10936,"**Only the weights of `nn.Linear`, `Conv1d/2d` and `ConvTranspose1d/2d` stream**, and of classes that declare `STREAMABLE = True` (IndexTTS's GPT-2 `Conv1D`). Their `forward` is where they are read."],[13308,"**Open the browser when the server starts**"],[9476,"**Options**"],[9969,"**Origin**: a state-changing request (not `GET`/`HEAD`/`OPTIONS`) and every WebSocket handshake, when it carries `Origin`, must come from the page's own origin or one in `server.allowed_origins`; without `Origin`, `Sec-Fetch-Site` must be `same-origin`, `none` or absent. Else 403 `bad_origin`."],[2953,"**Origin**：改变状态的请求（非 `GET`/`HEAD`/`OPTIONS`）和所有 WebSocket 握手，若带 `Origin`，必须是页面自身的源或 `server.allowed_origins` 中的一个；不带 `Origin` 时，`Sec-Fetch-Site` 只能是 `same-origin`、`none` 或缺失。否则 403 `bad_origin`。"],[13675,"**Out of date**: each finished stage records what it read — the dataset, the base model's revision and the settings it uses, and the earlier stages' results. When any of these changes, that stage and every stage after it are **Out of date** (**What this stage read has changed since it ran (the dataset, the model or a setting it uses): run it again.**). Running a stage again also makes the finished stages after it out of date, since they read its old files."],[13489,"**Output**: **Format** (WAV, FLAC, MP3, OGG, M4A), **Sample rate** (**The model’s own**, or 16–48 kHz) and **Levelling** (**Peak**, **Loudness**, **None**). The defaults come from **Settings › Speech**."],[12458,"**Padding.** The collator pads with `<|end_of_text|>`, which S2's vocabulary lacks: upstream pads with 0, and so does Mizuoto."],[10838,"**Parameter mapping**: Mizuoto's common names map onto upstream's generation config (`num_steps → num_step`, `temperature → class_temperature`), engine options fill the rest."],[13487,"**Parameters** lists only what this model takes; a value you leave alone is not sent, so the engine uses its own default. The engine's own options are under **Engine options**."],[8051,"**Parameters**: **Steps** (the diffusion's Euler steps per patch, 10), **Guidance scale** (2.0), **Text normalisation** (off; numbers, dates and symbols written out by wetext), **Max new tokens** (patches, 4096). Options: `min_len`, `retry_badcase` (on: a result much longer than its text is generated again with the next seed, at most `retry_badcase_max_times`; not when streaming), `retry_badcase_ratio_threshold`, `reference_prefix`."],[13228,"**Parameters**: the same panel as in Speak; it shows **N set** when you changed some."],[7462,"**Partly downloaded**"],[13082,"**Partly downloaded**"],[8184,"**Partly downloaded** can also mean a shared file it needs is missing; downloading the model again fetches it."],[13244,"**Pause after a line (ms)**"],[13247,"**Pause after a paragraph (ms)**"],[13250,"**Pause between chapters (ms)**"],[12530,"**Pauses and output.** The pause after each fragment is counted at 32 kHz whatever the output rate, and the audio is truncated to 16 bits (`(x × 32768).astype(int16)`), as upstream returns it."],[13355,"**Peak**"],[13356,"**Peak**, **Loudness** or **None**"],[10958,"**pins** the host copies of streamed weights (page-locked memory makes copies asynchronous and about twice as fast) within `compute.max_pinned_mb`, by default ComfyUI's budget: 40 % of RAM on Windows, elsewhere `max(0.4 × RAM, min(0.9 × RAM, RAM − 4 GB))`. Beyond it weights stay pageable and copy synchronously. XPU and MPS copy synchronously."],[10432,"**Place components per phase and estimate memory per request.** Engines put each phase's components on the device with `ctx.use` / `ctx.run`; a module whose weights are read outside its `forward` is marked `fixed`; a module that needs float64 is placed through `DeviceService.float64_device`. See Memory management."],[10031,"**Plain `def`**: routes that touch the disk and the database run in the thread pool. Only uploads that read the raw body (`uploads.spool()` streams it to a temporary file, never parsing multipart) and WebSockets are `async def`."],[10215,"**Plan before the queue.** `TtsService.plan()` checks the model's state, whether the engine is enabled and available, the licence, text, language, voice mode, references, parameters and device against the manifest, all before any job exists (GPU memory is not estimated: a model always tries to load); an error comes back at once with its code."],[13495,"**Plan** shows **What will happen** without speaking: the model, the voice mode, language, device, the number of segments, the parameters sent, each reference clip (and whether it is **transcribed first**) and **Notes**. Unsuitable settings fail here already."],[12507,"**Post-processing**: each fragment limited to a peak of 1, followed by the fragment pause, and the whole truncated to 16 bits."],[12402,"**Precision on a GPU.** The model is cast to its dtype *before* the checkpoint is copied in, as upstream does, so on a GPU the rotary embedding's `inv_freq` is fp16 too and the angles are computed in fp16."],[12834,"**Precision.** On CUDA, as upstream: float32 weights under bf16 autocast with a gradient scaler. Elsewhere float32 throughout: upstream cannot train off CUDA with its configurations (its forward casts the inputs to the config's bf16 while the weights stay float32), so its CPU reference is upstream with a `config.json` that says float32."],[12815,"**Precision.** The model is cast before the checkpoint is copied in, as upstream does, so the LongRoPE tables (built in float32) are rounded to bf16 with it."],[9472,"**Precision**"],[13103,"**Precision**: **Automatic**, `bf16`, `fp16` or `fp32`."],[8054,"**Precision**: the models' own bf16 on every device but Apple's (fp32 there), as upstream; `engines.voxcpm.dtype fp32` for full precision."],[12011,"**Preparing.** `prepare` (the `dataset_prepare` job, resource `cpu`) cuts at silences with slicer2 at GPT-SoVITS's defaults, transcribes through ASR and peak-normalises."],[13460,"**Preset speaker**"],[7947,"**Preset speakers** (v1 SFT / Instruct): 中文女, 中文男, 日语男, 粤语女, 英文女, 英文男, 韩语女."],[7939,"**Preset speakers**, **Instructions**, **Streaming**, **Speed**, **Inline tags**, **Long text** (no cloning)"],[7894,"**Preset speakers**: aiden, dylan, eric, ono_anna, ryan, serena, sohee, uncle_fu, vivian."],[13706,"**Preset**"],[13490,"**Presets** opens a menu:"],[13678,"**Previews**: with **Settings › Training › Speak a preview after training** on, the export stage speaks a sample with what was trained; it is listed here."],[13759,"**Projects**"],[13138,"**Projects** are for long-form reading: a book, a script or a dialogue with several voices. A project has two parts:"],[11683,"**Protocol 2** (`AGENT_PROTOCOL` in `mizuoto/core/remote/wire.py`) works at the level of a loaded engine. The frames are `mizuoto/core/remote/frames.py`'s (a 4-byte length, a kind, a JSON body or a JSON header plus raw bytes), over TCP or TLS:"],[12670,"**pydub without pydub.** Silence removal on the prompt and the output is reproduced on int16 arrays with pydub's arithmetic: millisecond lengths rounded, positions truncated, `audioop.rms` floored. `audioop` is gone in Python 3.13, so a port was needed anyway."],[10408,"**Python ≥ 3.10**, with 3.10–3.13 supported. `ty` checks types for 3.10, so do not use syntax or standard-library modules newer than that (`tomllib` needs its `tomli` fallback)."],[3392,"**Python ≥ 3.10**，支持 3.10–3.13。`ty` 以 3.10 为目标检查类型，所以不要用 3.11 之后才有的语法和标准库（`tomllib` 要有 `tomli` 回退）。"],[12329,"**Qwen2 as transformers 4.51 ran it.** CosyVoice 2/3's language model ran on transformers 4.51, whose SDPA path always repeats the KV heads and makes q, k and v contiguous (`QwenConfig.sdpa_gqa=False`)."],[12348,"**Qwen2 trains under transformers 4.51's additive mask** (`causal_mask_451`); the logged `loss` is divided by the accumulation steps, as upstream logs it; CosyVoice 1 keeps the recipe's `WarmupLR` (2500 steps)."],[5332,"**Qwen2 在 transformers 4.51 的加性掩码下训练**（`causal_mask_451`）；记录的 `loss` 除以累积步数，与上游的记录方式相同；CosyVoice 1 保留流程中的 `WarmupLR`（2500 步）。"],[10426,"**Randomness comes from the request.** Use `ctx.generator_for(device)` and `ctx.rng`; pass the generator to every random op (`torch.randn(..., generator=g)`), and draw in upstream's order, shapes and device. Calls that take no generator, such as `randn_like`, are rewritten in an equivalent explicit form. Where upstream draws from the global generator while it builds a model, replay the draws on a private generator."],[12939,"**Randomness from the request.** Every draw comes from `ctx.generator_for(device)` or `ctx.rng`, never from torch's global generator. A fresh `torch.Generator` seeded with *s* gives the same stream as the default generator after `torch.manual_seed(s)`, on the CPU and on CUDA (`check_rng.py`), so drawing upstream's draws in upstream's order reproduces upstream's seeded run. Where upstream draws while it builds a model (default initialisations that consume the global generator), the port replays those draws on a private generator when their values matter (CosyVoice 3's vocoder noise, the trainers' initialisations) or jumps the generator over them (Fish Speech's trainer)."],[12817,"**Randomness.** The CFM's noise is the only draw at inference, one `randn` per patch in the model's dtype. Each attempt draws from a fresh generator seeded with its seed, which is where upstream's `torch.manual_seed` puts the process-wide stream. Without a seed, a 32-bit seed comes from the request's stream (upstream: `torch.seed()`) and is reported in the applied parameters."],[10841,"**Randomness**: the Gumbel noise draws from `ctx.generator_for(self.device)`; HuBERT's layer-drop draws (made even in eval mode upstream) from `ctx.generator_for(\"cpu\")`."],[11783,"**Real models**: the contract suite drives installed models through the whole stack, and the parity harness compares the native engines with their references sample for sample. Developers run these by hand when they change an engine."],[10436,"**Record every deviation.** Each place a port differs from upstream (to run on every platform, to leave global state alone, because upstream depended on thread timing…) goes into the engine's notes and the design record `AGENTS.md`, with the comparison's numbers."],[13469,"**Record** with the microphone. While recording it shows the **Input level** and **A voice reference works best between 3 and 30 seconds of clear speech.**; then **Stop and add** or **Discard**. Browsers allow the microphone only over HTTPS or on this computer (localhost)."],[7975,"**Reference clips**: 1–12 s, at least 16 kHz."],[8027,"**Reference clips**: 1–20 s, at least 16 kHz. 24 kHz output."],[7896,"**Reference clips**: 1–30 s, at least 16 kHz (3–20 s works best). With the clip's transcript it follows the voice more closely."],[7949,"**Reference clips**: 1–30 s, at least 16 kHz."],[8053,"**Reference clips**: 1–30 s, at least 16 kHz. Output: 48 kHz (VoxCPM2), 44.1 kHz (1.5), 16 kHz (0.5B)."],[8106,"**Reference clips**: 1–30 s."],[8069,"**Reference clips**: 2–30 s."],[8009,"**Reference clips**: 3–10 s."],[12504,"**Reference**: the clip at 16 kHz with 0.3 s of silence appended; HuBERT's features quantised by SoVITS into the prompt's semantic tokens; the linear spectrogram for the style encoder; for v2Pro the speaker-verification embedding. v4/v5 also take the mel of the last clip read at 32 kHz as the flow's prompt."],[12446,"**References** are resampled with torchaudio's kernel to 44.1 kHz."],[13366,"**Refuse parameters a model does not take**"],[8200,"**Refused**: the token is wrong, or the two Mizuoto versions do not match. Give the token again with `mizuoto remote add <name> <address> --token <token>`; it is in the agent machine's `settings.toml` (`remote.agent.token`)."],[10509,"**Relative URLs plus a development proxy**: front-end code uses the same relative URLs in development and production."],[13233,"**Render all (N)**: the same for the whole project."],[13232,"**Render chapter (N)**: renders every line of the open chapter that is not **Rendered** (not rendered, changed or failed)."],[13189,"**Render this line again**: renders a new take of this line now, even when it is current;"],[13210,"**Rendered**"],[13218,"**Rendering**"],[13530,"**Replace parts of a recording with new words in the same voice.** It needs a model with speech editing: F5-TTS (v1 Base, Base, E2-TTS)."],[13393,"**Repository**"],[10435,"**Reproduce first, fix after.** Upstream's quirks (draw order, padding, alignment edge cases) are reproduced as they are and shown identical with the parity harness; a fix, where one is needed, is a separate change with the deviation and its reason recorded."],[9837,"**Resolution.** Each call is described by a `Call` (device kind, capability, dtype, head dims, GQA, one query or many, equal lengths, more than 1024 queries, mask kind, `mask_info`'s structure, a custom scale, causal, dropout, whether a gradient is needed), hashable, so a decode loop resolves once per `(site, Call)`. A backend is skipped when:"],[12020,"**Resources**: `engine:<engine>:<dev>` and `gpu:<dev>` (`cpu` on a CPU), so it waits for the engine's own inference and other jobs on the GPU. The device is `training.devices[0]`, else the engine's. A GPU run takes `gpu:<dev>` whole (`JobSpec.exclusive`, whatever `compute.gpu_jobs` allows); before it starts, the engine's loaded models are unloaded (`runtime.unload_engine`) and every other idle model's weights on that device move to RAM (`runtime.release_device`), and no model comes back while it runs. The run's peak memory is then estimated; when it exceeds the free memory the log warns, naming the preset that would fit."],[10221,"**REST is the truth; the socket only pushes.** `SocketBridge` (`mizuoto/api/sockets.py`) subscribes to the `EventBus`, hands each event from the job thread to the event loop with `call_soon_threadsafe`, and emits it under its event name. Events carry snapshots, never live objects."],[3205,"**REST 是事实来源，socket 只负责推送。** `SocketBridge`（`mizuoto/api/sockets.py`）订阅 `EventBus`，用 `call_soon_threadsafe` 把任务线程上的事件交给事件循环，按事件名发出。事件携带的是快照，从不是活对象。"],[13348,"**Result format**"],[13351,"**Result sample rate**"],[13498,"**Results** lists what you spoke on this screen. Each shows its text, duration, waveform (click to seek), model, time taken, real-time factor (RTF) and seed, with any warnings and licence notices. Its menu:"],[10409,"**ruff and ty are unpinned**, and `pyproject.toml` writes `lint.select` out rule by rule (`E4`, `E7`, `E9`, `F`, `I`, `UP`, `B`, `SIM`, `RUF100`, `ANN`), so a ruff upgrade cannot quietly change the rule set. Line length 180, indent 4. ty runs with `error-on-warning`. `python scripts/dev.py format` formats and applies the safe fixes; `lint` and `typecheck-py` only check."],[3393,"**ruff 与 ty 不锁版本**，`pyproject.toml` 把 `lint.select` 逐条写出（`E4`、`E7`、`E9`、`F`、`I`、`UP`、`B`、`SIM`、`RUF100`、`ANN`），所以升级 ruff 不会悄悄改变规则集。行宽 180，缩进 4。ty 以 `error-on-warning` 运行。`python scripts/dev.py format` 格式化并做安全的自动修复，`lint` 和 `typecheck-py` 只检查。"],[13056,"**Run again with these settings**"],[13511,"**Run again with these settings**"],[11024,"**Run the tiny model under `streaming.py`**: every unit streamed, half, none, strict. A failure there names the component used outside its phase or the weight read outside its unit."],[13669,"**Run this stage**"],[13369,"**Run waiting requests together**"],[13372,"**Run waiting requests together**: requests for the same model and voice that differ only in their text run as one batch, on engines that take one (Qwen3-TTS, GPT-SoVITS, OmniVoice). Only one-segment requests without a seed qualify: just before calling the engine, the running job takes the queued jobs with exactly the same settings along, makes them in one go and stores each one's result; if the batch fails, those jobs go back to the queue to run on their own. Requests with a seed are never joined, since a batch draws random numbers differently. Rendering a project relies on this to go faster."],[13667,"**Run**"],[12589,"**s2mel**: a length regulator and Seed-VC's DiT as a CFM (25 Euler steps, guidance 0.7) make the mel."],[5573,"**s2mel**：长度调节器和作为 CFM 的 Seed-VC DiT（25 步欧拉，引导强度 0.7）生成 mel。"],[13256,"**Sample rate**"],[8007,"**Sample rate**: 32 kHz for v2 / v2Pro / v2ProPlus, 48 kHz for v4 / v5 Turbo."],[12444,"**Sampling** draws from the request's generator in upstream's order: the main token twice (with the request's temperature and top-p, then with 1.0 and 0.9 for repetition-aware sampling), then nine fast-transformer draws. A draw is `argmax(probs / -log(u))`. Top-k is fixed at 30, as upstream fixes it."],[13492,"**Save as a preset…**: a **Preset name**; with **Only for** *model* checked it keeps every parameter, otherwise only the common parameters, for every model (a preset holding engine options is for the current model only). **Apply it whenever this model is picked** makes it the model's default."],[13522,"**Say what a recording says in another voice, keeping its words and timing.** It needs a model with voice conversion: CosyVoice (300M, 300M SFT, 2, 3)."],[13039,"**Search the text**: the result's text or name;"],[13488,"**Seed**: empty means **A new seed each time**; a number means **Keep this seed**, so the same input gives the same result. The dice button is **Roll a seed**; the unlock button goes back to a new seed each time."],[11859,"**Self-consistency first.** The reference is compared with a repeat of itself (`--name reference-repeat`) before anything is compared with it: a case that does not repeat cannot judge the native one. `cases/<engine>.jsonl` holds one case per line; the README explains its fields."],[13310,"**Server address**, **Port**"],[13470,"**Server files** picks a file on the server (only in a browser on the server machine)."],[11021,"**Set `PHASED = True` and run each part in a phase**: `ctx.run` for pure blocks, `ctx.use` for blocks that yield or consume a generator. Pass `generators=` for any generator the engine owns besides the context's, so a retry replays it."],[12999,"**Settings › Compute**"],[14015,"**Settings › Compute**: this computer's GPUs and the torch build in use, with the command to install the right build when it does not fit (the same check as `mizuoto doctor`)."],[14014,"**Settings › Downloads › Download source**: where models come from (**Hugging Face**, **hf-mirror.com**, **ModelScope**; the last two are often faster in mainland China)."],[12997,"**Settings › Downloads**"],[13683,"**Settings › Training** also has **Training precision**, **Checkpoints kept per run** and **Memory**: *Standard* trains as each recipe does; *Low* adds gradient checkpointing (each block of the model runs again in the backward pass instead of keeping its activations) and keeps what is not needed off the GPU, with the same results, about a third slower; *Lowest* also keeps the optimizer's state in RAM and streams LoRA's frozen weights from RAM, whose results differ slightly. A method's own **gradient_checkpointing** hyperparameter overrides it."],[7442,"**Settings** › **Downloads** › **Download source**; with **Custom**, fill in **Custom endpoint**."],[7487,"**Settings** › **Downloads** › **Repository**: **mizuoto-model mirror first** (the default). The mirror is fetched from the place chosen in **Download source**. **Each model's own repository** skips the mirror."],[8153,"**Settings** › **General** has **Set token** and **Clear token**; on the command line:"],[8447,"**Settings** › **Remote hosts** › **Add a host**: fill in **Name**, **Address** and **Token**, turn on **TLS** and give the **CA file on this machine** when needed, then **Add**. When changing a host, leave **Token** empty to keep the saved one."],[13771,"**Settings** (at the bottom)"],[13677,"**Settings** holds the method's hyperparameters (number fields), the rest under **Advanced**. **Changing a setting makes the stages that use it, and those after them, out of date.** Click **Save** after changing them."],[13302,"**Settings** is at the bottom of the navigation; the tabs at the top split it into nine parts. Most settings are saved as soon as you change them, with **Settings saved**; text fields save when you leave them; **Storage** has its own **Save** button."],[9650,"**Settings**: `mizuoto config set` writes `settings.toml`; a running server reads the change within about a second and the web UI refreshes. The server's address and port take effect the next time it starts."],[10244,"**Shared assets** (a manifest's `[[assets]]`) are files several models of one engine share, kept in `models/_assets/<engine>/<name>/` with `asset.json`; they download with the first model that needs them, or alone. Archive parts are verified and unpacked in place. Engines get them as `LoadSpec.options[\"assets\"]` (id → folder)."],[7952,"**Shared files**: `cosyvoice/wetext` (13 MB, the text normalisation grammars that write out numbers, dates and units), downloaded with the first model."],[8011,"**Shared files**: every model needs `gptsovits/encoders` (1.0 GB), `gptsovits/g2pw` (562 MB), `gptsovits/nltk-data` and `gptsovits/open-jtalk`, downloaded with the first model; training v2, v2Pro and v2ProPlus also needs the matching discriminator `gptsovits/s2d-*`."],[8109,"**Shared files**: IndexTTS-2 and 2.5 need `indextts/w2v-bert` (2.2 GB), `indextts/campplus` and `indextts/bigvgan`, and IndexTTS-2 also `indextts/semantic-codec`; they are downloaded with the model."],[13634,"**Shortest piece kept (s)**"],[13050,"**Show in folder**"],[13505,"**Show in folder**"],[13637,"**Silence below (dB)**"],[12619,"**Sizes from the configuration.** Sizes upstream hard-codes (w2v-BERT's width, `gpt_layer`) come from the configuration, so tiny test models build; the real models give the same numbers."],[12326,"**Sizes from the yaml.** Module sizes come from the model's own yaml (HyperPyYAML's tags read as data), not from code."],[12824,"**Snake** is the TorchScript function upstream scripts; weight norm is folded with `torch._weight_norm`, the call upstream's hook makes at each forward."],[5808,"**Snake** 是上游用 TorchScript 编译的那个函数；权重归一化用 `torch._weight_norm` 折叠，即上游钩子在每次前向时做的调用。"],[5148,"**Socket。** 在 `api/socket.ts` 处理新事件，并在 `AFFECTS` 中登记新任务种类影响的键："],[12549,"**SoVITS** (`train_s2.py`): `s2_train.py`'s and `s2_train_v3_lora.py`'s losses at every step and their saved weights tensor for tensor (half precision, version tag, no `enc_q`) on the CPU seeded alike, for v2, v2Pro, v2ProPlus, v4 and v5 Turbo (accumulation, gradient checkpointing, two epochs). v4 and v5 train SoVITS as a LoRA. Upstream lists clips from a `set`, whose order changes per process; they are sorted here. The WaveNet gate is TorchScript-compiled as upstream's (its gradients differ from eager ones in the last bits). Without the `s2d-*` asset the SoVITS stage refuses, as 0.1 did."],[12506,"**SoVITS** (v2 family) decodes tokens, phones and the style into 32 kHz audio; v4/v5 make a mel with the flow, then the vocoder makes 48 kHz audio."],[5533,"**SoVITS**（`train_s2.py`）：在 CPU 上以相同种子运行时，每一步的损失与 `s2_train.py` 和 `s2_train_v3_lora.py` 相同，保存的权重逐张量相同（半精度、版本标记、无 `enc_q`），覆盖 v2、v2Pro、v2ProPlus、v4 和 v5 Turbo（梯度累积、梯度检查点、两个 epoch）。v4 和 v5 以 LoRA 训练 SoVITS。上游从一个 `set` 列出音频，顺序随进程变化；这里排序。WaveNet 门控与上游一样用 TorchScript 编译（其梯度与即时执行在最后几位上不同）。没有 `s2d-*` 共享资源时 SoVITS 阶段拒绝运行，与 0.1 相同。"],[5490,"**SoVITS**（v2 系列）把 token、音素和风格解码为 32 kHz 音频；v4/v5 先由流模型生成梅尔谱，再由声码器生成 48 kHz 音频。"],[13384,"**Speak a preview after training**"],[13757,"**Speak**"],[13496,"**Speak** submits a speak job. Its card shows at the bottom of the page; when it is done the result appears under **Results**. Several jobs fold into one line, **… jobs**, saying how many run and how many wait (**… running · … waiting**), with their progress together and a button that cancels them all; open it to see each job's card in a list that scrolls. Synthesis jobs run one at a time by default, across all engines and devices; the others wait in order, showing **Waiting for other synthesis jobs** (**Settings › Compute › Synthesis jobs at once**)."],[13437,"**Speak** turns text into speech. From top to bottom the screen has **Model**, **Voice**, **Text**, **Style** (when the model has it), **Parameters** and **Results**; the **Speak** button stays at the bottom of the page. Each part shows only what the chosen model supports, so the screen changes with the model."],[13223,"**Speaker name**; the first speaker carries the **Narrator** badge; beside it the speaker's number of lines and a remove button. A removed speaker's lines go to the narrator."],[13186,"**Speaker**: who says the line; choosing the first speaker (the narrator) means no speaker;"],[13360,"**Speech recognition model**"],[12327,"**Speech tokens and CAM++ without onnxruntime.** The speech tokenizers are s3tokenizer's torch models with the weights read from the ONNX file; their codes equal onnxruntime's on the test corpus for v1, v2 and v3. CAM++ mirrors the exported graph (batch norms after convolutions folded, as the export folded them) and agrees with onnxruntime to about 1e-6 relative, not bit for bit."],[9434,"**Speech** › **A reference clip too long for a model**"],[9410,"**Speech** › **Default model**"],[9422,"**Speech** › **Levelling**"],[9442,"**Speech** › **Refuse parameters a model does not take**"],[9414,"**Speech** › **Result format**"],[9418,"**Speech** › **Result sample rate**"],[9450,"**Speech** › **Run waiting requests together**"],[9430,"**Speech** › **Speech recognition model**"],[9426,"**Speech** › **Transcribe reference clips without a transcript**"],[10437,"**Speed work keeps results.** Performance work (CUDA graphs, removed waits, compilation, weight streaming) must give the same tokens and the same audio; each round is compared with the previous one by `scripts/parity/perf.py` and `train_perf.py` (see Performance work). An optimisation that does change bits (Qwen3-TTS's `fused_projections`, `compute.kv_cache = static`) can only be an opt-in setting, and is listed in the output's parameters."],[13418,"**Standard**, **Medium**, **High**"],[13671,"**Start over**"],[9265,"**Storage** › **Cache**"],[9532,"**Storage** › **Delete results after days (0: keep)**"],[9269,"**Storage** › **Folders the browser may open**"],[9241,"**Storage** › **Models**"],[9249,"**Storage** › **Results**"],[9245,"**Storage** › **Voices**"],[13497,"**Stream**: with this switch (beside **Plan** and **Speak**) on, **Speak** plays the audio as it is made. Hover over it to see how this model streams: CosyVoice starts within moments of the first words; the other engines play each sentence as soon as it is ready; or Mizuoto splits the text and plays each part as soon as it is ready. The player bar shows **… played · … ready ahead** and offers **Stop**. When the model falls behind, playback pauses and waits rather than dropping speech; the whole result is still kept under **Results**."],[12741,"**Streaming is per segment**, as in 0.1: the model's whole segment is generated, then decoded."],[12540,"**Streaming speaks every text.** In streaming mode upstream speaks only the first text of each `batch_size` group."],[7300,"**Streaming text**: with a model that has **Streaming text** (CosyVoice 2 and 3), set `\"text_stream\": true`; `text` is only the beginning. Send the rest as `{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"…\"}` messages and `{\"type\": \"flush\"}` after the last. Leaving before the flush cancels the job."],[8400,"**Streaming, streamed text and cancelling work.** Audio chunks come back as they are made; a cancel is forwarded to the engine on the agent."],[7950,"**Streaming**: v2/v3 stream token by token; streamed text input needs the reference clip's transcript (zero-shot cloning or instruct2)."],[12942,"**Strict checkpoints.** A missing or unexpected key is an error; upstream sometimes kept random weights for missing keys."],[12620,"**Strict loading.** Checkpoints load strictly; upstream keeps random weights for missing keys (none are missing in the published checkpoints)."],[13330,"**Synthesis jobs at once**"],[10219,"**Synthesis.** `synthesize(task, request)` is a generator of `AudioChunk`s (float32 mono numpy samples, a sample rate, a segment index). The job drains it chunk by chunk (and hands each chunk to a `StreamSink` when the client streams); closing the generator stops the engine. One `SynthesisTask` per segment, or one batched task."],[11866,"**T0 Op**"],[4875,"**T0 的 DSP 夹具只在生成它们的那类机器上完全相同**：带 AVX2、不带 AVX-512 的 x86-64 Linux，且 torch 版本相同。在别处，内核的舍入不同（numpy 的 AVX-512 `exp` 和 `log`、Windows CRT 的 libm、Arm 上 torch 的 FFT 和 soxr 的 SIMD、另一个 torch 版本），所以 `tests/runtime/test_dsp.py` 在那里检查输出在这种舍入之内一致：float32 最大绝对误差 ≤ 1e-4 × max(1, ‖ref‖∞)，float64 ≤ 1e-12 × max(1, ‖ref‖∞)。CI 的 macOS、Windows 和 AVX-512 机器上实测最大为 4e-5。"],[4850,"**T0 运算**"],[11891,"**T0's DSP fixtures are identical on the machine class that made them**: x86-64 Linux with AVX2 and without AVX-512, under the same torch. Elsewhere the kernels round differently (numpy's AVX-512 `exp` and `log`, the Windows CRT's libm, torch's FFT and soxr's SIMD on Arm, another torch), so `tests/runtime/test_dsp.py` checks there that the outputs agree within that rounding: max abs error ≤ 1e-4 × max(1, ‖ref‖∞) in float32, 1e-12 × max(1, ‖ref‖∞) in float64. CI's macOS, Windows and AVX-512 runners measured up to 4e-5."],[11870,"**T1 Module**"],[4854,"**T1 模块**"],[11876,"**T2 Stage**"],[4860,"**T2 阶段**"],[11880,"**T3 End to end, seeded**"],[4864,"**T3 端到端（带种子）**"],[11884,"**T4 Statistical**"],[4868,"**T4 统计**"],[13203,"**Take N (s s)**"],[12337,"**TensorRT, vLLM and JIT** (0.1's load options `load_trt`, `trt_concurrent`, `load_vllm`) are not available."],[5321,"**TensorRT、vLLM 和 JIT**（0.1 的加载选项 `load_trt`、`trt_concurrent`、`load_vllm`）不可用。"],[12616,"**Text (1.5, 2)** is normalised by WeTextProcessing's own FSTs applied with kaldifst. Upstream runs pynini on Linux and other FSTs elsewhere; Mizuoto gives the Linux behaviour on every platform. Names and pinyin are numbered in first-seen order (upstream uses a `set`'s order, which varies between runs)."],[12169,"**Text and tests.** Add `nav.projects` and `projects.*` to `en.ts` and `zh-CN.ts`; rows that may hold a long name get `min-width: 0` (listed in `layout.test.ts` where it matters). Run `python scripts/dev.py test-web` (vitest and `vue-tsc`)."],[12503,"**Text front end**: language segmentation, then each language's grapheme-to-phoneme conversion into phone ids; Chinese also gets BERT features (chinese-roberta's third-last layer, repeated per phone)."],[12333,"**Text normalisation** is wetext's normaliser ported over kaldifst, identical on the corpus; its FSTs are the asset `cosyvoice/wetext` (ModelScope `pengzhendong/wetext` at a pinned commit). Text containing `<|…|>` is not normalised, as upstream skips it."],[13187,"**Text**: Ctrl+Enter in it inserts a line below;"],[12740,"**The 25 Hz tokenizer is not implemented.** No released model uses it, and upstream's wrapper cannot decode its output either."],[7193,"**The access token.** With `server.access_token` set, every request under `/api/`, `/ws/`, `/v1/`, `/openapi.json` and `/docs` must carry it, else 401 `auth_required`. The only exception is `GET /api/v1/app/health`. Give the token in any of these ways:"],[12666,"**The attention mask.** The language model is `runtime/lm/qwen`'s decoder under a full 4-D boolean mask: transformers returns a 4-D mask as it is, and SDPA gets it with the KV heads repeated, not causal. The conditional and unconditional rows run in one batch, as upstream batches them."],[13140,"**The cast**: each speaker has its own model, voice (a library voice, a preset speaker or the model's own voice), language, way of speaking and parameters. **The first speaker is the narrator**: lines without a speaker are theirs. A speaker without a model uses the project's."],[9828,"**The chain.** A named backend comes first, then `fast`'s chain for the call, then the site's reference:"],[12178,"**The code** and its tests: when anything else disagrees with them, they win."],[12738,"**The codec.** The encoder's transformer runs with a plain causal mask (its configured 250-frame window is ignored, as upstream's encode path ignores it); the decoder's transformer applies its 72-frame window. Decoding is in upstream's chunks (300 frames with 25 of left context), and when cloning in context the reference's share is cut off after the joint decode."],[10545,"**The component layer** (`src/ui/`): the components `@material/web` has (buttons, icon buttons, FAB, checkbox, filter chip, divider, text field, slider, progress, switch, tabs) are wrapped in project Vue components; the rest (shell, navigation, dialogs, sheets, menus, cards, snackbar, stepper, charts, waveforms…) are built from tokens. Feature code imports only from `@/ui`."],[12937,"**The contract suite** (`python scripts/dev.py test-engines`) drives the installed real models through planning, jobs and the runtime: every voice mode audible and intelligible (WER under 0.35 by speech recognition), seeds that repeat, segments, cancelling, and no residue in the process."],[10136,"**The core does not need torch to start.** Listing models, editing settings or serving the UI never loads a model; the runtime is built the first time a model loads."],[10054,"**The core method.** Write it in `mizuoto/core/<area>/service.py`, taking and returning `Record` models (`mizuoto/core/<area>/models.py`); raise only the classes in `core/errors.py`. If it changes something the UI shows, publish an event (a new event is a new `EventBase` subclass in `core/events/models.py`; the schema picks it up)."],[11781,"**The core's tests** need no GPU and no model: the dummy engine carries planning, jobs, the runtime service, streaming, cancellation and errors end to end, in the test's own process."],[10463,"**The design record.** `AGENTS.md` at the repository root records what the code does, the rules it keeps and why, and durable findings (such as which upstream behaviours a port reproduces to give the same output). Update it with any change of design or new finding."],[12615,"**The emotion embedding** is read from the clip again at 16 kHz, not from the 22.05 kHz copy resampled: it is a separate field of the voice cache."],[13377,"**The engine’s device**"],[11782,"**The engines' tests** run every engine and trainer on a tiny model with random weights, on the CPU, including runs partly loaded and streamed on a simulated device, also in CI."],[10971,"**The exact retry** (`compute.oom_retry`, on). When a phase run through `ctx.run` runs out of device memory:"],[13386,"**The export stage tries what was trained on a dataset clip**"],[12836,"**The export.** Full: `model.safetensors` (float32, upstream's keys) beside the base model's config, VAE and tokenizer. LoRA: the base weights (hard-linked where the file system allows) with `lora_weights.safetensors` and `lora_config.json`, applied when the engine loads, as upstream's `VoxCPM(lora_weights_path=…)` does; upstream never merges them. Without a 3–15 s clip the preview is spoken zero-shot."],[12459,"**The export** is upstream's flat `dual_ar` form (`config.json` + `model.pth`), which both 0.1 and Mizuoto load. The final validation pass is skipped (it changes nothing that is kept)."],[12411,"**The export** keeps the EMA weights with upstream's keys, the vocabulary and the vocoder, so both 0.1 and Mizuoto load it."],[12742,"**The frame rate is 12.5** (0.1 used 12.0; it only affected progress estimates)."],[7191,"**The Host header.** While the server is bound to a loopback address (`127.0.0.1` by default), `Host` must be `localhost`, `127.0.0.1`, `::1`, the bound address, or a name the embedding application added with `extra_hosts` / `allow_host()`; anything else is 400 `bad_host`. This blocks DNS rebinding. Bound to a non-loopback address (such as `0.0.0.0`), the server does not check `Host`."],[10216,"**The job.** `speak` holds `engine:<engine>:<device>` (capacity 1: a loaded engine serves one request at a time) and `gpu:<device>` when the device is not the CPU. The request is stored as JSON, so **retry** re-plans it after a restart."],[11477,"**The lower bound** is the oldest Mizuoto release with everything the package uses. CI tests the package on that release from PyPI (the `oldest-mizuoto` job); raise the bound when the package starts using something newer, and release Mizuoto first."],[12252,"**The model is its own.** CosyVoice's speech tokenizers also contain a Whisper encoder, but openai's attention there (q and k each scaled by d^-¼, masked) is another computation, so the two are not shared."],[10217,"**The model.** `RuntimeService.loaded(ModelRef(id, engine, variant, path), device, dtype, options, request)` returns the model's `EngineHandle`: a `LocalHandle` for this process, a `RemoteEngineHandle` for a device named `<host>/<device>`. It loads the model first unless it is loaded, after unloading others beyond `compute.max_resident_models`."],[13352,"**The model’s own**"],[10567,"**The node graph and the custom-node ecosystem.** A typed engine registry with entry points is enough, and the licence-gated engines register exactly that way."],[12822,"**The normaliser** is wetext 0.1.2's: the text stripped before tagging and after each FST, and with `remove_erhua` also text with 儿 and no digit handled. Its FSTs differ from those of wetext 0.0.4 (CosyVoice's asset) and of WeTextProcessing (IndexTTS), so they ship with the engine. Numbers are spelled by `inflect`; Mizuoto's 7.3.1 and upstream's 7.5.0 give the same words on the corpus."],[12400,"**The ODE.** torchdiffeq's fixed-grid Euler and midpoint steps are `nn.flow.cfm.odeint_fixed`; the grid is upstream's Empirically Pruned Step Sampling for 5, 6, 7, 10, 12 or 16 steps, otherwise a linear grid with sway sampling. Noise is drawn as upstream draws it, per item in the model's dtype."],[7192,"**The origin.** A state-changing request (anything but `GET`, `HEAD` and `OPTIONS`) or a WebSocket that carries an `Origin` must come from the page's own origin or one listed in `server.allowed_origins`, else 403 `bad_origin`; without an `Origin`, a `Sec-Fetch-Site` that says cross-site is refused too. curl, Python and other non-browser clients send neither header and are not affected. A non-empty `server.allowed_origins` also turns on CORS for those origins."],[10220,"**The output.** The segments are joined with the segment pause, normalised, resampled to the output rate, encoded (PyAV) and recorded as an `Output` with the applied parameters, timings (load, first chunk, total, RTF) and licence tags."],[12934,"**The parity harness** (`scripts/parity/`) runs cases through a whole Mizuoto stack with either implementation and compares the runs: `stack.py run <cases> --impl reference|native` (VoxCPM: `--impl upstream|native`), `compare.py <engine>`, and `train.py run|compare` for the trainers. The cases are `scripts/parity/cases/<engine>.jsonl` (74 in all); the environments, clips, fixtures and reports live outside the repository in `MIZUOTO_PARITY_DIR`. The reference is first compared with a repeat of itself: a case that does not repeat cannot judge the port. Its commands are in Testing."],[12328,"**The prompt mel** is Matcha's at 24 kHz for every version; v2/v3 keep exactly two mel frames per prompt token. v3 drops runs of more than five silent tokens and gets its system prompt (`You are a helpful assistant.<|endofprompt|>`)."],[12819,"**The prompt.** VoxCPM2 reads the clip with `librosa.load(sr=16000)` (soxr); 0.5B and 1.5 with `torchaudio.load` and `torchaudio.functional.resample`. A continuation prompt is padded to whole patches on the left, a reference on the right. The transcript and the text are joined without a space, as upstream joins them."],[12443,"**The prompt** is upstream's conversation, each text part tokenised alone; a frame's main token is `semantic_begin_id + code`."],[12397,"**The reference** is trimmed and padded as `preprocess_ref_audio_text` does, levelled to `target_rms` and resampled with torchaudio's `Resample`. pydub's 50 ms pad is reproduced from `audioop.ratecv`'s frame count (`edge_pad`: 1198 samples at 24 kHz, not 1200), since `audioop` is gone in Python 3.13."],[12344,"**The reference** is upstream with its generators seeded with the stage's seed once its model is built: upstream seeds 1986 in its yaml (its v2/v3 flow reseeds 0 while it is built) and then draws its random initialisation, while nothing draws here before training."],[12022,"**The request**: `trainer`, `stage`, `engine`, `method`, `experiment`, `workdir`, `dataset_dir`, `rows` (absolute audio paths, text, speaker, language, duration, rate; already filtered by licence in `training_rows`), `base_model` (`id`, `dir`, `variant`), `assets`, `device`, `precision` (`training.precision`), `hyperparams`, `language`, `results` (what finished stages returned), and the settings `training.previews` and `training.keep_checkpoints`."],[10055,"**The route.** Add a function with an `operation_id` to the module in `mizuoto/api/routers/`; a new resource gets a new module, added to `ROUTERS` in `app.py`. Operations that read server paths add `dependencies=[LocalDep]`."],[12167,"**The routes.** Add them to `router.ts` with `meta.screen` naming the destination; if it can be the remembered last screen, add it to `SCREENS`:"],[12735,"**The same tensor shapes.** The prompt is built as upstream's `generate` builds it: the three special embeddings looked up in one call, the codec head applied over the whole prefill. Smaller calls would compute the same values with other float sums."],[12737,"**The sampler.** The talker samples through transformers' processor chain in its order (repetition penalty, min-new-tokens, suppression of the control ids, temperature, top-k, top-p), then `multinomial` on the request's generator; finished rows of a batch are fed EOS, as transformers pads them. The code predictor's 15 draws follow, per frame."],[13139,"**The script**: chapters, each a list of lines. Each line has its text and the speaker who says it, and may have its own style instruction."],[12249,"**The seek loop inside each window.** Every window is padded to 30 s; a decoding that ends on a timestamp pair is decoded again from that timestamp (the features shifted, zeros after), and the tokens after the pair are dropped. `_decode_asr` re-bases the restarted timestamps and merges the overlapping windows."],[10138,"**The shared modules are standard library only**, because a training stage, the remote agent's frames and the engines all use them without the core's pydantic models."],[12164,"**The socket.** Handle the new event in `api/socket.ts` and list the keys the new job kinds affect in `AFFECTS`:"],[12739,"**The speaker encoder's mel** is Matcha-TTS's (`nn.dsp.mel.matcha_mel`), as upstream computes it."],[10057,"**The test.** Test it in `tests/api/test_api.py` with `TestClient` against the dummy engine; state-changing requests carry `headers={\"origin\": \"http://localhost\"}` (`ORIGIN` in that file)."],[12531,"**The text front end owns everything it uses**, built from asset paths: no `nltk.data.path`, fastText globals or `logging.basicConfig`."],[12672,"**The text tokenizer** is `mizuoto.text`'s BPE, without transformers' \"Mistral fix\" (the model names transformers 5.3, where it does not apply)."],[12398,"**The text.** A reference text ending in a one-byte character gets a trailing space, as `infer_batch_process` adds one."],[12820,"**The text.** Line breaks and runs of blanks become one space, then the text is normalised when asked. VoxCPM2's description or instruction becomes a `(…)` prefix with any parentheses inside removed, as upstream's web demo does; both are joined with `, ` when a request has both."],[10544,"**The token layer** (`mizuoto/webui/src/theme/`): colour roles `--md-sys-color-*` are generated by `@material/material-color-utilities`' Tonal Spot scheme from one seed colour (by default `#4f6b3a`), light and dark, at three contrast levels; type, shape, motion and state layers are CSS variables under Google's official names. The UI uses tokens only, never literal colours."],[12682,"**The token order** follows `JsonlDatasetReader`'s seed-42 order."],[12734,"**The tokenizer's split.** Upstream loads its processor with `fix_mistral_regex=True`, and transformers 4.57.3 then swaps in its \"Mistral fix\" pre-tokenizer regex for a local model whose config names a version between 4.57.2 and 5.0. `load_bpe(mistral_fix=…)` makes the same decision from the model's `config.json`; without it a few texts tokenise differently."],[12668,"**The tokenizer** is DAC (odd strides with an output padding, no final tanh), HuBERT (the positional convolution's weight norm folded over dim 2) and Euclidean residual codebooks. The semantic decoder and `fc1` are used only in training and are not loaded."],[12821,"**The tokenizer** is what transformers 5.3's `LlamaTokenizer` builds from the vocabulary, ignoring the file's own pipeline: no normaliser, `Metaspace` with `prepend_scheme=\"always\"` and no split, no unknown token in the BPE, and the config's special tokens added in id order (a token missing from the vocabulary gets the next free id, so VoxCPM2's `<|im_end|>` is 73442, not the file's 73440). The raw `tokenizer.json` gives other ids for text with leading blanks or after a special token. Upstream's wrapper then splits multi-character Han tokens into characters; a character outside the vocabulary is `<unk>`."],[10056,"**The types.** Run `python scripts/dev.py typegen` and commit `schema.d.ts`."],[11478,"**The upper bound** is the next minor release while Mizuoto is 0.x. `check_gated_distribution` (in `tests/core/test_engines.py`, run by each package's `test_<id>_package.py`) fails once Mizuoto's version leaves the range, so a Mizuoto release past it also releases the gated packages with a raised range."],[12166,"**The views.** `views/ProjectsView.vue` is the list: `useProjects()`, `EmptyState`, a grid of `AppCard`s and `NewProjectDialog`. `views/ProjectView.vue` is the detail page, taking the route's `id` as a prop: edits live in a local draft saved with `PUT` 800 ms after typing stops, and on `onDeactivated` and `onBeforeUnmount`; a running render is found in the jobs store by `kind` and `request.project` and shown with `JobCard`; the main actions sit in `PageFooter`. \"Try in Speak\" on a line hands the request to Speak through `handoff.sendRequest()`. Components come from `@/ui` only; styles use tokens only."],[10218,"**The voice.** With a reference, `prepare_voice` writes the engine's voice state (prompt codes, embeddings) into the voice cache once per key, and later requests pass the files as `VoiceSpec.cache`."],[13413,"**Theme**"],[13778,"**Theme**: cycles through light, dark and following the system. More under **Settings › Appearance**."],[10508,"**Thin routes over a service layer**, one router module per resource on the server and one query module per resource in the UI."],[12179,"**This site's development pages**: the design as built, the rules and why, one page per area, and one page per\nengine in the engine reference (the upstream behaviour each engine reproduces, its deviations, its\ntrainer and its parity result). Read the page for the area you change; a change of design updates it, in both\nlanguages."],[10839,"**Three voice modes**: references → a voice prompt; attributes → an instruction from `instruct_from(attributes)`; neither → the model's own voice. A free-text description raises `capability_not_supported`."],[12839,"**Through the stack**, 27 cases (every voice mode, normalisation, a forced retry, streaming, several segments, other steps and guidance, fp32 through `engines.voxcpm.dtype`): all identical in audio and behaviour (applied parameters, warnings, voice mode, segments, streamed chunk lengths)."],[13176,"**to this chapter**"],[4867,"**token 完全相同；音频完全相同或最大绝对误差 ≤ 1e-4**；例外逐个引擎列出并说明原因"],[5666,"**token 顺序**遵循 `JsonlDatasetReader` 以 42 为种子的顺序。"],[9970,"**Token**: when `server.access_token` is set, requests under `/api/`, `/ws/`, `/v1/`, `/openapi.json` and `/docs` must carry it, as `Authorization: Bearer`, the `mizuoto_token` cookie or a `token` query parameter, compared with `hmac.compare_digest`. Missing or wrong is 401 `auth_required`. `/api/v1/app/health` is exempt: the UI shell must load before it can ask for a token."],[12092,"**Tokens use Google's official names** (`--md-sys-*`), so `@material/web`'s components read them with no mapping; the project's own tokens start with `--app-`."],[13761,"**Tools**"],[13521,"**Tools** has two tabs: **Convert voice** and **Edit speech**. Both start from an existing recording; their results appear under **Results** at the bottom of the page (and in History), with the same menu as in Speak."],[13765,"**Train**"],[13559,"**Train** fine-tunes models on your own recordings, in two steps:"],[13708,"**Trained**"],[13376,"**Training device**"],[11811,"**Training memory tools.** `check_checkpointing` in `training_memory.py` runs a trainer's stages twice in fresh work folders, once as given and once with every block checkpointed, and compares every metric and every weight file written: they must be identical. The other tools that keep results (such as the optimiser state in RAM) are checked the same way."],[13379,"**Training precision**"],[8401,"**Training stays here.** With the engine on a remote host, its training methods say why: `<engine> runs on <host>, and training runs on this machine: mizuoto remote use <engine> --local`."],[9512,"**Training** › **Attention**"],[9516,"**Training** › **Checkpoints kept per run**"],[9508,"**Training** › **Memory**"],[9520,"**Training** › **Speak a preview after training**"],[9500,"**Training** › **Training device**"],[9504,"**Training** › **Training precision**"],[7951,"**Training** (GPU or CPU): **Fine-tune the language model** (`llm`) and **Fine-tune the LLM and the flow** (`llm_flow`), from v1_base, v2 or v3, following upstream's LibriTTS recipe; at least 60 s of data; exported as a new model. The LLM alone makes prosody and pronunciation follow the dataset; with the flow the timbre follows too."],[12932,"**Training** is identical when, seeded alike, every step's losses, learning rates and other metrics, and the saved weights, equal upstream's. Upstream rarely seeds everything (0.1 never did), so the reference is upstream with its generators seeded the way the native training stage seeds them."],[8012,"**Training**: **Fine-tune a voice** (`speaker`): upstream's own recipe (text features, speech features, semantic tokens, train SoVITS, train GPT), exported as the voice's own pair of weights. One to ten minutes of one speaker; minutes on a GPU, hours on a CPU. v4 and v5 Turbo train SoVITS as a LoRA."],[8028,"**Training**: **Fine-tune the model** (`full`) and **Fine-tune with LoRA** (`lora`, merged at export), both exported as a new model. The full fine-tune suits hours of speech for a new language or style and needs 24 GB of GPU memory or more; LoRA is lighter."],[8056,"**Training**: **Fine-tune the model** (`full`) and **Fine-tune with LoRA** (`lora`), upstream's own recipes (`train_voxcpm_finetune.py` with its configurations per model), both exported as a new model; a LoRA model keeps the base weights beside its adapters and applies them when it loads, as upstream does. A hyperparameter left at 0 takes the recipe's value for the model. On a GPU it trains as upstream does (float32 weights under bf16 autocast); on a CPU in float32 (upstream itself cannot train off CUDA). VoxCPM2's full fine-tune needs about 40 GB of memory; LoRA far less."],[7977,"**Training**: **Fine-tune the model** (`full`): upstream's `finetune_cli` recipe, the whole model trained further and exported as a new model of the same kind. Best with an hour of speech or more; a GPU is all but required. The result inherits CC-BY-NC-4.0."],[8072,"**Training**: **Fine-tune with LoRA** (`lora`, GPU or CPU): upstream's LoRA recipe (semantic tokens, packing, training, merging), exported as a new model. Upstream warns that it learns speaking style more than timbre; 24 GB of GPU memory; the result stays under Fish Audio's research licence."],[7898,"**Training**: **Teach it a speaker** (`speaker`, Base only): upstream's single-speaker fine-tune (`sft_12hz.py`), reimplemented; the Base model learns the dataset's voice and is exported as a new CustomVoice model with that voice as its preset speaker. A few minutes of one speaker; 24 GB of GPU memory or more for the 1.7B."],[8110,"**Training**: none."],[13657,"**Training**: the methods for this model; unavailable ones are marked **(not available)** with the reason (shared files missing, the engine not available or on a remote host…). Below are the method's description, its stages, what it makes (**Makes a voice’s own weights** or **Makes a new model**) and the least speech it needs."],[12840,"**Training**: VoxCPM-0.5B full, VoxCPM-0.5B LoRA and VoxCPM2 LoRA are identical to upstream's script at every step (both losses, the gradient norm, the learning rate), and so are the saved weights. Each export speaks identically when upstream loads it and when Mizuoto does."],[13732,"**Transcribe again** has speech recognition transcribe every clip again; **Add a clip** adds another."],[13357,"**Transcribe reference clips without a transcript**"],[13625,"**Transcribe**"],[13201,"**Try in Speak**"],[10933,"**Two requests on one GPU.** With `compute.gpu_jobs` above 1, a request short of its minimum (in `high`: of its whole size) while another request holds components on the device waits for that request to let go, up to 10 minutes, checking for a cancel; then it tries."],[13321,"**Unload models after idle minutes (0: never)**"],[12678,"**Upstream reseeds with its config's 42 after building the model**, so the stage's seed matters only through peft's LoRA initialisation, drawn first from the process-wide generator in module order (`A` and `B` made as `nn.Linear`, `A` drawn again)."],[12743,"**Upstream's `attn_implementation` is not a load option**: attention goes through Mizuoto's attention dispatcher, chosen by `compute.attention` / `engines.qwen3tts.attention`."],[12938,"**Upstream's computation, in its order and shapes.** Batching changes floating-point sums, so a port keeps upstream's tensor shapes even where a simpler form would do (three embeddings looked up in one call, a cache grown by concatenation, SDPA called with the same arguments transformers passed)."],[12547,"**Upstream's files, identically.** Each stage writes upstream's files in upstream's layout, identical to those of its four preparation scripts: `inputs.list`, `2-name2text.txt`, `3-bert/`, `4-cnhubert/`, `5-wav32k/` (byte for byte), `7-sv_cn/`, `6-name2semantic.tsv`. Upstream's `load_audio` read clips through the ffmpeg program; `nn/dsp/swresample.py` is libswresample's default resampler, identical to ffmpeg 7.0.2 on every rate tried (soxr gave 43 dB)."],[12675,"**Upstream's text normalisation** (`normalize_text`, WeTextProcessing) is not used by Mizuoto's requests and is not ported."],[13645,"**Usable clips: usable/all · length**;"],[13052,"**Use as a reference clip**"],[13507,"**Use as a reference clip**"],[13744,"**Use in Speak**: opens Speak with this voice."],[13652,"**Use it for training** / **Leave it out of training**: an excluded clip stays in the dataset but is not trained on;"],[5523,"**v4/v5 的流模型提示**始终是最后一段辅助参考音频；上游的取决于之前的请求。"],[12539,"**v4/v5's flow prompt** is always the last auxiliary clip; upstream's depends on the requests before."],[13396,"**Verify checksums**"],[13092,"**Verify** computes the SHA-256 of every file of an installed model again. It says **All N files are intact**, or lists **Damaged:** *files*. Delete a damaged model and download it again."],[10840,"**Voice cache**: `prepare_voice` saves the prompt as `prompt.pt`; `synthesize` prefers `voice.cache[\"prompt\"]`."],[8399,"**Voice caches come back.** The cache an engine prepares for a voice (on its first use) is written on the agent and sent back file by file into the voice's cache folder on the host, which later requests read."],[10248,"**Voice caches.** After loading the model, the job calls `prepare_voice` once per key into `voices/<slug>/cache/<engine>/<model>/<key>/` and records `cache.json`; one-off references go to `cache/voices/…`. The key hashes (model, model revision, the references' SHA-256 and transcripts, voice mode, Mizuoto's version, and for a licence-gated engine its distribution's version), so upgrading Mizuoto or that distribution rebuilds the caches once."],[12586,"**Voice prompt** (cached with the voice): the clip at 22.05 kHz (at most 15 s) and its 16 kHz copy; w2v-BERT 2.0's hidden state 17, normalised, conditions the GPT; the MaskGCT semantic codec quantises it into the decoder's prompt codes; CAM++ gives the style; the mel is the decoder's prompt."],[8010,"**Voice weights**: a voice can carry a GPT (`.ckpt`) and SoVITS (`.pth`) pair, used when its version matches the model's variant (otherwise Mizuoto warns and clones). Add them with `mizuoto voice add-weights <voice> -e gptsovits -f gpt=x.ckpt -f sovits=y.pth`."],[13763,"**Voices**"],[13698,"**Voices** is the voice library. A voice can be used again and again in **Speak**, **Projects** and **Tools**; when you change models, Mizuoto works out how the new model can use it."],[11120,"**VoxCPM 2 spent 40 of its 77 s in attention**: each step attended over the whole 8192-position static cache under a mask, though a few hundred positions were filled."],[4104,"**VoxCPM 2 的 77 秒中有 40 秒花在注意力上**：每一步都在掩码下对整个 8192 个位置的静态缓存做注意力，而实际只填了几百个位置。"],[12912,"**VoxCPM** came after 0.1. Its reference is upstream's own package (the commit the manifest pins), run behind an adapter in the same Mizuoto stack, with the library versions upstream locks."],[5896,"**VoxCPM** 在 0.1 之后才加入。它的参考实现是上游自己的包（清单固定的那个提交），在同一套 Mizuoto 完整链路里通过适配层运行，库版本与上游锁定的一致。"],[5811,"**VoxCPM2 带参考文本克隆时**同时使用参考*和*续写，与上游网页演示相同（`reference_prefix`，默认开启）。上游的 Python 接口只在调用方传入 `reference_wav_path` 时才加参考。"],[12618,"**w2v-BERT's layer-drop draws are not made**: they never change the output in eval mode."],[12447,"**WAV output.** `codec_decode` writes WAV with `nn.dsp.wav.write_wav`, byte-identical to `soundfile.write`: libsndfile 1.2 stores `lrint(x × 2³¹) >> 16`, clipped, which is `floor(x × 32768)` except for values just below a step. `codec_encode` reads WAV only."],[5431,"**WAV 输出。** `codec_decode` 用 `nn.dsp.wav.write_wav` 写 WAV，与 `soundfile.write` 逐字节相同：libsndfile 1.2 存储裁剪后的 `lrint(x × 2³¹) >> 16`，也就是 `floor(x × 32768)`，只有略低于一个台阶的值例外。`codec_encode` 只读 WAV。"],[13720,"**What the voice says in its sample** is the sentence to listen to; change it if you like."],[11888,"**Why T3 is judged on the CPU in fp32 only.** Any logit difference flips a multinomial draw (or a beam) and everything after it diverges. On GPUs in reduced precision even upstream does not match itself bit for bit (batched against single greedy decoding, for one), so GPU consistency is judged by T1's per-module error plus T4's statistics."],[11019,"**Wrap every module with weights in a `ModelHandle`** and list it in `self.handles`. Give an autoregressive LM `kind=\"sequence\"`; mark parts that run many times per step `hot`, and modules whose weights code reads outside their `forward` `fixed`. Name units with `memory_units()` when the default split (children of `ModuleList`/`Sequential`) does not fit the model."],[5385,"**x-transformers 的交错式旋转位置编码和 RMSNorm** 原样移植。"],[12401,"**x-transformers' interleaved rotary embedding and RMSNorm** are ported as they are."],[3013,"**一个操作，一个核心方法。** 路由体只解析、调用、返回；请求体和返回值都是核心层的 `Record` 模型，API 的 JSON 因而等于 CLI 的 `--json`。"],[3488,"**一份 OpenAPI 模式作为契约。** 每个路由有显式的 `operation_id`，输入输出都是 pydantic 模型。`mizuoto/api/openapi.py` 把每个事件模型和一个 `ServerEvents` 映射（事件名 → 模式）加进模式，所以 socket 推送的负载和 REST 一样有类型。`scripts/dev.py typegen` 用 `openapi-typescript` 生成 `schema.d.ts` 并提交，`typegen-check` 在 CI 里发现接口与类型的偏差。"],[3917,"**一块 GPU 上的两个请求。** `compute.gpu_jobs` 大于 1 时，如果一个请求连最小工作集都放不下（`high` 模式下是整个模型放不下），而另一个请求正占着该设备上的组件，它会等那个请求释放，最多 10 分钟，期间检查取消；然后再尝试。"],[6442,"**一段音频**"],[6511,"**一段音频**：直接提供一段目标声音的音频。"],[3823,"**三种音色模式**：有参考音频 → 音色提示；有属性 → 由 `instruct_from(attributes)` 生成的指令；都没有 → 模型自己的声音。自由文本描述会抛出 `capability_not_supported`。"],[5662,"**上游在构建模型之后用配置中的 42 重新播种**，所以阶段的种子只通过 peft 的 LoRA 初始化起作用，这一初始化首先按模块顺序从进程级生成器抽取（`A` 和 `B` 先作为 `nn.Linear` 创建，`A` 再抽取一次）。"],[5727,"**上游的 `attn_implementation` 不是加载选项**：注意力经过 Mizuoto 的注意力分派器，由 `compute.attention` / `engines.qwen3tts.attention` 选择。"],[5659,"**上游的文本规范化**（`normalize_text`、WeTextProcessing）Mizuoto 的请求用不到，没有移植。"],[5922,"**上游的计算、顺序和形状。** 批处理会改变浮点求和，所以即使有更简单的写法，移植版也保留上游的张量形状（三个嵌入在一次调用里查出、缓存靠拼接增长、SDPA 用 transformers 当时传的参数调用）。"],[6183,"**上移** / **下移**"],[4462,"**上限**在 Mizuoto 还是 0.x 时取下一个次版本。`check_gated_distribution`（在 `tests/core/test_engines.py`，由各包的 `test_<id>_package.py` 调用）在 Mizuoto 的版本超出范围时失败，所以 Mizuoto 发布越过上限时，也要提高范围并发布这两个包。"],[6434,"**下载 模型名（大小）**"],[6032,"**下载**"],[6487,"**下载**"],[2366,"**下载** › **下载来源**"],[2382,"**下载** › **仓库**"],[2378,"**下载** › **同时下载的文件数**"],[2374,"**下载** › **校验文件**"],[2370,"**下载** › **自定义地址**"],[6075,"**下载**：下载缺少的文件。下载会续传、核对每个文件的大小和 SHA-256，某个来源缺文件时自动换下一个来源（见下载来源）。它需要的共享文件随之一起下载。"],[449,"**下载中**"],[6064,"**下载中**"],[6374,"**下载来源**"],[4461,"**下限**是包含该包所用一切的最旧 Mizuoto 版本。CI 用 PyPI 上的这个版本测试该包（`oldest-mizuoto` 作业）；包开始用到更新的东西时提高下限，并先发布 Mizuoto。"],[3414,"**不下载任何东西。** 引擎用的文件都是模型文件或共享资源，由 `ModelService` 下载并通过 `LoadSpec` 交给引擎。"],[5654,"**不依赖 pydub 的 pydub。** 对提示和输出的静音去除，在 int16 数组上按 pydub 的算术复现：毫秒长度四舍五入、位置截断、`audioop.rms` 向下取整。Python 3.13 已经没有 `audioop`，本来就需要移植。"],[5602,"**不做 w2v-BERT 的 layer drop 抽样**：在 eval 模式下它们从不改变输出。"],[3409,"**不改动进程级状态。** 不给全局随机数生成器播种，不改 `os.environ`、工作目录或 `sys.path`，不调用 `logging.basicConfig`、`torch.set_default_dtype`、`torch.use_deterministic_algorithms`、`torch.set_float32_matmul_precision`，不给 `torch.backends.*` 或 `torch._inductor.config` 赋值，不用 `sdpa_kernel`（它对所有线程切换 SDPA 的内核）。`compute.fast` 的那几个开关只在 `mizuoto/runtime/accel/features.py` 里设置，由主机和训练阶段调用。"],[5924,"**不改进程级状态。** 不改环境变量、工作目录、`sys.path`、`torch.backends` 标志、全局种子或日志配置；`tests/test_architecture.py` 禁止这样做，契约套件也会在请求前后比较进程状态的摘要（`mizuoto.snapshot` 操作）。"],[5433,"**不构建上游从不运行的编解码器模块。** 上游的编解码器为解码器第一个块构建了一个 transformer，却从不接上它（没有权重，从不运行）。`codec.pth` 里还有旧版上游保存的 RoPE 表和掩码，上游已不再加载，这里也忽略。"],[5311,"**不用 onnxruntime 的语音 token 和 CAM++。** 语音分词器是 s3tokenizer 的 torch 模型，权重从 ONNX 文件读出；在测试语料上，v1、v2、v3 的编码都与 onnxruntime 相同。CAM++ 照搬导出的计算图（卷积后的 batch norm 已折叠，与导出时一样），与 onnxruntime 的相对误差约 1e-6，并非逐位一致。"],[4004,"**不要自己移动模块。** 在主机上构建（或在 `spec.device` 上；句柄会接手），由管理器放置。以 float64 计算的模块在没有 float64 的设备上用 `float64_device` 和 `pin_to_cpu`。用 `handle.replace` 换权重。"],[2578,"**不需要启动服务器。** 每条命令自己打开数据文件夹（设置、数据库、模型），执行完就关闭；引擎运行在命令自己的进程里，加载的模型随命令一起释放，所以每条 `speak` 都要重新加载一次模型。需要连续合成很多句时，用服务器（网页界面或 HTTP 接口）更快，那里模型会保留在内存中。"],[5531,"**与上游完全相同的文件。** 每个阶段按上游的目录结构写出上游的文件，与其四个准备脚本的输出完全相同：`inputs.list`、`2-name2text.txt`、`3-bert/`、`4-cnhubert/`、`5-wav32k/`（逐字节）、`7-sv_cn/`、`6-name2semantic.tsv`。上游的 `load_audio` 通过 ffmpeg 程序读取音频；`nn/dsp/swresample.py` 是 libswresample 的默认重采样器，在试过的每种采样率上都与 ffmpeg 7.0.2 相同（soxr 只有 43 dB）。"],[5440,"**与上游相同的混合精度。** 检查点中的张量按上游的方式赋值，所以 S2 的归一化层保持 bfloat16，而 LoRA 层持有 float32 副本。"],[1381,"**两台机器运行相同的 Mizuoto 版本。** Mizuoto 0.2 使用第 2 版 agent 协议，以“已加载的引擎”为单位工作（加载、准备音色、合成、转换、编辑）。协议版本不同的主机和 agent 会在握手时互相拒绝，并提示在两台机器上安装相同版本的 Mizuoto。"],[3445,"**两种语言。** 文档站的每个页面都有 `<slug>.mdx`（简体中文，默认语言）和 `<slug>.en.mdx`（英文），结构逐节对应；侧边栏是 `meta.json` 和 `meta.en.json`，顺序相同。测试检查每个中文页面都有英文版。README 也有两份（`README.md`、`README.zh-CN.md`），界面文字在 `en.ts` 和 `zh-CN.ts` 里，键必须一致。"],[5604,"**严格加载。** 检查点严格加载；上游对缺失的键保留随机权重（已发布的检查点中没有缺失的键）。"],[5926,"**严格加载检查点。** 缺少或多出的键都是错误；上游有时会给缺少的键保留随机权重。"],[4872,"**为什么 T3 只在 CPU 上以 fp32 判断。** 任何一点 logits 差异都会翻转一次多项式抽样（或一个束），之后的一切随之分叉。在 GPU 上降精度运行时，连上游自己都不能与自己逐比特一致（例如批量和单条的贪心解码），所以 GPU 上的一致性由 T1 的模块级误差加 T4 的统计指标判断。"],[6714,"**主音频** 标记，或 **设为主音频** 按钮。克隆时主音频排在最前；音色列表中播放的也是它。"],[6397,"**主题**"],[6763,"**主题**：在浅色、深色和跟随系统之间切换。更多外观选项在 **设置 › 外观**。"],[6589,"**之前的结果**：从合成结果中挑选。结果会带着它的许可标记加入；许可不允许用来训练其他引擎的结果（例如 Fish Speech 的结果），训练时会被拒绝。"],[5007,"**事件**：`MetricEvent` 每秒批量写进 `metrics.jsonl`，并以 `train_metrics` 发布（界面的损失曲线实时跟随）；`ProgressEvent` 变成步骤的进度和消息；`OutputEvent(kind=\"sample\")` 复制为一个 `sample` 类型的输出。重新运行的阶段会先从 `metrics.jsonl` 里删掉它以前的点。"],[6656,"**从头开始**"],[6377,"**仓库**"],[5162,"**代码**及其测试：其他任何内容与它们冲突时，以它们为准。"],[2954,"**令牌**：设置了 `server.access_token` 时，`/api/`、`/ws/`、`/v1/`、`/openapi.json` 和 `/docs` 下的请求都要携带它：`Authorization: Bearer`、`mizuoto_token` cookie 或 `token` 查询参数，用 `hmac.compare_digest` 比较。缺失或不符是 401 `auth_required`。`/api/v1/app/health` 例外，界面外壳要先加载才能询问令牌。"],[3528,"**令牌层**（`mizuoto/webui/src/theme/`）：颜色角色 `--md-sys-color-*` 由 `@material/material-color-utilities` 的 Tonal Spot 方案从一个种子色（默认 `#4f6b3a`）生成，有亮色、暗色和三档对比度；字号、圆角、动效、状态层都是 Google 官方名字的 CSS 变量。界面里只用令牌，不写字面颜色。"],[5076,"**令牌用的是 Google 官方的名字**（`--md-sys-*`），所以 `@material/web` 的组件不经任何映射就能读取它们；项目自己的令牌以 `--app-` 开头。"],[3200,"**任务。** `speak` 占用 `engine:<引擎>:<设备>`（容量 1：一个已加载的引擎一次只服务一个请求），设备不是 CPU 时还占用 `gpu:<设备>`。请求以 JSON 保存，所以**重试**在重启后也会重新规划。"],[1177,"**任务** › **日志**；`mizuoto job log <任务 id>`；`GET /api/v1/jobs/{id}/log`"],[2635,"**任务**：命令行的任务也写进数据库，所以 `mizuoto job list` 能看到服务器的任务，网页界面的 **任务** 面板也能看到命令行跑过的任务。任务记录着运行它的进程；一个进程打开数据文件夹时，只把**已经退出的**进程留下的未完成任务标为 **已中断**，不会动另一个仍在运行的进程的任务。"],[6760,"**任务**：有任务在运行时显示转圈的图标和数量（**N 个运行中**）。点开是任务面板，列出最近的 30 个任务；每个任务卡片显示状态、进度（下载还显示已下载量、速度和剩余时间），并可以 **取消**、**重试** 和查看 **日志**。点 **全部任务** 打开完整的任务列表，可按 **全部**、**进行中**、**已结束** 筛选，**清除已结束** 清理历史。排队中的任务会说明在等什么，例如 **等待 GPU**、**等待引擎**、**等待其他合成任务**（见设置中的 **同时运行的合成任务**）、**等待其他下载**；另一个任务占用着 GPU 时可以点 **仍然运行**，在显存足够时并行运行。"],[2576,"**任务在前台运行。** `speak`、`design`、`model download`、`train run`、`project render` 等会创建一个任务，并在当前终端里执行到结束；进度条显示在 stderr 上（只在 stderr 是终端时显示，`--json` 时关闭），下载会显示已下载量、速度和剩余时间。"],[6378,"**优先使用 mizuoto-model 镜像**"],[3916,"**估算从不拒绝加载**（ComfyUI 的做法）。`high` 模式下，空闲组件腾出空间后整体尝试加载；其他模式下，低于最小工作集时仍按最小工作集尝试，并在日志中记一条警告。只有显存分配真正失败才算错误。加载前从不检查模型目录中的 `vram_mb`。"],[6158,"**作为新章节**"],[6038,"**保存为音色**"],[6493,"**保存为音色**"],[5819,"**保持上游的做法**：每段音频在右侧补齐到整块；停止标签在最后一块，损失只算音频位置；每个微批次的损失除以累积步数；关闭裁剪时梯度按 1e9 裁剪；记录的学习率是下一步的。"],[5441,"**保留**：上游的训练前向不像推理那样把码本嵌入乘以 1/√11；预热让第一步的学习率为 0，`B` 从零开始，所以前两步的损失相同。"],[6308,"**保留在内存中的模型数**"],[3940,"**保留少量副本**：正在运行的单元和正在传输的单元（`compute.async_offload + 1` 个）；副本被丢弃前再次运行的单元（CFG 的两半、beam）直接复用；"],[6619,"**保留的最短片段（秒）**"],[6196,"**修改后未重新生成**"],[3420,"**偏差要记录。** 每个与上游不同的地方（为了跨平台、为了不改全局状态、因为上游行为依赖线程时序等）写进该引擎的说明和设计记录 `AGENTS.md`，附上对照数字。"],[5514,"**停顿与输出。** 每个片段后的停顿无论输出采样率如何都按 32 kHz 计算，音频截断为 16 位（`(x × 32768).astype(int16)`），与上游的返回值相同。"],[3419,"**先复现，再修正。** 上游的怪癖（采样顺序、填充方式、对齐的边界情况）先原样复现，用对照工具证实一致；确有必要修正时，作为单独的改动，并记录偏差及原因。"],[4843,"**先自洽，再对照。** 参照实现先与自己的重复运行比较（`--name reference-repeat`）：自己都不能复现的用例无法用来评判原生实现。`cases/<engine>.jsonl` 每行一个用例，字段见 README。"],[3199,"**先规划，再排队。** `TtsService.plan()` 对照清单检查模型状态、引擎是否启用且可用、许可、文本、语言、音色模式、参考音频、参数和设备，这些都在任务创建之前（不估算显存：模型总是尝试加载）；出错立刻带着错误码返回。"],[1033,"**克隆**：有参考文本时，VoxCPM2 同时把参考音频作为独立的参考和待续写的开头（与上游演示相同；选项 **reference_prefix** 关闭后只续写）；没有文本时只作为参考。VoxCPM 1.5 和 0.5B 以续写方式克隆。"],[1082,"**克隆音色**、**无文本克隆**、**发音控制**、**长文本**"],[926,"**克隆音色**、**无文本克隆**、**指令**、**音色转换**、**流式输出**、**流式文本输入**、**语速**、**行内标签**、**长文本**"],[917,"**克隆音色**、**无文本克隆**、**音色转换**、**流式输出**、**语速**、**行内标签**、**长文本**"],[6249,"**全部导出**：整个项目导出为一个文件。"],[6217,"**全部生成（N）**：对整个项目做同样的事。"],[936,"**共享文件**：`cosyvoice/wetext`（13 MB，把数字、日期和单位写成文字的文本规范化语法），随第一个模型一起下载。"],[1093,"**共享文件**：IndexTTS-2 和 2.5 需要 `indextts/w2v-bert`（2.2 GB）、`indextts/campplus`、`indextts/bigvgan`，IndexTTS-2 还需要 `indextts/semantic-codec`，随模型一起下载。"],[995,"**共享文件**：每个模型都需要 `gptsovits/encoders`（1.0 GB）、`gptsovits/g2pw`（562 MB）、`gptsovits/nltk-data`、`gptsovits/open-jtalk`，随第一个模型一起下载；训练 v2、v2Pro、v2ProPlus 还需要对应的判别器 `gptsovits/s2d-*`。"],[3228,"**共享资源**（清单的 `[[assets]]`）是一个引擎的多个模型共用的文件，放在 `models/_assets/<引擎>/<名字>/`，带 `asset.json`；随第一个需要它的模型下载，也可以单独下载。压缩包部分校验后解压到原处。引擎通过 `LoadSpec.options[\"assets\"]`（id → 文件夹）拿到它们。"],[3122,"**共用模块只用标准库**，因为训练阶段、远程 agent 的帧和引擎都要用它们，而不带核心的 pydantic 模型。"],[6352,"**关闭：忽略这些参数并给出提示。** 打开后直接拒绝请求。超出范围的值始终会被拒绝"],[3921,"**其余都是固定部分**：只要组件在设备上，它们就在设备上。包括嵌入（码本经常通过 `.weight` 直接读取）、归一化、缩放系数、缓冲区、与单元外模块共享的参数（共享的嵌入与输出头）、模型的第一个参数（代码通过它判断模型所在设备）、小于 64 KB 的单元、标为 `fixed` 的模块，以及固定在 CPU 上的模块（`DeviceService.pin_to_cpu`，从不移动）之下的一切。"],[3828,"**内存**：`memory_required` 按批中每行估算 logits 所需的工作内存。"],[6761,"**内存中的模型**：显示已加载的模型数（**已加载 N 个**）。点开列出每个已加载的模型及其设备、权重占用的内存，以及它是 **忙碌** 还是 **空闲**；可以 **卸载** 单个模型，或点 **释放显存** 一次卸载所有空闲的模型。上一个请求失败的引擎也会列出，并附上错误。"],[4105,"**内存分配**：每层都要分配和释放几到几十 MB 的张量，按 glibc 默认设置每次都重新映射，并由内核清零页面。"],[6072,"**内置**"],[6616,"**最长片段（秒）**"],[4995,"**准备。** `prepare`（`dataset_prepare` 任务，资源 `cpu`）按 GPT-SoVITS 的默认参数用 slicer2 在静音处切分，经 ASR 转写，并做峰值归一化。"],[5525,"**出错时抛出错误**，而不是像上游那样返回一秒 16 kHz 静音。"],[5383,"**分块**按上游的方式切分，按顺序生成，并用上游的交叉淡化拼接；`duration` 也按上游的方式分摊到各块。"],[5805,"**分词器**是 transformers 5.3 的 `LlamaTokenizer` 从词表构建出来的那个，忽略文件自带的流水线：没有 normalizer，`Metaspace` 使用 `prepend_scheme=\"always\"` 且不拆分，BPE 中没有未知 token，配置中的特殊 token 按 id 顺序添加（词表中没有的 token 取下一个空闲 id，所以 VoxCPM2 的 `<|im_end|>` 是 73442，而不是文件中的 73440）。直接使用 `tokenizer.json` 时，以空白开头或位于特殊 token 之后的文本会得到不同的 id。随后上游的包装把多字汉字 token 拆成单字；词表之外的字为 `<unk>`。"],[5652,"**分词器**由 DAC（奇数步幅加输出填充，没有最后的 tanh）、HuBERT（位置卷积的权重归一化沿第 2 维折叠）和欧氏残差码本组成。语义解码器和 `fc1` 只在训练中使用，不加载。"],[5718,"**分词器的切分。** 上游用 `fix_mistral_regex=True` 加载处理器，transformers 4.57.3 对配置中版本号介于 4.57.2 和 5.0 之间的本地模型，会换用它的 “Mistral fix” 预分词正则。`load_bpe(mistral_fix=…)` 根据模型的 `config.json` 做出同样的判断；不这样做，少数文本的分词会不同。"],[6607,"**切分长片段**"],[6042,"**删除**"],[6189,"**删除**"],[6497,"**删除**"],[6727,"**删除**：把音色移到数据文件夹的回收站（`trash/`）。"],[6160,"**加到本章**"],[3821,"**加载**：`OmniVoiceModel(config, ops.default)` 由 `load_into(model, load_state_dict(folder / \"model.safetensors\"))` 填充，再转成目标精度（GPU 支持 bf16 就用 bf16，否则 fp16；CPU 上 fp32；明确设置的 `engines.omnivoice.dtype` 优先）；音频分词器同样处理；文本分词器来自 `mizuoto.text.tokenize.bpe.load_bpe(folder)`；两个句柄。"],[4638,"**加载**（`LocalEngine.load`）："],[3411,"**加载不抽随机数。** 模块用 `runtime.ops` 的层构建（`ops.default` 跳过随机初始化），检查点严格加载（缺少或多出的键都是错误，除非引擎明确列为可忽略）。"],[3412,"**加载在推理模式之外进行，参数保持 `nn.Module` 创建时的样子**（不调用 `requires_grad_(False)`）。CPU 上有两个会改变结果的内核陷阱：对非连续的三维输入，`F.linear` 在权重 `requires_grad` 或权重是推理张量（在 `torch.inference_mode()` 里创建）时会选用另一个内核，即使处在 `no_grad` 或推理模式下。上游的权重是需要梯度的普通参数，所以原生引擎也这样保留；请求仍在推理模式里运行。"],[937,"**加载选项**：`fp16`（GPU 上用半精度：更快，结果略有不同）。"],[962,"**加载选项**：`ode_method`（`euler` 或 `midpoint`）。"],[1095,"**加载选项**：`use_qwen_emo`（默认开）、`use_torch_compile`（v2/v2.5：与 `compute.compile` 一样编译 s2mel DiT 和 BigVGAN，见 性能与加速）。"],[883,"**加载选项**：注意力按注意力设置选择。`fused_projections`（默认关闭）是快速模式：每层的 q/k/v 与 gate/up 投影各合并为一次矩阵乘法，在 GPU 上再快几个百分点，但音频不再与原实现逐位一致（输出参数中会标注 `fused_projections`）。"],[5079,"**动效**：命名的过渡（`fade-through`、`shared-axis-x`、`container`、`sheet`、`scrim`、`list` 等，`ui/motion/`），在支持的浏览器里用 View Transitions 做列表到详情的容器变换。系统或应用内选择“减少动效”时，所有过渡变成 100 ms 的淡入淡出，没有涟漪。"],[6403,"**动画**"],[4667,"**协议 2**（`mizuoto/core/remote/wire.py` 的 `AGENT_PROTOCOL`）在“已加载引擎”这一层工作。帧格式来自 `mizuoto/core/remote/frames.py`（4 字节长度、一个类型字节、JSON 正文，或 JSON 头加原始字节），走 TCP 或 TLS："],[6754,"**历史**"],[6020,"**历史** 页列出所有结果，最新的在最前：合成页、音色页的试听、设计候选、工具页的转换与编辑、训练的试听，以及项目导出的文件。"],[6471,"**参数** 部分只列出这个模型接受的参数；不动的参数不会发送，由引擎使用自己的默认值。引擎特有的选项收在 **引擎选项** 中。"],[1035,"**参数**：**步数**（每块扩散的欧拉步数，10）、**引导强度**（2.0）、**文本规范化**（默认关闭；由 wetext 读出数字、日期和符号）、**最大生成 token 数**（块数，4096）。选项：`min_len`、`retry_badcase`（默认开启：结果比文本长得多时用下一个种子重新生成，最多 `retry_badcase_max_times` 次；流式时不重试）、`retry_badcase_ratio_threshold`、`reference_prefix`。"],[6212,"**参数**：展开后与合成页的参数面板相同；有改动时显示 **已设置 N 项**。"],[3822,"**参数映射**：Mizuoto 的通用参数名映射到上游的生成配置（`num_steps → num_step`、`temperature → class_temperature`），其余由引擎选项填充。"],[5328,"**参考实现**是在模型构建完成后用阶段的种子给生成器播种的上游：上游在 yaml 中播种 1986（其 v2/v3 flow 在构建时又重新播种 0），然后抽取随机初始化，而这里在训练前不做任何抽样。"],[959,"**参考音频**：1–12 秒，至少 16 kHz。"],[1011,"**参考音频**：1–20 秒，至少 16 kHz。采样率 24 kHz。"],[933,"**参考音频**：1–30 秒，至少 16 kHz。"],[1037,"**参考音频**：1–30 秒，至少 16 kHz。输出：48 kHz（VoxCPM2）、44.1 kHz（1.5）、16 kHz（0.5B）。"],[880,"**参考音频**：1–30 秒，采样率至少 16 kHz（推荐 3–20 秒）。带上文本时更贴近原音色。"],[1090,"**参考音频**：1–30 秒。"],[5488,"**参考音频**：16 kHz 的音频末尾补 0.3 秒静音；HuBERT 特征经 SoVITS 量化为提示的语义 token；线性频谱供风格编码器使用；v2Pro 另有说话人验证嵌入。v4/v5 还把最后读入的那段音频在 32 kHz 下的梅尔谱作为流模型的提示。"],[1053,"**参考音频**：2–30 秒。"],[993,"**参考音频**：3–10 秒。"],[5381,"**参考音频**按 `preprocess_ref_audio_text` 的方式裁剪和填充，响度调到 `target_rms`，用 torchaudio 的 `Resample` 重采样。pydub 的 50 毫秒填充按 `audioop.ratecv` 的帧数复现（`edge_pad`：24 kHz 下 1198 个采样，而不是 1200），因为 Python 3.13 已经没有 `audioop`。"],[5430,"**参考音频**用 torchaudio 的内核重采样到 44.1 kHz。"],[6347,"**参考音频对模型来说过长时**"],[2638,"**取消**：`mizuoto job cancel` 只能取消本进程里的任务，对服务器正在运行的任务会报告 `Job … is not running`。要取消服务器的任务，在网页界面的 **任务** 面板里点 **取消**，或调用 `POST /api/v1/jobs/{job_id}/cancel`。"],[3826,"**取消与进度**：每个解码步调用 `ctx.check_cancel()`，之后 `ctx.progress(\"generating\", …)`。"],[6228,"**句间停顿（毫秒）**"],[6476,"**另存为预设…**：填 **预设名称**；勾选 **仅用于 模型名** 则保存全部参数，否则只保存通用参数，适用于所有模型（含有引擎选项的预设只能用于当前模型）。勾选 **选中此模型时自动应用** 则设为该模型的默认预设。"],[3920,"**只有 `nn.Linear`、`Conv1d/2d`、`ConvTranspose1d/2d` 的权重会流式加载**，以及声明了 `STREAMABLE = True` 的类（IndexTTS 的 GPT-2 `Conv1D`）。这些层的权重只在其 `forward` 中读取。"],[3417,"**可取消。** 每个循环（自回归 token、ODE 步、分段、束搜索步）里调用 `ctx.check_cancel()`。`Cancelled` 继承自 `BaseException`，不要用宽泛的 `except BaseException` 吞掉它。"],[6630,"**可用片段：可用数/总数 · 时长**；"],[2904,"**合并投影**（`engines.qwen3tts.load_options.fused_projections`，关）在加载时把每层的 q/k/v 以及 gate/up 权重分别堆叠成一个线性层（`QwenDecoder.fuse`；是真正的 `ops.Linear`，仍可流式加载）。仅用于推理。cuBLAS 对更宽的矩阵会选用别的内核，所以在 CUDA 上结果不逐位相同；输出会列出 `fused_projections`。"],[4235,"**合并投影**（`fused_projections`，需主动开启），4 / 8 层下每帧毫秒数："],[6353,"**合并等待中的请求**"],[6356,"**合并等待中的请求**：同一模型和音色、仅文本不同的请求，在支持批处理的引擎上（Qwen3-TTS、GPT-SoVITS、OmniVoice）合并为一批运行。具体来说，只有一段文本、没有指定种子的请求才会合并：正在运行的任务在调用引擎前，把排队中设置完全相同的任务一起带上，一次生成，再分别保存各自的结果；批处理失败时，这些任务回到队列中各自运行。指定种子的请求不合并，因为批处理时随机数的取法不同。项目的生成正是借助这一点加速的。"],[3203,"**合成。** `synthesize(task, request)` 是一个产出 `AudioChunk` 的生成器（float32 单声道 numpy 采样、采样率、段号）。任务逐块取出（客户端流式接收时，也把每块交给 `StreamSink`）；关闭生成器就会让引擎停下。每段一个 `SynthesisTask`，或一个批处理任务。"],[6742,"**合成**"],[6421,"**合成** 页把文本变成语音。页面从上到下依次是 **模型**、**音色**、**文本**、**风格**（模型支持时）、**参数** 和 **结果**；**合成** 按钮固定在页面底部。各部分只显示所选模型支持的选项，换模型后界面会随之变化。"],[6765,"**合成**、**工具** 等页面的主要按钮固定在页面底部，旁边是本页启动的任务卡片和错误说明。错误说明包括 **原因**、**解决办法**，以及可展开的 **详情**，可以一键 **复制**。"],[6480,"**合成**：提交一个合成任务。任务卡片显示在页面底部，完成后结果出现在 **结果** 中。有多个任务时，它们收成一行 **… 个任务**，显示运行中和排队的数量（**… 个运行中 · … 个排队**）、总体进度和一个全部取消的按钮；展开后在可滚动的列表中显示每个任务的卡片。默认跨所有引擎和设备一次只运行一个合成任务，其余任务按顺序排队，显示 **等待其他合成任务**（**设置 › 计算 › 同时运行的合成任务**）。"],[6104,"**同一引擎的多个模型共用的文件，随第一个需要它们的模型一起下载一次。** 例如 GPT-SoVITS 的编码器、G2PW、NLTK 数据、Open JTalk 词典和训练用的判别器，IndexTTS-2 的 w2v-BERT、语义编解码器、CAM++、BigVGAN，以及 CosyVoice 的文本规范化语法。"],[6383,"**同时下载的文件数**"],[6311,"**同时运行的 GPU 任务数**"],[6314,"**同时运行的合成任务**"],[6726,"**名称**、**语言**、**标签**（逗号分隔）和 **描述**，改完点 **保存**。"],[5491,"**后处理**：每个片段峰值限制为 1，后接片段间停顿，整体截断为 16 位。"],[2812,"**后端链。** 指定的后端排在最前，然后是 `fast` 针对该调用的后端链，最后是调用点的参照计算："],[6428,"**启用**"],[2444,"**启用** / **停用**"],[2579,"**命令行可以使用任何路径。** 网页界面只能读取 **浏览器可以打开的文件夹**（`paths.browse_roots`）里的服务器文件，而 `--ref`、`model import`、`dataset import` 等可以直接给出本机任意路径。"],[3489,"**命令走 REST，socket 只推送。** socket.io 挂在 `/ws`，只从服务器发往客户端。REST 是事实来源，事件只用来修补或作废客户端的查询缓存；重连后重新拉取，丢掉的事件不会让界面过期。"],[5655,"**响度与长文本。** 参考音频的响度调到 RMS 0.1，输出再调回去；长输出按文本分块生成，以参考音频（或第一块）为条件，并交叉淡化。"],[5314,"**噪声。** v2/v3 的 flow 噪声是上游以种子 0 生成的缓冲（前 1×80×15000 个正态抽样）。`randn_like(x)` 保留 `x` 的步长，所以当 `x` 是转置的（HiFT 的正弦源）时，抽样落入元素的顺序与 `randn(shape)` 不同：`nn.vocoders.hift.randn_like` 用生成器填充 `empty_like(x)`。"],[3961,"**回退**（`compute.oom_fallback`，默认关）。重试之后，如果引擎提供了更省显存的方式（`ctx.run(…, fallback=(what, fn))`），就用它。其输出略有不同，因此记录在 `applied.fallbacks` 中并带一条警告："],[4008,"**在 `streaming.py` 下运行小型模型**：所有单元流式加载、一半、不流式，严格模式。在那里失败时，会指出在阶段之外使用的组件或在单元之外读取的权重。"],[5917,"**在 GPU 上**不与上游做逐采样比较。GPU 上检查的是 Mizuoto 自己的加速路径不改变任何结果：CUDA 图和每步只等待设备一次的解码循环，与同一块 GPU 上普通的 eager 代码给出相同的 token 和音频。"],[6185,"**在“合成”中试听**"],[6177,"**在下方插入一句**"],[6603,"**在停顿处切分长录音，用语音识别补全缺失的文本，并统一音量。添加片段后运行。**"],[3800,"**在单独的发行包里**（许可证不允许随 `mizuoto` 发布，即决策 D1）：在它的 `pyproject.toml` 里把类注册到入口点组 `mizuoto.engines`，依赖 `mizuoto`，并在 `mizuoto/core/inference/service.py` 的 `DISTRIBUTIONS` 里加上引擎 id → 发行包名，这样缺少安装时能按名字报告。Fish Speech 的写法："],[6729,"**在合成中使用**：带着这个音色打开合成页。"],[5927,"**在推理模式之外加载**，请求在推理模式之内运行（见下）。"],[6034,"**在文件夹中显示**"],[6489,"**在文件夹中显示**"],[4007,"**在有更省显存且足够接近的方式时提供回退**（分块、一次一项），附一句说明它做什么。"],[3799,"**在本发行包里**：把引擎加进 `BUILTIN`："],[6179,"**在此结束段落** / **与下一句同段**"],[5320,"**在没有 float64 的设备上**（Apple MPS、Intel Arc），CosyVoice 3 的 F0 预测器留在 CPU 上，模型其余部分照常移动；声码器在自己的设备上把输入交给它。"],[5802,"**坏例重试。** 非流式结果若每个文本 token 对应 `retry_badcase_ratio_threshold` 块或更多，就用种子 + 1 重新生成，最多 `retry_badcase_max_times` 次；块数上限为 `min(tokens × ratio + 10, max_len)`。`applied.retries` 记录重新生成的次数。"],[5442,"**填充。** 整理器用 `<|end_of_text|>` 填充，而 S2 的词表里没有它：上游实际以 0 填充，Mizuoto 也是。"],[5925,"**复现库的数值。** `mizuoto.nn.dsp` 与上游调用的库逐位一致：torchaudio（2.3.1 和 2.8.0）、librosa（0.10、0.11、1.0）、openai-whisper、经 `librosa.resample` 调用的 soxr、Matcha-TTS 的 mel、ffmpeg 程序的重采样器，以及 soundfile 的 WAV。`mizuoto.text.tokenize.bpe` 对 Qwen2 系列分词器给出与 transformers 相同的 id；文本规范化用 kaldifst 应用原始的 FST；ONNX 权重直接从 protobuf 读取，不需要 onnx。"],[6392,"**多少天后删除结果（0：保留）**"],[6200,"**失败**"],[5921,"**契约套件**（`python scripts/dev.py test-engines`）让已安装的真实模型走规划、任务和运行时：每种音色方式都能发声且听得懂（经语音识别 WER 低于 0.35）、种子可复现、分段、取消，以及进程中不留残余。"],[2516,"**存储** › **多少天后删除结果（0：保留）**"],[2225,"**存储** › **模型**"],[2253,"**存储** › **浏览器可以打开的文件夹**"],[2233,"**存储** › **结果**"],[2249,"**存储** › **缓存**"],[2229,"**存储** › **音色**"],[3941,"**学习单元的运行顺序**（记录每个单元上次之后运行的单元），并在 CUDA 和 ROCm 上**预取**：当前单元计算时，在副流上复制接下来的单元。计算流在使用副本前等待复制的事件，每个副本都记录在计算流上，缓存分配器不会提前复用它的显存。不按学到的顺序进入的单元当场复制：正确性从不依赖顺序；"],[5823,"**完整链路**，27 个用例（每种音色方式、文本规范化、强制重试、流式、多段、其他步数和引导值、通过 `engines.voxcpm.dtype` 设为 fp32）：音频和行为（实际参数、警告、音色方式、分段、流式分块长度）全部完全相同。"],[6545,"**实验**：选一个起始模型和训练方式，在数据集上逐阶段运行该引擎自己的微调流程（由 Mizuoto 实现）。结果是**音色的专属权重**（加到音色库中的某个音色上）或**一个新模型**（出现在 **模型** 页）。"],[6644,"**实验名称**：默认是“数据集-模型”，只能用字母、数字、`-`、`_` 和 `.`。"],[3553,"**对 `comfy-aimdo`（原生显存分配器）和锁定版本的 `comfy-kitchen` 的依赖。** 显存管理用 torch 自己的分配器实现。"],[6401,"**对比度**"],[5918,"**对照工具**（`scripts/parity/`）让用例用任一实现走完整的 Mizuoto 链路并比较结果：`stack.py run <cases> --impl reference|native`（VoxCPM：`--impl upstream|native`）、`compare.py <engine>`，训练器用 `train.py run|compare`。用例在 `scripts/parity/cases/<engine>.jsonl`（共 74 个）；环境、音频、夹具和报告放在仓库之外的 `MIZUOTO_PARITY_DIR`。参考实现先与自己的重复运行比较：自己都不能复现的用例无法用来评判移植版。命令见测试。"],[5820,"**导出。** 全量：`model.safetensors`（float32，上游的键名），与基础模型的配置、VAE 和分词器放在一起。LoRA：基础权重（文件系统允许时用硬链接）加 `lora_weights.safetensors` 和 `lora_config.json`，在引擎加载时应用，与上游的 `VoxCPM(lora_weights_path=…)` 相同；上游从不合并它们。没有 3–15 秒的音频时，预览以零样本方式朗读。"],[6224,"**导出** 标签页："],[6728,"**导出**：下载一个 zip，包含音色信息、参考音频和微调权重。"],[5395,"**导出**保留使用上游键名的 EMA 权重、词表和声码器，所以 0.1 和 Mizuoto 都能加载。"],[5443,"**导出**是上游扁平的 `dual_ar` 形式（`config.json` + `model.pth`），0.1 和 Mizuoto 都能加载。最后一轮验证被跳过（它不改变任何保留下来的东西）。"],[6246,"**导出已生成的部分**：关闭时（默认），要导出的范围内每一句都必须是 **已生成**，否则报错；打开后，从未生成的句子不导出，修改后未重新生成的句子使用它们现有的录音。"],[6248,"**导出本章**：只导出当前章节；文件名为“项目名 — 章节标题”。"],[6370,"**导出阶段用训练结果合成一段数据集中的句子**"],[5152,"**导航与保活。** 在 `App.vue` 的 `nav` 中加一项（图标先加到 `ui/icons.ts`），详情页要每个项目一个实例时把前缀加进 `viewKey`，需要记住为上次界面时加进 `lastScreen` 的监听："],[5310,"**尺寸来自 yaml。** 各模块的尺寸取自模型自己的 yaml（HyperPyYAML 的标签当数据读取），而不是写在代码里。"],[5603,"**尺寸来自配置。** 上游写死的尺寸（w2v-BERT 的宽度、`gpt_layer`）改为取自配置，这样小型测试模型也能构建；真实模型得到的数值相同。"],[5077,"**层级首先用表面色调表达**（`surface`、`surface-container-low` … `surface-container-highest`），阴影其次。"],[6339,"**峰值**"],[6340,"**峰值**、**响度** 或 **不处理**"],[6746,"**工具**"],[6505,"**工具** 页有两个标签页：**音色转换** 和 **语音编辑**。两者都以一段已有的录音为输入，结果和合成结果一样出现在页面下方的 **结果** 中（也出现在历史中），菜单操作相同。"],[3550,"**巨大的文件和长 `if` 链**（例如按顺序匹配的模型识别表）。每个引擎在自己的包里有自己的识别、配置和构建。"],[2637,"**已加载的模型**：`mizuoto runtime` 列出正在运行的服务器持有的模型（通过数据文件夹中的 `server.json` 找到服务器），`mizuoto runtime --unload [MODEL]` 在服务器上卸载它们。"],[6088,"**已启用**：关闭后这个引擎的模型不能使用，合成页底部会改为提供 **启用** 按钮。"],[452,"**已安装**"],[6068,"**已安装**"],[6664,"**已导出**：导出的 **音色**（可以 **打开** 或 **在合成中使用**）或 **模型**（点 **模型** 跳到模型页）。导出的权重会加到所选音色上；导出的新模型以 `引擎/名称` 出现在模型列表中。"],[455,"**已损坏**"],[6070,"**已损坏**"],[1169,"**已损坏**：运行 `mizuoto model verify <模型>` 列出损坏的文件，删除这些文件（或 `mizuoto model delete <模型>`）后重新下载；大小正确的文件不会重新下载。"],[6194,"**已生成**"],[6660,"**已过期**：每个完成的阶段都记录了它读取的内容——数据集、起始模型的版本和它用到的设置，以及之前阶段的结果。这些内容变化后，这个阶段及其后的阶段都标为 **已过期**（**此阶段运行后，它读取的内容（数据集、模型或它用到的设置）已改变：请重新运行。**）。重新运行某个阶段时，它之后已完成的阶段也会过期，因为它们读的是这个阶段的旧文件。"],[5080,"**布局**：compact 窗口用底部导航栏，更宽时用导航轨（`AppShell`）。"],[5726,"**帧率是 12.5**（0.1 用的是 12.0；只影响进度估计）。"],[6762,"**帮助**：在浏览器的新标签页中打开本文档。"],[2200,"**常规** › **服务器启动时打开浏览器**"],[2188,"**常规** › **服务器地址**"],[2192,"**常规** › **端口**"],[2204,"**常规** › **访问令牌**"],[3123,"**引擎之间互不导入**：共用代码进 `nn` 或 `runtime`，在那里只测一次。"],[6432,"**引擎名 需要 torch**…，附安装命令"],[6361,"**引擎所用设备**"],[4766,"**引擎的测试**在 CPU 上用权重随机的小模型运行每个引擎和训练器，包括在模拟设备上部分加载、流式加载的运行，同样在 CI 里跑。"],[5522,"**微调权重。** 序列化了上游 `utils.HParams` 的 SoVITS 检查点由受限反序列化器读取（张量、`OrderedDict`，`HParams` 作为字典）。v4/v5 的 LoRA 文件不经 peft 合并（在 float32 下 W += B·A·α/r，与 peft 的合并结果相同）。"],[5735,"**快速模式**（加载选项 `fused_projections`，默认关闭）：加载时把每层的 q/k/v 和 gate/up 投影各自合成一个带堆叠权重的线性层（它们仍像普通层一样可以流式加载）。在 GPU 上每帧快约 3–4 %，但矩阵乘法会选用其他内核，音频不再逐位相同；在 CPU 对照用例中相同。开启时输出会列出 `fused_projections`。参数名会改变，所以只用于推理。"],[6466,"**怎么说**：一句风格指令，例如“开心地，稍快一些”（Qwen3-TTS 1.7B CustomVoice、CosyVoice 2 和 3、CosyVoice 300M Instruct）。"],[5571,"**情感**：来自说话人音频本身、另一段音频（按 `emo_alpha` 混合），或通过情感矩阵混入的八个权重（按 CAM++ 相似度选行）；描述由情感模型（Qwen3-0.6B，贪心解码）转换为权重。"],[5599,"**情感嵌入**从音频以 16 kHz 重新读取，而不是由 22.05 kHz 的副本重采样得到：它是音色缓存中单独的一个字段。"],[6468,"**情感权重**：每种情感一个 0–1 的滑块（**高兴**、**愤怒**、**悲伤**、**恐惧**、**厌恶**、**忧郁**、**惊讶**、**平静**）。"],[1089,"**情感权重**（八个，上游顺序）：happy、angry、sad、afraid、disgusted、melancholic、surprised、calm。参考音频情感可以设强度；文本情感需要加载选项 `use_qwen_emo`（默认开，约 1.2 GB）。"],[6625,"**所说语言**"],[3827,"**批处理**：设置了 `task.texts` 时，所有文本放进一批，各自以 `segment = task.segment + index` 产出。"],[4003,"**把每个带权重的模块包进 `ModelHandle`**，列在 `self.handles` 中。自回归语言模型用 `kind=\"sequence\"`；每一步运行多次的部分标为 `hot`，代码在 `forward` 之外读取其权重的模块标为 `fixed`。默认拆分（`ModuleList`/`Sequential` 的子模块）不适合模型时，用 `memory_units()` 指定单元。"],[5513,"**抽样。** 一个生成器按段重新播种，先抽 T2S 的采样，再抽 SoVITS（或流模型）的噪声，与上游的 `set_seed` 加全局随机流一致。准备参考音频时不抽样（不重放 HuBERT 的层丢弃；0.1 出于同样的原因在播种之前准备参考音频）。"],[5651,"**抽样。** 位置上（以及设了 `class_temperature` 时类别上）的 Gumbel 噪声来自请求的生成器，按步、按条抽取，与上游相同；批次的组成会改变抽样，上游也是如此。"],[5316,"**抽样顺序。** 非流式时按上游的顺序抽样（语言模型、v1 的 flow 噪声、声码器噪声）。流式使用上游的分块：v1 每块 100 个 token，重叠 20 个，用 Hamming 窗交叉淡化；v2/v3 从 25 个 token 起翻倍到 100，向前看三个 token。"],[5598,"**抽样顺序**：所有抽样都按上游的顺序（先 GPT，后 DiT 的噪声）来自请求的生成器。"],[6350,"**拒绝模型不接受的参数**"],[5313,"**按 transformers 4.51 的方式运行 Qwen2。** CosyVoice 2/3 的语言模型原本跑在 transformers 4.51 上，那里的 SDPA 路径总是重复 KV 头，并让 q、k、v 连续（`QwenConfig.sdpa_gqa=False`）。"],[5595,"**按 transformers 4.52 的计算方式实现 GPT-2**：`Conv1D` 即 `addmm`，tanh GELU，SDPA 在提示上因果且不带掩码，在每个新 token 上不带掩码。"],[5720,"**按 transformers 的方式调用注意力**（`hf_sdpa`）：没有掩码时，多 token 查询用带 `enable_gqa` 和 `is_causal` 的 SDPA；有掩码时重复 KV 头。缓存像 `DynamicCache` 那样靠拼接增长。"],[5817,"**按上游的顺序抽样**，使用以 42 播种的私有生成器（上游的 `Accelerator` 用 42 给每个生成器播种）：重放构建时的默认初始化（先 VAE，再模型，然后是用 Kaiming 初始化的 LoRA `A`，其值被保留；其余由检查点覆盖）；每次遍历数据加载器时抽基础种子和采样器的种子；每次前向时抽 CFM 的掩码、条件噪声（即使比例为 0 也会抽）、`r`、`t` 和 `z`，以及 LoRA 的 dropout 掩码。在 CPU 上一个生成器负责全部抽样，与上游的默认生成器相同；在 CUDA 上前向的抽样来自设备生成器。"],[5392,"**按上游的顺序抽样**：按上游的构建顺序做模型的随机初始化（UNetT 最后才创建一层的跳连投影），前两个 epoch 各一个数据加载 worker 的种子（持久化的加载器；accelerate 的 `skip_first_batches` 副本会遍历 epoch 0），然后每个批次依次是片段、噪声、时间、两次 `random()` 调用和 dropout 掩码。"],[4671,"**按内容传文件。** 路径在另一台机器上没有意义。请求里提到的每个文件都变成 `mizuoto-file:<sha256>/<文件名>`：`have` 询问 agent 缺哪些，`put` 以 8 MiB 的帧发送缺的那些，并核对 SHA-256。agent 把它们存在 `<cache>/remote/files/`，一个月没有主机要过的文件会被删除。`prepare_voice` 写入的目录变成 `mizuoto-out:…`，其中的文件作为 `file` 帧传回主机自己的目录。"],[6244,"**按响度**"],[6245,"**按响度**、**按峰值** 或 **保持原样**；在生成每句时应用"],[6152,"**按此切分台词**：**每行文本** 时每行是一句；**每个句子** 时每行再按句子拆成多句。"],[4006,"**按请求估算每个阶段的工作显存**：KV 缓存用 `peak_bytes`，按模型实际计算的精度；注意力分数、CFG 批次、按长度计算的解码器激活。`ctx.use` 下要给出该阶段可能达到的上限。"],[5664,"**按长度分批**（`StreamLengthGroupDataset`、`PaddingDataCollator` 的四维掩码），与 SDPA 配置相同，而不是 FlexAttention 的打包。"],[3416,"**按阶段放置组件，按请求估算显存。** 引擎用 `ctx.use` / `ctx.run` 把每个阶段需要的组件放上设备，在模块 `forward` 之外读取权重的模块要标成 `fixed`；需要 float64 的模块经 `DeviceService.float64_device` 放置。见显存管理。"],[5387,"**按顺序生成各块。** 上游在一个共享全局随机数生成器的线程池里生成长文本的各块，所以它自己的输出取决于线程时序；0.1 的适配层按顺序生成，Mizuoto 也是如此。"],[6661,"**损失** 部分在训练阶段运行时实时显示曲线；有多个训练阶段时可以切换，有多条曲线时可以用标签逐条开关。还没有数据时显示 **训练阶段运行时，损失曲线显示在这里**。"],[6430,"**接受 引擎名 的许可**"],[5434,"**接受但无效果**：`normalize` 和 `repetition_penalty` 在上游的推理路径中不起任何作用，所以这里也不起作用。"],[2448,"**接受许可**"],[1034,"**描述与指令**（VoxCPM2）：按上游的做法写在文本前的括号里：`(年轻女性，温柔甜美)你好`。中英文均可；汉语方言也这样指定（粤语、四川话……）。"],[6446,"**描述音色**"],[5312,"**提示 mel** 在每个版本都是 24 kHz 的 Matcha mel；v2/v3 严格保持每个提示 token 对应两帧 mel。v3 丢弃长于五个的静音 token 串，并加上它的系统提示（`You are a helpful assistant.<|endofprompt|>`）。"],[5803,"**提示。** VoxCPM2 用 `librosa.load(sr=16000)`（soxr）读取音频；0.5B 和 1.5 用 `torchaudio.load` 和 `torchaudio.functional.resample`。续写提示在左侧补齐到整块，参考在右侧补齐。参考文本与待合成文本之间不加空格拼接，与上游相同。"],[5427,"**提示**是上游的对话，每个文本部分单独分词；每帧的主 token 是 `semantic_begin_id + code`。"],[3421,"**提速不改变结果。** 性能工作（CUDA 图、同步消除、编译、内存流式加载）必须得到相同的 token、相同的音频；每一轮都用 `scripts/parity/perf.py` 和 `train_perf.py` 与上一轮对照（见性能工作）。确实会改变比特的优化（如 Qwen3-TTS 的 `fused_projections`、`compute.kv_cache = static`）只能是需要用户主动开启的选项，并在输出的参数里注明。"],[6023,"**搜索文本**：按结果的文本或名称搜索；"],[6030,"**收藏** / **取消收藏**"],[6485,"**收藏** / **取消收藏**"],[6025,"**收藏**：只显示收藏的结果。"],[4463,"**改动一个需要接受许可的引擎的选项**，也会改动 `mizuoto` 里它的清单：先发布带新清单的 Mizuoto，再发布把下限提高到该版本的包。"],[3443,"**改动引擎或训练器**：更新 `tests/engines_native/` 的小模型测试（包括模拟设备上的流式加载检查），用真实模型跑契约套件，并用对照工具与上游比较。"],[3446,"**改行为就改文档**：用户可见的变化写进使用教程、命令行或进阶页面，开发者需要知道的写进开发文档。"],[5429,"**数值**：Fish 的 RMSNorm 在 float32 中计算；RoPE 作用于相邻元素对，频率表舍入到 bfloat16；预填充用带布尔因果掩码的 SDPA，解码步骤用 SDPA 的 math 内核（直接调用，不改进程级设置）；快 transformer 用手写的 softmax。权重归一化保留检查点的两种格式，并在每次前向时重新计算，与上游相同。"],[5329,"**数据加载。** 每个加载 worker 对自己的分片跑完整个流水线；分片（每片 1000 段音频）少于 worker 时，每个 worker 都读所有分片，所以默认两个 worker 时每段音频每个 epoch 出现两次，与上游相同。打乱顺序从 `Random(base_seed + k)` 抽样；批次轮流来自各 worker；特征在单线程上生成，与 worker 中一样。"],[6643,"**数据集**；数据集中可用的语音时长不足时，创建会失败，并说明现有与所需的时长。"],[6544,"**数据集**：同一个音色的若干片段及其文本。"],[6387,"**文件夹** 中可以把以下内容放到别处，每项下方显示当前的默认位置：**模型**、**音色**、**结果**、**缓存**。留空表示使用数据文件夹中的默认位置。"],[1382,"**文件按内容传送。** 请求里用到的文件（参考音频、情感参考音频等）按 SHA-256 发送：agent 已经有的不再发送，没有的分块（每块 8 MB）上传一次。agent 启动时删除一个月内没有被任何主机用到的文件。"],[5153,"**文字与测试。** 在 `en.ts` 和 `zh-CN.ts` 加 `nav.projects` 和 `projects.*`；名字可能很长的行加 `min-width: 0`（必要时登记到 `layout.test.ts`）。运行 `python scripts/dev.py test-web`（vitest + `vue-tsc`）。"],[6470,"**文字描述**：在 **描述情感** 中用文字写出来。"],[5382,"**文本。** 以单字节字符结尾的参考文本会补一个空格，与 `infer_batch_process` 相同。"],[5804,"**文本。** 换行和连续空白变成一个空格，需要时再做文本规范化。VoxCPM2 的描述或指令变成 `(…)` 前缀，并去掉其中的括号，与上游网页演示相同；请求同时有两者时用 `, ` 连接。"],[5600,"**文本（1.5、2）** 用 WeTextProcessing 自己的 FST 通过 kaldifst 做规范化。上游在 Linux 上运行 pynini，在其他平台用另一套 FST；Mizuoto 在所有平台上都给出 Linux 上的行为。人名和拼音按首次出现的顺序编号（上游用 `set` 的顺序，每次运行都可能不同）。"],[6461,"**文本** 框最多 20000 个字符。在框中按 Ctrl+Enter 直接合成。"],[6171,"**文本**：在文本框中按 Ctrl+Enter 在下方插入一句；"],[5656,"**文本分词器**是 `mizuoto.text` 的 BPE，不加 transformers 的 “Mistral fix”（模型声明的是 transformers 5.3，那里不适用）。"],[5487,"**文本前端**：先做语种切分，再按各语言做字音转换，得到音素 id；中文另有 BERT 特征（chinese-roberta 倒数第三层，按音素重复）。"],[5515,"**文本前端自己持有用到的一切**，从共享资源路径构建：不改 `nltk.data.path`，没有 fastText 全局变量，也不调用 `logging.basicConfig`。"],[5317,"**文本规范化**是移植到 kaldifst 上的 wetext 规范化器，在语料上结果相同；它的 FST 是共享资源 `cosyvoice/wetext`（ModelScope `pengzhendong/wetext`，固定提交）。含 `<|…|>` 的文本不做规范化，与上游一样跳过。"],[5806,"**文本规范化**采用 wetext 0.1.2 的做法：在标注前和每个 FST 之后去掉首尾空白，开启 `remove_erhua` 时也处理含“儿”但不含数字的文本。它的 FST 与 wetext 0.0.4（CosyVoice 的共享资源）和 WeTextProcessing（IndexTTS）的都不同，所以随引擎提供。数字由 `inflect` 读出；Mizuoto 的 7.3.1 与上游的 7.5.0 在语料上给出相同的词。"],[6520,"**新的词句**：这一处的新内容（作为记录；模型依据的是上面的完整文本）；"],[6330,"**无**"],[3400,"**日志**用 `mizuoto` 日志记录器（`logging.getLogger(__name__)` 位于 `mizuoto.*` 之下）；只有入口（`mizuoto/logger.py` 的 `setup_logging`）配置处理器。"],[6521,"**时长（秒）**：新语音的长度，留空（**自动**）则与原来的片段等长。"],[3015,"**普通 `def`**：涉及磁盘和数据库的路由在线程池里运行。只有读原始请求体的上传（`uploads.spool()` 把它流式写入临时文件，从不按 multipart 解析）和 WebSocket 是 `async def`。"],[5733,"**更少的内核，相同的比特**（仅在不需要自动求导时，所以训练不受影响）：q 和 k 一起归一化和旋转；code predictor 的旋转表只生成一次；在设备上的自检表明 `F.rms_norm` 给出与 float32 归一化相同的比特时使用它。"],[6101,"**更改在模型下次加载时生效（其模型现在会被卸载）。** **设置 › 计算** 中的 **编译模型（torch.compile）** 可以同时为多个引擎提速。详见性能。"],[6162,"**替换现有脚本**"],[3554,"**有意偏离参考实现的数值**（例如默认启用融合的 RMSNorm）。Mizuoto 默认路径上保持参考数学，融合等会改变比特的做法只作为可选项。"],[3397,"**有类注解里用到 `list[...]` 的类不定义名为 `list` 的方法**（ty 会把这个名字解析成方法）。写成 `list_models`、`list_voices`、`list_presets`。"],[6292,"**服务器启动时打开浏览器**"],[6294,"**服务器地址**、**端口**"],[443,"**未下载**"],[6062,"**未下载**"],[1039,"**未包含**：上游可选的参考音频降噪（ZipEnhancer，ModelScope 流水线）与时间戳；两者在上游默认都关闭。"],[5809,"**未提供**：用 ZipEnhancer 对参考音频降噪（`denoise`；一个 ModelScope 流水线外加第二个模型，上游默认关闭）、时间戳（stable-ts）、上游在 CUDA 上的 `torch.compile`（`optimize`）以及 vLLM 服务。"],[6198,"**未生成**"],[5605,"**未移植**：TensorRT、上游的加速引擎和 BigVGAN 的 CUDA 内核（0.1 的加载选项 `use_accel`、`use_trt`、`trt_precision`、`use_cuda_kernel`），以及 2.5 的低显存文本切分（上游在显存不足 10 GB 的 GPU 上把文本切成 40 个字符的片段；Mizuoto 由运行时管理显存）。`use_torch_compile` 会为 s2mel DiT 和 BigVGAN 开启 `compute.compile`。"],[5526,"**未移植**：上游的 CUDA 图 T2S（`t2s_accel`，会改变结果）、`set_seed` 对进程级 TF32 的切换，以及超采样（仅 v3，不在模型目录中）。在带 bf16 矩阵单元的 CPU 上，上游的 `set_float32_matmul_precision(\"medium\")` 可能会用到它们；Mizuoto 保持 fp32。"],[5163,"**本站的开发文档**：实现后的设计、规则及其原因，每个领域一页；引擎参考每个引擎一页（复现了上游的哪些行为、\n有哪些偏差、训练器以及对照结果）。改动某个领域前先读对应页面；设计有变化时同步修改它，中英文都要改。"],[5596,"**束采样**，即上游所用的旧版 transformers 路径：log-softmax 依次经过重复惩罚（作用于所有 id，包括提示的占位 id）、温度、top-k 和 top-p（至少保留两个），加上各束的分数，不放回地抽取 `2 × num_beams` 个候选，再由 `BeamSearchScorer` 维护假设。"],[176,"**来源（Origin）。** 改变状态的请求（`GET`、`HEAD`、`OPTIONS` 以外）和 WebSocket，如果带 `Origin`，它必须是页面自己的来源或列在 `server.allowed_origins` 中，否则返回 403 `bad_origin`；没有 `Origin` 但 `Sec-Fetch-Site` 表明是跨站请求时同样拒绝。curl、Python 等非浏览器客户端不带这些头，不受影响。`server.allowed_origins` 非空时服务器还会为这些来源开启 CORS。"],[6687,"**来自音频**"],[6469,"**来自音频**：一段 **情感参考音频**，只借用它的情感，不借用它的音色；**强度** 0–2。"],[6588,"**某个音色的片段**：选择音色库中的一个音色，点 **添加**，加入它的参考音频及文本。"],[5147,"**查询键与查询。** 在 `api/queries/keys.ts` 加 `projects` 和 `project(id)`，新建 `api/queries/projects.ts`："],[6402,"**标准**、**中**、**高**"],[3398,"**标识符和时间**用 `mizuoto/core/clock.py`：`new_id(prefix)`（毫秒时间戳的十六进制加 8 个随机十六进制字符，大致按创建时间排序）和 `now_iso()`（UTC，毫秒，以 `Z` 结尾，可按文本排序）。"],[3979,"**校准。** 在 CUDA 或 XPU 上每个阶段之后，管理器测量其工作显存：高于已放置权重的峰值，减去 Streamer 副本的最大占用，再减去该阶段之后保留下来的内存（CUDA Graph 的内存池、随模型保留的缓冲区）。超出估算时，它按阶段记住这个比值（乘以 1.1，最多 16），以引擎和组件名为键（`qwen3tts:talker`），下次相应地多预留。比值保存在 `<cache>/memory/calibration.json`（格式版本 2；其他版本的文件会被忽略）。"],[6076,"**校验**：重新计算已安装模型所有文件的 SHA-256。完好时提示 **全部 N 个文件完好**，否则列出 **已损坏：文件名**。已损坏的模型可以删除后重新下载。"],[6380,"**校验文件**"],[3120,"**核心启动不需要 torch。** 列出模型、改设置、提供界面都不加载模型；运行时在第一次加载模型时才建立。"],[3038,"**核心方法。** 在 `mizuoto/core/<领域>/service.py` 写方法，参数和返回值是 `Record` 模型（`mizuoto/core/<领域>/models.py`）；错误只用 `core/errors.py` 的类。若它改变了界面要显示的东西，发布一个事件（新事件就在 `core/events/models.py` 加一个 `EventBase` 子类，模式会自动带上它）。"],[4765,"**核心的测试**不需要 GPU，也不需要模型：dummy 引擎在测试自己的进程里，端到端地支撑起规划、任务、运行时服务、流式、取消和错误。"],[6237,"**格式**"],[5665,"**梯度裁剪**按上游的参数顺序（token 嵌入在先）累加各张量的范数。"],[4996,"**检查。** `check` 给出 `DatasetReport`：时长直方图、过短或过长的片段、空文本、削波、采样率和许可标签；可以按报告里的问题筛选行，逐条排除或删除。"],[3549,"**模块级可变全局变量**（显存状态、已加载模型列表、中断标志、深处读取的命令行参数）。Mizuoto 用 `Services` 和设置对象，设备和取消令牌显式传递，因为 CPU 任务和 GPU 任务可以同时运行。"],[3415,"**模块级缓存要以完整输入为键**（包括每个参数、dtype 和设备），或者干脆每次调用时构建。只按部分参数作键的全局缓存，会让同一进程里的第二种配置用上第一种的结果。"],[3201,"**模型。** `RuntimeService.loaded(ModelRef(id, engine, variant, path), device, dtype, options, request)` 返回模型的 `EngineHandle`：本进程里是 `LocalHandle`，设备名为 `<主机>/<设备>` 时是 `RemoteEngineHandle`。模型没加载就先加载，加载前先把超出 `compute.max_resident_models` 的其他模型卸掉。"],[3227,"**模型。** 目录模型下载到 `models/<引擎>/<模型>/`，`model.json` 最后写入并列出文件。状态是 `missing`、`partial`（有文件夹没有 `model.json`，或缺它需要的共享资源）、`installed`、`corrupt`（大小不符或校验失败）或 `downloading`。`model_download` 任务（资源 `io`）以 `downloads.concurrency` 个线程下载到 `<文件>.part`，用 Range 续传，校验大小和 SHA-256，按来源顺序尝试（`downloads.source` 优先，然后 Hugging Face、hf-mirror、ModelScope；`downloads.repository = \"mizuoto-model\"` 时先试镜像）；某个来源缺的文件从下一个取。`import_model` 按文件识别引擎和变体，大小与目录模型相符时再校验 SHA-256，否则登记为用户模型 `<引擎>/<名字>`。"],[5985,"**模型**"],[6752,"**模型**"],[1442,"**模型** › **引擎**，在引擎卡片的 **设备** 中选择远程主机上的设备（显示为 `主机 · 设备`）。"],[6057,"**模型** 页有三个标签页：**模型**（各引擎的模型目录）、**引擎**（各引擎的可用状态与设置）和 **共享文件**（同一引擎多个模型共用的文件）。"],[6024,"**模型**：**全部模型**，或某一个模型；"],[6208,"**模型**：没选时标签显示 **模型（使用项目的：…）**；选了之后可以点 **使用项目的模型** 改回。"],[6336,"**模型原生**"],[1380,"**模型状态来自 agent。** 对设备指向远程主机的引擎，模型是否“已安装”取决于 agent 上已安装的模型列表（主机每 15 秒左右重新询问一次），而不是本机的模型文件夹。模型要在 agent 上用它自己的 `mizuoto` 命令安装。"],[5236,"**模型独立实现。** CosyVoice 的语音分词器里也有一个 Whisper 编码器，但那里用的是 openai 的注意力（q 和 k 各乘以 d^-¼，带掩码），是另一种计算，所以两者不共用。"],[6231,"**段间停顿（毫秒）**"],[5330,"**每个 epoch 以一轮验证结束**（在训练列表上，与上游相同），验证同样会抽样（Qwen2LM 的双流选择、flow 的流式选择、条件和噪声）。它的损失写入日志，不作为指标。"],[3394,"**每个函数都有类型标注**（`mizuoto/` 和 `packages/native/` 下；测试和脚本除外）。`Any` 只用在值确实可以是任何东西的地方（JSON）。"],[3441,"**每个改动都带测试**，并让 `python scripts/dev.py check`（lint、typecheck-py、test-py、test-web、typegen-check）通过。CI 在 Linux、Windows、macOS 和 Python 3.10–3.13 上运行同样的测试，所以注意路径、编码和换行在 Windows 上的行为。"],[5233,"**每个窗口内的 seek 循环。** 每个窗口都补齐到 30 秒；以一对时间戳结束的解码会从该时间戳重新解码（特征平移，后面补零），时间戳对之后的 token 被丢弃。`_decode_asr` 为重新开始的时间戳重新定基，并合并重叠的窗口。"],[3014,"**每个路由都写 `operation_id`**，它是 OpenAPI 中操作的名字。"],[5005,"**每个阶段一个进程**：`host_target(\"mizuoto.training.stage\", cwd=work)` 通过 `JobContext.run_worker`，用服务器自己的解释器运行 `python -m mizuoto.training.stage <request.json>`。阶段进程看得到所有设备，名字不变。心跳超时是 30 分钟（`STAGE_HEARTBEAT_TIMEOUT`）；任何一行输出都会重置它，而阶段本身每 10 秒也会发一次心跳。"],[6243,"**每句音量统一**"],[5731,"**每帧只等待一次。** 单样本抽样采用 `multinomial` 本身的计算（`argmax(p / Exp(1))`），去掉它的检查（`runtime.sampling.multinomial1`；概率为 NaN 仍是错误，在每帧那一次等待时读取）；掩码每个设备只构建一次；重复惩罚作用于已抽取 id 的掩码（`repetition_penalty_seen`，算术相同）；填充情况在主机端已知。"],[6366,"**每次运行保留的检查点数**"],[6463,"**每行一个结果**：支持批量的模型（Qwen3-TTS、GPT-SoVITS、OmniVoice）才有这个开关；打开后每行文本各生成一个结果。"],[5658,"**没有 FlashInfer 和 CUDA 图。** 0.1 中它们的加载选项已经去掉；SDPA 适用于所有平台。"],[5432,"**没有守护线程，也没有预分配 32 768 个位置的缓存。** 缓存通过拼接增长；经过 `repeat_interleave` 后，键和值就是上游构造的那些张量。注意力掩码按调用生成，而不是上游那 4 GiB 的掩码缓冲。"],[5724,"**没有实现 25 Hz 分词器。** 没有已发布的模型使用它，上游的封装也无法解码它的输出。"],[5657,"**没有自由文本设计。** 模型是在封闭的属性词表上训练的；自由文本会被拒绝，与 0.1 相同。"],[5318,"**没有语言模型线程。** 上游把语言模型放在声码器旁边的线程里运行；这里它在请求的线程中运行，token 一到就生成分块。上游流式的 v1/v2 在主线程抽取声码器噪声，同时语言模型在另一个线程采样，所以流式音频取决于线程时序；Mizuoto 的声码器从自己的生成器（种子 + 1）抽样，token 与非流式请求相同。CosyVoice 3 的噪声是固定的，流式结果完全相同。"],[4794,"**注意力。** 每个调用点传入的 `mask_info` 都与它的稠密掩码对照检查。`MIZUOTO_TEST_ACCEL=count python -m pytest tests/engines_native packages/native` 让每次注意力调用都经过一个策略：它统计调用点，并按调用点自己的参照方式计算；如果某个调用点从没以这种方式被调用到（例如有代码绕过 `compute.attention` 直接调用 SDPA），测试结束时就会失败。每个 conftest 列出本目录的调用点（`SITES_TESTED`）；检查本身在 `tests/engines_native/accel_checks.py`。"],[5235,"**注意力**：先投影查询再乘以 `head_dim ** -0.5`，SDPA 使用 `scale=1`，q、k、v 都是连续张量；解码器在多 token 提示上为无掩码的因果注意力，每个新 token 不加掩码，缓存按拼接增长。"],[5800,"**注意力**使用 SDPA，`enable_gqa`，张量连续：预填充时为因果注意力，局部模块中为双向注意力，逐步生成时在显式布尔掩码下对静态缓存计算。上游对缓存的全部位置计算（超出当前长度的部分为零并被掩码）；Mizuoto 只算到当前长度之后第一个 256 的倍数（`minicpm.ATTEND_BLOCK`），掩码保留。被掩码的位置只会加上精确的零，而 SDPA 在任何 64 的倍数处截断都给出相同的结果位（在 CPU 上以 bf16 和 fp32 对 3100 以内的每个位置检查过），所以结果完全相同，VoxCPM2 在 CPU 上快 1.5 倍。"],[5650,"**注意力掩码。** 语言模型是 `runtime/lm/qwen` 的解码器，使用完整的四维布尔掩码：transformers 原样返回四维掩码，SDPA 收到的是重复了 KV 头的掩码，不是因果的。条件行和无条件行在一个批次里运行，与上游的批处理方式相同。"],[3413,"**注意力都经过 `accel.attention(q, k, v, site=…)`**，不直接调用 SDPA 或它的 aten 内核，这样 `compute.attention` 才能切换后端（见注意力加速）。"],[934,"**流式**：v2/v3 逐 token 流式输出；流式文本输入需要参考音频的文本（零样本克隆或 instruct2）。"],[6481,"**流式**：打开这个开关（位于 **计划** 和 **合成** 旁）后，**合成** 会边生成边播放。悬停可以看到当前模型的方式：CosyVoice 在首批词语生成后即开始播放；其他引擎每句生成好就播放；或由 Mizuoto 拆分文本，每段生成好就播放。播放条显示 **已播放 … · 已就绪 …**，可以 **停止**。模型跟不上时播放会暂停等待，不会丢掉语音；完整的结果照样保存在 **结果** 中。"],[5725,"**流式按段进行**，与 0.1 相同：先生成模型的整段，再解码。"],[284,"**流式文本输入**：模型支持 **流式文本输入**（CosyVoice 2 和 3）时，请求中设 `\"text_stream\": true`，`text` 只是开头；之后发送 `{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"…\"}` 追加文本，最后发送 `{\"type\": \"flush\"}`。在 `flush` 之前断开连接会取消任务。"],[5524,"**流式时每段文本都会朗读。** 上游在流式模式下只朗读每组 `batch_size` 中的第一段文本。"],[1384,"**流式输出、流式文本输入和取消都可用。** 音频片段一生成就从 agent 传回；取消请求会转发给 agent 上的引擎。"],[6398,"**浅色**、**深色**、**跟随系统**（顶栏的主题按钮也可以切换）"],[3041,"**测试。** 在 `tests/api/test_api.py` 用 `TestClient` 对着 dummy 引擎测试；改变状态的请求带 `headers={\"origin\": \"http://localhost\"}`（文件里的 `ORIGIN`）。"],[6390,"**浏览器可以打开的文件夹**"],[4994,"**添加。** 音频可以来自文件（旁边同名的 `.lab` 或 `.txt` 是它的文本）、上传、某个音色的参考音频、已有的输出（保留它们的许可标签），或已知布局的文件夹（GPT-SoVITS 的 `.list`、LJSpeech、CSV、普通文件夹）。"],[6522,"**添加一处修改** 增加一行，行尾的按钮删除一行。只有填了起点和终点、且终点大于起点的行才会提交。"],[6323,"**添加主机**：填写 **名称**（引擎的设备写作 `名称/cuda:0`）、**地址**（如 `192.168.1.20:7870`）、**令牌**（agent 生成令牌时会显示它），需要时打开 **TLS** 并指定 **本机上的 CA 文件**，然后点 **添加**。"],[6590,"**添加服务器文件夹**（只在服务器本机的浏览器中出现）：先选择 **文件夹格式**，再选择文件夹："],[6213,"**添加角色** 新建一个角色。项目本身的语言在同一标签页的 **项目** 中设置（**语言**；**由各模型决定** 表示交给各模型），也可以用 `mizuoto project set --lang`。"],[6181,"**添加风格指令**"],[6634,"**片段** 列表每页 50 条，可以搜索文本或按问题筛选。每条片段："],[6631,"**片段时长** 的直方图；"],[5234,"**特征**来自 transformers 的 `WhisperFeatureExtractor`，使用它自己的 float64 slaney 滤波器组和转置后的乘法，而不是 openai-whisper 的 log-mel。Turbo 的 `tokenizer_config.json` 设置了 `clean_up_tokenization_spaces`（\" .\" 变成 \".\"），按分段应用。"],[6202,"**生成中**"],[6216,"**生成本章（N）**：生成当前章节中所有不是 **已生成** 的句子（未生成、过期、失败的）。"],[5146,"**生成类型。** 后端路由就绪后运行 `python scripts/dev.py typegen`，`schema.d.ts` 中出现 `/api/v1/projects` 等路径和 `Project`、`ProjectInput` 等模型。在 `api/types.ts` 加别名："],[6637,"**用于训练** / **不用于训练**：排除的片段保留在数据集中但不参与训练；"],[6036,"**用作参考音频**"],[6491,"**用作参考音频**"],[6506,"**用另一个音色说出录音里的话，保留原话和节奏。** 需要支持音色转换的模型：CosyVoice（300M、300M SFT、2、3）。"],[6514,"**用同一音色把录音中的部分内容替换成新的词句。** 需要支持语音编辑的模型：F5-TTS（v1 Base、Base、E2-TTS）。"],[6040,"**用这些设置重新运行**"],[6495,"**用这些设置重新运行**"],[5719,"**相同的张量形状。** 提示按上游 `generate` 的方式构建：三个特殊嵌入在一次调用里查出，编解码器头作用于整个预填充。拆成更小的调用，值虽相同，浮点求和却不同。"],[3493,"**相对地址加开发代理**：前端代码在开发和生产中使用同样的相对 URL。"],[4767,"**真实模型**：契约套件让已安装的模型走完整条链路，对照工具把原生引擎与参照实现逐采样比较。开发者改动引擎时手动运行它们。"],[4103,"**矩阵乘法占主导**（`F.linear`/`addmm`：50–90 % 的时间）。自回归语言模型对着 fp32 权重一次生成一个 token，受内存带宽限制（Qwen3-TTS 的 1.7B talker 每帧以约 36 GB/s 读取约 6.8 GB）。更快的内核、更低的精度或其他线程数都会改变求和结果。"],[5150,"**视图。** `views/ProjectsView.vue` 是列表：`useProjects()`、`EmptyState`、一组 `AppCard`，以及 `NewProjectDialog`。`views/ProjectView.vue` 是详情页，接收路由参数 `id` 作为 prop：编辑保存在本地草稿里，停止输入 800 ms 后 `PUT` 保存，`onDeactivated` 与 `onBeforeUnmount` 时也保存；进行中的渲染从 jobs store 中按 `kind` 和 `request.project` 找到，用 `JobCard` 显示；主要操作放在 `PageFooter`。\"在 Speak 中试听\"一行通过 `handoff.sendRequest()` 交给 Speak。只从 `@/ui` 取组件，只用令牌写样式。"],[1183,"**离线**：连不上 agent。确认那台机器上 `mizuoto agent` 正在运行，且监听的是能从本机访问的地址（默认只监听 `127.0.0.1`，需要 `--host 0.0.0.0`）；检查地址、端口（默认 7870）和防火墙；两边的 TLS 设置要一致。"],[6472,"**种子**：留空表示 **每次使用新的种子**；填一个数则 **保持这个种子**，同样的输入会得到同样的结果。骰子按钮 **随机一个种子**，解锁按钮回到每次新种子。"],[6204,"**空**"],[3895,"**空闲** = 驱动报告的空闲显存，加上 torch 缓存分配器占着但未使用的部分；设置了 `compute.vram_limit_mb` 时，不超过它减去本进程已占用的量。"],[6305,"**空闲多少分钟后卸载模型（0：从不）**"],[5393,"**第 *e* ≥ 1 个 epoch 用种子 666 + *e* − 1 打乱**：accelerate 的加载器会把采样器的 epoch 重置为它自己的迭代次数。"],[6187,"**第 N 版（秒数）**"],[6477,"**管理预设…**：**设为默认**、**取消默认**、删除。"],[3040,"**类型。** 运行 `python scripts/dev.py typegen`，提交 `schema.d.ts`。"],[5799,"**精度。** 与上游一样，先转换模型的精度再拷入检查点，所以 LongRoPE 表（以 float32 构建）随之舍入为 bf16。"],[5818,"**精度。** 在 CUDA 上与上游相同：float32 权重，bf16 自动混合精度，带梯度缩放器。其他设备全程 float32：上游用它的配置无法在 CUDA 以外训练（前向把输入转成配置中的 bf16，而权重仍是 float32），所以 CPU 上的参考实现是配置 `config.json` 为 float32 的上游。"],[2456,"**精度**"],[6087,"**精度**：**自动**、`bf16`、`fp16`、`fp32`。"],[1038,"**精度**：与上游相同，除 Apple 设备（fp32）外都用模型自带的 bf16；需要全精度时设 `engines.voxcpm.dtype fp32`。"],[5237,"**精确的捷径**：只有一个窗口时复用语言识别时的编码器输出；所有束的行逐位相同时不重排交叉注意力缓存。两者都不改变任何 token。"],[3955,"**精确重试**（`compute.oom_retry`，默认开）。经 `ctx.run` 运行的阶段显存不足时："],[5822,"**组件**，每个模型在 bf16 和 fp32 下：分词器和文本规范化在 420 条文本上，VAE 的潜变量和解码；然后是各种方式的完整请求（中英文的零样本和克隆、只用参考、只用续写、设计、带指令的克隆音色、文本规范化、强制重试、有无音色的流式，包括分块长度）。全部完全相同。"],[3529,"**组件层**（`src/ui/`）：`@material/web` 已有的组件（按钮、图标按钮、FAB、复选框、筛选 chip、分隔线、文本框、滑块、进度条、开关、标签页）包一层项目自己的 Vue 组件，其余（外壳、导航、对话框、侧栏、菜单、卡片、提示条、步骤条、图表、波形……）用令牌自己实现。业务代码只从 `@/ui` 导入。"],[5919,"**组件检查**：`scripts/parity/check_tokenizer.py`（BPE 与 transformers 的分词器对比）、`scripts/parity/dsp_fixtures.py`（DSP 与 torchaudio、librosa、Whisper 和 soxr 对比，保存为 `tests/fixtures/dsp/*.npz`）、`scripts/parity/check_rng.py`（显式生成器与播种后的默认随机流对比），以及按引擎的模块脚本，例如 `voxcpm_modules.py`。"],[6482,"**结果** 列出本次在合成页生成的语音。每条显示文本、时长、波形（点击跳转）、模型、耗时、实时率（RTF）和种子，以及警告和许可声明。右侧菜单："],[2866,"**结果不精确。** 在 CPU 上以 fp32 与即时执行相比，音频最大差异为：F5-TTS 9e-5，IndexTTS 6e-5，GPT-SoVITS 3e-5。CosyVoice 的梅尔谱差异在 5.7e-6 之内，但 HiFT 由 F0 驱动的声源把它放大到音频中约 1e-2（即时执行换一个线程数也是如此）。VoxCPM 的浮点差异可能改变语音结束的位置。模型加载后的第一个请求要付出编译时间（CPU 上 30 到 160 秒）；收益见性能记录。"],[6332,"**结果格式**"],[6335,"**结果采样率**"],[6613,"**统一音量**"],[5722,"**编解码器。** 编码器的 transformer 用普通的因果掩码（忽略配置中的 250 帧窗口，与上游的编码路径一样）；解码器的 transformer 应用 72 帧窗口。解码按上游的分块进行（300 帧，左侧 25 帧上下文），在上下文中克隆时，联合解码之后再切掉参考音频那一段。"],[6317,"**编译模型（torch.compile）**"],[3490,"**耗时工作是任务加事件**，请求本身很快返回；进度和取消随之而来。"],[1052,"**能力**：**克隆音色**、**多段参考**（最多 4 段）、**行内标签**、**对话**、**流式输出**（按段）、**种子**。采样率 44.1 kHz。"],[990,"**能力**：**克隆音色**、**多段参考**（最多 4 段）、**训练音色**、**语速**、**批量**（最多 20 条）、**长文本**、**流式输出**、**种子**；v2、v2Pro、v2ProPlus 另有 **无文本克隆**。"],[1008,"**能力**：**克隆音色**、**按属性设计**、**自带音色**、**行内标签**、**发音控制**、**语速**、**时长**、**批量**（最多 8 条）、**长文本**、**种子**。克隆时 Mizuoto 总会提供文本（缺少时由语音识别补全），所以 OmniVoice 不会自己加载 Whisper。"],[877,"**能力**：Base 有 **克隆音色**、**无文本克隆**；CustomVoice 有 **预置说话人**、**指令**（0.6B 没有指令：上游会静默忽略，所以 Mizuoto 不声明）；VoiceDesign 有 **按描述设计**。所有变体都支持 **批量**（每批最多 8 条）和 **种子**。"],[1032,"**能力**：VoxCPM2：**克隆音色**、**无文本克隆**、**按描述设计**、**指令**、**自带音色**、**流式输出**（每 40 毫秒一块）、**种子**。VoxCPM 1.5 和 0.5B：**克隆音色**（需要参考文本，缺少时由语音识别补全）、**自带音色**、**流式输出**、**种子**。"],[957,"**能力**（三个变体相同）：**克隆音色**、**语速**、**时长**、**长文本**、**种子**、**流式输出**（按块）、**语音编辑**。克隆必须有参考音频的文本：没有文本时，开启 `tts.auto_transcribe` 且已下载语音识别模型就会自动转写。"],[6123,"**脚本**：若干章节，每章是一句一句的台词。每句有文本和说话的角色，可以单独加风格指令。"],[6303,"**自动**"],[6364,"**自动**"],[6365,"**自动**、`fp32`、`fp16`、`bf16`"],[6593,"**自动识别**"],[6341,"**自动识别没有文本的参考音频**"],[6448,"**自带音色**"],[2834,"**自检**：一个 1 × 2 × 64 × D 的 fp16 注意力，与 fp32 下 SDPA 的 math 内核比较，要求结果有限且误差不超过 2e-3（SageAttention 为 2e-2），这能发现为别的 torch 或 GPU 构建的 wheel。"],[3551,"**节点图和自定义节点生态。** 一个有类型的引擎注册表加入口点就够了，需要接受许可的引擎正是这样注册的。"],[3492,"**薄路由加服务层**，每种资源一个路由模块，界面一侧每种资源一个查询模块，两边一一对应。"],[1010,"**行内标签**：`[laughter]`、`[sigh]`、`[question-en]`、`[surprise-wa]` 等 13 个。"],[932,"**行内标签**：v1 为 `[laughter]`、`[breath]`、`<strong></strong>`；v2 另有 `<laughter></laughter>`；v3 为 `[breath]`、`[laughter]`、`[cough]`、`[sigh]` 等 11 个。"],[1184,"**被拒绝**：令牌不对，或两边的 Mizuoto 版本不兼容。用 `mizuoto remote add <名称> <地址> --token <令牌>` 重新填写令牌；令牌在 agent 那台机器的 `settings.toml` 中（`remote.agent.token`）。"],[6348,"**裁剪以适配**"],[6349,"**裁剪以适配**（在限制之前最安静的位置截断，原文本作废），或 **拒绝**"],[5331,"**裁剪顺序。** 参数按上游的顺序裁剪（`sft._ORDER`），因为总范数按这个顺序求和；检查点保持上游的键顺序，Qwen 绑定的 `lm_head` 与嵌入共享存储。"],[6206,"**角色** 标签页上方的 **项目** 部分可以修改项目的 **模型**、**项目名称** 和 **描述**。下面是每个角色一张卡片："],[6170,"**角色**：选择说这句话的角色；选第一个角色（旁白）就是不指定角色；"],[6207,"**角色名称**；第一个角色带有 **旁白** 标记；旁边显示这个角色的句数和移除按钮。移除角色后，它的台词交给旁白。"],[6124,"**角色表**：每个角色有自己的模型、音色（音色库中的音色、预置说话人或模型自带的音色）、语言、说话方式和参数。**第一个角色是旁白**：没有指定角色的句子都由旁白朗读。没有选模型的角色使用项目的模型。"],[5807,"**解码。** VoxCPM2 从开头去掉解码出的上下文块（提示的最后 `min(3, n)` 块）；第一代只要有提示音频就去掉 `2 × patch × hop` 个采样，与上游一样不管提示多长。流式时每块输出一段：VoxCPM2 经有状态的因果解码器，第一代则解码最后三块并保留最新的一块。"],[6479,"**计划**：不真正合成，只显示 **将要执行的操作**：模型、音色方式、语言、设备、分段数、发送的参数、每段参考音频（以及是否 **先识别文本**）和 **提示**。参数不合适时在这里就会报错。"],[2309,"**计算** › **之后允许更省显存的方式**"],[2273,"**计算** › **保留在内存中的模型数**"],[2289,"**计算** › **保留的空闲内存**"],[2277,"**计算** › **保留的空闲显存（MB）**"],[2357,"**计算** › **加速**"],[2337,"**计算** › **同时运行的 GPU 任务数**"],[2341,"**计算** › **同时运行的合成任务**"],[2293,"**计算** › **在内存中保留显存权重的副本**"],[2301,"**计算** › **复制流数量**"],[2353,"**计算** › **失败而不是回退**"],[2305,"**计算** › **显存不足时重试该步骤**"],[2281,"**计算** › **模型如何使用显存**"],[2285,"**计算** › **每块 GPU 最多使用**"],[2349,"**计算** › **注意力**"],[2297,"**计算** › **流式权重使用的锁页内存**"],[2269,"**计算** › **空闲多少分钟后卸载模型（0：从不）**"],[2345,"**计算** › **编译模型（torch.compile）**"],[2265,"**计算** › **默认设备**"],[6693,"**训练**"],[6750,"**训练**"],[2492,"**训练** › **内存**"],[2500,"**训练** › **每次运行保留的检查点数**"],[2496,"**训练** › **注意力**"],[2504,"**训练** › **训练后合成试听**"],[2488,"**训练** › **训练精度**"],[2484,"**训练** › **训练设备**"],[6543,"**训练** 页用你自己的录音微调模型。它分两步："],[996,"**训练**：**Fine-tune a voice**（`speaker`）：上游的完整流程（文本特征、语音特征、语义 token、训练 SoVITS、训练 GPT），导出为音色专属的一对权重。一到十分钟的单人语音；GPU 上几分钟，CPU 上几小时。v4 和 v5 Turbo 以 LoRA 训练 SoVITS。"],[961,"**训练**：**Fine-tune the model**（`full`）：上游 `finetune_cli` 的流程，整个模型继续训练，导出为同类新模型。最好有一小时以上语音，几乎必须用 GPU；结果继承 CC-BY-NC-4.0。"],[1012,"**训练**：**Fine-tune the model**（`full`）和 **Fine-tune with LoRA**（`lora`，导出时合并），都导出为新模型。全量微调适合用数小时语音学习新语言或风格，需要 24 GB 以上显存；LoRA 更轻。"],[1040,"**训练**：**Fine-tune the model**（`full`）和 **Fine-tune with LoRA**（`lora`），即上游自己的方案（`train_voxcpm_finetune.py` 及其按模型的配置），结果都导出为新模型；LoRA 模型把基础权重与适配器放在一起，加载时按上游的方式应用。超参数留为 0 时取该模型的方案值。在 GPU 上与上游相同（fp32 权重，bf16 自动混合精度）；在 CPU 上用 fp32（上游本身无法在 CUDA 以外训练）。VoxCPM2 的全量微调约需 40 GB 内存；LoRA 少得多。"],[1056,"**训练**：**Fine-tune with LoRA**（`lora`，GPU 或 CPU）：上游的 LoRA 流程（提取语义 token、打包、训练、合并），导出为新模型。上游提醒它学到的更多是说话风格而不是音色；需要 24 GB 显存，结果仍受 Fish Audio 研究许可约束。"],[882,"**训练**：**Teach it a speaker**（`speaker`，仅 Base）：上游的单说话人微调（`sft_12hz.py`，在 Mizuoto 中重新实现），Base 学会数据集的音色，导出为以它为预置说话人的 CustomVoice 新模型。几分钟的单人语音即可；1.7B 需要 24 GB 以上显存。"],[5824,"**训练**：VoxCPM-0.5B 全量、VoxCPM-0.5B LoRA 和 VoxCPM2 LoRA 在每一步都与上游脚本相同（两项损失、梯度范数、学习率），保存的权重也相同。每个导出结果无论由上游还是 Mizuoto 加载，朗读结果都相同。"],[1094,"**训练**：无。"],[935,"**训练**（GPU 或 CPU）：**Fine-tune the language model**（`llm`）和 **Fine-tune the LLM and the flow**（`llm_flow`），起点为 v1_base、v2、v3，按上游 LibriTTS 流程，至少 60 秒数据，导出为新模型。只训 LLM 时韵律与发音跟随数据集；连 flow 一起训时音色也跟随数据集。"],[5916,"**训练**相同，指两边用同样的种子时，每一步的损失、学习率等指标以及保存的权重都与上游相同。上游很少给所有东西播种（0.1 从来没有），所以参考实现是按原生训练阶段的播种方式给生成器播种之后的上游。"],[6368,"**训练后合成试听**"],[6642,"**训练方式**：这个模型可用的方式；不可用的带有 **（不可用）** 并写明原因（缺少共享文件、引擎不可用或在远程主机上等）。下方显示这种方式的说明、阶段、结果类型（**生成音色专属权重** 或 **生成新模型**）和所需的最少语音时长。"],[4795,"**训练显存工具。** `training_memory.py` 的 `check_checkpointing` 把训练器的阶段在全新的工作目录里跑两遍，一遍原样，一遍每个块都做梯度检查点，比较每个指标和每个写出的权重文件：必须完全相同。保持结果的其他工具（如把优化器状态放在内存里）用同样的方式检查。"],[1385,"**训练留在本机。** 引擎在远程主机上时，训练方法会说明原因：`<engine> runs on <host>, and training runs on this machine: mizuoto remote use <engine> --local`。"],[6363,"**训练精度**"],[6360,"**训练设备**"],[3229,"**许可。** `licence.gated` 的引擎（Fish Speech、IndexTTS）要求 `engines.<id>.accepted_licence == \"<许可 id>@<版本>\"`，才能下载模型和共享资源、才能合成；许可全文随包发布（`manifests/licences/`）。`requires_consent` 让克隆需要一段同意声明，`trains_others = false` 让它的输出不能作为别的引擎的训练数据，`notice` 显示在结果下方。输出都带许可标签。"],[4997,"**许可。** 交给训练器的行是 `training_rows(数据集, 目标引擎)`：排除被标记的和没有文本的行；如果某些行的许可标签不允许用来训练目标引擎（引擎清单的 `trains_others = false`），整个请求被拒绝。"],[1091,"**许可**：bilibili Model Use License，需要接受（`bilibili-model-use@2025-09-09`）；允许商用，但结果不能用于训练其他引擎；结果下方的提示会提醒：IndexTTS 的免责声明禁止未经声音主人许可克隆其声音。"],[1054,"**许可**：Fish Audio Research License，需要接受（`fish-audio-research@2026-03-07`），不可商用，结果不能用于训练其他引擎，结果下方显示 \"Built with Fish Audio\"。"],[960,"**许可**：代码 MIT，预训练权重 CC-BY-NC-4.0（在 Emilia 上训练），不能商用；不需要接受许可，结果带有提示。"],[2452,"**设备**"],[6086,"**设备**：**自动**，本机上该引擎支持的设备（如 `cuda:0`、`cpu`），以及已添加的、该引擎在其上可用的远程主机的设备（显示为“主机 · 设备”）。选了远程设备后，这个引擎在那台机器上运行，卡片显示 **在 主机 上**，其依赖也由那台机器管理（见远程主机）。"],[1055,"**设备**：GPU 上用 bf16；CPU 上用 fp32（bf16 在 CPU 上是模拟的，慢得多）。显存需求约 22 GB。"],[6999,"**设置 › 下载 › 下载来源**：模型从哪里下载（**Hugging Face**、**hf-mirror.com**、**ModelScope**；在中国大陆，后两者通常更快）。"],[5981,"**设置 › 下载**"],[5983,"**设置 › 计算**"],[7000,"**设置 › 计算**：本机的显卡和正在使用的 torch 构建，不合适时给出安装正确构建的命令（与 `mizuoto doctor` 的检查相同）。"],[6668,"**设置 › 训练** 中还有 **训练精度**、**每次运行保留的检查点数** 和 **内存**：*标准* 按各配方训练；*低* 加上梯度检查点（反向传播时重新运行模型的每个块，而不保留其激活值），并把用不到的部分移出 GPU，结果相同，约慢三分之一；*最低* 还把优化器状态放在内存中，并从内存流式加载 LoRA 的冻结权重，结果略有不同。方法自己的 **gradient_checkpointing** 超参数优先。"],[6458,"**设置 › 语音 › 自动识别没有文本的参考音频** 打开、且已安装语音识别：Mizuoto 先查转写缓存，没有就在合成任务中先转写（计划中显示 **先识别文本**）。音色库音色的转写结果会保存回音色。"],[4005,"**设置 `PHASED = True`，把每个部分放进一个阶段**：纯代码块用 `ctx.run`，产出或消费生成器的代码块用 `ctx.use`。引擎在上下文之外自己持有的生成器用 `generators=` 传入，重试时会一并重放。"],[426,"**设置** › **下载** › **下载来源**；选 **自定义** 时填写 **自定义地址**。"],[471,"**设置** › **下载** › **仓库** 选 **优先使用 mizuoto-model 镜像**（默认）。镜像从 **下载来源** 选中的地方访问。选 **各模型自己的仓库** 则不使用镜像。"],[1146,"**设置** › **计算** 中也显示同样的检查结果。提示 \"sees no GPU: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES hides them\" 表示启动 Mizuoto 的环境中设置了这个变量。"],[1431,"**设置** › **远程主机** › **添加主机**，填写 **名称**、**地址**、**令牌**，需要时打开 **TLS** 并填写 **本机上的 CA 文件**，点 **添加**。修改已有主机时 **令牌** 留空则保留已保存的令牌。"],[6662,"**设置** 中是这种训练方式的超参数（数字输入框），**高级** 中是其余的。**修改设置会使用到它的阶段及其后的阶段过期。** 改完点 **保存**。"],[6286,"**设置** 在导航栏最下方，顶部的标签页分为九个部分。大部分设置改动后立即保存，并提示 **设置已保存**；文本框在离开输入框时保存；**存储** 部分需要点 **保存**。"],[2634,"**设置**：`mizuoto config set` 写入 `settings.toml`，正在运行的服务器在约 1 秒内读到改动，网页界面随之刷新。服务器地址和端口要在下次启动服务器时生效。"],[6756,"**设置**（最下方）"],[6689,"**设计**"],[1009,"**设计属性**：gender（male、female）、age（child … elderly）、pitch（very low pitch … very high pitch）、style（whisper）、accent（american accent 等 10 种）、dialect（河南话、四川话、东北话等 12 种）。不接受自由描述。"],[3447,"**设计记录。** 仓库根目录的 `AGENTS.md` 记录代码实际做了什么、守着哪些规则、为什么，以及长期有效的发现（例如为得到与上游相同的输出复现了哪些行为）。改了设计或得出了新发现，就同时更新它。"],[177,"**访问令牌。** 设置了 `server.access_token` 时，`/api/`、`/ws/`、`/v1/`、`/openapi.json` 和 `/docs` 下的每个请求都要带上令牌，否则返回 401 `auth_required`。唯一的例外是 `GET /api/v1/app/health`。令牌可以用以下任一方式提供："],[6296,"**访问令牌**"],[6663,"**试听**：导出阶段会用训练结果朗读一段（**设置 › 训练 › 训练后合成试听** 打开时），结果列在这里。"],[6639,"**详情** 中可以修改名称、语言和描述。页面底部有 **删除**（移到回收站；用它建立的实验将无法再运行）和 **用它训练**（以这个数据集新建实验）。"],[6290,"**语言**"],[6210,"**语言**：**使用项目的语言**，或模型支持的某种语言。"],[6462,"**语言**：**自动识别**，或模型支持的某种语言。"],[1092,"**语言**：IndexTTS-2.5 的日语文本需要可选依赖 `mizuoto-indextts[ja]`。"],[1036,"**语言**：VoxCPM2 支持 30 种（ar、my、zh、da、nl、en、fi、fr、de、el、he、hi、id、it、ja、km、ko、lo、ms、no、pl、pt、ru、es、sw、sv、tl、th、tr、vi），不需要语言标签，按原文朗读。VoxCPM 1.5 和 0.5B：zh、en。"],[879,"**语言**：zh、en、de、it、pt、es、ja、ko、fr、ru。"],[930,"**语言**：zh、en、ja、ko、yue；v3 为 zh、en、ja、ko、de、es、fr、it、ru、yue。"],[992,"**语言**：zh、en、ja、ko、yue。日语需要可选依赖 `mizuoto[gptsovits-ja]`，韩语需要 `mizuoto[gptsovits-ko]`。"],[958,"**语言**：zh、en。采样率 24 kHz。"],[2418,"**语音** › **参考音频对模型来说过长时**"],[2434,"**语音** › **合并等待中的请求**"],[2426,"**语音** › **拒绝模型不接受的参数**"],[2398,"**语音** › **结果格式**"],[2402,"**语音** › **结果采样率**"],[2410,"**语音** › **自动识别没有文本的参考音频**"],[2414,"**语音** › **语音识别模型**"],[2406,"**语音** › **音量均衡**"],[2394,"**语音** › **默认模型**"],[6344,"**语音识别模型**"],[5723,"**说话人编码器的 mel** 是 Matcha-TTS 的（`nn.dsp.mel.matcha_mel`），与上游的计算相同。"],[6211,"**说话方式**：这个角色每句话的风格指令（模型支持指令时才显示）。"],[5006,"**请求内容**：`trainer`、`stage`、`engine`、`method`、`experiment`、`workdir`、`dataset_dir`、`rows`（绝对音频路径、文本、说话人、语言、时长、采样率；已经在 `training_rows` 里按许可过滤过）、`base_model`（`id`、`dir`、`variant`）、`assets`、`device`、`precision`（`training.precision`）、`hyperparams`、`language`、`results`（已完成阶段的返回值），以及设置 `training.previews` 和 `training.keep_checkpoints`。"],[4643,"**调用**（`LocalHandle.prepare_voice`、`synthesize`、`convert`、`edit`、`call`）：每次都在调用线程（某个任务的线程）上、在 `torch.inference_mode()` 里运行，上下文已绑定，模型的句柄由 `manager.use(...)` 占住。种子取自任务的 `params[\"seed\"]`。"],[5004,"**资源**：`engine:<引擎>:<设备>` 和 `gpu:<设备>`（CPU 上是 `cpu`），所以它会等引擎自己的推理和 GPU 上的其他任务。设备取 `training.devices[0]`，没有就用引擎的设备。GPU 上的运行整个占用 `gpu:<设备>`（`JobSpec.exclusive`，不受 `compute.gpu_jobs` 限制）；开始前卸载该引擎已加载的模型（`runtime.unload_engine`），并把该设备上其他空闲模型的权重移到内存（`runtime.release_device`），运行期间没有模型回到这个设备。随后估算这次运行的显存峰值，超出空闲显存时在日志里警告，并给出能放下的预设。"],[6641,"**起始模型**：只列出可以训练的已安装模型。没有时提示安装可训练的模型。"],[6519,"**起点（秒）** 和 **终点（秒）**：被替换的语音在录音中的位置；"],[6404,"**跟随系统** 或 **减少**；**预览** 按钮演示一次动画"],[3395,"**跨越 API 边界的模型都继承 `Record`**（`mizuoto/core/record.py`，pydantic v2，`json_schema_serialization_defaults_required`）：设置、请求、响应、事件、`--json` 的输出都是。有默认值的字段在输出模式里是必填的，生成的 TypeScript 类型因此与服务器实际发送的一致。"],[3039,"**路由。** 在 `mizuoto/api/routers/` 对应的模块里加函数，带 `operation_id`；新资源则新建模块并加入 `app.py` 的 `ROUTERS`。读服务器路径的操作加 `dependencies=[LocalDep]`。"],[5151,"**路由。** 在 `router.ts` 加路由，`meta.screen` 指向目的地；若它是可记住的上次界面，加入 `SCREENS`："],[5439,"**跳过初始化抽样。** 上游在加载检查点之前先用随机权重构建模型，并在抽取 `A` 之前把每个 loralib 层初始化两次：约 18 G 次抽样。`initial_lora` 只根据形状算出这些抽样让生成器前进多少（float32 的 `normal_` 或 `uniform_` 前进其大小，大小不是 16 的倍数时 `normal_` 再多 16），然后在 GF(2) 中把 MT19937 向前跳（`mizuoto.training.rng`）：用 2 秒而不是 40 秒的抽样得到同样的状态，在加载权重的同时在另一个线程中计算。随后是加载器的基础种子和每一步的 LoRA dropout 掩码。"],[6610,"**转写**"],[3204,"**输出。** 各段以段间停顿拼接、归一化、重采样到输出采样率、编码（PyAV），记录为一个 `Output`，带实际参数、耗时（加载、首块、总计、RTF）和许可标签。"],[6473,"**输出**：**格式**（WAV、FLAC、MP3、OGG、M4A）、**采样率**（**模型原生**，或 16–48 kHz）和 **音量均衡**（**峰值**、**响度**、**不处理**）。默认值来自 **设置 › 语音**。"],[6652,"**运行**"],[6654,"**运行此阶段**"],[2821,"**选择。** 每次调用用一个 `Call` 描述（设备类型、计算能力、精度、头维度、GQA、单个还是多个查询、长度是否相等、查询是否超过 1024 个、掩码类型、`mask_info` 的结构、自定义缩放、因果、dropout、是否需要梯度），它可哈希，所以一个解码循环对每个 `(site, Call)` 只选择一次。后端在以下情况被跳过："],[2460,"**选项**"],[446,"**部分下载**"],[6066,"**部分下载**"],[1168,"**部分下载** 也可能是缺少它需要的共享文件，下载一次模型就会补上。"],[5428,"**采样**按上游的顺序从请求的生成器抽样：主 token 抽两次（先用请求的温度和 top-p，再用 1.0 和 0.9 做重复感知采样），然后是快 transformer 的九次抽样。一次抽样就是 `argmax(probs / -log(u))`。top-k 固定为 30，与上游相同。"],[5721,"**采样器。** talker 依次经过 transformers 的处理器链（重复惩罚、min-new-tokens、屏蔽控制 id、温度、top-k、top-p），再在请求的生成器上做 `multinomial`；批量中已结束的行被喂入 EOS，与 transformers 的填充方式相同。每帧接着是 code predictor 的 15 次抽样。"],[6240,"**采样率**"],[991,"**采样率**：v2 / v2Pro / v2ProPlus 为 32 kHz，v4 / v5 Turbo 为 48 kHz。"],[3396,"**重依赖在函数内导入**：核心里的 av、numpy 热路径，命令行里的 fastapi、uvicorn，以及 `core/inference` 里的所有模型代码。`mizuoto version` 和 `mizuoto --help` 因此保持快速，测试会检查这一点。"],[5663,"**重新播种之后的抽样来自私有生成器**：每个 epoch 加载器的基础种子和 LoRA dropout 掩码共用一个以 42 播种的生成器；第 *w* 个 worker 的 `Random` 和 `Generator` 以 `(base + w) mod 2**32` 播种。在每个 worker 里，webdataset 先花掉一次 `randint(0, 1000000)` 生成一个从不使用的种子，然后处理器才开始抽样。分片列表用 `Random(epoch)` 打乱，样本经过以 epoch 播种的 webdataset 20 000 样本缓冲区；各 worker 的批次轮流到来。"],[6173,"**重新生成这一句**：立即为这句生成一个新版本，即使它已经是最新的；"],[6717,"**重新识别** 用语音识别重新转写所有音频；**添加音频** 再加一段。"],[3942,"**锁页**：在 `compute.max_pinned_mb` 之内把流式权重的主机副本放进锁页内存（复制变为异步，约快一倍）；默认为 ComfyUI 的预算：Windows 上为内存的 40 %，其他系统为 `max(0.4 × 内存, min(0.9 × 内存, 内存 − 4 GB))`。超出部分仍为可分页内存，同步复制。XPU 和 MPS 上同步复制。"],[3399,"**错误只用 `mizuoto/core/errors.py` 的类**，错误码只在 `mizuoto/core/codes.py`。给用户的修复命令放在 `detail[\"hint\"]`，命令行会把它作为第二行打出，界面显示在错误下方。不要在路由或命令里自己拼 HTTP 状态码或退出码。"],[3016,"**长操作返回 `Job`。** `POST /tts/speak?wait=true` 用 `JobService.wait` 等待，超过 `timeout` 抛 `OperationTimeoutError`（504，`detail.job_id` 指向仍在运行的任务）。"],[881,"**长文本**：上游不切分长文本，由 Mizuoto 分段。"],[5810,"**长文本**由 Mizuoto 切分；上游不切分。"],[3491,"**阻塞工作不进事件循环。** 访问磁盘和数据库的路由是普通 `def`（在线程池里运行）；任务线程上的事件用 `call_soon_threadsafe` 交给事件循环。"],[5801,"**随机性。** CFM 的噪声是推理时唯一的抽样，每块一次 `randn`，使用模型的精度。每次尝试都从一个以其种子初始化的新生成器抽样，与上游 `torch.manual_seed` 设置进程级随机流的位置相同。没有种子时，从请求的随机流中取一个 32 位种子（上游：`torch.seed()`），并在实际参数中报告。"],[3825,"**随机数**：Gumbel 噪声从 `ctx.generator_for(self.device)` 抽取；HuBERT 的层丢弃抽样（上游在评估模式下也会抽）从 `ctx.generator_for(\"cpu\")` 抽取。"],[5923,"**随机数来自请求。** 每次抽样都来自 `ctx.generator_for(device)` 或 `ctx.rng`，从不使用 torch 的全局生成器。用种子 *s* 初始化的全新 `torch.Generator`，与 `torch.manual_seed(s)` 之后的默认生成器产出相同的序列，CPU 和 CUDA 上都是如此（`check_rng.py`），所以按上游的顺序做上游的抽样，就能复现上游带种子的运行。上游在构建模型时就有抽样（默认初始化会消耗全局生成器）的地方，若这些值有影响，移植版在私有生成器上重放这些抽样（CosyVoice 3 的声码器噪声、各训练器的初始化），或让生成器直接跳过它们（Fish Speech 的训练器）。"],[3410,"**随机数来自请求。** 用 `ctx.generator_for(device)` 和 `ctx.rng`，每个随机操作都显式传入生成器（`torch.randn(..., generator=g)`），并按上游的顺序、形状和设备抽取。`randn_like` 等不接受生成器的调用改写成等价的显式形式。上游在构建模型时从全局生成器抽过随机数的，用私有生成器重放。"],[3894,"**需要** = 句柄尚未放到设备上的字节 + 工作显存（估算乘以其校准系数，见下文）+ `compute.vram_reserve_mb`。"],[6622,"**静音阈值（dB）**"],[3202,"**音色。** 有参考音频时，`prepare_voice` 按缓存键把引擎的音色状态（提示码、嵌入）写进音色缓存，只做一次；之后的请求通过 `VoiceSpec.cache` 传入这些文件。"],[6748,"**音色**"],[6683,"**音色** 页是音色库。一个音色可以在 **合成**、**项目**、**工具** 中反复使用，换模型时 Mizuoto 会自动判断它在新模型上怎么用。"],[6440,"**音色库**"],[6510,"**音色库**：音色库中的一个音色，使用它的参考音频作为目标声音；"],[5570,"**音色提示**（随音色缓存）：22.05 kHz 的音频（最多 15 秒）及其 16 kHz 副本；w2v-BERT 2.0 的第 17 层隐藏状态经归一化后作为 GPT 的条件；MaskGCT 语义编解码器把它量化为解码器的提示编码；CAM++ 给出风格；mel 是解码器的提示。"],[994,"**音色权重**：音色可以带一对 GPT（`.ckpt`）和 SoVITS（`.pth`）权重，版本与模型变体一致时使用，否则给出提示并改用克隆。用 `mizuoto voice add-weights <音色> -e gptsovits -f gpt=x.ckpt -f sovits=y.pth` 添加。"],[6705,"**音色样例要说的话** 是试听用的句子，可以修改。"],[3232,"**音色缓存。** 加载模型之后，任务对每个键调用一次 `prepare_voice`，写入 `voices/<slug>/cache/<引擎>/<模型>/<键>/` 并记下 `cache.json`；临时参考音频写入 `cache/voices/…`。键是（模型、模型版本、参考音频的 SHA-256 与转写、音色模式、Mizuoto 版本，以及需要接受许可的引擎的发行包版本）的哈希，所以升级 Mizuoto 或该发行包会重建一次缓存。"],[3824,"**音色缓存**：`prepare_voice` 把提示存成 `prompt.pt`；`synthesize` 优先用 `voice.cache[\"prompt\"]`。"],[1383,"**音色缓存会传回本机。** 引擎为音色准备的缓存（第一次使用某个音色时生成）写在 agent 上，随结果逐个文件传回，保存在本机音色的缓存文件夹里；之后使用同一音色时直接读取。"],[3233,"**音色自有权重**（`Voice.weights[engine]`）：清单有 `[weights]` 角色的引擎（GPT-SoVITS 的 `gpt` 和 `sovits`）可以带一个音色专属的微调，存于 `weights/<引擎>/`，随音色导出导入；版本由文件判断，与变体的 `weights_version` 相同时才使用。"],[6747,"**音色转换** 与 **语音编辑**"],[6338,"**音量均衡**"],[4873,"**音频之外的行为**也是对照的一部分，在两种实现上都经过契约套件检查：实际生效的参数和警告、音色模式的判定（`fit`）、流式的粒度与块数、取消的行为、对无效输入的错误码（参考音频太长、不支持的语言、缺少转写）、输出采样率、分段的拼接。"],[6595,"**音频文件（旁边可有同名 .lab 或 .txt）**"],[3017,"**音频文件**用 `files.audio_response()`：`FileResponse` 支持 `Range`，长文件可以拖动。流式合成见 `streaming.py`（分块 WAV 或裸 PCM，采样率在 `X-Mizuoto-Sample-Rate`，任务 id 在 `X-Mizuoto-Job`）。"],[6587,"**音频文件或录音**：拖放、选择文件、**录音**，或 **服务器文件**。可以在 **说话人** 中写明这些片段是谁说的（可选），然后点 **添加（N）**。"],[6234,"**章间停顿（毫秒）**"],[6744,"**项目**"],[6122,"**项目** 用来朗读长篇内容：一本书、一份剧本或一段多人对话。一个项目由两部分组成："],[6691,"**预置**"],[6444,"**预置说话人**"],[923,"**预置说话人**、**指令**、**流式输出**、**语速**、**行内标签**、**长文本**（不能克隆）"],[878,"**预置说话人**：aiden、dylan、eric、ono_anna、ryan、serena、s