al`: aligned top-left. Sites pass it as upstream passed `is_causal` (CosyVoice's streamed-text steps feed several tokens over a cache with it). Bottom-right causality, a KV cache's, comes through `mask_info`."],[2702,"`causal` 即 SDPA 的 `is_causal`：左上对齐。调用点按上游传 `is_causal` 的方式传它（CosyVoice 的流式文本步骤会借助它在缓存上一次送入多个 token）。右下对齐的因果关系（KV 缓存的情形）通过 `mask_info` 表达。"],[9845,"`causal`: aligned bottom-right (query *i* sees key *j* when `j ≤ i + n_k − n_q`); `window`: `j > i' − window`."],[2829,"`causal`：右下对齐（查询 *i* 能看到键 *j* 当 `j ≤ i + n_k − n_q`）；`window`：`j > i' − window`。"],[12304,"`CausalMaskedDiffWithDiT`: a 22-layer DiT"],[5288,"`CausalMaskedDiffWithDiT`：22 层 DiT"],[12298,"`CausalMaskedDiffWithXvec`: causal U-Net"],[5282,"`CausalMaskedDiffWithXvec`：因果 U-Net"],[11624,"`check_cancel()`, `cancelled()`"],[4608,"`check_cancel()`、`cancelled()`"],[10128,"`check_native_package`, which each gated package's `test_<id>_package.py` calls for itself: `packages/native/*/mizuoto_*` follow the engines' rule (and may import their own package), leave the process state alone and compute attention only through `mizuoto.runtime.accel`."],[3112,"`check_native_package`，由每个需要接受许可的包的 `test_<id>_package.py` 对自己调用：`packages/native/*/mizuoto_*` 遵守引擎的规则（另可导入自己的包），不改变进程状态，注意力只经 `mizuoto.runtime.accel` 计算。"],[11815,"`check_oom_retry` makes one layer inside a phase run out of memory the first time it is called: the phase runs again with more weights streamed, and the result must be exactly the undisturbed one."],[4799,"`check_oom_retry` 让阶段里的某一层第一次调用时内存不足：阶段以更多权重流式加载的方式重新运行，结果必须与未受干扰时完全相同。"],[4837,"`check_rng.py --device cuda:0`"],[11853,"`check_rng.py --device cuda:0`"],[11813,"`check_streamed` runs a tiny engine at three device sizes (every unit streamed, half, everything resident) and compares with the plain CPU sample for sample."],[4797,"`check_streamed` 在三种设备大小下（每个单元都流式加载、一半、全部常驻）运行小型引擎，与普通 CPU 上的结果逐采样比较。"],[4839,"`check_tokenizer.py <model>`"],[11855,"`check_tokenizer.py <model>`"],[4713,"`check`"],[