dia-smi`, `rocm-smi` or `amd-smi`, or by asking torch; see Performance), reports the torch build against them (with the exact install command when they do not match), whether each engine is available or what it still needs (torch, or a licence-gated engine's distribution), and the optional extras that are missing. In the web UI, **Settings › Compute** shows the torch check, and **Check this machine** on each engine card under **Models › Engines** shows that engine's."],[8310,"`mizuoto doctor` prints the memory settings in effect."],[11480,"`mizuoto doctor` reports an installed gated engine that does not go with this Mizuoto (its range excludes it, or its `OPTION_SCHEMA` and the manifest disagree) as an error with `pip install --upgrade mizuoto mizuoto-<id>`, and `mizuoto version` lists each distribution's version."],[6930,"`mizuoto doctor` 会列出找到的 GPU（通过 `nvidia-smi`、`rocm-smi` 或 `amd-smi`，或询问 torch；见 性能），对照它们检查 torch 的构建（不匹配时给出准确的安装命令），报告每个引擎是否可用、还缺什么（torch，或需要接受许可的引擎的发行包），以及缺少的可选扩展。在网页界面中，**设置 › 计算** 显示 torch 的检查结果，**模型 › 引擎** 中每个引擎卡片的 **检查本机** 显示该引擎的检查结果。"],[1294,"`mizuoto doctor` 打印当前生效的内存设置。"],[3982,"`mizuoto doctor` 有一项 `memory` 检查结果，列出当前生效的策略（模式、保留量、上限、内存保留量、主机副本、锁页预算、复制流、重试与回退）。"],[9179,"`mizuoto env vars` lists the environment variables Mizuoto reads, and the `MIZUOTO_*` variables set now:"],[2163,"`mizuoto env vars` 列出 Mizuoto 读取的环境变量，以及当前已设置的 `MIZUOTO_*` 变量："],[8150,"`mizuoto job cancel` reaches only its own process's jobs; for a job the server runs it answers \"is not running\". Cancel the server's jobs in the web UI or with `POST /api/v1/jobs/{id}/cancel`."],[1134,"`mizuoto job cancel` 只能取消本进程的任务，对服务器正在运行的任务会报 \"is not running\"。取消服务器的任务请用 Web UI，或 `POST /api/v1/jobs/{id}/cancel`。"],[9655,"`mizuoto job retry` runs a failed, cancelled or interrupted job again in the foreground (its stored request is planned again)."],[2639,"`mizuoto job retry` 在前台重新运行一个失败、已取消或已中断的任务（它保存的请求会重新规划）。"],[10850,"`mizuoto model download <id>/<name>`, then the contract suite on the real models; record the port and its parity on the engine's page (`engines-<id>`, both languages), add it to the sidebars (`meta.json`, `meta.en.json`) and to the engine reference table, and add rules to `AGENTS.md` if there are any."],[3834,"`mizuoto model download <id>/<名字>`，然后在真实模型上跑契约套件；把移植情况和对照结果记进该引擎的页面（`engines-<id>`，中英文都要），把它加进侧边栏（`meta.json`、`meta.en.json`）和引擎参考的表格；如有新的规则，再记进 `AGENTS.md`。"],[10758,"`mizuoto model import` identifies the engine and variant from file contents alone: `mizuoto/core/models/detect.py` reads configuration files (OmniVoice: `model_type == \"omnivoice\"` in `config.json`), and the engine's `detect_variant` must agree."],[3742,"`mizuoto model import` 只凭文件内容判断引擎和变体：`mizuoto/core/models/detect.py` 读取配置文件（OmniVoice：`config.json` 里 `model_type == \"omnivoice\"`），引擎的 `detect_variant` 必须与它一致。"],[13274,"`mizuoto project cast <project> <speaker-id> [--name] [-m] [-v] [--preset] [-l] [--instruct] [-p name=value] [-O name=value] [--remove]`"],[6258,"`mizuoto project cast <项目> <角色id> [--name] [-m] [-v] [--preset] [-l] [--instruct] [-p 参数=值] [-O 选项=值] [--remove]`"],[13288,"`mizuoto project delete <project>`"],[6272,"`mizuoto project delete <项目>`"],[13280,"`mizuoto project export <project> [-o file] [-c chapter-id] [-f format] [--srt file] [--allow-missing]`"],[6264,"`mizuoto project export <项目> [-o 文件] [-c 章节id] [-f 格式] [--srt 字幕文件] [--allow-missing]`"],[13272,"`mizuoto project import <project> <script> [--split …] [--replace] [--chapter chapter-id]`"],[6256,"`mizuoto project import <项目> <脚本> [--split …] [--replace] [--chapter 章节id]`"],[6270,"`mizuoto project list`"],[13286,"`mizuoto project list`"],[13270,"`mizuoto project new <name> [-m model] [--voice voice \\| --preset speaker] [-l lang] [--script file] [--split line\\|sentence]`"],[6254,"`mizuoto project new <名称> [-m 模型] [--voice 音色 \\| --preset 说话人] [-l 语言] [--script 文件] [--split line\\|sentence]`"],[13278,"`mizuoto project render <project> [-c chapter-id] [--line line-id] [--force]`"],[6262,"`mizuoto project render <项目> [-c 章节id] [--line 句子id] [--force]`"],[13284,"`mizuoto project script <project>`"],[6268,"`mizuoto project script <项目>`"],[13276,"`mizuoto project set <project> [--name] [-m] [-l] [--line-pause] [--paragraph-pause] [--chapter-pause] [-f] [--sample-rate] [--normalize]`"],[6260,"`mizuoto project set <项目> [--name] [-m] [-l] [--line-pause] [--paragraph-pause] [--chapter-pause] [-f] [--sample-rate] [--normalize]`"],[13282,"`mizuoto project show <project>`"],[6266,"`mizuoto project show <项目>`"],[10680,"`mizuoto runtime` asks the running server (`server.json`) first, and reports its own process only when there is none"],[11689,"`mizuoto runtime` asks the running server (found through `server.json` in the data folder), since its process holds the models; without a server it reports the command's own process. The same is `GET /api/v1/runtime` and `POST /api/v1/runtime/unload`, and the web UI's **Models in memory** sheet (`LoadedModelsSheet`)."],[8259,"`mizuoto runtime` lists the loaded models of the running server (device, memory, how much of it is on the device, last use, busy or idle); `mizuoto runtime --unload [MODEL]` unloads one, or every model not in use. In the web UI the **Models in memory** panel does the same, with a bar for how much of each model is on its GPU, and **Free GPU memory** releases the memory idle models hold. The API is `GET /api/v1/runtime` and `POST /api/v1/runtime/unload`."],[3664,"`mizuoto runtime` 先问正在运行的服务器（`server.json`），没有才报告本进程"],[1243,"`mizuoto runtime` 列出正在运行的服务器已加载的模型（设备、内存、有多少在设备上、上次使用、忙碌或空闲）；`mizuoto runtime --unload [MODEL]` 卸载一个模型，或所有未在使用的模型。网页界面的 **内存中的模型** 面板做同样的事，并用进度条显示每个模型有多少在 GPU 上，其中的 **释放显存** 释放空闲模型占用的显存。对应接口为 `GET /api/v1/runtime` 和 `POST /api/v1/runtime/unload`。"],[4673,"`mizuoto runtime` 询问正在运行的服务器（通过数据目录里的 `server.json` 找到它），因为模型在服务器进程里；没有服务器时报告命令自身进程的情况。对应 `GET /api/v1/runtime` 和 `POST /api/v1/runtime/unload`，以及 Web UI 的**内存中的模型**面板（`LoadedModelsSheet`）。"],[13516,"`mizuoto speak --help` lists every option (`--describe`, `--attr`, `--emotion-audio`, `--batch`, `--use-preset` and more); see the command reference."],[6500,"`mizuoto speak --help` 列出所有选项（`--describe`、`--attr`、`--emotion-audio`、`--batch`、`--use-preset` 等），完整参考见命令参考。"],[11487,"`mizuoto version`, `mizuoto env vars` and `mizuoto doctor`: every engine must be available;"],[4471,"`mizuoto version`、`mizuoto env vars` 和 `mizuoto doctor`：每个引擎都必须可用；"],[2199,"`mizuoto webui` 启动后打开浏览器"],[6293,"`mizuoto webui` 启动后是否自动打开浏览器"],[20,"`mizuoto webui` 启动的服务器同时提供网页界面和 HTTP 接口。网页界面能做的事都通过这套接口完成，所以脚本和其他程序也能做同样的事。"],[2172,"`MIZUOTO_<GROUP>__<FIELD>`"],[9188,"`MIZUOTO_<GROUP>__<FIELD>`"],[2168,"`MIZUOTO_CONFIG_DIR`"],[9184,"`MIZUOTO_CONFIG_DIR`"],[7612,"`MIZUOTO_CONFIG_DIR`, or the data folder"],[596,"`MIZUOTO_CONFIG_DIR`，或数据文件夹"],[368,"`MIZUOTO_DATA_DIR`"],[2166,"`MIZUOTO_DATA_DIR`"],[7384,"`MIZUOTO_DATA_DIR`"],[9182,"`MIZUOTO_DATA_DIR`"],[9171,"`MIZUOTO_DATA_DIR` or `mizuoto webui --data-dir <path>` puts it elsewhere. `settings.toml` sits in the data folder unless `MIZUOTO_CONFIG_DIR` or `webui --config-dir` names another folder for it (the data stays in the data folder). **Settings** › **About** in the web UI shows the **Data folder** and the **Settings file**."],[9124,"`MIZUOTO_DATA_DIR` or the platform's default"],[2108,"`MIZUOTO_DATA_DIR` 或系统默认位置"],[7609,"`MIZUOTO_DATA_DIR`, or the platform's default"],[7680,"`MIZUOTO_DATA_DIR`, or the platform's default"],[593,"`MIZUOTO_DATA_DIR`，或系统默认位置"],[664,"`MIZUOTO_DATA_DIR`，或系统默认位置"],[2170,"`MIZUOTO_LOG_LEVEL`"],[9186,"`MIZUOTO_LOG_LEVEL`"],[8197,"`MIZUOTO_LOG_LEVEL` sets the level (`DEBUG`, `INFO`, `WARNING`, `ERROR`; default `INFO`), and every command takes `--debug`."],[9648,"`MIZUOTO_LOG_LEVEL` sets the log level as well (`DEBUG`, `INFO`, `WARNING`, `ERROR`; default `INFO`). Each job's full log is `jobs/<job id>.log` in the data folder (`mizuoto job log <job id>`); a training stage's output goes into its job's log too."],[371,"`MIZUOTO_SERVER__OPEN_BROWSER`"],[