.core`、`mizuoto.version`、`mizuoto.logger`；`mizuoto.runtime`、`mizuoto.nn`、`mizuoto.engines`、`mizuoto.training` **只能在函数内**"],[6963,"`mizuoto.db`"],[13978,"`mizuoto.db`"],[10154,"`mizuoto.db` (SQLite, numbered migrations)"],[3138,"`mizuoto.db`（SQLite，带编号的迁移）"],[11431,"`mizuoto.nn.dsp`, bit-exact with those libraries; soxr"],[4415,"`mizuoto.nn.dsp`，与这些库逐比特一致；soxr"],[10114,"`mizuoto.nn`, `mizuoto.runtime`"],[3098,"`mizuoto.nn`、`mizuoto.runtime`"],[9864,"`mizuoto.runtime.compile.Compiled` wraps one hot module in `torch.compile(dynamic=True)`: no shape buckets, so a new length does not recompile. Engines call `compiled or module`, so with the setting off the code path is the eager one. The setting is read at each load (`RuntimeOptions.compile`) and reaches models loaded after a change."],[2848,"`mizuoto.runtime.compile.Compiled` 把一个热点模块包进 `torch.compile(dynamic=True)`：不按形状分桶，新的长度不会触发重新编译。引擎调用 `compiled or module`，所以设置关闭时走的就是即时执行路径。该设置在每次加载时读取（`RuntimeOptions.compile`），对修改之后加载的模型生效。"],[10111,"`mizuoto.runtime`, `mizuoto.core.codes`, `mizuoto.core.inference.tasks`"],[10120,"`mizuoto.runtime`, `mizuoto.nn`, `mizuoto.text`, `mizuoto.engines`, `mizuoto.training`, `mizuoto.core.codes`, `mizuoto.core.inference.tasks`"],[3095,"`mizuoto.runtime`、`mizuoto.core.codes`、`mizuoto.core.inference.tasks`"],[3104,"`mizuoto.runtime`、`mizuoto.nn`、`mizuoto.text`、`mizuoto.engines`、`mizuoto.training`、`mizuoto.core.codes`、`mizuoto.core.inference.tasks`"],[3101,"`mizuoto.text`"],[10117,"`mizuoto.text`"],[11856,"`mizuoto.text`'s BPE against transformers' tokenizer on the corpus (run in an environment that has transformers)"],[4393,"`mizuoto[gptsovits-ja]`"],[4697,"`mizuoto[gptsovits-ja]`"],[11409,"`mizuoto[gptsovits-ja]`"],[11713,"`mizuoto[gptsovits-ja]`"],[7838,"`mizuoto[gptsovits-ja]` (Japanese: pyopenjtalk 0.4.1, built from source with CMake and a C++ compiler), `mizuoto[gptsovits-ko]` (Korean: python-mecab-ko, jamo)"],[822,"`mizuoto[gptsovits-ja]`（日语：pyopenjtalk 0.4.1，需用 CMake 和 C++ 编译器从源码构建）、`mizuoto[gptsovits-ko]`（韩语：python-mecab-ko、jamo）"],[4396,"`mizuoto[gptsovits-ko]`"],[4700,"`mizuoto[gptsovits-ko]`"],[11412,"`mizuoto[gptsovits-ko]`"],[11716,"`mizuoto[gptsovits-ko]`"],[5170,"`mizuoto/`"],[12186,"`mizuoto/`"],[4889,"`mizuoto/`、`tests/`、`scripts/` 下的其他内容、`pyproject.toml`，或新路径"],[2934,"`mizuoto/api/app.py` 的 `create_app(services, bound_host, bound_port, extra_hosts, serve_ui, api_prefix)` 构建整个应用。服务由调用者拥有（`mizuoto webui` 用 `build_services(start_background=True)` 构建、`mizuoto.embed.MizuotoServer` 在宿主应用里构建），应用只把它挂在 `app.state.services` 上。"],[3088,"`mizuoto/api`"],[10104,"`mizuoto/api`"],[10058,"`mizuoto/cli/` uses Typer:"],[3042,"`mizuoto/cli/` 用 Typer。结构："],[3522,"`mizuoto/cli/app.py` 的 `get_app()` 在一个函数里注册所有命令和命令组，名字和帮助文字写在注册处；这个文件就是整个命令行的目录。命令函数（`cli/commands/*.py`）是不带装饰器的普通函数。"],[3091,"`mizuoto/cli`"],[10107,"`mizuoto/cli`"],[9921,"`mizuoto/core/compute/cpu.py` (standard library only) is applied by the host before torch is imported (`cpu.apply`, when the runtime is built) and handed to the processes it starts (`child_env`: training stages, job workers). Neither changes a result. Variables the environment sets itself win; off glibc and off Linux nothing changes."],[2905,"`mizuoto/core/compute/cpu.py`（只用标准库）由主机在导入 torch 之前应用（建立运行时时调用 `cpu.apply`），并传给它启动的进程（`child_env`：训练阶段、任务进程）。两者都不改变结果。环境中已设置的变量优先；非 glibc 或非 Linux 系统上不起作用。"],[3126,"`mizuoto/core/context.py` 的 `build_services()` 按依赖顺序构建全部服务，返回 `Services` 数据类："],[10724,"`mizuoto/core/engines/manifests/*.toml` ships in the `mizuoto` package; `EngineRegistry` loads every file in the folder and validates it as `EngineManifest` (`mizuoto/core/engines/models.py`). The manifest of a licence-gated engine ships in `mizuoto` too, so the catalogue and the licence text are there before its distribution is installed. The top level:"],[3708,"`mizuoto/core/engines/manifests/*.toml` 随 `mizuoto` 包发布；`EngineRegistry` 读取目录下的每个文件，按 `EngineManifest`（`mizuoto/core/engines/models.py`）校验。需要接受许可的引擎，其清单也在 `mizuoto` 里，所以在它的发行包装上之前，模型目录和许可全文就已经在了。顶层字段："],[10715,"`mizuoto/core/engines/manifests/<id>.toml`, files manifests in `manifests/files/`"],[3699,"`mizuoto/core/engines/manifests/<id>.toml`，模型文件清单在 `manifests/files/`"],[10846,"`mizuoto/core/engines/manifests/<id>.toml`; run `dev.py model-manifests <id>`; the licence text in `manifests/licences/` when gated."],[3830,"`mizuoto/core/engines/manifests/<id>.toml`；运行 `dev.py model-manifests <id>`；需要接受许可时，把许可全文放进 `manifests/licences/`。"],[10299,"`mizuoto/core/errors.py` holds every error type. Each class carries `code`, `http_status` and `exit_code`, and both front ends translate mechanically: the API turns any `MizuotoError` into `{\"code\", \"message\", \"detail\"}` (`mizuoto/api/errors.py`); the CLI turns it into its exit code and logs `detail[\"hint\"]` as a second line (`cli/factory.report_error`). The code strings are in `mizuoto/core/codes.py` (standard library only), so engines and training stages raise `EngineError(message, detail, code=codes.…)` without pydantic, and the core rebuilds the class with `error_from_code()`."],[3283,"`mizuoto/core/errors.py` 包含全部错误类型。每个类都带 `code`、`http_status` 和 `exit_code`，两个前端机械地转换：API 把任何 `MizuotoError` 变成 `{\"code\", \"message\", \"detail\"}`（`mizuoto/api/errors.py`）；CLI 把它变成退出码，并把 `detail[\"hint\"]` 作为第二行打出（`cli/factory.report_error`）。错误码字符串在 `mizuoto/core/codes.py`（只用标准库），所以引擎和训练阶段不需要 pydantic，抛出 `EngineError(message, detail, code=codes.…)` 即可，核心再用 `error_from_code()` 还原成对应的类。"],[3255,"`mizuoto/core/events/models.py` 里的每个事件都是带 `__event_name__` 的 `Record`：`job_updated`、`job_log`、`jobs_cleared`、`outputs_added` / `outputs_removed`、`voices_changed`、`models_changed`、`presets_changed`、`engines_changed`、`runtime_changed`（已加载的模型和各引擎的状态，即 `RuntimeStatus`）、`compute_changed`、`settings_changed`、`datasets_changed`、`projects_changed`、`experiments_changed`、`train_metrics`。`EventBase.get_events()` 收集所有子类；`mizuoto/api/openapi.py` 把它们写进 OpenAPI 模式，界面据此为 socket 生成类型。"],[4553,"`mizuoto/core/inference/engine.py`"],[11569,