al_state_alone`: no call that changes process-wide state in `runtime`, `nn`, `text`, the engines and the gated packages (see Runtime)."],[3114,"`test_native_code_leaves_global_state_alone`：`runtime`、`nn`、`text`、各引擎和需要接受许可的包里，不允许出现改动进程级状态的调用（见运行时）。"],[4813,"`test_no_residue`"],[11829,"`test_no_residue`"],[10134,"`test_one_distribution`: `pyproject.toml` depends on torch and on no other `mizuoto-*` distribution, and `packages/` holds no worker package and no engine packages besides `packages/native`."],[3118,"`test_one_distribution`：`pyproject.toml` 依赖 torch，不依赖任何其他 `mizuoto-*` 发行包，且 `packages/` 下除 `packages/native` 外没有 worker 包和引擎包。"],[10126,"`test_only_core_inference_reaches_model_code`: no module of `mizuoto/core` outside `core/inference` imports the runtime, `nn`, the engines or the trainers."],[3110,"`test_only_core_inference_reaches_model_code`：`mizuoto/core` 里除 `core/inference` 之外，没有模块导入运行时、`nn`、引擎或训练器。"],[4809,"`test_seed_repeats_and_segments`"],[11825,"`test_seed_repeats_and_segments`"],[10127,"`test_shared_modules_are_standard_library_only`: `core/codes.py`, `core/jobs/events.py`, `core/jobs/jsonl.py`, `core/remote/frames.py` and `core/inference/tasks.py` import only the standard library (and each other). The runtime, the engines and the training stages share them."],[3111,"`test_shared_modules_are_standard_library_only`：`core/codes.py`、`core/jobs/events.py`、`core/jobs/jsonl.py`、`core/remote/frames.py` 和 `core/inference/tasks.py` 只导入标准库（以及彼此）。运行时、引擎和训练阶段都要用它们。"],[11739,"`test-engines [engine…] [-- pytest options]`"],[4723,"`test-engines [引擎…] [-- pytest 选项]`"],[11818,"`test-engines` sets `MIZUOTO_CONTRACT=1` and `MIZUOTO_TEST_ENGINES` (the engines named) and runs `tests/engines` with `-m engine -v`. The suite uses the models of `MIZUOTO_TEST_DATA_DIR` (default: the normal data folder), but runs in a temporary data folder and writes nothing to the real one, on `MIZUOTO_TEST_DEVICE` (default `auto`)."],[4802,"`test-engines` 设置 `MIZUOTO_CONTRACT=1` 和 `MIZUOTO_TEST_ENGINES`（指定的引擎），以 `-m engine -v` 运行 `tests/engines`。套件使用 `MIZUOTO_TEST_DATA_DIR`（默认是平常的数据目录）里的模型，但在临时数据目录里运行，不往真实目录写任何东西，设备是 `MIZUOTO_TEST_DEVICE`（默认 `auto`）。"],[11737,"`test-py [pytest options…]`"],[4721,"`test-py [pytest 选项…]`"],[4735,"`test-web`"],[11751,"`test-web`"],[11802,"`tests/conftest.py`:"],[4786,"`tests/conftest.py`："],[11808,"`tests/engines_native/` builds, for each engine, a model of the engine's own architecture with a few small layers and random weights, writes it to a temporary folder as the engine expects to find it (configs, a byte-level vocabulary, safetensors), and drives the real code: `Engine.load` with a `Runtime(DeviceService(), ModelManager(...))`, a `RequestContext`, voice prompts, decoding, batches, seeds that repeat, cancellation. `test_<id>_train_tiny.py` runs every stage of the engine's trainer on a few clips. They need no download, so CI runs them on every push with CPU torch. The gated engines' tests are in their packages, `packages/native/<pkg>/tests/`; `testpaths` in `pyproject.toml` lists those folders, so `python -m pytest` runs them with the rest, and they skip unless their packages are installed. They use `tests/engines_native`'s helpers (`streaming.py`, `accel_checks.py`), so run them from the repository root, or from the package folder with the root's `pyproject.toml` (its `pythonpath` puts the root on `sys.path`)."],[4792,"`tests/engines_native/` 为每个引擎搭一个与引擎结构相同、只有几个小层、权重随机的模型，按引擎期望的样子写进临时目录（配置、字节级词表、safetensors），然后驱动真实的代码：用 `Runtime(DeviceService(), ModelManager(...))` 调 `Engine.load`，配一个 `RequestContext`，测音色提示、解码、批处理、可重复的种子和取消。`test_<id>_train_tiny.py` 用几段音频跑完引擎训练器的每个阶段。它们不需要下载，所以 CI 每次推送都用 CPU 版 torch 运行。需要接受许可的引擎的测试放在各自的包里，即 `packages/native/<pkg>/tests/`；`pyproject.toml` 的 `testpaths` 列出了这些目录，所以 `python -m pytest` 会连同其余测试一起运行它们，没装对应的包时跳过。它们用到 `tests/engines_native` 的辅助模块（`streaming.py`、`accel_checks.py`），所以要在仓库根目录运行；在包目录里运行也可以，根目录 `pyproject.toml` 的 `pythonpath` 会把根目录加进 `sys.path`。"],[11004,"`tests/engines_native/streaming.py` runs each tiny engine so, with every unit streamed (mode `none`), with half the room between its minimum and its size, and whole, and compares each output with the plain CPU run: identical. The parity harness does the same on real models (`--setting compute.simulate_vram_mb=…`). See Testing."],[3988,"`tests/engines_native/streaming.py` 这样运行每个小型引擎：所有单元都流式加载（`none` 模式）、取最小工作集与整个大小之间一半的空间、整体加载，并把每次的输出与普通 CPU 运行比较：完全相同。一致性验证工具在真实模型上也这样做（`--setting compute.simulate_vram_mb=…`）。见测试。"],[10819,"`tests/engines_native/test_<id>_tiny.py` builds a tiny model of the engine's own architecture with random weights in a temporary folder (config files, a byte-level vocabulary, safetensors written by the test) and drives the real code path on the CPU: loading, voice prompts and their cache, decoding, batches, seeds that repeat, cancellation. No weights are downloaded, so CI runs it on every push (CPU torch). `test_omnivoice_tiny.py` is a complete example; trainers have `test_<id>_train_tiny.py`."],[3803,"`tests/engines_native/test_<id>_tiny.py` 在临时目录里搭一个与引擎结构相同、权重随机的小模型（配置文件、字节级词表、测试自己写出的 safetensors），在 CPU 上走真实的代码路径：加载、音色提示及其缓存、解码、批处理、可重复的种子、取消。不下载任何权重，所以 CI 每次推送都跑（CPU 版 torch）。`test_omnivoice_tiny.py` 是一个完整的例子；训练器有 `test_<id>_train_tiny.py`。"],[10721,"`tests/engines_native/test_<id>_tiny.py`, the contract suite, `scripts/parity/`"],[3705,"`tests/engines_native/test_<id>_tiny.py`、契约套件、`scripts/parity/`"],[10820,"`tests/engines/test_contract.py` (markers `engine` and `weights`, deselected by default) drives the whole stack (plan → job → runtime → engine) for every installed catalogue model of the available engines: `describe` agrees with the manifest; every declared voice mode is audible, at the right rate, about as long as the text needs, and says the text (word error rate below 0.35 when ASR is installed); a seed repeats; two segments split; cancelling mid-generation stops the engine; and no process-wide state is left behind. A new engine id goes into the suite's `engines` settings override. See Testing."],[11817,"`tests/engines/test_contract.py` goes through the whole stack (plan → job → runtime → engine) for every installed catalogue model of every available engine:"],[4801,"`tests/engines/test_contract.py` 对每个可用引擎的每个已安装目录模型，走完整的链路（规划 → 任务 → 运行时 → 引擎）："],[3804,"`tests/engines/test_contract.py`（标记 `engine` 和 `weights`，默认排除）对可用引擎的每个已安装目录模型，走完整的链路（规划 → 任务 → 运行时 → 引擎）：`describe` 与清单一致；声明的每种音色模式都能发声、采样率正确、时长与文本相称、说的是那段文本（装了 ASR 时，词错误率低于 0.35）；种子可复现；两段能正确切分；中途取消能让引擎停下；不留下任何进程级状态。新引擎的 id 要加进套件里 `engines` 设置覆盖的列表。见测试。"],[10418,"`tests/test_architecture.py` checks every module's imports with `ast`; the tables are in Architecture. In short:"],[10097,"`tests/test_architecture.py` walks every module's absolute imports with `ast` and checks them against these tables; the standard library is always allowed."],[3402,"`tests/test_architecture.py` 用 `ast` 检查每个模块的导入，规则表见整体架构。要点："],[3081,"`tests/test_architecture.py` 用 `ast` 遍历每个模块的绝对导入，对照下表检查；标准库总是允许的。"],[12316,"`text_normalize` with wetext, cleaning and splitting"],[4622,"`text_pieces()`"],[11638,"`text_pieces()`"],[5229,"`text.py`"],[5374,"`text.py`"],[5588,"`text.py`"],[5641,"`text.py`"],[5790,"`text.py`"],[12245,"`text.py`"],[12390,"`text.py`"],[12604,"`text.py`"],[12657,"`text.py`"],[12806,"`text.py`"],[5508,"`text/`"],[12524,"`text/`"],[12978,"`text/tokenize/`, `text/normalize/`"],[5962,"`text/tokenize/`、`text/normalize/`"],[228,"`text` / `texts`"],[7244,"`text` / `texts`"],[10803,"`text`, `language`, `voice`, `style` (`instruct`, `emotion`), `params` (common parameters by Mizuoto's names), `options` (engine options), `texts` (a batch), `segment` / `segments`, `stream`, `text_stream`"],[11979,"`text`, `speech`, `semantic`, `sovits`, `gpt`, `export`"],[3787,"`text`、`language`、`voice`、`style`（`instruct`、`emotion`）、`params`（按 Mizuoto 名称的通用参数）、`options`（引擎选项）、`texts`（批处理）、`segment` / `segments`、`stream`、`text_stream`"],[4963,"`text`、`speech`、`semantic`、`sovits`、`gpt`、`export`"],[5590,"`text25.py