del's components that the current phase does not need are. Each victim gives up units, in reverse fill order, until the shortfall is met (`partially_unload`); in `high` and `shared` it leaves whole. `empty_cache` runs after an eviction, never per request."],[10906,"Components the phase does not name stay where they are and give up memory first when another phase needs it: an IndexTTS clone of a cached voice never places w2v-BERT or CAM++."],[47,"compute"],[7063,"compute"],[13294,"Compute"],[10812,"Compute attention with `mizuoto.runtime.accel.attention(q, k, v, site=SITE, …)`, never `F.scaled_dot_product_attention` (an architecture test forbids it): declare `SITE = accel.Site(\"<id>.<part>\")` once per call site, and pass the arguments upstream passed to SDPA (`causal` is its `is_causal`). A site where upstream wrote attention by hand gives that code as its `reference`; one that only its reference may compute is `swappable=False` (attentions with relative positions inside the scores are not sites at all: they stay hand-written). Where the site builds a mask from a structure (padding on one side, causal, a window), pass `mask_info` too, so faster kernels can take the call (Acceleration)."],[11028,"Conditions"],[11218,"Configuration"],[9138,"Configuration and environment variables"],[9664,"Configuration and environment variables: settings, environment variables and the data folder."],[9545,"Connect with TLS"],[9952,"Contents"],[13607,"Contents"],[13974,"Contents"],[10397,"Conventions"],[12176,"Conventions that hold everywhere"],[10028,"Conventions:"],[13519,"Convert voice"],[182,"Cookie"],[7198,"Cookie"],[11625,"Cooperative cancel. `check_cancel()` raises `Cancelled`, a `BaseException`, so model code's `except Exception` cannot swallow it. Engines call it at every token or ODE step"],[10959,"Copies are made outside inference mode, in the weights' own dtype, so a streamed layer computes with the same kind of tensor as a resident one (an inference tensor takes other CPU