[8057,"Fish Audio S2 Pro: a dual-autoregressive model trained on about ten million hours in some fifty languages. Best for: expressive cloning, free-form inline tags such as `[laughing]`, and dialogue between speakers."],[1041,"Fish Audio S2 Pro：双自回归模型，约一千万小时、五十种左右语言的训练数据。适合：富有表现力的克隆、自由形式的行内标签（如 `[laughing]`）和多说话人对话。"],[5410,"Fish Audio S2 Pro（fishaudio/fish-speech，Fish Audio Research License）。移植版同样受该许可约束，所以作为单独的发行包发布：`mizuoto-fishspeech`（`packages/native/fishspeech`，包名 `mizuoto_fishspeech`，附 `LICENSE.md`），注册在入口点组 `mizuoto.engines` 下（`fishspeech = mizuoto_fishspeech:FishSpeechEngine`）。下载模型和合成都需要先接受许可。在 CPU 上以 fp32、相同种子运行时，它的编码和音频与 Mizuoto 0.1 所运行的上游带种子 `generate_long` 完全相同，训练器导出的模型与 0.1 逐位相同。面向用户的说明见 引擎详解。"],[734,"Fish Speech"],[824,"Fish Speech"],[4019,"Fish Speech"],[4985,"Fish Speech"],[5400,"Fish Speech"],[5868,"Fish Speech"],[6575,"Fish Speech"],[6851,"Fish Speech"],[7750,"Fish Speech"],[7840,"Fish Speech"],[11035,"Fish Speech"],[12001,"Fish Speech"],[12416,"Fish Speech"],[12884,"Fish Speech"],[13591,"Fish Speech"],[13866,"Fish Speech"],[7855,"Fish Speech (`fish-audio-research@2026-03-07`), IndexTTS (`bilibili-model-use@2025-09-09`)"],[7805,"Fish Speech (`fishspeech`)"],[9899,"Fish Speech (`mizuoto_fishspeech/generate.py`)"],[8173,"Fish Speech (Fish Audio Research License) and IndexTTS (bilibili Model Use License) need their licence accepted before their models and shared files are downloaded, or they synthesize (exit code 5, HTTP 403). Read it, then:"],[10578,"Fish Speech and IndexTTS are distributions of their own (`mizuoto-fishspeech`, `mizuoto-indextts`), installed into the same environment and registered under the entry-point group `mizuoto.engines`"],[7405,"Fish Speech and IndexTTS are in the image only when it was built with `--build-arg GATED=1`; otherwise their cards say **Not available** (`mizuoto-fishspeech` or `mizuoto-indextts` missing). Even then, their licence must be accepted before downloading their models or speaking:"],[12982,"Fish Speech and IndexTTS are ports of code whose licences (the Fish Audio Research License, the bilibili Model Use License) also cover the port. They are therefore separate distributions, `mizuoto-fishspeech` and `mizuoto-indextts`, each shipping its licence, installed into the same environment and registered under the entry-point group `mizuoto.engines`. Their manifests ship with `mizuoto`, so the catalogue and the licence text are there before the distribution is installed. They follow the same rules as the built-in engines and import nothing from another engine."],[4083,"Fish Speech clone-en"],[4146,"Fish Speech clone-en"],[11099,"Fish Speech clone-en"],[11162,"Fish Speech clone-en"],[13026,"Fish Speech results show \"Built with Fish Audio\" beneath them, and cannot be used as training data for other engines."],[11212,"Fish Speech S2 Pro LoRA (2 steps): 207.4 s before the CPU rounds, 172–173 s after round 1, 128.5–130.6 s after round 2 (training stage 146.8 → 83 s), metrics and weights identical. Its warm request went from 110.4 to 85.7 s (the codec 3.3 → 2.0 s), its parity cases unchanged."],[11187,"Fish Speech S2 Pro LoRA, 2 steps"],[4171,"Fish Speech S2 Pro LoRA，2 步"],[4196,"Fish Speech S2 Pro LoRA（2 步）：CPU 优化前 207.4 秒，第一轮后 172–173 秒，第二轮后 128.5–130.6 秒（训练阶段 146.8 → 83 秒），指标和权重完全相同。它的预热请求从 110.4 秒降到 85.7 秒（编解码器 3.3 → 2.0 秒），一致性用例不变。"],[4192,"Fish Speech 合并 LoRA 时每个基座权重只做一份 float32 拷贝，而不是两份"],[3562,"Fish Speech 和 IndexTTS 作为独立发行包（`mizuoto-fishspeech`、`mizuoto-indextts`），装进同一环境，经入口点组 `mizuoto.engines` 注册"],[1162,"Fish Speech 和 IndexTTS 的结果不能作为训练其他引擎的数据：加入数据集时会保留结果的许可标签，训练时拒绝这些片段。"],[5966,"Fish Speech 和 IndexTTS 移植的代码，其许可（Fish Audio Research License、bilibili Model Use License）同样约束移植版。因此它们是单独的发行包 `mizuoto-fishspeech` 和 `mizuoto-indextts`，各自附带许可，安装在同一个环境里，并在入口点组 `mizuoto.engines` 下注册。它们的清单随 `mizuoto` 一起发布，所以在发行包安装之前，模型目录和许可全文就已经在了。它们遵守与内置引擎相同的规则，也不从其他引擎导入任何东西。"],[2730,"Fish Speech 的快速 transformer（`fishspeech.fast`）、IndexTTS 的 perceiver（`indextts.perceiver`）"],[6010,"Fish Speech 的结