es fit, they load whole. Otherwise they load partly within the budget: free memory less working memory and reserve."],[13999,"If you need none of the data, delete the data folder. **Careful**: it holds your voice library, results, projects and training data. With Docker: `docker volume rm mizuoto-data`."],[13696,"Import"],[7216,"Import a folder on the server into a dataset"],[13065,"Import a model folder"],[13273,"Import a script (append, replace, or into a chapter)"],[8851,"Import as `<engine>/<name>` rather than as the catalogue model it matches"],[7417,"Importing a model folder"],[13127,"Importing a script"],[7318,"In Mizuoto"],[10549,"In Mizuoto"],[12118,"In rows that hold a file name the text element has `min-width: 0` (a long name must not push the buttons out of view); Speak and a voice's page are one column of sections with their actions in `PageFooter`; a button beside a field is centred on it; sections are never side by side"],[12211,"In short (the full list is Conventions):"],[11814,"In strict mode, a component off the device rests as meta tensors and a streamed unit's weights exist only while the unit runs. So an engine that uses a component it did not place for the phase (`ctx.use`), or reads a unit's weights outside its `forward`, fails here."],[13929,"In the container the server listens on `0.0.0.0`, so set an access token with `MIZUOTO_SERVER__ACCESS_TOKEN`. The browser shows an **Access token** dialog when the page opens; enter it there."],[12061,"In the manifest, `[training.<id>]`: the stages and what they `use`, the hyperparameters, `export`, and `assets` and `devices` when needed. On the engine class, `TRAINER = \"mizuoto.engines.<id>.train:<Class>\"`."],[8313,"In the other modes a model that does not fit loads partly, down to its smallest working set (the parts that never stream and the copies in flight). Even when the estimate says that does not fit, Mizuoto tries it: in every mode only an allocation that really fails is an error."],[7456,"In t