ine with its weights streamed and compare the audio with the plain run. The mechanisms that do change numbers (tiled decoding, the static KV cache, the `lowest` training preset) are opt-in and say so in the output."],[12625,"None: IndexTTS publishes no training code for its TTS models, and the manifest declares no method."],[11042,"Not done because it changes results"],[13079,"Not downloaded yet"],[7860,"Not for training other engines"],[13935,"Note"],[7429,"Notes"],[8463,"Notes"],[10743,"Notes"],[11392,"Notes"],[11910,"nothing"],[11680,"Nothing refuses a model on an estimate of GPU memory: it always tries to load, and only a real allocation failure is an error. When a job fails for running out of memory (after the exact retries), `ComputeService.release_after_oom` unloads every model not in use from every GPU (ComfyUI's `unload_all_models`); models on the CPU stay. How components share a device below this level is in Memory."],[11010,"nothing: each recipe exactly"],[11445,"numpy ports with integer semantics"],[10124,"numpy, torch"],[10112,"numpy, torch, safetensors, and the optional attention packages flash_attn, flash_attn_interface, xformers, sageattention, sageattn3 (imported on demand inside `runtime/accel` only)"],[10121,"numpy, torch, safetensors, tokenizers, sentencepiece, tiktoken, soxr, yaml, inflect, regex, and the text front ends' packages (pypinyin, rjieba, jieba, opencc, wordsegment, budoux, fasttext, ToJyutping, fugashi, pyopenjtalk, jamo, mecab)"],[10115,"numpy, torch, soxr"],[3108,"numpy、torch"],[3096,"numpy、torch、safetensors，以及可选的注意力包 flash_attn、flash_attn_interface、xformers、sageattention、sageattn3（只在 `runtime/accel` 里按需导入）"],[3105,"numpy、torch、safetensors、tokenizers、sentencepiece、tiktoken、soxr、yaml、inflect、regex，以及各文本前端的包（pypinyin、rjieba、jieba、opencc、wordsegment、budoux、fasttext、ToJyutping、fugashi、pyopenjtalk、jamo、mecab）"],[3099,"numpy、torch、soxr"],[11451,"NVIDIA (CUDA)"],[9817,"NVIDIA (sm ≥ 8.0), head dims 64/96/128"],[9823,"NVIDIA Blackwell (sm ≥