 the bottom offers **Download** *model* *(size)*."],[7204,"On a 401 the web UI shows the **Access token** dialog and asks for it once."],[8214,"On a CPU"],[8330,"On a CPU (fp32, 8 threads) the compiled module's time dropped by 23 % for F5-TTS (a whole request from 60 s to 45 s), 7 % for IndexTTS's DiT and 20 % for its BigVGAN, 7 % for GPT-SoVITS v4, and nothing for CosyVoice or (bf16) VoxCPM. The audio differs slightly from the uncompiled run; for VoxCPM that can move where the speech ends."],[12415,"On a GPU the model runs in fp16 as upstream does; Mizuoto offers no fp32 rotary embedding there."],[7579,"On a machine with the models downloaded, build the mirror under `<repo id>/resolve/main`:"],[12138,"On connect and reconnect the active jobs are fetched again (`resync()`); a reconnect also invalidates the usual lists on screen."],[12843,"On CUDA the first request in a process decodes its latents (which are identical) with slightly different bits from later requests; later requests repeat each other exactly."],[10438,"On GPUs in reduced precision, bit identity is not required; modules are judged by their error and whole runs statistically. The tiers and tolerances are in Testing."],[8427,"On its first start without a token the agent makes a random one, saves it as `remote.agent.token` and prints it:"],[10603,"On its own torch 2.3.1 and on 2.8, sampling already diverges"],[13597,"On the **Datasets** tab, click **New dataset**."],[13655,"On the **Experiments** tab, click **New experiment** (or **Train on it** on a dataset's page)."],[8384,"On the agent"],[11040,"On the CPU"],[11609,"On the CPU nothing is moved and nothing is counted, unless `DeviceService(simulate={\"cpu\": bytes})` makes it play a GPU (tests and the parity harness: `compute.simulate_vram_mb`)."],[10908,"On the CPU the manager moves and counts nothing (the load and offload device are the same), so phases cost nothing there."],[11832,"On the CPU, every catalogue model of every engine passes the contract suite. The whole suite takes hours (the larger the model, the slower), so when changing one engine, run that engine."],[8385,"On the host"],[7583,"On the other machines:"],[7735,"Once it is reachable, anyone with the address can use it: set `access_token`, or add authentication of your own. HTTP API details the access checks."],[7736,"Once started, the server writes `server.json` (`host`, `port`, `url`, `pid`) into the data folder so other programs can find it; `stop()` removes it."],[13028,"Once the model is downloaded, open **Speak**, choose it and a voice, type some text and click **Speak**. Speak explains every option."],[13644,"Once there are clips, the **Report** shows:"],[10981,"one 30 s window at a time"],[13617,"One audio file name and its text per line"],[13099,"One card per engine:"],[10881,"One component: whole or partly placed, host copies, hooks for streamed units"],[10592,"One Docker image holds the server, the UI and every engine; the licence-gated engines come with `GATED=1`"],[11564,"One engine on one device in this process, and the handle of one of its loaded models"],[10169,"One engine per (engine, device), here or on a remote host; `loaded()` gives a model's `EngineHandle`; unloading, the idle reaper, the doctor"],[11561,"One engine per (engine, device), made on demand; `loaded()` gives a model's `EngineHandle`; `max_resident_models`, the idle reaper, `runtime_changed`, the doctor"],[10500,"One environment, every engine implemented in-tree on a ComfyUI-style runtime"],[12174,"One environment, one process"],[7398,"One GPU only: `--gpus '\"device=1\"'`."],[13913,"One image holds the server, the UI and every engine, with GPT-SoVITS's Japanese and Korean front ends; models go to the `/data` volume."],[10778,"One loaded model. It is not re-entrant: the job scheduler gives it one request at a time (the `engine:<engine>:<device>` resource)."],[12043,"One loss point"],[12256,"One model in the catalogue; speech recognition is used inside Mizuoto, not offered as a synthesis model or through `GET /v1/models`."],[12017,"One more rule: when a stage is **run again**, the finished stages after it that were not part of the same run lose their fingerprints. They read the old stage's files, so they are stale even when the inputs (and fingerprints) are the same."],[10077,"One name cannot be both a command and a group, so the environment variable listing is `mizuoto env vars`, not `mizuoto env`."],[13461,"One of the model's own speakers (Qwen3-TTS CustomVoice, CosyVoice 300M SFT…)"],[10082,"One operation, one core method"],[10519,"One optional access token (a Bearer header, the `mizuoto_token` cookie or `?token=`), plus a Host check (against DNS rebinding) and an Origin check on state-changing requests; binding to a non-loopback address logs a warning"],[13703,"One or more reference clips with their transcripts, for cloning"],[8624,"One output per line of the text"],[11579,"One per call: cancel, generators, progress, text pieces, scratch"],[10884,"One per device: the device copies of streamed units, their learnt order, prefetch on side streams, pinning"],[13407,"One per line. Dialogs such as **Server files** and **Import a model folder** browse only these. **Empty: your home folder, the data folder and every drive.**"],[12254,"One phase per transcription: the whole model, the decoder marked `hot` (it runs per token and beam), `kind=\"sequence\"`. With `compute.oom_fallback`, a transcription that runs out of memory decodes one 30 s window at a time instead of four; that is another batch shape, so in rare ties a transcript may differ."],[10497,"One Python environment and one worker process per engine, upstream code vendored as it was"],[10574,"One Python environment, every engine ported in-tree and run in the server's own process; no upstream code vendored"],[9954,"One router module per resource, `routers/<resource>.py`, each with `APIRouter(prefix=\"/v1/<resource>\")`"],[13184,"One row per line, from left to right:"],[13075,"One row per model, with its name, variant, size, GPU memory (**N GB of GPU memory**) and description, and its state:"],[10665,"One synthesis path serves every feature, so micro-batching and every engine come for free"],[10253,"One TCP connection (optionally TLS) is a session for one (engine, device): `open`, `load`, `prepare_voice`, `synthesize`, `convert`, `edit`, `call`, `unload`, `status` one after another; `cancel` and `text` at any time. Frames are length-prefixed JSON or binary (`core/remote/frames.py`, standard library only)."],[11803,"One temporary data folder per test and an empty environment (`environ={}`: the developer's own `MIZUOTO_*` variables never leak in)."],[10983,"one text at a time"],[12427,"One variant, `s2_pro` (catalogue model `fishspeech/s2-pro`): cloning from one to four clips, each with its transcript; inline tags; dialogue between speakers (`<|speaker:i|>`). The model folder holds `config.json`, the weights (`model.safetensors.index.json` and its shards, `model.safetensors`, or `model.pth`), `codec.pth` and the BPE tokenizer files. A voice's cache is `codes.pt`, each reference's codes."],[12641,"One variant, `v0` (catalogue model `omnivoice/omnivoice`): cloning (the transcript is required; Mizuoto supplies it by speech recognition when it is missing, so the engine never loads Whisper itself), design from a closed vocabulary of attributes, the model's own voice, and 13 inline non-verbal tags."],[12228,"One variant, `whisper` (catalogue model `asr/whisper-large-v3-turbo`); the model is built from `config.json`, so other Whisper sizes in the same format load too. The folder holds `config.json`, `generation_config.json`, `model.safetensors` (or `pytorch_model.bin`), `preprocessor_config.json`, `tokenizer.json` and `tokenizer_config.json`."],[9195,"Only `MIZUOTO_*` variables whose names contain `__` are overrides."],[12105,"Only components under `ui/` (plus `theme/tokens.css` and the tests' `test/setup.ts`) import `@material/web`. Views and feature components import `AppButton`, `TextField`, `AppDialog`, `SegmentedButton`, `Stepper`, `LineChart`… from `@/ui`."],[13506,"Only in a browser on the server machine"],[10632,"Only linear and convolution weights stream, never embeddings"],[13633,"Only longer clips are cut"],[10746,"Only names from `CommonParam` (`temperature`, `top_p`, `num_steps`, `speed`, `seed`…). `target` is the engine's own name; `default` only shows the engine's default, Mizuoto never imposes it; `approximate = true` adds a warning to results; `variants` and `streaming` narrow where it applies"],[10662,"Only requests that differ in nothing but their text, with one segment and no seed, join a micro-batch"],[12404,"Only the Vocos vocoder is offered; upstream's BigVGAN variant of the v0 model is not in the catalogue."],[7526,"Only these models and shared files"],[7509,"Only these models and shared files (default: every installed one)"],[8873,"Only this engine (default: all)"],[8712,"Only voices in this language (`list`)"],[10924,"only when the weights take at most half of the device's memory (`low_ratio`)"],[4411,"ONNX 文件里的权重由仓库内的协议缓冲区读取器（`runtime/convert/onnx.py`）转换成 torch 模块，转换结果缓存在模型文件夹的 `.mizuoto/` 下"],[4410,"onnxruntime"],[11426,"onnxruntime"],[13020,"Open **Models › Engines** and click **Accept the licence** on the engine's card (or, on **Speak** with one of its models chosen, **Accept the** *engine* **licence** at the bottom)."],[13143,"Open **Projects** in the navigation. Each card shows the project's name, rendered lines out of all lines (red when some failed), its description, **N chapter(s) · N line(s)**, **N speaker(s)**, the length of what is rendered and a bar coloured by the lines' states. Click a card to open the project."],[14018,"Open **Speak** in the navigation (the UI starts there)."],[7700,"Open a browser once started"],[9215,"Open a browser when `mizuoto webui` starts"],[9662,"Open a new terminal afterwards to complete commands, subcommands and options."],[13051,"Open its