 it in bf16 (upstream's default) and in fp32, and both trainers give its weights bit for bit. User-facing details: Engines in depth."],[8029,"OpenBMB's tokenizer-free TTS: it generates continuous speech latents patch by patch (a MiniCPM-4 language model and a small diffusion model per patch), with no speech codes in between. Best for: natural cloning, with or without the clip's transcript; voices made from a sentence of description; style instructions on a cloned voice; 30 languages at 48 kHz (VoxCPM2)."],[12533,"OpenCC is the C++ `opencc==1.4.2` (the pure-Python port differs on 321 of 182 814 conversions, which feed G2PW);"],[5517,"OpenCC 用 C++ 版 `opencc==1.4.2`（纯 Python 移植版在 182 814 次转换中有 321 次不同，而这些结果会送入 G2PW）；"],[7589,"Opening the services"],[9930,"OpenMP threads bound to distinct physical cores (`OMP_PLACES=cores`, `OMP_PROC_BIND=close`). Left to the scheduler two threads sometimes share a core, and that process runs a third slower for its whole life. `off` leaves placement to the scheduler (better when other busy programs share the cores)"],[13895,"Operating system"],[7224,"Operation"],[10793,"Operations named in the manifest's `ops` (ASR's `transcribe`, Fish Speech's `codec_encode` / `codec_decode`)"],[7545,"Option"],[7558,"Option"],[8402,"Option"],[8573,"Option"],[8705,"Option"],[8789,"Option"],[9062,"Option"],[9107,"Option"],[13947,"Option"],[7830,"Optional extras"],[11378,"Optional extras"],[11698,"Optional extras"],[13886,"Optional extras"],[10586,"Optional extras only where a platform limit requires one: `gptsovits-ja` (`pyopenjtalk==0.4.1`, source only), `gptsovits-ko`, `mizuoto-indextts[ja]`"],[10771,"Optional features: install spec → the modules it provides, e.g. GPT-SoVITS's `{\"mizuoto[gptsovits-ja]\": (\"pyopenjtalk\",), \"mizuoto[gptsovits-ko]\": (\"mecab\", \"jamo\")}`; `mizuoto doctor` lists the ones that do not import"],[13147,"Optionally paste a script under **Script** (see the next section) and choose **Make a line of each**: **line of text**