t a current take; `--force` renders current ones too"],[13133,"Rendering"],[13234,"Rendering is one **Render a project** job with a step per chapter. It submits an ordinary speak job per line and keeps up to 8 of them queued, so that **Settings › Speech › Run waiting requests together** can run lines with the same model, voice and settings, differing only in their text, as one batch (on engines that take batches, such as Qwen3-TTS, GPT-SoVITS and OmniVoice). Those speak jobs do not announce themselves one by one; the render announces itself once when it ends."],[13200,"Reorder"],[8676,"Replace parts of a recording with new speech in the same voice (speech editing)."],[11421,"Replaced by"],[13179,"Replaces every chapter with the script's; the old lines' takes are deleted"],[10235,"Report models: `RuntimeStatus`, `LoadedModelInfo`, `DoctorReport`…"],[8987,"Report what training would see: durations, empty texts, clipping, rates, speakers"],[10862,"Reporting"],[8201,"Requests to an unavailable host fail with `remote_unavailable` (exit code 14); `mizuoto remote use <engine> --local` runs the engine here again. See Remote hosts."],[9449,"Requests waiting for the same model that differ only in their text run as one batch, on engines that take one"],[10780,"Required"],[11377,"Required"],[13894,"Requirement"],[13884,"Requirements"],[13883,"Requirements, torch for your hardware, installing Mizuoto from PyPI, from source or with Docker, where the data lives, and updating and uninstalling."],[8622,"Resample the result"],[10276,"Resource"],[7020,"Resources"],[10275,"Resources have names and capacities. The scheduler runs a job only when every resource it needs has room; otherwise the job is `waiting`, with `waiting_for` naming the full one:"],[7303,"Response"],[10145,"Responsibility"],[7624,"Responsible for"],[7039,"REST API"],[12134,"REST is the source of truth; events only patch or invalidate queries:"],[23,"REST 接口"],[6814,"REST 接口、事件与流式音频的 WebSocket、兼容 OpenAI 的 `/v1/audio/sp